window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":901,"title":"Chapter 901 Secluded Cultivation, a Great Battle Is About to Start","paragraphs":["901 Secluded Cultivation, a Great Battle Is About to Start","The holy land wanted to become the Federation’s overlord. This was something everyone knew.","The Wei clan of the holy land had a relationship with the Monster Cult and even conspired with each other. It was undoubtedly a difficult thing for the Federation to accept.","The Federation and the Monster Cult were mortal enemies, and the Wei clan’s relationship with the Monster Cult tarnished the Wei clan’s reputation within the Federation.","Initially, when the holy land wanted to take over the Federation, although many people hated it, even more, did not care. After all, there were already many clans and sects throughout the Federation, so why would few more matter?","!!","However, conspiring with the Monster Cult was something the Federation could not accept.","Under the relentless education of the government over the years, the Monster Cult was known as a heinous enemy. The cult’s propaganda of wanton to let the monsters rule over humans was unacceptable to the Federation.","Many regarded the cult as a chess piece the Infinite Demon Mountain had placed among the human race, and they wanted to kill everything.","Now, the Wei clan was cooperating with the cult. As soon as this news came out, it instantly sparked a great uproar within the Federation.","The Federation immediately condemned them. Chu Yunfan released video evidence that he had secretly recorded on his terminal. Although the video was not long, it was enough to see that a Wei clan expert had cooperated with the cult’s leader.","The Wei clan had joined forces with the cult to kill the chief of the Federation’s Special Ops. He was a high-ranking official of the Federation. Even if the Wei clan wanted to quibble, there was no way out of this.","For a moment, the Wei clan became the target of endless condemnation. Though the Wei clan prided itself on its strength, it could not withstand such immense pressure.","They did not care about the opposition and hostility of one, two, hundreds, thousands, or even millions of ordinary people. However, denouncement from the entire Federation was a terrifying force.","No one could ignore everyone’s condemnation. The Wei clan temporarily retreated to a high mountain in the Kunlun Realm where the holy land was connected to. A group of Wei clan elders was anxiously discussing something.","“I’ve received news from my clan. We have to solve this matter. We can’t let this matter become an obstacle to entering the Federation.”","“That’s right. Since things have come to this, we can only give up on him.”","“Still, we can’t let Chu Yunfan go just like that. The clan wants to take over the Federation and rule over all other forces. He will be an obstacle in our path.”","“You’re right. What kind of laughable system is the Federation using now? It allows the government chosen by ordinary people to override us. We martial artists!”","“We must correct this laughable system!”","The Wei elders roared.","“We’ve received news that Chu Yunfan is about to break through to the Divine Ability Stage. He’ll be at his weakest at that time, and we will kill him then!”","“Just wait for that moment. Chu Yunfan, you’re dead meat!”","After Chu Yunfan released the video, the Wei clan quickly responded. Soon, a Wei clan elder clarified that the person who had besieged Chu Yunfan was a traitor to the Wei clan. He had betrayed the Wei clan long ago, and none of his actions were the clan’s intentions.","They claimed that the Wei clan was determined to stand with the Federation and would never cooperate with the Monster Cult. Only a few people believed this outrageous lie, but it was best for the Wei clan to release a statement than to remain silent.","In the Federation, an invisible hand was pushing all of this along. Slowly, it diverted everyone’s attention. The people’s anger was terrifying, but the people were also forgetful.","Soon, everyone refocused their attention on Chu Yunfan, especially on the character that appeared in the video. Chu Yunfan’s escape and even counter-attacks were an incredible miracle.","While discussing Chu Yunfan, the people did not know that undercurrents were surging in the dark. Countless people were waiting for Chu Yunfan to break through.","The center of the incident, Chu Yunfan, mobilized Special Ops’s channels and began collecting the ingredients for a Divinity Nourishment Pill. He already had the central ingredient—the inner core of a third-tier Divine monster.","With his current power and influence, he could get as many herbs as he wanted with just a few words. That was the benefit of joining the government. The government’s abundance of cultivation resources was not something other forces could compare to.","He was not in a hurry to make the pill because he knew everyone was waiting for him to break through. When he did, someone would make a move. With his current strength, third-tier Divine experts were no match for him. If they could not hold out, Chu Yunfan would kill them.","He could still protect himself even against a fourth-tier Divine expert. He fully prepared himself for that battle, as it would be enough to wipe out the unstable factors inside and outside the Federation.","Though Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry, it was easy for Special Ops to collect these herbs. Not to mention that Special Ops had recently raided and exterminated various forces under his leadership.","Just within the Outskirt Territories, two sects had been exterminated. Although a part of the spoils was credited to the military, the remainder was still enough for Special Ops.","Special Ops’ strength grew twice as large after Chu Yunfan took over. His prestige in office was unprecedentedly high. As a result, the members carried out Chu Yunfan’s orders quickly and to a tee.","When the herbs were transported into the city, Chu Yunfan announced to the outside world that he would be going into seclusion for a time. He did not say what he was about to do, but many who had been waiting for this understood that the opportunity had finally come.","“It’s finally here. It will be Chu Yunfan’s death when he tries to break through!”","“Let him live a little longer.”","“I can use my full strength now.”","Chu Yunfan’s seclusion did not attract much attention within Special Ops. Many thought he was just doing ordinary seclusion.","As to not alert the enemy, Chu Yunfan did not tell anyone. However, countless pairs of eyes were watching him.","A true battle of the ages was about to begin, and it was about to shock the world."]},{"number":902,"title":"Chapter 902 Breakthrough, the Outbreak of a Great Battle","paragraphs":["902 Breakthrough, the Outbreak of a Great Battle","There was a huge training room in the depths of Special Ops’ headquarters. A substantial alchemical furnace stood in it, and beside the furnace were countless herbs.","The Deep Sea Crocodile expert’s inner core was nestled within one of the treasure boxes. It emitted a faint precious light. The fluctuation of the divine power was at least several times stronger than the inner cores that Chu Yunfan had obtained before.","“Let’s begin.”","Next to Chu Yunfan was a spatial rift, and on the other side of the spatial rift was the space of the Mountain River Diagram. Inside, the Thunder Winged Beast was on high alert, ready to attack at any moment.","The people outside thought they could interrupt Chu Yunfan while he tried to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage and cause him to suffer a backlash.","However, they did not know that Chu Yunfan planned to make his breakthrough in the Mountain River Diagram. Even if they broke into Special Ops’ base, it would not affect him in any way.","These people were destined to be disappointed.","After preparing everything, Chu Yunfan lit the fire for the furnace and added various herbs to it at lightning speed. He controlled everything to minute detail. Compared to the first time he refined the Divinity Nourishment Pill, there was already a world-shaking change.","He was a hundred times more powerful than before. Back then, he only had a 70% chance of successfully making the Divinity Nourishment Pill, but now, he had a 100% chance of success.","Chu Yunfan went into seclusion for an entire day and successfully made the pill. It was much earlier than when he had first made it.","If an Alchemy Emperor took action, they could refine a large pile of Divinity Nourishment Pills in just a moment’s effort. To an alchemist, the stronger they were, the easier it was to make pills.","Chu Yunfan moved to take the Divinity Nourishment Pill out of the furnace, and a medicinal fragrance instantly filled the air. The pill sat in the middle of the furnace, quietly emitting a precious glow.","He picked up the pill and then stepped into the Mountain River Diagram. Upon swallowing the pill, an endless medicinal power began to radiate from it.","This breakthrough utterly differed from any of his previous breakthroughs. When Chu Yunfan broke through before, the power would integrate with his energy and flow into his limbs and bones to expand his body.","However, it was different this time. All the energy began to rush into Chu Yunfan’s mind like a swarm of bees. Suddenly, he felt like his brain was boiling. It was as if countless energies were erupting in his mind. Still, he was not flustered because he had already prepared himself. He quickly circulated the Emperor Method.","The energy swarmed into his mind but did not disperse at will. Instead, Chu Yunfan’s Emperor Method controlled it, constantly attacking a particular forbidden area in Chu Yunfan’s mind.","This level was like a closed door, separating the mortal and the extraordinary. Only by opening this door could one truly achieve transcendence.","Chu Yunfan’s infinite Spirit Energy was also undergoing a form of transformation. His Spirit Energy gradually merged with his True Energy, transforming into a powerful force unique to those in the Divine Abilities Stage.","However, Chu Yunfan dared not let his guard down. All of this happened in his mind. If he made the slightest mistake, his brain would explode and he would die.","Chu Yunfan could sense the door’s existence as his Spirit Energy grew. Once he opened the door, he would be in a new world and be different from others.","However, the toughness and tenacity of that door were beyond imagination. If Chu Yunfan were to break through it himself, it would take at least a year.","Suddenly, the godhead lying quietly in Chu Yunfan’s mind responded. It burst out with a rainbow light and enveloped his senses. Even the forbidden area he could sense seemed to be undergoing a shocking change.","He dared not hesitate and immediately began to cultivate. Suddenly, he made a shocking decision and jumped into the pool of lightning liquid.","The lightning liquid began to boil crazily, turning into an endless amount of lightning energy that constantly washed over his body.","Chu Yunfan used the lightning liquid’s energy to complete the last step of the Imperial Physique’s cultivation. From the skin to the flesh, and now to the bone. Once he completed it, his physical body would reach an incredible level.","A large part of the pool’s energy was converted into energy by the Emperor Method, which constantly trained his body. At almost every moment, the lightning liquid’s energy electrocuted his cells, but they would stubbornly regenerate. This was an unprecedented cultivation method.","Chu Yunfan only had a little time to complete the Imperial Physique’s cultivation. After all, he wanted to complete it all in one go.","Initially, this was impossible, but with the recovery of his godhead, he felt that the violent medicinal power of the Divinity Nourishment Pill in his mind begin to calm down.","It began to attack the forbidden area and gradually combined its mental power with innate True Energy, transforming it into an extraordinary divine power.","A considerable portion of the lightning liquid turned into energy and surged into his mind, being absorbed by the godhead.","The godhead absorbed this energy and emitted a rainbow light, protecting Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough path.","Once he broke through and finally completed the Imperial Physique’s bone stage, Chu Yunfan’s strength would increase to unfathomable extents.","That was what countless people wanted to stop. As time passed, more and more people outside the Special Ops’s headquarters began investigating. Finally, on this night, those who had been holding back for a long time took action.","The pitch-black night stopped in the distant night sky. The lights in Special Ops drove the darkness far away.","Suddenly, hundreds of shining lights in the sky rose out of thin air, intertwining into a network of countless flames. Upon closer inspection, these hundreds of lights were the tail flames of hundreds of powerful missiles.","These light rays tore through the night and streaked the sky above Special Ops.","At that moment, hundreds of missiles exploded in mid-air before anyone could react. The terrifying explosion shocked everyone and tore the night apart, making the sky as bright as day.","The real battle was about to begin."]},{"number":903,"title":"Chapter 903 Nuclear Bombs Bombarding the Ground, the War Is in Full Swing","paragraphs":["903 Nuclear Bombs Bombarding the Ground, the War Is in Full Swing","Countless missiles exploded in mid-air as if they had collided with something. Under the light, one could vaguely see a huge barrier that surrounded the entire Special Ops.","As one of the top law enforcement departments in the Federation, how could Special Ops not have a barrier defense? Especially with their recent wealth.","It was even more exaggerated than the barrier of the Eight Greats. After all, the mighty Federation backed the Special Ops.","None of these missiles could penetrate into Special Ops, but the situation instantly made Special Ops sound their sirens.","“Enemies are attacking!”","“Hurry!”","“Mechas, take off!”","All of Special Ops instantly reacted. The lowest level personnel was a martial artist in the Acquired Stage. Compared to ordinary people, these people’s reaction speed was much faster.","They never expected foreign enemies to invade their headquarters in Kunlun City, especially when there was no reaction from the city.","Many quickly ran out of the office building. From inside Special Ops’ headquarters, many mechas took off. However, they only saw this scene for a moment.","A missile was flying over from a distance. Then the sky above Special Ops suddenly became as bright as day, and a massive mushroom cloud formed above Special Ops’ building. The barrier that could withstand dozens of missiles got utterly blown apart.","Boom!","The terrifying explosion brought along countless white lights that wreaked havoc in all directions. Although the barrier had eliminated most of the explosion’s power, the aftershocks blew away many Special Ops experts. The aftershocks even sent many mechas that had just taken flight flying and they crashed into the office building.","Everyone was dumbfounded, and many almost went blind. The explosion’s light was as bright as the sun. If it were ordinary people, they would certainly have been blinded a long time ago.","“It’s a nuclear bomb!”","No one knew who shouted, but Special Ops was in an uproar. Everyone was shocked as this attack was even more terrifying than what they had expected.","A nuclear bomb had sieged their office. As a law enforcement agency of the Federation, they represented the face of the Federation. Being attacked was already a big deal, not to mention by a nuclear bomb.","Everyone could imagine that the Federation would be in an uproar the next day, regardless of the outcome. Neither the government nor the army would tolerate such a situation.","No matter who was involved, it was conceivable that they would face a thunderous blow from the Federation. No one knew why someone would be so bold.","There was no doubt about the nuclear bomb’s power as one of them broke the defensive barrier.","Some reacted quickly and thought the chief of Special Ops was the only person who could be targeted in such a way and have such a powerful weapon used against him.","Chu Yunfan brought the Fire Acolytes’ sect master back for trial and sentenced him to death. This matter caused a great uproar outside but made countless Special Ops members feel high-spirited.","So what if it was a Divine expert? If they broke the law, Special Ops would judge them.","However, it was clear this matter would take some work to resolve. The attack out on the Infinite Sea had been a follow-up to this matter. However, the matter should have ended after the chief had killed several Divine experts.","Now, it seemed undercurrents were still surging in the dark. There was no end to it.","“This isn’t good! They’re here for Chief Chu!”","Deep inside Special Ops’ headquarters, Huo Ruonan, the deputy chief, was the first to react. However, the enemy’s whereabouts were still unknown. Since the other party dared to make a move, it would be challenging to deal with them.","This would undoubtedly be a long and difficult night for Special Ops.","“Pass on my order. All mechas are to take off. Fire all the ground-to-air missiles and shoot down all the enemies!”","At this moment, countless violent tides swept across the sky. It was as if a dam had collapsed, and torrential water currents gushed out. It almost instantly drowned the entire Special Ops.","Suddenly, a marvelous sword light slashed across the sky. When the flood came into contact with this sword light, it only took an instant before the light ultimately reduced it to nothingness.","As many exclaimed in surprise, a figure slowly appeared in the sky above Special Ops. Many looked at it and exclaimed.","“It’s the Tang clan leader!”","Most recognized the white figure in the sky as none other than Tang Siyu, the current leader of the Tang clan. Many realized this because they knew the relationship between her and their chief was extraordinary.","Moreover, according to the information they had received, Tang Siyu had recently entered the Divine Abilities Stage. Although she had just stepped into this level, there was no doubt the current Special Ops needed a Divine expert.","“Come out. There’s no point in playing tricks since you’re already here,” Tang Siyu said slowly.","Her clear and melodious voice was full of endless majesty. She was much more powerful than when she had just broken through. She possessed the power of the mysterious Arcane Sky Spirit Physique. After her clan had invested various resources into her regardless of the cost, she had already entered the first tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Compared to others, this cultivation progress was shocking, even if it was not as fast as Chu Yunfan’s.","“Hehehe! Tang Siyu, since you’re here, you will die as well!”","An incomparably enormous figure slowly emerged. It looked like a vicious crocodile that covered the entire sky. Everyone took a sharp intake of breath.","Tang Siyu pulled out her sword and pounced forward without much thought. Her body flickered a few times, dragging a long shadow through the sky."]},{"number":904,"title":"Chapter 904 When You Sing, I Will Appear","paragraphs":["904 When You Sing, I Will Appear","The colossal crocodile covering almost half the sky was a Divine expert, but he was not the most powerful. The two Divine experts collided fiercely. It was as if a nuclear bomb had exploded, and the whole place was in an uproar.","Tang Siyu was much smaller than the enormous crocodile. However, she was not the slightest bit inferior in this collision. It was as if the void was about to explode.","At that moment, another figure appeared and pounced toward Tang Siyu. His spear pierced through the air and swept toward Tang Siyu amid her fierce battle with the crocodile.","The spear’s power was intense. Wherever the spear passed, the fluctuation of Spirit Energy would occur. One could see the flames in the spear erupting through the darkness. No one could resist it.","As the spear was about to pierce Tang Siyu, a figure flickered through the air and appeared before the spear. The figure spread his hands and formed a huge barrier in front of him. The spear pierced through the barrier, but it could no longer advance. At this time, the two figures revealed themselves.","Many recognized the figure who had created the barrier. It was the junior leader of the Chu clan, Chu Haoyue, who had been in the limelight recently. After becoming a Divine expert, he was poised to become the next head of the clan.","Since Chu Yunfan showed little interest in the clan, Chu Haoyue did not have a competitor. All Chu Haoyue’s competitors from back then were on a lower level than him now.","As someone who had been in the limelight recently, people naturally knew him very well, especially those in Special Ops.","The other person was a tall, sturdy man with white hair and a ruddy complexion. He wore a fiery red robe and looked like a ball of fire.","His spear shimmered as if it were a fireball.","“I didn’t expect to see you here,” Chu Haoyue said.","When everyone focused on the man with white hair and ruddy complexion, someone exclaimed, “Isn’t that the Flaming Spear, Mo Beidou?!”","The person yelling recognized the man.","After hearing this, everyone in Special Ops’ expression changed. That was because many had heard rumors about Mo Beidou. Many people had grown up hearing rumors about him.","This powerhouse, famous for a hundred years, spent most of his time in outer space and did not usually enter the Federation’s territory. No one had expected him to appear so suddenly.","Chu Haoyue looked at Mo Beidou and thundered, “Mo Beidou, do you know what kind of crime it is to attack Special Ops, a branch department of the Federation?”","“No need to talk to me in such a tone. Since I’m here, it shows that I have nothing to fear. If the Federation’s president were here, I would be afraid. However, he isn’t.”","Mo Beidou sneered as he looked at Chu Haoyue. “I’m an old acquaintance of your family’s Great Ancestor. It was difficult for you to become a Divine expert, so don’t throw your life away here.","“Today, someone entrusted me to come and claim Chu Yunfan’s life. If you insist on stopping me, don’t blame me for killing you too.”","Mo Beidou’s expression grew cold.","“Mo Beidou, you want to kill my descendant, but you didn’t even ask for my permission!”","At this moment, another shocking aura came from within Special Ops. An older man in gray clothes slowly revealed himself. The man looked a little old, but his footsteps were remarkably steady, his body was strong, and his energy was terrifying.","“Why is the Chu Great Ancestor here?”","The Chu Great Ancestor’s appearance shocked Special Ops. In a short time, three other Divine experts had appeared, and one was a top expert like the Chu Great Ancestor, who had long been famous worldwide.","Many realized that the sudden attack had caught them off guard, but it did not mean it caught their chief off guard too.","The Chu Great Ancestor, Chu Haoyue, and Tang Siyu—the master of the Tangs—could not have arrived so quickly.","There was only one possibility—that they had been here all along.","It was evident that Chu Yunfan had anticipated this battle. He did not just give up but had arranged a similarly top-notch lineup to deal with it.","Thinking that their chief had long been prepared, Special Ops felt much more at ease. It turned out it was not an unprepared surprise attack. With so many top-tier experts keeping watch, they felt relieved.","A piece of news had spread out. It attracted many experts because their chief was in total seclusion to break through the Divine Abilities Stage. These people were probably here to stop it.","However, they could not help at this moment. Unless they used a nuclear bomb, it would be tough for mortals to interfere in the battle between Divine experts.","“You? Can you stop us all by yourself?” Mo Beidou looked at the Chu Great Ancestor and continued, “That brat from your clan doesn’t know the rules. Those who don’t follow the rules will die.”","The Chu Great Ancestor glanced at Mo Beidou, saying, “That’s our family’s business. It is not your place to meddle. Tomorrow, you’ll become a wanted criminal of the Federation. You’ll have to find a way to hide.”","“Hahaha! It has already come to this, and you’re still so stubborn. You can’t save him if we all want him dead!”","Suddenly, another figure flew over from a distance. This figure’s appearance caused Special Ops to burst out in uproar. It was a skinny older man in a dark yellow robe. However, he looked like a king who ruled the world.","“It’s the Huang Great Ancestor! My God! Out of the Eight Greats, three of them have sent Divine experts!”","Most people could not help but exclaim when they saw who the person was."]},{"number":905,"title":"Chapter 905 The Main Character Arrives, and a Great Battle Erupts","paragraphs":["905 The Main Character Arrives, and a Great Battle Erupts","Many Special Ops experts could not help but feel pessimistic. Although it was currently two against two, the combination of the Huang clan leader and Mo Beidou was far stronger than the Chu Great Ancestor and Chu Haoyue’s combination.","Among the four masters, Chu Haoyue was the least experienced, which meant he was the weakest. After all, limited people were like Chu Yunfan. Chu Haoyue was just an average person.","“The Huang Great Ancestor is also here!”","Deep within Special Ops’ headquarters, Huo Ruonan was staring at the Huang Great Ancestor. She knew things were not looking good. Even the army would get held back if a person of such a level got involved. She smiled bitterly.","“Your chief is so annoying. Even if we are to face severe punishment from the Federation, we still have to eliminate your chief.”","“The kid is annoying. Hahahaha, but he is the Federation’s hope!” A hearty laugh echoed in the distance, followed by an elderly figure flying over.","“It’s Heavenly Dragon Elder! It’s him!” Someone from the Special Ops recognized the person.","“He’s planning to add to the number of Divine experts here!” someone cried out in surprise. Many might be unable to see even one Divine expert their entire lives.","The number of Divine experts here was increasing, and it looked like more than ten of them. The number of Divine experts they had seen throughout their lives could not even compare to how many had appeared today.","“It’s you...” Both Mo Beidou and the Huang clan leader had looks of disbelief on their faces.","They had prepared an extensive lineup today to deal with Chu Yunfan and prevent the Chu Great Ancestor and others from coming to help. However, the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s appearance was beyond their expectations.","The Heavenly Dragon Elder had only met Chu Yunfan once at his birthday banquet, and now he was willing to help Chu Yunfan.","“Heavenly Dragon Elder, why must you get involved in this? It’s a pool of muddy water for you. You shouldn’t stay out of it.” The Huang Great Ancestor glared at the Heavenly Dragon Elder coldly.","Most would consider the two sides old friends. Over the past hundred years, they had cooperated and fought alongside each other—until now.","“I don’t want to get involved either.” The Heavenly Dragon Elder walked in step by step. “Although my villa is not within the Federation’s territories, I have my principles. Brothers may fight each other, but I can’t accept joining forces with outsiders. Especially when it’s the Monster Cult that attacks my people.”","The Heavenly Dragon Elder made himself very clear. Although he was independent of the Federation and was in a neutral position, the Federation still had his back. His neutral policy would work as long as the Federation existed.","If these people annihilated the Federation, no matter if it were the Infinite Demon Mountain, the Sea Race, or the Holy Land, no one would allow them to remain neutral.","As the saying goes, those not of our race had a different heart.","The most important thing was that he thought highly of Chu Yunfan. If Chu Yunfan could make it through today, no one would be able to stop him. He had already started his momentum, and no one could stop him.","After all, it was better to send charcoal during the snow than to add flowers on top of a grave. Everyone understood this principle. The Longevity Pill Chu Yunfan gave the Heavenly Dragon Elder was essential, and he had to return the favor.","Therefore, when Chu Yunfan invited him, the Heavenly Dragon Elder agreed without hesitation.","“No one can save Chu Yunfan today!”","At this time, a cold voice sounded in the distance. Another strong middle-aged man strode over while astride a light beam. His aura was monstrous, no less than that of the Heavenly Dragon Elder who had just appeared. The balance of the victory had tilted in the other party’s favor.","The energy and blood in his body boiled, and he looked like an incomparably colossal whale. He was an expert from the Deep Sea Whale tribe.","Among the current sea tribes, the two clans that have had the most contact with humans were the Deep Sea Whales and the Deep Sea Crocodiles.","Since the two major tribes had Divine experts, there was no doubt that the situation had worsened for Special Ops.","“How dare a member of the marine folks appear here. Are you looking for death?!”","Suddenly, another loud voice came from the depths of Special Ops. An older man wearing a military uniform strode out. His hair was white, but his spirit was unassailable.","“It’s Marshal Zhu!”","Many Special Ops experts instantly recognized the older man. He was the legendary marshal, Zhu Buping, who had a long reputation within the army.","Zhu Buping took one step at a time as he entered the scene. The aura around his body continued to erupt. He was equal to this Deep Sea Whale expert.","Many of the Special Ops experts were utterly dumbfounded because the battle was likely to involve more than ten Divine experts.","No matter how well-prepared Special Ops were, they would be destroyed.","Besides the Deep Sea Crocodile expert and Tang Siyu, who were fighting intensely, the aura the others released suppressed everything as if they would crush both Heaven and Earth.","It was too terrifying.","“Zhu Buping, you dare to stop me?!”","From afar, another shout echoed, followed by a figure flying over. The person’s potent aura could suppress all the Divine experts. The energy and blood he emitted were so powerful that one could feel it even at night. The aura resembled the Sun in the Sky.","“All of you must kill that little b*stard before he breaks through. Leave these troublesome fakes to me.”","When this person arrived, he began to command the Divine experts, and no one felt anything was amiss.","The Special Ops members gasped when they saw this person. They understood that the main character had finally arrived. This person was none other than the Jiang Great Ancestor who had a blood feud with their chief.","The Jiang Great Ancestor was much more powerful than the rumors. He seemed to have subdued everyone the moment he arrived as if he was the king of the world.","The real battle finally broke out. the Jiang Great Ancestor raised his saber, and the atmosphere became intense."]},{"number":906,"title":"Chapter 906 Overall Disadvantage, When Will Chu Yunfan Come Out of Seclusion?","paragraphs":["906 Overall Disadvantage, When Will Chu Yunfan Come Out of Seclusion?","“Fourth tier Divine.”","Zhu Buping opened his mouth and spat out these three words.","The others’ expressions were also extremely grave. Only at their level could they understand what the fourth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage meant.","Against such powerful figures, crushing defeat was imminent. An expert at this level was terrifyingly powerful. Those above the fourth tier were almost invincible when going up against anyone lower level than them.","The Jiang Great Ancestor had just stepped into this level, but the suppression and advantage the breakthrough had brought were still obvious.","He wielded a saber in his hand, and his expression was filled with absolute confidence. It would be great if he could disrupt Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough and cause him to go berserk, but whether he succeeded or not was irrelevant. He was confident that he could kill Chu Yunfan with his now tyrannical strength.","Strength was the guarantee of confidence.","“Are you going to get in my way? Then, I’ll kill all of you as well!” the Jiang Great Ancestor boomed.","“I have no choice. I may be a old bag of bones, but I still have to go to the battlefield.” Zhu Buping looked at the Jiang Great Ancestor indifferently.","In terms of cultivation base, there was indeed a considerable gap between him and the Jiang Great Ancestor. However, he did not plan on defeating the Jiang Great Ancestor. He was only going to stall him.","“Let’s take to the skies. You won’t be able to bear the consequences if we fight here,” Zhu Buping said as he looked at the Jiang Great Ancestor icily.","“Just you? That’s not enough,” the Jiang Great Ancestor said coldly.","“Then count me in.” The Heavenly Dragon Elder stepped forward.","“Me too,” the Chu Great Ancestor said.","The three third-tier Divine experts stepped forward to stop the Jiang Great Ancestor because they knew how terrifying his current state was. Only if the three of them attacked together would they be able to fight him to a draw.","“You stay here. Otherwise, there will be nobody to hold the fort,” Zhu Buping said to the Chu Great Ancestor.","Then, he flew into the sky, followed by the Heavenly Dragon Elder.","The Jiang Great Ancestor said not a word and followed behind. The consequences of fighting here were too severe. If Kunlun City was destroyed, even the Jiangs wouldn’t be able to bear the consequences.","The Federation was so powerful that it wouldn’t be a problem for it to destroy them.","Boom, boom, boom!","In a short while, the light of all kinds of terrifying divine powers swept through the sky. In the distant sky, three top-tier Divine experts were fighting.","Be it general Zhu Buping or the Heavenly Dragon Elder, both of them were famous top-notch experts. In terms of strength, they were extremely powerful existences within the Federation. However, through Special Ops’ cameras, many were shocked to find that the Jiang Great Ancestor was easily suppressing both of them.","The Jiang Great Ancestor suppressed these people with just a few strikes of his powerful Life Ender technique.","On the other side, after they were no longer held back, Mo Beidou and the Deep Sea Whale expert made their move and faced the Chu Great Ancestor. An extremely shocking conflict instantly broke out between the two sides.","The battle soared into the sky. They still maintained some rationality and did not make a move in Special Ops since they were in Kunlun City which was not far from Special Ops. Experts of this level could destroy the entire city.","On another end, the Huang Great Ancestor looked at Chu Haoyue coldly.","“Chu Haoyue, it’s still not too late for you to step aside. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being impolite,” he said.","Now that the Chus were about to rise up, Chu Haoyue too had risen. For the future of the Huang clan, the Huang Great Ancestor had come to kill Chu Yunfan. But for that same future, he was not willing to completely offend the Chus.","Now that the Chus had two powerful experts with divine powers, their future was limitless.","“As long as I’m here, you will not pass through here,” Chu Haoyue said indifferently.","“In that case, don’t blame me for taking action!” the Huang Great Ancestor roared and began to fight Chu Haoyue.","At this time, the battlefield above Special Ops had been divided into four parts, and the Chus were at a disadvantage in three of the four battlefields.","Only Tang Siyu had the upper hand in the battle with the huge crocodile. In terms of strength, Tang Siyu, who had already a first-tier Divine, managed to beat the huge crocodile and force it to retreat.","Although the huge crocodile had also entered the first tier of the Divine Abilities Stage and was much stronger than the average human expert, he had unfortunately encountered Tang Siyu who cultivated the Arcane Sky Spirit Physique.","Whether it was in terms of skill or physical strength, Tang Siyu was much more terrifying than him.","Suddenly, just when everyone thought that everything would be decided by the outcome of these battles, a blood-red figure rushed toward Special Ops. The barrier surrounding the building had been broken and no one could stop the blood-red figure.","But just as the figure was about to enter the building, a huge lightning bolt descended from the sky and struck the blood-red figure.","Everyone finally saw who it was. The blood-red figure was wrapped in blood-red energy that gave off a terrifying demonic aura.","This person’s entire body flowed with blood-red energy, and there was a pair of blood-red wings on his back. At a glance, he looked like a blood-red bat, which was extremely terrifying.","“It’s a hybrid of the Monster Cult!” many people exclaim.","They all recognized that this monster hybrid was the product of the cult’s many years of experimentation.","It was not easy for a hybrid to reach the Innate Stage, and this person had clearly surpassed it and had reached the Divine Abilities Stage. Although he had barely entered it, it was an incredible miracle for a hybrid.","There was no telling how many tens of thousands of lives were behind this.","“The hybrids of the cult have actually reached this stage?”","From within the depths of Special Ops, Huo Ruonan fixed her gaze on the figure. There was no doubt that the cult was ahead of the Federation in the field of monster hybrids. She didn’t know what kind of evil secret technique had been used to achieve this.","At the same time, a blue figure rushed out from the depths of Special Ops and fought the blood-red figure.","There were five battles happening in the sky above Special Ops. Countless experts were staring up at the sky because they knew that the ones who would decide the outcome were not them, but these top experts.","Countless people had the same thought. ‘Chief Chu, when are you coming out of seclusion?’"]},{"number":907,"title":"Chapter 907 Finally Out of Seclusion, Showing off Divine Power With One Hand","paragraphs":["907 Finally Out of Seclusion, Showing off Divine Power With One Hand","The battlefield was divided into five parts, and more than ten Divine experts were fighting madly above Kunlun City.","Everyone within the city trembled in fear. However, no news had been released, so no one knew what was going on. All communications had been completely sealed off. It was clear that they had been prepared for this.","On the battlefield, Chu Haoyue was the one in the most difficult position. The gap between him and the Huang Great Ancestor was huge. Although the Huang Great Ancestor was not at his peak state, Chu Haoyue was completely crushed by the gap in level and combat experience.","After all, it hadn’t been long since he had reached this level, so he was almost instantly suppressed. Judging from the situation, the Huang Great Ancestor would pass him very soon.","At this moment, Special Ops finally realized the difference between the different tiers of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Everyone recognized the blue figure on a different battlefield. It was none other than the Thunder Winged Beast that follows Chu Yunfan all year round.","At the most critical moment, even the Thunder Winged Beast had appeared. Everyone knew how bad the situation was. In other words, there was no one else to defend Chu Yunfan now. It was easy to imagine how dangerous the situation was.","The blood-red hybrid carried an extremely strong demonic aura. It was unknown how many people’s resentment it had to bear before it was forcefully created, but the Thunder Winged Beast completely suppressed him.","The power of thunder dominated over this demonic energy, forcing the other party to retreat.","However, the hearts of those from Special Ops clenched. They could see that their side was at a complete disadvantage. It was not something that could be resolved even if Tang Siyu or the Thunder Winged Beast had the upper hand.","The only way to break out of this dangerous situation was for their chief to come out of seclusion in person. Only then could they possibly reverse this extreme disadvantage.","Spurt!","On the battlefield, the outcome was finally decided. Every second felt like a century to the members of Special Ops. Every second could determine the outcome of the battle.","The first person who failed to hold out was Chu Haoyue, whom the Huang Great Ancestor sent flying.","And the Huang Great Ancestor didn’t stop. He rushed toward Special Ops, wanting to kill Chu Yunfan.","“Sh*t! Stop him! Fire all missiles! Mechas, take off!” Huo Ruonan roared, and the numerous missiles from the depths of Special Ops swept over like a rain of bullets.","“Hmph!” the Huang Great Ancestor snorted coldly as the saber in his hand split the air before him.","The missiles and cannonballs all exploded in mid-air, unable to hurt him in the slightest. For an expert of his level, unless it was a nuclear bomb, it would be very difficult to pose much of a threat to him.","Swish!","The Huang Great Ancestor launched forward. The mechas that were rising into the sky couldn’t stop him in time. They could only watch as he rushed past them.","Suddenly, a terrifying aura burst out from the depths of the building. Countless Spirit Energy gathered toward that direction. The terrifying power enveloped almost half of Kunlun City.","“This is the phenomenon of someone who broke through to the Divine Abilities Stage. How is it so huge?!”","Everyone was completely dumbfounded, especially the Huang Great Ancestor. He was the first to feel the pressure of the terrifying Spirit Energy phenomenon. When he broke through to the Divine Abilities Stage, the power he had invoked was not even one-tenth of this scale.","This was a phenomenon that was caused by nature when one breaks through to the Divine Abilities Stage. After breaking through, the person would begin to become one with nature, which in turn caused this phenomenon.","“He’s breaking through! This is the moment! We can’t let him survive it!’ the Huang Great Ancestor proclaimed.","From high up in the sky, the Jiang Great Ancestor also boomed, “Stop him! Kill him!”","The other experts, including Mo Beidou and the rest, froze. They all knew that victory or defeat would only be decided in that instant.","Fortunately, they still had time, so they should be able to stop him. After all, although Chu Yunfan had broken through, he would take some time to complete the process.","But at this moment, a figure that was even faster than him arrived. It was a dark shadow, and a shocking demonic energy burst out from its body. The energy shrouded the entire building.","“It’s the demons! They’ve sent an expert!”","Special Ops was completely stunned, or rather, dumbfounded. They had expected a demon expert to be involved in this.","There were experts from both inside and outside the Federation, and the marine folks and the demons were also involved. All of this was just to kill Chu Yunfan.","“Even the demons are involved!”","“How could you...” Zhu Buping was instantly enraged. This matter was not as simple as they had thought.","It didn’t matter whether this demon expert had been recruited by the Jiang Great Ancestor or not, its appearance signaled that they had noticed Chu Yunfan.","It was clear that Chu Yunfan was not someone they could ignore. His light was too dazzling, and even the demons were afraid of him. They wanted to take advantage of this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to kill him.","Under normal circumstances, as long as Chu Yunfan stayed within Kunlun City, with the protection of the local garrison and his own tyrannical strength, even if a few more demons came, they would surely perish. It was only at this moment that the demons could make use of the Federation’s internal conflicts to kill him.","Some people saw the true appearance of the shadow. It was a fox with six tails and its whole body burned with dark flames.","Records of this monster were within the Federation’s compilations. It was a Six-Tail Nether Flame Fox. This monster was extremely good at concealing itself. Even Divine experts wouldn’t be able to sense it. There were so many experts present, but none of them realized that there was a Six-Tail Nether Flame Fox hidden near them.","It had clearly been waiting for this opportunity to kill Chu Yunfan in one strike.","The Huang Great Ancestor stopped in his tracks because he knew that the fox was stronger than him in terms of assassination. He locked his divine sense onto it as his eyes flashed with greed.","A Divine Six-Tail Nether Flame Fox. No matter if it was dead or alive, its value would be immeasurable.","Just as Special Ops was about to fall into despair, a huge hand suddenly emerged from the building’s depths, grabbed at the fox, and pressed on its head tightly.","Immediately after, a sneer was heard. “Just to kill me, such a big lineup was sent out. Just as well. None of us will leave this place. Let’s die together!”"]},{"number":908,"title":"Chapter 908 The Terrifying One-Handed Beat Down","paragraphs":["908 The Terrifying One-Handed Beat Down","The voice attracted everyone’s attention. Even the Divine experts on the battlefield could not help but look over. When they saw a giant hand pressing down on the Six-tailed Nether Flame Fox, they could not help but gasp.","Although the fox was good in assassinations and not in direct combat, it had entered the Divine Stage. It was not weak at this stage, even if it had any shortcomings, because their abilities in all aspects had increased after stepping into that level.","Faced with the fox, they felt it was tough to deal with because it was too fast, especially when it kept hiding and attacking. It was almost impossible to guard against.","In that situation, even the Huang Great Ancestor stopped because he believed in the fox’s ability to launch a surprise attack. Chu Yunfan would not be able to escape.","However, a giant hand pressed the fox to the ground before it could attack.","The fox was much smaller than the crocodile that was fighting up in the sky, but it was still over sixteen feet tall. However, the energy-condensed hand was pressing down on the fox. This series of changes happened too quickly, almost like a blur.","Roar!","The fox erupted, turning into flames that filled the sky, about to burn the whole of Special Ops. It was outraged, as none had ever bullied it to this extent. The boundless dark flames were about to burn the large hand pressing on top of it.","At that moment, the Divine experts realized that the fox had entered the second tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","With such cultivation, everyone present, except the Jiang Great Ancestor, would be severely injured if it were a sneak attack. The fox was indeed an assassin from the human-demon battlefield. It was extremely terrifying.","However, it instantly realized that no matter how much Spirit Energy it channeled, it could not burn the enormous hand. That huge hand was like a divine mountain, firmly pressing the fox down.","The dark flames the fox was so proud of were utterly useless against the hand.","Suddenly, the big hand rose up, and the fox was overjoyed. It finally had the opportunity to escape.","It instantly turned into a dark figure and disappeared without a trace. Still, the hand reacted faster, turning into a golden lightning bolt and smacking toward the dark figure.","Bam!","The hand smashed the fox’s body, forming a dust cloud dozens of feet high. The ground of the Special Ops building cracked.","The ground was sealed with special cement. Using missiles to blast it was useless. Now, it had been smashed into pieces. One could imagine how powerful the big hand was.","The fox struggled to flee and escape into the distance, but the big hand slapped it again.","Bam!","The fox slammed into the ground again. It was as if all the bones in its body were about to break. It was terrifying, and the impact made it dizzy.","Roar!","The fox roared. As a Divine expert who had dominated the human-demon battlefield, it would never give in. Instead, it flew into the sky again. But, the big hand smacked it down again.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The fox tried to flee more than a dozen times, but the hand kept smacking it down. The fox could not break free from the hand.","When the fox landed for the last time, there was a massive pit around it. At this time, the fox no longer had its previous demonic aura. It looked like a great demon, but its blood covered its whole body.","Blood seeped from its fur, and its four legs had broken from fall after fall. It looked miserable. Its fur was exposed, and its bones were visible in some places. One could imagine what kind of attack the fox had suffered.","Everyone gasped because they knew who the owner of this big hand was. It was Chu Yunfan.","They knew how powerful Chu Yunfan was, but it seemed like they had underestimated him. He was not even physically present, and he was able to severely injure the Six-tailed Nether Flame Fox with just an energy-condensed hand.","It was as if Chu Yunfan was casually disciplining his disobedient pet. With a dozen slaps, he had made the fox, which had been on the human-demon battlefield and hated by countless people, so miserable.","Chu Yunfan knew how to use this kind of energy-condensed strike technique. It was a fundamental ability, but to use it to this extent and beat up a second-tier Divine monster was an unimaginable miracle.","If Chu Yunfan was this strong, how strong would he really be when he came out?","“No, I can’t let him continue to break through!”","The Huang Great Ancestor immediately felt a sense of danger. He initially thought the fox would be enough to injure Chu Yunfan severely, so he did not intervene. However, he now realized his previous estimation was too optimistic.","Swish!","The Huang Great Ancestor immediately flew toward the depths of Special Ops. He slashed out with a saber, and its light flew toward the depths of Special Ops.","Swish!","The terrifying blade light instantly tore through everything. It was as if it could split Special Ops in half. Suddenly, the enormous energy-condensed hand moved again and blocked the saber light.","Clang!","The saber light struck the energy-condensed hand, getting crushed inch by inch. The shattered saber light which filled the sky scattered. It was gorgeous but also highly dangerous.","“Petty tricks!” Chu Yunfan’s disdain filled voice echoed from the depths of Special Ops. The phenomenon in the sky was still expanding at an astonishing speed while Chu Yunfan was still going though a shocking transformation.","However, everyone could feel an increasingly powerful pressure gathering in this place. It was like an unparalleled expert was about to break free from their shackles.","“Stop him!” The Jiang Great Ancestor roared.","Even he could no longer suppress the anxiety in his heart."]},{"number":909,"title":"Chapter 909 Supernatural Phenomenon, Ascension Completed","paragraphs":["909 Supernatural Phenomenon, Ascension Completed","The Jiang Great Ancestor was anxious. He was no longer as confident as he was in the beginning. He was not sure if he could control the situation.","The strength that Chu Yunfan displayed far exceeded his expectation. He definitely couldn’t let Chu Yunfan continue to grow stronger.","But at this time, the Heavenly Dragon Elder and Zhu Buping knew that the battle had reached its most critical moment. They absolutely could not let the Jiang Great Ancestor interfere with Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, all their efforts would have been in vain.","They did everything they could to stop the Jiang Great Ancestor. Although the Jiang Great Ancestor was much stronger than them, he was held back for some time.","On the other battlefields, whether it was the Chu Great Ancestor, Chu Haoyue, Tang Siyu, or even the Thunder Winged Beast, all of them had rushed forth to buy Chu Yunfan every last bit of time.","Chu Yunfan was still in the process of breaking through, and the phenomenon it created was absolutely shocking. Once he was successful, it was simply unimaginable how powerful he would become.","He was the key to turning the tide of the battle.","The only person who had the means and opportunity to make a move now was the Huang Great Ancestor.","The Huang Great Ancestor’s saber attack was useless against Chu Yunfan. A sharp light flashed through his eyes, and the weapon in the ancestor’s hand exploded again.","All the divine power within his body burned, turning into a monstrous divine might. In the blink of an eye, he had slashed out thousands of times. Every slash contained all his strength, and they had the power to destroy the world.","These saber lights finally gathered together and turned into a huge long saber. The saber lights crisscrossed each other and turned into a terrifying rainbow light.","No one dared to ignore this attack. If it landed directly on Special Ops, the whole department would be turned into ashes.","The attack of a third-tier Divine was unimaginably overbearing.","When the saber fell, no one doubted that Chu Yunfan would be able to escape no matter where he hid.","Suddenly, just as the blade fell, a golden light burst out. A huge fist formed out of thin air and blasted toward the saber.","The fist force transformed into a huge golden roc. It let out a cry and rushed toward the Heavens, crushing everything in its path.","Boom!","The saber light and the golden roc collided in mid-air. The terrifying force destroyed everything and turned into a shockwave that was hundreds of feet wide.","Bam!","Under the impact of the golden roc’s attack, the saber light shattered. It was no different from before. No matter how powerful the force was, it could not do anything to this golden roc.","After shattering the saber light, the golden roc’s momentum didn’t slow down as it continued to attack the ancestor.","Bam!","The golden roc’s wing tore open a large wound on the ancestor’s chest. Blood spurted out, and the wound was so deep that one could see his bone.","The golden roc was as fast as a bolt of lightning. The Huang Great Ancestor was caught off guard and barely managed to avoid being split in half at the last second.","At this time, the golden roc’s remaining strength finally dissipated. It turned into a golden light and disappeared.","Huff! Huff!","The Huang Great Ancestor gasped for breath. He couldn’t believe it. He had suffered a huge loss in the collision. He was certain that he had used all his strength in that attack. He had held nothing back.","But even so, when it collided with the other party’s fist force, it collapsed at the first touch, and almost half of his body had been blown up.","As he circulated his internal energy to heal his injuries, he retreated to the side, not daring to go in any deeper. That earlier lesson had taught him that Chu Yunfan was not to be underestimated.","“Is this Chief Chu’s doing? That’s so scary!”","“The chief truly is powerful!”","“This is fantastic! Chief has passed the most dangerous stage!”","The whole of Special Ops was cheering. Judging from the current situation, Chu Yunfan should have already passed the most dangerous period and reached an astonishing realm.","With just a single punch, Chu Yunfan was able to severely injure the Huang Great Ancestor who was famous throughout the Federation. What kind of shocking strength was this?","If it was them in the past, they wouldn’t even dare to think about it. However, some had other thoughts in their hearts. No wonder these people wanted to kill their chief even if it meant offending the Federation.","It was because this kind of person was too destructive.","Among these people, the happiest were, of course, Huo Ruonan and the others. They were high-level members of Special Ops. If anything happened to Chu Yunfan, they would not be any better off. They could finally let out a deep breath.","Their chief seemed reckless, but he always proved to be prepared.","At this time, the Six-Tail Nether Flame Fox finally saw an opening. It turned into a dark flame and fled into the distance.","This place was terrifying. He had been on the human-demon battlefront for so many years, but he had never encountered such a dangerous and terrifying scene.","That person had yet to appear, but he already felt his heart pound. It was as if he was facing the master.","When the fox first received the order, he thought that some people from Infinite Demon Mountain were making a mountain out of a molehill. What was a human junior in comparison to them?","Who knew that this human who was no more than twenty years old, who would be considered an infant if placed within the demon clan, would scare him to death?","However, just when the fox thought that he had escaped, a thunderbolt suddenly appeared out of thin air. It turned into a long whip and struck the fox.","Bam!","The fox was ruthlessly hit to the ground, creating another large pit. There was a shocking wound on his body. A gash so deep had appeared—so deep that his bones could be seen, and he was almost split in half.","With just one whip, his spine was completely broken. He couldn’t move an inch. If it wasn’t for the strong life force of being at the Divine Abilities Stage, he would have died a long time ago.","“The next time you try to flee, you will die.”","From the depths of Special Ops came Chu Yunfan’s cold voice, which made the fox shiver. That voice sounded like it belonged to a demon.","Chu Yunfan was not human!","At the same time, the phenomenon that covered half of Kunlun City rapidly surged toward the Special Ops building. No one could stop it. Countless people within the city felt a terrifying pressure crushing in on them from all directions.","Finally, the phenomenon was formed, and Chu Yunfan’s ascend was completed.","A figure slowly walked out from the depths of Special Ops."]},{"number":910,"title":"Chapter 910 Killing a Third-Tier Divine With a Single Punch","paragraphs":["910 Killing a Third-Tier Divine With a Single Punch","Supernatural phenomenon. Ascension completed.","This was the phenomenon of the Divine Abilities Stage that everyone knew. Now, the phenomenon had been fully formed, and under it, a figure slowly approached the battlefield like a king.","The man’s footsteps were slow, but every step he took seemed to shake everyone’s hearts.","At this moment, he was the center of attention. He was the leader of all the heroes of the world.","!!","Although he had not really attacked yet, he had already stunned everyone. Just a moment ago, he had gravely injured the Huang Great Ancestor with a casual punch. It was like child’s play to him.","He had also casually beaten up the Six-Tail Nether Flame Fox that had dominated the human-demon battlefront and made countless people gnash their teeth in hatred.","“The next time you try to flee, you will die.”","This simple sentence had scared the fox witless. It crawled on the side, trembling and not daring to resist.","The wounds on his body were simply unbearable to look at. Blood was flowing everywhere, and the wounds were so deep that bones could be seen. Even a third-tier Divine would have to go all out. The extremely troublesome monster had been beaten up just like that.","It was none other than Chu Yunfan.","His eyes were as cold as ice, and the aura on his body was still developing. Everyone knew that it was because he had just broken through to the Divine Abilities Stage. The True Energy in his body had yet to completely transform into divine power.","He was constantly transforming and becoming stronger. People could even sense that he was getting stronger at a rapid rate with every passing moment.","The power that could crush everything was gradually rising.","Chu Yunfan barely even glanced at the Six-Tail Nether Flame Fox that was already half dead. After this lesson, the fox surely wouldn’t dare to run away. He naturally had his reasons for not killing the fox.","“What a great lineup.” Chu Yunfan looked at the many powerful beings in the sky. “To kill me, you guys have really put in a lot of effort. If it was an ordinary person, I’m afraid they would have died under this lineup.”","Step by step, Chu Yunfan ascended into the sky. At this time, he no longer needed to rely on his thunder wings to fly. Flying was an instinct of a Divine.","Chu Yunfan had truly stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage and had become a true Divine.","He could feel his life force boiling as he broke through to a new forbidden zone. When he looked at the world, he realized he had gained a new understanding.","Chu Yunfan glanced at the Huang Great Ancestor and said, “Kill yourself and I’ll let the Huang clan live.”","His expression was extremely calm, but there was an unquestionable meaning in it. At this moment, he was the king who ruled the world.","Chu Yunfan had no intention of killing the whole Huang clan. He wanted to uproot their power, but that didn’t mean that he wanted to kill all the hundreds of thousands of people within their clan. Excluding the countless people who had various relatives within the Huang clan, there were millions of people in total. He was not a homicidal maniac.","After all, they weren’t like those evil Monster Cult members who had been brainwashed living out in the Outskirt Territories. Many of the Huangs’ descendants were the Federation’s elites.","Of course, this was also largely related to his current strength. With his current strength, the Huangs no longer posed a threat to him.","“Fat chance!”","The Huang Great Ancestor was so enraged that his entire body trembled. When had he been humiliated to such an extent? Even the president wouldn’t dare to ask him to commit suicide.","Chu Yunfan had no respect for him, and this was a direct slap to his face.","At this moment, the Huang Great Ancestor erupted. The saber he wielded burst out with countless saber lights. It instantly turned into a peerless firmament. All manners of multicolored light swept through the sky. At this moment, his aura rose to an extremely powerful level.","‘He’s so close. This is my chance!’ A crazed look appeared in the Huang Great Ancestor’s eyes.","Chu Yunfan was standing close to him now. Another few inches and he would close the gap between them.","“You’re so careless!”","Just as he had expected, the saber light cut into Chu Yunfan’s body. Even an expert at the third-tier Divine would be severely injured and die if caught off guard.","Clang!","The saber collided with Chu Yunfan’s body, and the light that burst out was as brilliant as the Sun in the sky, illuminating the dark night.","“It’s done!” Mo Beidou roared.","Everyone, including the Jiang Great Ancestor and the Deep Sea Whale expert, had an expression of wild joy on their faces. Chu Yunfan did not manage to dodge this attack, so he was definitely going to die.","This time, they were definitely going to win.","“Oh no!”","The whole of Special Ops sucked in a breath of cold air. Chu Yunfan had been careless and got hit.","However, when the light faded, what everyone saw was completely different from what they had expected. The saber had landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but it didn’t even manage to cut through his skin.","Chu Yunfan’s body lit up with a jade-like light, and the saber light was unable to cut through this light.","Everyone was shocked and dumbfounded.","Chu Yunfan had taken a full-powered attack from a third-tier Divine, but he was completely unscathed. He didn’t even make any defensive moves. He wasn’t wearing any armor, nor was he using any defensive formations or barriers. He was able to pull off this incredible feat purely with his physical body.","What a terrifying thing this was.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan’s face was calm. When he broke through to the Divine Abilities Stage, he had cultivated the Imperial Physique to the bone stage.","At this point, the Imperial Physique had reached its peak stage, and its power had undergone a tremendous change compared to before.","Moreover, after he had fused it with Thunderclap Physique, the Imperial Physique evolved to an unprecedented level. It was probably a level that even the founder of the Imperial Physique, the Alchemy Emperor, had never expected.","What the Alchemy Emperor couldn’t do, Chu Yunfan had done it.","“Impossible!”","The Huang Great Ancestor was the one who was the most affected because he also held the greatest hope. He thought that he could kill Chu Yunfan in one strike. Who knew that he couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan at all?","On the contrary, he didn’t even get a scratch on him.","Suddenly, he felt a chill run from the soles of his feet to the top of his head. He finally realized how far the gap between him and Chu Yunfan had become.","He wanted to flee, but Chu Yunfan would not give him the chance to do so.","Chu Yunfan simply clenched his fist and punched out. This punch transformed into an incomparably huge asura which also threw out a punch.","It shattered all of the Huang Great Ancestor’s defensive barriers before landing on the ancestor’s body.","Bam!","The Huang Great Ancestor was hit head-on. It was just a simple punch, but his body began to crack inch by inch in front of everyone’s eyes. Blood sprayed out like a mist, and he instantly died miserably.","Just one punch was enough."]},{"number":911,"title":"Chapter 911 The Power of an Electromagnetic Weapon, Killing Divines","paragraphs":["911 The Power of an Electromagnetic Weapon, Killing Divines","Chu Yunfan had killed a third-tier Divine expert with a single punch.","It was something that was supposed to happen only after a shocking battle. But now, the outcome was settled with a single punch. One could imagine how amazing it was.","Before Chu Yunfan had appeared, the Huang Great Ancestor had beaten up many experts with one hand.","And now, as soon as Chu Yunfan appeared, he killed the Huang Great Ancestor, who was in the third tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, with a single punch.","The Huang Great Ancestor was seriously injured, and it was Chu Yunfan who had injured him.","This was extremely terrifying.","“My god...”","After a deathly silence, the sound of many gasps could be heard. Chu Yunfan had become so powerful after breaking through.","It was simply unbelievable.","“Since everyone is here, let’s begin,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","From the beginning to the end, everything had been under his control. This was a trap he had set up to capture all those who were hostile to him in one fell swoop.","Everything was going according to plan. He had also successfully entered the Divine Abilities Stage. He could feel the divine power in his body increasing rapidly. Divine power was the source of all the incredible abilities of Divine experts.","Only after stepping into it did he realize that this power was formed after the combination of mental energy and one’s internal True Energy.","At this moment, the blood-red hybrid that was fighting the Thunder Winged Beast rushed over as if it had received an order. Countless rays of blood-red energy separated from the hybrid’s body and turned into blood-red crystals, which rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","Many people could sense that these blood-red rays contained terrifying energy. Once it exploded, it would form a terrible power.","“Be careful!”","Many people within Special Ops couldn’t help but exclaim.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, did not move an inch. From under his feet, the power of countless thunderbolts began to form a cyclone with him as the center. The cyclone swirled faster and soon surrounded him.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","With a series of loud explosions, the blood-red crystals all turned into nothingness when they came into contact with the lightning vortex around Chu Yunfan. They exploded in mid-air one by one, but they couldn’t cause any damage to Chu Yunfan.","The lightning energy in Chu Yunfan’s body formed a huge magnetic field around him, and no one and nothing could break through it.","At the same time as the blood-red crystals exploded, the hybrid pounced toward Chu Yunfan without care. At this moment, everyone felt a terrifying energy spreading from the hybrid’s body. It was on the verge of exploding.","That terrifying power made everyone’s face change!","“D*mn it! That lunatic!”","Even the Jiang Great Ancestor, who had been the most confident, had a change in his expression. In that instant, he also sensed the existence of extreme danger.","He instantly determined that it was a nuclear bomb. That was the only logical explanation. There was a nuclear bomb hidden within the body of the hybrid.","There was no doubt that the hybrid was aiming for Chu Yunfan, but in reality, the hybrid was a suicide soldier. His goal was to completely destroy Chu Yunfan.","The hybrid was already quite a distance away from Special Ops, and the battlefield was up in the sky. However, even the Jiang Great Ancestor could feel the extreme danger.","He determined that this was not a miniature nuclear bomb used under ordinary circumstances, but a large-scale nuclear bomb that was used to wipe out cities.","One of these bombs was enough to destroy the entire city.","Only then did he remember that although he and the Monster Cult’s master both wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, they had completely different ideals.","The cult master wanted to destroy the entire human civilization and allow the monsters to rule the entire world. Destroying Kunlun City was just something that the cult master did in passing.","Forget the Federation’s rage after this battle, they would surely be affected and might even die here.","“You’re looking for death!”","Even the Jiang Great Ancestor, who was very far away, had sensed it, so it was naturally impossible for Chu Yunfan to not notice.","Chu Yunfan sneered. He produced a coin out of thin air and threw it up into the sky. He opened his palm, and countless electric currents wrapped around his arm.","Suddenly, he opened his palm, and countless electric currents burst out and swept across the coin.","Boom!","The terrifying attack formed a super large electromagnetic cannon.","The attack swept out a three-foot-wide tide and instantly hit the hybrid.","Roar!","The hybrid screamed in pain as he was sent flying. A huge hole appeared in his chest, and his entire upper body evaporated. The nuclear bomb within his body that was about to explode also instantly evaporated.","Although he was a hybrid and had undergone all sorts of inhumane modifications, he was still undoubtedly dead at this moment, and he tumbled down from the sky.","This was a move Chu Yunfan had developed by imitating the principle of electromagnetic weapons. Its power was so great that it could destroy a Divine expert.","It was only because he possessed the Thunderclap Physique that he could achieve such a feat.","Everyone was completely dumbfounded.","“Was that an electromagnetic cannon?”","“Is it possible for a human to fire an attack similar to an electromagnetic cannon?”","“The Divine Abilities Stage truly can’t be calculated with common sense.”","“Chief Chu is so strong!”","The experts of Special Ops were all cheering for Chu Yunfan’s combat power. Only the Divine experts knew what had truly happened.","Chu Yunfan had saved the entire city. At the same time, they were shocked by Chu Yunfan’s amazing combat power. If it were them, they could at most blow away the hybrid, but they couldn’t stop the explosion of the nuclear bomb.","However, Chu Yunfan was able to completely crush his opponent.","Chu Yunfan didn’t let out a sigh of relief after killing the hybrid with one strike. His expression remained cold.","This hybrid had been sent by the cult master. To kill him, the cult master had not hesitated to destroy all of Kunlun City. Judging from the number of people living within the city walls, at least ten million people would have died a tragic death.","This had touched Chu Yunfan’s bottom line.","Chu Yunfan looked at the Jiang Great Ancestor coldly and said, “All of you can forget about leaving this place.”"]},{"number":912,"title":"Chapter 912 Brutal Death, the Smashing of a Divine","paragraphs":["912 Brutal Death, the Smashing of a Divine","Everyone could feel the dense killing intent from this sentence. The fact that Chu Yunfan had killed two Divine experts in a row made them feel a little regretful.","Chu Yunfan was absolutely terrifying. If it were any one of them, they wouldn’t have been able to achieve such a clean feat and not even leave behind a trace of smoke or fire.","It was as if it had been easy for Chu Yunfan.","After Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he came to Chu Haoyue’s side and put his hand on Chu Haoyue’s back. A stream of the Emperor Method’s divine power flowed into Chu Haoyue’s body.","Chu Haoyue immediately felt that his injuries were rapidly recovering. In a short while, he was almost completely healed.","He was shocked. He didn’t know what kind of cultivation technique Chu Yunfan cultivated to have such an amazing healing effect. But it was obvious that Chu Yunfan didn’t intend to say much.","Chu Yunfan suddenly disappeared from where he was standing, leaving behind a ray of light that looked like a thunderbolt.","The Nine Heavenly Deity Transformations made him extremely fast. In an instant, he had arrived at the battle site between Tang Siyu and the Deep Sea Crocodile.","The moment the Deep Sea Crocodile expert, who was fighting bitterly with Tang Siyu, saw Chu Yunfan appear on the battlefield. His hair stood on end as if he was being stared at by a terrifying primordial beast.","Such a feeling made him feel cold all over.","It was already very difficult to deal with Tang Siyu alone. Now that Chu Yunfan, who had killed countless people, had been added to the mix.","Chu Yunfan was no ordinary being, but an expert in the Divine Abilities Stage. As for those below that level, they were all ants.","“Sh*t!”","The Deep Sea Crocodile expert roared, forcing Tang Siyu to retreat. He flitted and he was about to turn into a wave to flee.","“Don’t let him escape!” Tang Siyu shouted.","“He’s not going anywhere,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","After he finished speaking, his figure flickered, leaving behind a few afterimages as he chased after the expert. It was the Nine Cyclone Phantoms.","In an instant, it was as if the world was filled with Chu Yunfan’s afterimages. His speed didn’t seem very fast, but in the blink of an eye, he had caught up with the Deep Sea Crocodile expert.","Like a flash of light and a shadow, he had crossed the great sky.","When the crocodile saw that Chu Yunfan was catching up to him, he was shocked. But at this time, the violent and brutal genes hidden in its bloodline suddenly burst out.","After being forced to the extreme, he exploded.","Roar!","The crocodile let out a long roar and swept over its thick tail. Most of the monster’s cultivation was on his body. This tail sweep could even send half of a mountain flying. The power of this attack was unimaginable.","Clang!","The thick tail hit Chu Yunfan’s body, but it failed to affect Chu Yunfan. His body glowed with a jade light that blocked the huge tail.","Then, the crocodile saw Chu Yunfan grab his tail. Although Chu Yunfan’s hand was small compared to the huge tail, he still managed to grab it firmly.","Immediately after, the crocodile felt a huge force pulling on his body. No matter how much it struggled, it was useless. The terrifying power that was born from cultivating the Imperial Physique was finally completely released.","Bam!","Then, everyone saw that the crocodile was caught and then smashed down. Its huge body smashed into an open space.","The entire ground was smashed into a huge pit. Even with its strong physique, it was still dizzy from the fall.","However, before anyone could react, they saw Chu Yunfan directly grab the tail that was much bigger than himself and fiercely smashed the crocodile into the ground again.","Bam!","He slammed the crocodile’s head into the ground again, and the terrifying force created a large pit, setting off a shocking wave of dust that was dozens of feet high. Those who were watching felt their eyelids twitch.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Chu Yunfan swung his arm crazily, and the crocodile was continuously smashed into the ground, causing the earth to shake.","Many of the experts in Special Ops could feel the ground shake. One could imagine how shocking it was.","The ground of the Special Ops building was made of special cement. Even a magnitude seven or eight earthquake would not shake it.","Chu Yunfan smashed the crocodile into the ground more than a hundred times, and everyone saw that the crocodile no longer looked like a human, or rather, a crocodile. Wounds appeared little by little on its incomparably huge body. All its bones were broken, and its internal organs were smashed into a pile of paste. Its skull, the toughest part of its body was also broken, and its body parts were smashed to bits.","Then, Chu Yunfan casually threw the corpse of the crocodile into the lake.","Boom!","The ground trembled again. The crocodile didn’t move. It had stopped breathing.","From within Special Ops, many gasped when they saw the scene captured from afar. The sounds of gulping could be heard everywhere. Their chief was brutal.","It wasn’t that they hadn’t seen people with the ability to resist sea monsters, but they had never heard of such a brutal way of fighting that one could smash the other party to death.","“What the... How strong is Chief Chu?”","“Is this really a battle between Divine experts?”","“That is terrifying. Luckily, the chief is on our side.”","Many people swallowed a mouthful of saliva before they finally came back to their senses.","As for the Divine experts who were still in the midst of battle, this feeling was truly shocking.","Mo Beidou, Zhu Buping, and the others were confident that they could defeat the Deep Sea Crocodile in terms of strength. In fact, it was not impossible for them to kill him. However, it was simply impossible for them to kill the crocodile with such a casual and strange force.","Even among Divine experts who were known for their miracles, this kind of record was unimaginable. It was almost impossible to achieve.","Although everyone was still in the midst of an intense battle and did not dare to relax, their hearts were like a turbulent sea.","The Divine experts had divided the battlefield into five areas, but Chu Yunfan had broken through three of them at an astonishing speed. Now, only the battlefield between Zhu Buping, the Heavenly Dragon Elder, and the Jiang Great Ancestor, as well as the one where the Chu Great Ancestor was fighting Mo Beidou and the mysterious Deep Sea Whale expert, were left.","Chu Yunfan paused only for a moment. Then, his figure flickered, and he rushed into one of the battlefields."]},{"number":913,"title":"Chapter 913 Two Palm Strikes and Mo Beidou Was Dead!","paragraphs":["913 Two Palm Strikes and Mo Beidou Was Dead!","Chu Yunfan’s figure flickered, and he rushed into the battlefield where the Chu Great Ancestor was fighting.","At this time, the Chu Great Ancestor was struggling under the siege of two third-tier Divine experts.","After all, the combat strength of either one of these two was equal to his. He was unsure if he could win against one of them, let alone two.","Fortunately, his goal was to stall so Chu Yunfan could have time to make his breakthrough. Otherwise, he feared that he would already have lost if theft really were to fight.","Especially after Chu Yunfan displayed his terrifying strength, the two could feel the extreme danger. They quickened their pace and unleashed various terrifying attacks, regardless of the cost. They had to deal with the Chu Great Ancestor before Chu Yunfan had time to spare.","Many wounds had appeared on the Chu Great Ancestor’s body, and blood flowed out. If this continued, he would not be able to hold out for much longer.","However, Mo Beidou and the others were mistaken. Ultimately, Chu Yunfan managed to kill all his opponents and came to the Chu Great Ancestor’s aid before he was defeated.","After entering the battlefield, Chu Yunfan did not have much time to speak, so he hurriedly said, “Great Ancestor, I’ll kill Mo Beidou. You hold the other one back!”","“No problem! Hahaha!” The Chu Great Ancestor laughed out loud. With Chu Yunfan around, the duo’s plan had utterly failed. Now, the scales of victory had tilted in Chu Yunfan and the Chu Great Ancestor’s favor.","After that, the Chu Great Ancestor roared and pounced toward the Deep Sea Whale expert.","The battle between the two sides was intense, and the sky shook. In the night, the blood and energy of the two sides boiled like the blazing sun.","The battle was fierce. The Chu Great Ancestor did not have Chu Yunfan’s overwhelming strength, and he was also well into his years. He could barely use his body but gave his all for his descendant’s sake.","Meanwhile, the Deep Sea Whales expert realized the danger and wanted to flee. However, he could not, as the Chu Great Ancestor was holding him back.","At this moment, he finally understood that the only way to escape was to defeat the Chu Great Ancestor. Under such circumstances, both sides fought with all their might, and the battle became highly intense.","Both sides were covered in blood, and it was unknown whose blood was whose. Blood splattered, and bone fragments flew everywhere. Mo Beidou was just about to help when he saw a figure blocking his way.","“Chu Yunfan, do you honestly want to fight us to the death today?” Mo Beidou’s eyes were cold as he glared at Chu Yunfan. He clenched his spear tightly, and the energy and blood in his body boiled, shaking the sky. At this point, he had already decided to risk his life.","“If I was at a disadvantage and I was the one who said that, would you let me live?” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile. “We won’t stop until one of us dies. You think too highly of yourself. Killing you is too easy.”","At this moment, Mo Beidou knew there was no room for negotiation. Just like what Chu Yunfan had asked, Mo Beidou would not let Chu Yunfan go if he were in Chu Yunfan’s shoes either. Since that was the case, they could only fight to the death.","At this moment of life and death, Mo Beidou put everything aside. All the energy and blood in his body exploded, and his spear flashed. It was like a fire dragon’s long roar. The roar was so loud that the entire sky shook.","He resembled a reborn spear saint. It was his most potent attack and the highest profoundness of his spear technique. He had not completely mastered it, so he would not use it so rashly. Once he did, he would have to pay with his life.","But at this point, he had no choice but to fight to the death.","The spear was like a dragon, and its horrifying consciousness filled the entire sky. The Special Ops experts could feel their martial will boil, but it was being suppressed.","At this moment, the spear was the king of all martial arts. All other martial arts had to submit to it.","Many were shocked. Mo Beidou had roamed the Outskirt Territories for so many years. Although he had primarily maintained a neutral position, he had also opposed the Federation before. However, he had lived well and did not need to establish a great sect of his own because he alone was enough of a deterrent to the Federation.","The speed of this spear attack seemed slow and could have been faster in comparison. However, his massive spear’s consciousness could lock onto anyone and not allow them to escape.","That no longer had anything to do with speed because he had locked onto his target using his martial will.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan looked at the spear coldly without a change in expression. During the critical moment, he finally made his move. He simply pushed out a palm horizontally. It was not a well-known strike technique but a simple one.","However, everyone felt their bodies relax. The terrifying spear’s consciousness that had suppressed their martial was shattered at this moment.","The spear’s consciousness that filled the sky disappeared without a trace.","Then everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s palm pushing out horizontally as if it had formed an enormous cage that covered everything.","When the spear’s fire dragon came into contact with the palm, the dragon crumbled inch by inch, turning into embers that filled the sky and dissipated. Then the palm hit the spear.","Bam!","The spear broke inch by inch. This spear was undoubtedly a magic weapon and contained mighty magic power. Still, it shattered in one strike when it faced Chu Yunfan.","It was not hard to imagine how powerful Chu Yunfan was now. He did not even need any magic weapons because he was not inferior to any magic weapon and was even more terrifying than ordinary magic weapons.","After reaching minor completion, this was the incredible power of the Imperial Physique. Even with his bare hands, he was no weaker than a magic weapon.","Mo Beidou hastily retreated as his spear exploded and shattered while his hands turned bloody from the terrifying impact. He felt the massive gap between Chu Yunfan and himself, not daring to move forward.","However, Chu Yunfan’s second strike had already come down. Compared to the first, this one was even more terrifying. Based on his strength, it had already surpassed the power of most palm techniques.","Strength was the foundation of everything after all.","Bam!","Mo Beidou could not block this strike. All his defenses instantly collapsed, and the palm landed on his body.","The crowd watched as Mo Beidou’s body exploded as blood splattered everywhere.","“Two palm strikes!”","“Mo Beidou is dead!”"]},{"number":914,"title":"Chapter 914 Next, It’s Your Turn to Die!","paragraphs":["914 Next, It’s Your Turn to Die!","At this moment, everyone was completely dumbstruck. Mo Beidou, who was known as a legend both inside and outside the Federation, had been killed in two strikes.","Even the Jiang Great Ancestor, who was suppressing the Heavenly Dragon Elder and Zhu Buping up in the sky, paused for a moment as the look in his eyes turned solemn.","In his memory, only the Federation’s president was capable of killing Mo Beidou with two strikes.","“Hahahaha, well done!” Zhu Buping laughed uproariously.","!!","The Jiang Great Ancestor was suppressing him into a miserable state. There was only a fine line between a third and fourth-tier Divine, but the difference in strength between the two sides was huge.","One of his arms hung by his side. It had been fractured in an attack from the Jiang Great Ancestor. Even a casual movement would cause him to feel extreme pain.","However, Zhu Buping didn’t care. He had been fighting for many years on the human-demon battlefield and had escaped death many times to get to his current strength and status. For him, this degree of injury was nothing.","And seeing that Chu Yunfan had killed another powerful enemy, he felt elated. According to this speed, it was only a matter of time before Chu Yunfan killed everyone. What they needed to do was to stall for time. The victory was within their grasp.","The Heavenly Dragon Elder standing behind him was also in a sorry state. His clothes were in tatters and he was bleeding profusely. Even though the two of them had joined forces, the Jiang Great Ancestor had still forced them into a corner. If either of them had fought him alone, they would have long been defeated.","They just needed to buy time. If Chu Yunfan won, they would win.","If they had thought of this, the Jiang Great Ancestor naturally had as well. If Chu Yunfan got the time he needed, then no matter how confident the Jiang Great Ancestor was, he would be caught in a group fight. It would be difficult for him to fight against four people with just his two fists.","What truly made him uneasy was the astonishing strength that Chu Yunfan displayed. He killed the Huang Great Ancestor with a single punch and Mo Beidou in two strikes. This strength was absolutely shocking.","“Get out of my way! Anyone who stands in my way will die!” the Jiang Great Ancestor roared.","However, Marshal Zhu Buping and the Heavenly Dragon Elder would not allow him to attack at this moment. Their efforts would be in vain if they did.","For a moment, the Jiang Great Ancestor was suppressing them, but he couldn’t escape for a time either.","On another battlefield, the Deep Sea Whale expert and the Chu Great Ancestor were fighting. Blood flew in all directions, and the battle looked extremely fierce.","Although their cultivation levels were similar, the Chu Great Ancestor was old and no longer in his prime. Furthermore, he had used up too much energy. At this point, he had no other choice.","Bam!","Finally, the Chu Great Ancestor couldn’t hold out any longer and was sent flying by a punch. His entire body was covered in blood, and his bones were broken in many places. One could imagine the intensity of the battle.","“Die, you sack of old bone!” the Deep Sea Whale expert roared in anger.","Just as he was about to kill the Chu Great Ancestor, he saw a flash of lightning appear in the sky and then strike down at an astonishing speed.","The Deep Sea Whale expert instantly felt an extreme danger. He hurriedly dodged and avoided the flash of the lightning.","When the expert came back to his senses, Chu Yunfan had already joined the battle and was standing in front of him and the Chu Great Ancestor.","The Deep Sea Whale expert was shocked. If Chu Yunfan was here, then the result of the battle between him and Mo Beidou was extremely clear. Mo Beidou failed to stop Chu Yunfan and died at his hands instead.","Sure enough, when he looked again, Mo Beidou was nowhere to be seen. He cursed in his heart. He was so close to killing the Chu Great Ancestor. He was only a little bit away, but Mo Beidou couldn’t even hold out for a short time.","In terms of time, it was almost an instant kill.","It didn’t buy the expert any time at all, and it only served to show how powerful and terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","“It’s your turn,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at the Deep Sea Whale expert with a calm expression.","“Chu Yunfan, we have no intention of becoming your enemy. Considered this carefully. You have already offended the Deep Sea Crocodiles to the extreme. Do you want to make us your enemy as well?”","The moment the Deep Sea Whale expert saw Chu Yunfan, he felt his whole body go numb and the soles of his feet turn cold.","It wasn’t that he was discouraged, but it was because Chu Yunfan was simply too powerful. Before Chu Yunfan had even shown himself, he was able to beat up the Six-Tail Nether Flame Fox with one hand. Then, after he came out of seclusion, he instantly killed the Huang Great Ancestor, the Divine monster hybrid, and the Deep Sea Crocodile expert. He had even defeated Mo Beidou in two strikes.","No matter who saw this kind terrifying combat strength, they would be shocked. Though they may not feel that kind of emotion for many years, it was still a natural instinct.","And now, the Deep Sea Whale expert once again felt the feeling of being dominated by fear. The strength he was so proud of could no longer give them a complete sense of security.","“So what if you’re my enemy?” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer, “Ever since your tribe stepped foot in here, you’ve been clamoring that you want to kill me. Do you think we can still shake hands and make peace now?”","“Since you’ve come to kill me, you should be prepared to be killed by me. You’ve lived for so many years. How are you still so naive?”","The Deep Sea Whale expert was suddenly at a loss for words. His tribe wasn’t on friendly terms with Chu Yunfan. They had provoked him time and time again, and now they even came to kill him. Naturally, they had to be prepared to be killed in return.","However, he wasn’t going to sit still and wait for death. The divine power in his body instantly burst out. At this time, dense scales began to grow all over his body. In just a moment, a scale armor had formed around his body. This was his true trump card—a trump card that had never failed before.","With a trident in hand, the Deep Sea Whale expert looked like a general who had won every battle.","Chu Yunfan’s face remained expressionless, but he made his move almost at the same time as the expert. He clenched his five fingers into a fist, and a huge asura appeared behind him. He then threw a punch at the expert.","The terrifying fist intent locked onto the Deep Sea Whale expert, making it impossible for him to escape. He let out a long cry and suddenly swung the trident in his hand toward Chu Yunfan’s fist.","Boom!","Everyone heard a huge explosion as the trident was sent flying and disappeared like a meteor."]},{"number":915,"title":"Chapter 915 Killing the Deep Sea Giant Whale in One Punch, the Jiang Great Ancestor’s Next Move","paragraphs":["915 Killing the Deep Sea Giant Whale in One Punch, the Jiang Great Ancestor’s Next Move","Everyone could only see the Deep Sea Whale experts’ bloody hands. His entire palm had exploded.","He had felt a strange force from the trident the moment he collided with Chu Yunfan. Then, the trident flew out of his hand.","Meanwhile, the Deep Sea Whale expert had his eyes wide open. He was dumbfounded as he looked at the scene in disbelief.","Someone had sent his magic weapon flying.","!!","Most knew the Deep Sea Whales for their mighty strength throughout the Infinite Sea. Regarding physical strength, he was also one of the top existences among many marine tribes.","It wasn’t that none had ever suppressed him. Someone would always be more robust than him in cultivation, Spirit Energy, and divine arts. However, this was the first time someone had forced him into such a situation in a battle of pure strength.","However, his shock only lasted for a moment. Chu Yunfan did not give him any extra time to think before his attack arrived.","Chu Yunfan clenched his fist, and terrifying fist intent emerged from his body. It was even more powerful and terrifying than the spear intent that Mo Beidou had released before he died.","He used his fist intent to suppress the other party’s martial will. At this moment, the fist was the most righteous path in the world, the king of all. This punch had locked onto the Deep Sea Whale expert, making it impossible for him to escape.","The Deep Sea Whale expert realized he could not escape, so he decided to kill Chu Yunfan. The scales on his body rapidly multiplied, covering his entire body.","The scale armor possessed an impressive defensive ability, and the Deep Sea Whale expert was confident he could escape unscathed. Even if a nuclear bomb hit him, he would be fine as long as he had on his armor.","He had no fear unless he was at the core of the explosion. Such a defensive power was above many defensive magic weapons.","Boom!","The scene took a long time to describe, but it happened instantly. After blowing away the Deep Sea Whale expert’s magic weapon with a punch, Chu Yunfan formed another punch in the next moment and blasted it out.","The punch technique had a very high requirement on the body. If it were any ordinary person, they would feel exhausted after punching with all their might, and it would be impossible for them to last so long.","However, Chu Yunfan could casually punch dozens or even hundreds of times without feeling any pressure. One could only imagine how strong his physique had become.","Bam!","The punch landed on the Deep Sea Whale expert’s body. Everything went silent for a moment as everyone held their breath while watching Chu Yunfan’s white fingers clench into another fist and hit the densely packed scales.","“Did it get blocked?” An expert from Special Ops was shocked.","The combat power Chu Yunfan had just displayed was simply unstoppable. Whether it was a first-tier, a second-tier, or even a third-tier Divine, the difference was just in blocking one move.","However, this no longer worked here. It seemed like the Deep Sea Whale expert was able to block Chu Yunfan’s punch. It looked utterly unbelievable.","Soon after, someone exclaimed in surprise, “No, he didn’t block it!”","Then they saw the scale armor blocking Chu Yunfan’s attack crack inch by inch. Blood spurted out, and it contained a divine light that looked extremely terrifying.","Then the scale armor exploded with a boom, turning into a stream of light that scattered in all directions. Afterward, everyone saw that the Deep Sea Whale expert had become a bloodied man.","His eyes were wide open in disbelief. A large hole had appeared in his chest, pierced by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","“That’s impossible!”","The Deep Sea Whale expert could not accept that the scale armor he was so proud of was so vulnerable. With a boom, he fell out of the sky and crashed into the ground.","Upon his death, he transformed into his original body.","It was an incomparably large deep sea whale. However, the Deep Sea Whale expert looked miserable. There was almost no piece of flesh on his body that was intact. Blood flowed everywhere, and wounds so deep that bones could be seen were everywhere.","“He was destroyed in just one punch!”","“This is great! Only the Jiang Great Ancestor is left!”","Everyone in Special Ops cheered. It seemed like the only powerful enemy they had left was the Jiang Great Ancestor. Chu Yunfan had singledhandely resolved the terrifying disaster.","“Many thanks, Great Ancestor!” Chu Yunfan said to the Chu Great Ancestor.","“No need to thank me.”","The Chu Great Ancestor shook his head and said, “I’m not so old that I can’t protect my descendants.”","He noticed Chu Yunfan wanting to come over and treat his injuries, so he hurriedly said, “Don’t worry about me. Let’s go and help the Heavenly Dragon Elder and Zhu Buping first.”","Chu Yunfan nodded and did not insist. The ancestor’s injuries looked terrible, but in reality, this degree of injury was nothing to a Divine Expert with powerful recovery abilities. At least, it was not fatal if he did not continue fighting.","Simultaneously, only one battle remained in the sky, and that was where the Jiang Great Ancestor was. Besides Zhu Buping and the Heavenly Dragon Elder, Tang Siyu, Chu Haoyue, and the Thunder Winged Beast had joined the battle.","Five Divine Experts had surrounded the Jiang Great Ancestor. They joined forces and barely managed to salvage the situation.","The Jiang Great Ancestor’s strength was undoubted. He had almost single-handedly forced Zhu Buping and the Heavenly Dragon Elder to retreat. If Tang Siyu, Chu Haoyue, and the Thunder Winged Beast had not arrived to help, they would have been defeated by now.","Even so, they were still having a hard time.","Suddenly, a figure flew out of the Jiang Great Ancestor’s body at this critical moment. The figure’s aura soared into the sky and was terrifying.","No one expected another expert to emerge from the Jiang Great Ancestor’s body.","In the blink of an eye, the figure had pounced toward Zhu Buping and the Heavenly Dragon Elder, who were already injured and trying their best to hold on.","Bam! Bam!","The two were instantly sent flying. The duo was severely injured and were forced to retreat as they coughed up blood."]},{"number":916,"title":"Chapter 916 After Today, the Jiang Clan Will Be No More","paragraphs":["916 After Today, the Jiang Clan Will Be No More","This change came too suddenly. Although Zhu Buping and the others were having a hard time, they could still hold out.","However, with the addition of another expert, the balance of the entire battlefield had been completely destroyed.","Taking advantage of this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, without the restraint of the two third-tier Divine experts, the Jiang Great Ancestor could finally free up his hands. With the Life Ender technique, he had already struck three times in the blink of an eye.","Tang Siyu, Chu Haoyue, and the Thunder Winged Beast were severely injured. They were slashed and coughed up blood as they hastily retreated.","!!","Fortunately, they had dodged the attacks. Otherwise, it wouldn’t have been as simple as coughing up blood and retreating.","In just a short time, the five Divine experts were beaten to the point of coughing up blood and were forced to retreat. The situation that seemed to be in their favor collapsed in an instant. Even though they were mentally prepared, the Jiang Great Ancestor’s ferocity still shocked everyone.","How terrifying were the experts who had stepped into that level? As long as they seized the slightest opportunity, they could turn this flaw into an opportunity for victory.","At this moment, everyone finally saw the figure of the expert who had suddenly appeared.","“It’s the Tang Great Ancestor!” many cried out in surprise.","That expert was none other than the Tang Great Ancestor.","Only then did they remember that the Jiang Great Ancestor had refined the Tang Great Ancestor into a puppet. The Jiang Great Ancestor had been able to suppress the two top experts of the Federation—the Heavenly Dragon Elder and Zhu Buping—on his own. Therefore, many had forgotten that the Tang Great Ancestor, who had been refined into a puppet, was a trump card of the Jiang Great Ancestor.","Before he was refined into a puppet, the Tang Great Ancestor was already a third-tier Divine expert. In terms of cultivation, he was not inferior to the Heavenly Dragon Elder or Zhu Buping.","In that instant, the Tang Great Ancestor exploded, heavily injuring the other two of them in one fell swoop and forcing them out of the battle.","Many felt a chill run down their spines. The Jiang Great Ancestor was a shrewd man. If he had released the Tang Great Ancestor from the very beginning, they wouldn’t have been caught off guard, and the five of them wouldn’t have been defeated so quickly.","Tang Siyu looked at her family’s Great Ancestor who had been refined into a puppet with a conflicted look in her eyes. Although she was originally just a lowly member of the Tang clan, she had grown up within the family and had heard stories of the Tang Great Ancestor.","Now that she saw her ancestor being used as a puppet, she was filled with grief and indignation.","At this time, Chu Yunfan had just arrived at the battlefield. He thought that he could make it in time. Who knew that he wouldn’t?","The Jiang Great Ancestor had a regretful expression on his face. Chu Yunfan had arrived too quickly. Otherwise, he would have been able to catch all of these people in one fell swoop.","However, this was still better than being surrounded by these people.","“I’ll leave the rest to you. We’re going to recuperate,” Zhu Buping said as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","The entire situation had been very disadvantageous to them from the very beginning. Whether it was in terms of numbers or strength, they had been at a disadvantage from the start.","They had already done their best to hold out until now under such circumstances. If it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan, they would have been defeated.","“You’ve worked hard. Thank you for coming to help me. I’ll definitely repay the favor,” Chu Yunfan said.","Everyone then flew down and began to sit cross-legged in the open space of the Special Ops building to recuperate. The people from Special Ops did not dare to disturb them.","One after another, they raised their heads to look at the sky. Two people, no, three, faced each other from a distance.","The Jiang Great Ancestor’s control over the Tang Great Ancestor was clearly extremely sophisticated. The Tang Great Ancestor was not as stiff and inflexible as ordinary puppets. On the contrary, he was extremely agile.","“Chu Yunfan, I didn’t expect that an ant that I looked down on in the past would be able to force me to this extent today.”","The Jiang Great Ancestor sounded very emotional as he spoke. However, his eyes were still shining. He was trying to buy time for himself to recover.","Though he had won the battle against the five Divine experts, he had used up a lot of energy. At his age, he was not in his prime anymore, and his recovery ability could not be compared to the young.","Chu Yunfan could naturally sense the Jiang Great Ancestor’s intentions, but he didn’t care. In his eyes, the Jiang Great Ancestor was just a dead man walking.","“What’s the difference if you had expected it or not? You’re speaking as if your clan has never sent anyone to kill me,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","“After today, the Jiang clan will be no more. Your clan will be uprooted,” Chu Yunfan proclaimed, “Two of the Eight Greats will be wiped out in a single night. This is something you didn’t expect, right? ”","“What big words.” the Jiang Great Ancestor’s expression changed. He might not care about other things, but his family was his only taboo.","He was the one who had developed the Jiangs from nothing into something. From an ordinary small family, he had developed it into a large family with hundreds of thousands of people.","He had devoted all his efforts to this life, and he would never allow anyone to ruin his plans.","“For this one sentence, you must die today. As long as you are related to me, you must all die.” The Jiang Great Ancestor’s divine power burst out.","“Do you think I’m like those people? Soon, you’ll know the power of a fourth-tier Divine,” the Jiang Great Ancestor said slowly. He was still recovering the divine power that he had used up.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were as cold as lightning as he shouted, “You won’t get the chance!”","In an instant, he made his move. His energy and blood surged to the extreme and soared toward the sky. A terrifying will and majesty wantonly emitted out.","At the same time, the Tang Great Ancestor, who had been standing still this whole time, also made his move. An astonishing amount of energy and blood burst out from the Tang Great Ancestor. He struck out with his palm, and in the blink of an eye, the entire world boiled.","“Watch out, Yunfan! That’s the Wan Kingdom Sky-Shattering Palm!” Tang Siyu quickly cried out in surprise.","She instantly recognized the origin of this technique. That was the striking technique that the Tang Great Ancestor had used in fights all over the world, and it was extremely powerful.","As for Chu Yunfan, he didn’t move an inch, allowing the strike to land on his body.","Bam!","With a loud boom, the strike landed on Chu Yunfan, but it was completely useless. It even failed to move him.","At this time, Chu Yunfan finally made his move. His hand glowed with the light of a barrier and he slapped the Tang Great Ancestor’s body, but the Tang Great Ancestor wasn’t sent flying.","Countless sealing runes appeared on the Tang Great Ancestor’s body. In an instant, Chu Yunfan had sealed him. This was a sealing technique of the Ancient Zenith Civilization from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","He had instantly cut off the Jiang Great Ancestor’s connection to the Tang Great Ancestor’s corpse, freeing him from the Jiang Great Ancestor’s control."]},{"number":917,"title":"Chapter 917 You Couldn’t Do It in the Past, and You Can’t Do It Now","paragraphs":["917 You Couldn’t Do It in the Past, and You Can’t Do It Now","“What?!” The Jiang Great Ancestor’s eyes widened. Even someone as arrogant as him couldn’t help but reveal a look of disbelief at this moment.","Others did not know, but he knew how powerful his secret puppeteering technique was. It was a puppeteering technique from the Ancient Zenith Civilization that he had obtained from the ruins.","Naturally, he did not only have one puppet. The Tang Great Ancestor was the most powerful one among them, and the Tang Great Ancestor was also the only Divine expert that he had ever refined into a puppet.","Whenever he had used the Tang Great Ancestor, he had never failed. He had never even seen a puppet disobey his command, let alone have his connection with the puppet cut off.","!!","He had never seen such a method before.","“What kind of sealing technique is this?” The Jiang Great Ancestor glared at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, said nonchalantly, “Do you think you’re the only one who has had fortuitous encounters?”","In this era of the Federation’s great leap forward, almost all of the famous experts had their own various fortuitous encounters, which was why they could stand out from the competition among countless people.","Obtaining the Alchemy Emperor’s memories and godhead was Chu Yunfan’s greatest fortuitous encounter.","This sealing technique was an extremely impressive sealing technique of the Ancient Zenith Civilization. Of course, it was not something that people of the Jiang Great Ancestor’s level could come into contact with.","Chu Yunfan gently sent the Tang Great Ancestor’s body to Tang Siyu’s side. Tang Siyu’s eyes flashed with gratitude, and in the end, she only said, “Be careful.”","The other Divine experts looked surprised. Ever since they found out that the Jiang Great Ancestor had refined the Tang Great Ancestor into a puppet, they had been having a headache, but they had not been able to come up with a good way to deal with it.","But now, Chu Yunfan had solved it so easily. With a seal, he separated the Tang Great Ancestor from the Jiang Great Ancestor.","As for Chu Yunfan, if it wasn’t for the fact that this was the Tang Great Ancestor, which had turned into someone else’s puppet, he would have directly attacked and blown up the other party with one punch.","“If that’s what you’re relying on, then you can just give up,” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “No one will be able to save you today.”","“You’ve only stripped me of my puppet, and you already think you’re invincible? Since you’ve taken away one of my puppets, I’ll refine you into one.” The Jiang Great Ancestor looked at Chu Yunfan coldly as his body radiated with a boundless aura.","“Come and try then.”","Chu Yunfan looked at the Jiang Great Ancestor. He didn’t mind that the Jiang Great Ancestor had taken the time to recover, because as time passed, more and more of his innate True Energy and mental energy would combine and turn into divine power. In other words, stalling was also beneficial to him.","The Jiang Great Ancestor’s strength was limited, but Chu Yunfan’s was constantly getting stronger. The medicinal effects of the Divinity Nourishment Pill were still fermenting.","Finally, the Jiang Great Ancestor couldn’t hold it in any longer. He let out a loud roar, causing the entire air to buzz and vibrate. The countless stars in the sky bloomed with intense light as if they were reflecting his power.","At this time, the boundless Spirit Energy of nature began to gather crazily. At a speed visible to the naked eye, it condensed into his hand and formed a terrifying long blade.","“What kind of method is this? The Jiang Great Ancestor can use the power of Kunlun City’s leyline at will!”","“As expected, the Jiang Great Ancestor isn’t that easy to deal with!”","“This is a truly peerless battle. A battle that surpasses the peak of Divine Abilities Stage!”","“This is the true power of the Divine Abilities Stage. Borrowing the power of nature is definitely not limited to one’s own power. There is a limit to human power, but the power of nature is endless!”","Countless Special Ops members were shocked by the Jiang Great Ancestor’s methods. To be able to contain the power of nature in one’s technique was, without a doubt, an extremely terrifying technique.","The long blade became brighter and brighter, but at the same time, it also became heavier and heavier. It was unknown how many tons of terrifying power it had.","Boom!","The saber suddenly descended, and the terrifying power within it instantly bloomed out. It was as if it was going to slash the sky into pieces. It was extremely terrifying.","In Special Ops, many experts felt the astonishing power of this blade. They were even unable to move and were stunned by the power of this blade.","Just as the blade was about to land, the boiling blood in Chu Yunfan’s body started to surge, and a terrifying power instantly soared up into the sky.","Chu Yunfan started to move. He didn’t seem to be fast, but he actually was. In just an instant, he clenched his five fingers into a fist and threw out a simple punch. The dazzling fist force turned into a huge asura, which met the blade imbued with nature’s power.","Boom!","It was a terrifying collision. It was as if a blazing sun had exploded. The terrifying power made people tremble in fear. The light covered everything, and in that instant, everyone’s senses lost their function.","When they could see again, they saw the asura’s huge fist had hit the blade, and they were in a deadlock.","Then, everyone saw the asura shine with golden light like a living god. After a moment of stalemate, the blade started to crack, unable to block the power of the punch.","Bang!","After a loud bang, the blade turned into a light that filled the sky and disappeared without a trace.","The Jiang Great Ancestor’s face turned pale. This blade was connected to his mind, which was why its power could be raised to this level. Even an ordinary third-tier Divine would be cut down by this blade if they didn’t dodge.","This was a profound connection he had just comprehended after breaking through to the fourth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. Who knew that it would be broken by Chu Yunfan’s punch?","Chu Yunfan’s cold voice sounded in his ear, “Do you think you can control the world? Though you’ve reached the fourth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, you still won’t be able to achieve such a thing.”","Immediately after, a terrifying aura emerged from Chu Yunfan’s body and soared into the sky. A golden light swept over at an unimaginable speed, and one could vaguely see that it was a huge golden roc.","That was Chu Yunfan’s garuda portion. The speed of his punch was unparalleled.","The Jiang Great Ancestor barely managed to swing his blade once before the golden roc completely destroyed it. The fist force then blasted into his body.","Bam!","The Jiang Great Ancestor was sent flying for more than a thousand steps before he managed to stop and stabilize himself. However, he couldn’t help but cough up a mouthful of blood.","He was severely injured with just one punch."]},{"number":918,"title":"Chapter 918 You’re Just So-So!","paragraphs":["918 You’re Just So-So!","There was a deadly silence. Everyone was stunned and a little dumbfounded. The Jiang Great Ancestor was so powerful that there was no doubt about it.","But even so, he was still heavily injured by a single punch and had been made to cough up blood.","“As expected, he’s ridiculously strong after ascending to the Divine Abilities Stage,” Chu Haoyue couldn’t help but lament.","He and Chu Yunfan had entered the Divine Abilities Stage at almost the same time. The difference between them was only a few months.","This time difference could be considered as stepping into this stage at the same time. But the difference in strength between the two sides was like Heaven and Earth.","He knew that even if Chu Yunfan hadn’t stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage, he was no match for Chu Yunfan. But he hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan would become so powerful after stepping into this level.","He too was in Divine Abilities Stage, but he couldn’t even withstand a single strike from the Jiang Great Ancestor. On the other hand, Chu Yunfan’s casual attack severely injured the Jiang Great Ancestor. The two of them were not on the same level.","“At least we didn’t support the wrong person. The Federation will have another top expert!” Zhu Buping laughed as he spoke. However, as he laughed, he pulled at his wounds, causing his face to constantly twitch.","“Beat him to death! Let that old man know that he can’t bully others just because he has broken through!”","Everyone had their own thoughts, but they all raised their evaluation of Chu Yunfan’s combat strength.","Not to mention the others, even the Jiang Great Ancestor was extremely shocked. He was wearing the armor of the magic artifact level. Under normal circumstances, no matter how one attacked, they wouldn’t be able to do anything to him.","Just like before, even when he was besieged by five Divine experts, he came out unscathed and didn’t even seem to be in a sorry state. It was all because of the defensive ability of this armor.","The attacks of these people could not even break through the defense of the armor.","But now, Chu Yunfan had broken his armor with just one punch. He could feel that his armor had been dented, which was why the fist force had injured him.","In other words, the power of Chu Yunfan’s punch was evident.","Even he couldn’t help but feel a deep fear of Chu Yunfan’s terrifying strength and physical quality. Not to mention other means, just Chu Yunfan’s terrifying physical strength alone was enough to sweep away many strong enemies.","The consequences of fighting with Chu Yunfan like this could be predicted.","“Chu Yunfan, you’ve killed so many of my clan members. I’ll make you pay in blood today!” the Jiang Great Ancestor shouted.","Chu Yunfan looked at him coldly and didn’t say anything. These people had been high and mighty for too long, and they had all selectively forgotten that they had tried to kill him many times.","“You? You’re nothing more than this.”","After a long time, Chu Yunfan finally opened his mouth and said these words.","The innate True Energy in his body was still being converted into divine power.","If it was an ordinary person, all of their True Energy would have already been transformed into divine power. However, Chu Yunfan’s True Energy was at least ten times, or even dozens of times, that of people of the same level. Therefore, his transformation time was longer than ordinary people.","The Jiang Great Ancestor could feel the disdain in Chu Yunfan’s words. His face immediately turned red with anger and he shouted, “Borrowing the power of nature! Vajra Body!”","At this moment, the Jiang Great Ancestor formed a hand seal. Suddenly, everyone could feel the wind and clouds and the earth stir as if an inexplicable force was starting to gather in the void.","This inexplicable force gathered together and turned into a golden light that filled the sky, pouring into the Jiang Great Ancestor’s body.","Under everyone’s watchful eyes, the Jiang Great Ancestor’s body suddenly grew a lot taller, reaching a full ten feet. His muscles bulged, and a golden light flowed on the surface of his skin, making him look like a living vajra.","The vajra’s eyes were filled with rage, and the heavens and earth trembled.","“Was that the Divinity Bestowment Spell?” The group of experts was completely dumbfounded. They recognized the origin of this technique. The Federation placed great emphasis on quality education. Those who could cultivate all the way up were not only good at cultivation but were also versed in other aspects.","They were basically all elites of the Federation who had read extensively and had various abilities.","They all recalled the origin of this spell. In fact, it had a long history. Before the catastrophe, during ancient times, this spell was common everywhere. It was a trick used by various religions to deceive people.","After the great catastrophe, there was naturally very little market for it. This was because the people of this era believed that gods were just stronger people. Naturally, there was no market for divine arts.","However, this was only what ordinary people thought. In reality, as the elites of the Federation, they naturally knew that the Divinity Bestowment Spell hadn’t disappeared. It was very popular among many great sects in the Outskirt Territories.","It was just an ordinary technique used by Acquired or Innate Stage experts at most. No Divine experts would use it. This was because the so-called great gods they summoned were much weaker than themselves. To these clear-minded experts, they were of no use at all.","However, the spell that the Jiang Great Ancestor had used was clearly different.","With a vajra as his upper body, his aura was monstrous. And that fierce aura seemed to have instantly turned into another person.","“Die!”","The Jiang Great Ancestor’s eyes flickered with blood-red light, forming a sharp contrast with the golden color around him. It was a holy yet demonic aura that was difficult to conceal.","In an instant, he moved. He raised the Life Ender in his hand, and all the killing intent in the sky condensed over. The killing intent materialized.","This place had just experienced the battle of many Divine experts, so the killing intent here was far more than anywhere else. It was like a warzone.","Even the Divine experts—Zhu Buping and the others—felt an extreme sense of danger from this slash. This slash could completely destroy Special Ops that was located below.","“Hahaha, this is getting interesting!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t retreat. Instead, he advanced and shouted loudly. He also made his move. At that moment, he clenched his five fingers into a fist and formed an asura that met the blade head-on.","Bang!","There was a loud explosion as if gold and iron had collided.","The collision between the two sent sparks flying in all directions.","After obtaining the upper body of a vajra, the Jiang Great Ancestor’s physique had clearly become much stronger. After a powerful attack, he didn’t move and continued to madly slash at Chu Yunfan.","As if he had found a good opponent, Chu Yunfan activated all the energy and blood in his body and sent out a sky full of fist shadows.","Boom, boom, boom!","A series of dazzling clashes and terrifying shockwaves drowned everything."]},{"number":919,"title":"Chapter 919 The Jiang Great Ancestor Is Dead!","paragraphs":["919 The Jiang Great Ancestor Is Dead!","Simple, direct, and violent. Those were the feelings the battle between the two gave everyone.","After reaching the Divine Abilities Stage, this kind of fighting style was scarce. They usually competed with various divine powers and martial skills.","The Jiang Great Ancestor implored the use of divine powers, while Chu Yunfan was competing with purely his physical cultivation. Everyone was dumbfounded as they watched the shocking battle.","This dazzling fighting style was shocking, and any attack could cause massive damage. The two came to a draw. Saber light and fist intent were everywhere, bombarding each other’s bodies without care.","The two sides crossed and faced each other.","“Excellent! It’s been a long time since I’ve had such a good fight!” Chu Yunfan laughed uproariously. The series of battles caused his blood to boil.","Indeed, only a few people could compete with him in terms of physical strength. And the situation was more challenging for the Jiang Great Ancestor than for Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan could do it purely with his physical quality, while the Jiang Great Ancestor had to use Divinity Bestowment Spell to keep up. After a series of attacks, the ancestor was not at a disadvantage, but he had used up a lot of energy.","The golden light around his body was no longer as dazzling. It was much dimmer compared to the beginning.","The more they fought, the more they discovered how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. The ancestor’s strength was declining, and it was weakening as he consumed more and more of his True Energy.","But Chu Yunfan was getting stronger and stronger. He transformed increasing amounts of innate True Energy into divine power while growing more robust. The most important thing was that the ancestor was already old and could not compare to Chu Yunfan who was in his prime.","“This is the end of the warm-up!”","After this series of attacks, Chu Yunfan had turned all of his innate True Energy into divine power. He had finally stabilized his Divine Abilities Stage cultivation, and his combat power had reached an unprecedented level.","The look in the ancestor’s eyes turned sharp, and the two had the same thought. Chu Yunfan’s warm-up was over, and the Jiang Great Ancestor felt that his body would collapse if he did not get rid of Chu Yunfan soon.","The Jiang Great Ancestor’s entire body glowed while his hair stood up, and divine light flowed up the surface of his body. His clothes fluttered in the wind, and all his energy, blood, and divine power condensed together.","The Jiang Great Ancestor made his move. He appeared before Chu Yunfan as quickly as a flash of lightning.","The Life Ender in his hand finally burst with its ultimate profoundness, instantly condensing all its killing intent. Its power was endless, and it seemed to be invincible.","Swish!","The saber light left his body as the dazzling light illuminated the night sky, looking absolutely terrifying. It was a rare and significant collision, rarely seen, even back in ancient times.","Chu Yunfan also made his move, and his energy and blood erupted like a violent tide. That was his most significant advantage, so there was no reason for him not to use it. Simultaneously, the power of thunder circulated through his body.","He unleashed the incredible power of the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique.","Boom!","As the saber light fell, it cut apart Heaven and Earth. At the same time, Chu Yunfan’s fist momentum finally condensed to its limit, and he threw out a punch.","Bang!","At the moment of the collision, a scene no one expected happened. Chu Yunfan’s punch swept across the area, as easily as crushing dry weeds and smashing rotten wood.","Under Chu Yunfan’s fist intent, the huge saber light started to crack inch by inch. The single strike decided the outcome, as Chu Yunfan’s power suppressed everything.","The Jiang Great Ancestor tried to retreat but was at a disadvantage, and he was faintly suffering from the backlash of the attack. After the fist intent shattered the dazzling saber light, it continued to sweep across and headed straight for the Jiang Great Ancestor.","Bang!","The punch landed on the Jiang Great Ancestor’s body.","That was not the first time Chu Yunfan’s fist had landed on the Jiang Great Ancestor’s body. When they had exchanged blows previously, both sides had landed attacks on each other’s bodies, but neither had caused much damage to the other.","However, it was different this time. Chu Yunfan was all-powerful and had reached the peak of his current stage.","“Did he block it?!” many could not help but exclaim in surprise.","Everyone wondered if the Jiang Great Ancestor would be able to block Chu Yunfan’s attack again and if the two would fall into an endless battle.","But to everyone’s surprise, the brilliant golden light on the Jiang Great Ancestor’s body began to shatter.","The vajra conjured by the Jiang Great Ancestor with his divine ability instantly crumbled.","Spurt!","The Jiang Great Ancestor coughed up blood and retreated. He had suffered a significant loss in the collision. Even his most potent attack after using the Divinity Bestowment Spell was vulnerable before Chu Yunfan.","For the first time, the Jiang Great Ancestor felt powerless, and he truly felt the gap between himself and Chu Yunfan. Suddenly, the Jiang Great Ancestor did something no one had expected. He turned and fled.","Previously, he had vowed to kill Chu Yunfan, but now, after a series of attacks, he no longer had such wishful thinking. The only thing he could think of was he had to escape or die here.","If he could escape, even if he had to flee to the Outskirt Territories, he would still be among the strongest. Everything would be over if he died here. Even his whole family would be uprooted.","“You want to leave?” Chu Yunfan sneered as he watched the Jiang Great Ancestor trying to frantically escape.","Chu Yunfan raised his hand and threw a coin. Immediately after, countless electric currents formed a potent magnetic field on his arm. In the magnetic field, countless electric currents began to sweep and bombard the coin.","A terrifying electromagnetic cannon shot out, bringing an unimaginable and unstoppable force that swept across the sky.","Boom!","The cannon beam hit the Jiang Great Ancestor as he fled. He had swiftly fled, but he was not as fast as the thunder power that struck him. Then a blood-curdling screech echoed as the Jiang Great Ancestor’s body exploded in mid-air, turning into a rain of blood.","The Jiang Great Ancestor was dead.","After a long while, everyone finally recovered from their dazed state. The legendary figure whose name shook the Federation, the person who had fought for many years and had rarely lost, had died before their eyes at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","However, more people realized that tonight’s battle could not stay hidden. A new god was about to rise up within the Federation."]},{"number":920,"title":"Chapter 920 Generous Gifts as Thanks","paragraphs":["920 Generous Gifts as Thanks","Chu Yunfan heaved a sigh of relief after killing the Jiang Great Ancestor with his electromagnetic cannon shot. The Jiang Great Ancestor’s existence had been an enormous shadow hovering over him for many years.","The Jiangs were a threat to Chu Yunfan and his family because of the Jiang Great Ancestor’s existence. Chu Yunfan was not able to contend against the Jiang Great Ancestor for a long time, but he now could finally breathe a sigh of relief.","Now that the Jiang Great Ancestor was gone, only a few inside and outside the Federation could threaten him.","He conjured a hand made of energy and sucked the Six-tailed Nether Flame Fox into the Mountain River Diagram. The fox no longer dared to resist.","!!","The fox was almost scared to death when he saw Chu Yunfan kill several Divine experts far stronger than him as if he was cutting vegetables.","It was especially so for the Jiang Great Ancestor who was a fourth-tier Divine expert. Even at Myriad Demon Mountain, such a figure would be regarded as a big shot.","Now that the Jiang Great Ancestor had died so tragically, Chu Yunfan was simply a demon in the fox’s eyes—a demon in human skin.","If he dared to resist, he was sure Chu Yunfan would easily chop him up.","After collecting the fox, Chu Yunfan officially landed. At this time, Special Ops also began to get busy. The battle had ended, but someone needed to clean up the battlefield.","The corpses of Divine experts were priceless. They also needed to repair the broken barrier and clear the missiles and nuclear bombs. It was destined to be a sleepless night.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan, the Chu Great Ancestor, Chu Haoyue, Zhu Buping, the Heavenly Dragon Elder, Tang Siyu, and the others landed on the ground. After completing their initial treatment, they followed Chu Yunfan into the depths of Special Ops.","With Chu Yunfan taking the lead, Everyone followed suit and took their seats.","“I am extremely grateful that you were willing to come to my aid, seniors,” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands and said to Zhu Buping and the Heavenly Dragon Elder.","There was no need to mention his relationship with Tang Siyu to those present. Chu Haoyue and the Chu Great Ancestor were on the same side, and although Chu Yunfan was just a branch descendent, he was nonetheless a descendant of the Chu Great Ancestor.","However, whether Chu Yunfan was a branch descendant or a direct descendant, this matter was only relative to Chu Haoyue. For the Chu Great Ancestor, they were all his descendants, so there was naturally no difference.","Therefore, no one was surprised that Chu Yunfan only cupped his hands and thanked the other two elders.","“I was just returning the favor for the Longevity Pill you gave me the last time. My old bones were almost torn apart,” the Heavenly Dragon Elder said in an intimate tone and he chuckled.","Zhu Buping did not mind and said, “Your grandfather is a subordinate of mine, and you’re my junior, so this is nothing. Moreover, these people want to challenge the Federation’s dignity. I’m just teaching them a little lesson.”","Chu Yunfan knew that even though the two did not say anything, he had to return the favor, so he said, “I currently do not have anything to repay you with. I only have some achievements in the field of alchemy. I’m sure you’ve heard of the Divinity Nourishment Pill I make.”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, the Heavenly Dragon Elder, the Chu Great Ancestor, and Zhu Buping’s eyes lit up, especially the Chu Great Ancestor. He knew the Divinity Nourishment Pill all too well. After all, their family’s second Divine expert was born from this pill.","The Heavenly Dragon Elder and Zhu Buping did not know much about this pill. But they knew a little about the pill’s magical effects.","The pill’s miracle included Chu Yunfan’s instructor, Jeang Yuanbin, Chu Haoyue, and Tang Siyu. After taking the Divinity Nourishment Pill, their cultivation soared, and they had broken through to the Divine Abilities Stage.","Everyone knew no one in the current Federation had found a way to enter the Divine Abilities Stage yet. There was no such thing as a breakthrough rate, as it was based on luck and one’s talent. Out of hundreds of peak Innate cultivators, there might only be one who would gain the chance to enter the Divine Abilities Stage.","However, the Divinity Nourishment Pill that Chu Yunfan refined was different. At least, it seemed like there had been no cases of failure.","In their opinion, one could step into the Divine Abilities Stage, but it was rare. If one wanted to break through, one had to be at least at the peak Innate Stage to be qualified. And there were plenty of peak Innate experts under their command.","“I will give you a list later. Send me the medicinal herbs needed to make the Divinity Nourishment Pill. The most important thing is a Divine monster’s inner core,” Chu Yunfan said.","He did not mind publicizing the list of medicinal herbs needed for the Divinity Nourishment Pill. According to the level of alchemy within the Federation, which was still in its infancy, and even back in the Ancient Zenith Civilization, successfully making this pill was highly unlikely.","Many factors contributed to making medicinal pills. One could not guess how to make them just by looking at a list of herbs. Of course, it was another matter if it were an Alchemy Emperor.","An Alchemy Emperor had already had a profoundness in alchemy and grasped every formula. As long as they looked at the list of medicinal herbs, they could reverse-deduce the process according to the alchemic formula.","But there had only been one such person in countless years.","“Sure! No problem!”","Everyone looked overjoyed, especially the Heavenly Dragon Elder. He was already old, and even though Chu Yunfan had given him the Longevity Pill to extend his life, he was already in his sunset years.","At this time, training his successor was of utmost importance.","“Besides that, I know you guys have been stuck in the third tier for a long time. I’ve recently obtained some insights on Divine cultivation, which should help you make a breakthrough,” Chu Yunfan said to the three elders present.","The trio’s breathing quickened. It would already be very helpful to them if Chu Yunfan could help them make the Divinity Nourishment Pill to nurture the younger generation.","The difference between third-tier and fourth-tier Divines was evident. Chu Yunfan had beaten the Jiang Great Ancestor to death, but that did not invalidate the Jiang Great Ancestor’s strength. After all, he had severely injured the five of them.","It only meant that Chu Yunfan was far stronger.","The Chu Great Ancestor could not care less and quickly asked, ” Are you serious?”","“There shouldn’t be any problems.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","The trio had been stuck at the third tier for at least a few decades. They had accumulated plenty of experience but needed a way to break through.","This was the disadvantage of having their path cut off, or they would have broken through to a higher stage long ago."]},{"number":921,"title":"Chapter 921 Incident, Federation Shaken","paragraphs":["921 Incident, Federation Shaken","Chu Yunfan was not lacking in methods to breakthrough.","The Divine Abilities Stage was the supreme stage of this era, but it was not so back during the Ancient Zenith Civilization era.","At that time, every sect and clam had cultivation methods for the Divine Abilities Stage. The key points to break through each stage in the Divine Abilities Stage differed from sect to sect, but they were generally similar.","It might be a simple task to Chu Yunfan, but it was no different from opening a path to Heaven for the Chu Great Ancestor, Zhu Buping, and the Heavenly Dragon Elder.","!!","Their importance was unparalleled. Once they broke through, they could transcend all other experts. After all, there were few experts in the fourth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage inside and outside the Federation, if one did not count the Infinite Demon Mountain, the marine folks, the holy land, and other places.","This was the gift that Chu Yunfan had prepared for them.","Chu Haoyue said little because he had also received similar benefits from the Chu Great Ancestor. After all, the Chu Great Ancestor would pass down his experiences.","As for Tang Siyu, she did not care. There was no need to say anything more about the relationship between her and Chu Yunfan.","Meanwhile, the Heavenly Dragon Elder and the others felt that this had been a worthwhile trip. They had paid a heavy price and were severely injured in that battle, but it was nothing compared to what they obtained.","This was the effect Chu Yunfan wanted to create. If one followed him, one would naturally have meat to eat, especially in the current situation where many inside and outside the Federation were hostile toward him.","These people who were friendly to him were valuable to him, and he was okay with letting these people gain benefits from him.","“Hahaha! You’re a good lad, Chu Yunfan. I didn’t misjudge you!” Zhu Buping laughed out loud. “But since we’ve already said this much, we’ll have to discuss how to deal with this matter.”","Everyone turned to Chu Yunfan as Zhu Buping’s sentence ended.","Chu Yunfan had become the group’s leader. In regard to his strength and generosity, no one could say anything against it.","“Since the Jiangs and Huangs participated in the nuclear attack on Kunlun City, you should know what crime it constitutes. My suggestion is to uproot the two clans’ power by banning them from business, politics, and the military.","“Send out people to settle the two clans. Anyone who participated in this will be executed. Those who have committed many crimes and used the two clan’s power to commit evil will also be executed and imprisoned according to their respective crimes.","“As for those who weren’t involved, they’ll be imprisoned for a while. After the lesson, send them to different places and don’t give them a chance to gather again,” Chu Yunfan stated his principles.","“All right, we’ll follow your plan,” Zhu Buping said and discreetly heaved a sigh of relief.","He had feared that Chu Yunfan was young and reckless, unwilling to suffer losses, and would insist on exterminating the Jiangs. That could cause a massive uproar throughout the Federation.","After all, these people were the Federation elites, unlike the brainwashed followers of the great sects in the Oitskirt Territories. There were at least millions of people in the two clans if direct, branch families, and various relatives further away were counted.","Naturally, not everyone could participate in the planning of this matter. It was estimated that ninety-nine percent of people did not know about this.","If all of them were to be killed, the number of innocent people killed could reach millions. If that happened, who inside and outside the Federation wouldn’t be scared?","Chu Yunfan would be crowned the demon king of killing.","Chu Yunfan’s plan was the best way to deal with this matter. There was no indiscriminate killing, but it would uproot the two clans regarding business power. Concerning politics and the military, their clan members and people related to them would all be dismissed.","In addition, their clan members would be scattered across the land. The decline of the two clans would then be a foregone conclusion.","The Jiangs and Huangs had offended countless people at their peak of power. It would have been good if those people did not kick them while they were down. It would be impossible for the Jiangs and Huangs to recover.","“Other than the Jiangs and the Huangs, there’s also Mo Beidou. He was a loner with nothing to say, but he had disciples who will be on the wanted list for life.","“There’s also the Deep Sea Whales and the Deep Sea Crocodiles. The two tribes have often targeted me, so I can’t let them off so easily. They must give me a satisfactory answer,” Chu Yunfan continued.","He was not a broad-minded person. These two tribes had targeted him many times and were the vanguards for the marine folks to enter dry land. Chu Yunfan would also uproot these two tribes if possible.","“All right, that’s all I have to say. You can go and prepare. I can start making the pills when your materials are here,” Chu Yunfan said.","The crowd left one after another, leaving him and Tang Siyu alone. The night’s battle finally ended, and the Sun rose from the East, its light tearing apart the night.","On the roof of Special Ops’ headquarters, the golden sunlight shone on the ground like golden rain, rendering everything a dreamy color.","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu sat side by side, and the sunlight elongated their shadows.","This was a precious moment for Chu Yunfan, even if they were just sitting side by side. The two had much to do recently. Chu Yunfan had been busy cultivating, while Tang Siyu was cultivating and managing the Tang clan’s many affairs.","There was a faint fragrance lingering at the tip of his nose. The two did not speak but felt very at ease. While the duo enjoyed their rare moment of leisure, the outside world was in complete chaos because of last night’s battle.","More than ten Divine experts at the peak of the Federation had made a move. How shocking was that?","Not to mention, the sensational matter of a nuclear bomb bombarding Kunlun City had also occurred.","Although they were only attacking Special Ops, their headquarters was in Kunlun City. To many, attacking Special Ops was no different from attacking Kunlun City.","This city was once the first human base city when they started to take over the Kunlun Realm. It was also the last barrier for humans to retreat to Earth’s border. It was of great significance to humankind.","However, someone had used a nuclear bomb to bombard Kunlun City. It instantly set off a great uproar on the Internet.","The whole story of the incident quickly spread through the Internet. It involved the two behemoths—the Jiangs and the Huangs. The others were lone wolves like Mo Beidou or individuals of the marine folks, the Immortal Demon Mountain, and the Monster Sect, which were already hostile forces toward the Federation.","Only the Jiangs and the Huangs could be considered the backbone of the Federation. Ultimately, the two clans joined forces to launch the nuclear bomb, causing a great uproar."]},{"number":922,"title":"Chapter 922 It Was as if the Sky Had Collapsed and the Earth Had Collapsed Overnight","paragraphs":["922 It Was as if the Sky Had Collapsed and the Earth Had Collapsed Overnight","Among the two families, the Jiangs launched many nuclear bombs in the last few years and were repeat offenders. However, the Huangs had used only nuclear bombs a few times.","Nuclear bombs and more than ten Divine experts.","The matter involved the Federation, experts from the Outskirt Territories, the marine folks, the Infinite Demon Mountain, and many other behemoths. Every piece of news was extremely shocking.","A war of this scale would only occur between the Federation and the Infinite Demon Mountain.","Someone had blocked all signals that night, and it was only at the end of the battle that the news spread all over the Internet. However, many in Kunlun City had recorded clips of the battle with their terminals from a distance.","The battles had been far away and high up in the sky, so they could not see them clearly. Nevertheless, the scenes captured were shocking. It was a dark and gloomy night, but the powerful energy and blood of the Divine experts in battle were like blazing suns illuminating the sky.","They were Divine experts akin to living gods. Every move they made was no less powerful than a bomb or a small tactical nuclear bomb.","Someone soon compiled and processed the entire battle based on the scattered videos taken from different angles. The battle between Divine experts was much scarier than what computer special effects could render.","Many were terrified just by watching the video. After all, Divine experts could casually blast a mountain into pieces. These were the true rulers of the Federation.","Everyone could see from the video that the experts from Special Ops were clearly at a disadvantage. Almost all sides had suffered. Only Tang Siyu, who was suppressing the huge crocodile, was fine","The crocodile’s original form frightened many people. The power of non-human experts was genuinely terrifying. The battle situation changed, especially after the Jiang Great Ancestor joined in.","Whether it was the Heavenly Dragon Elder or Zhu Buping, both were world-famous masters, especially Zhu Buping, known as the heavenly pillar of the Federation Army.","However, even with the two working together, the Jiang Great Ancestor still managed to suppress them. His terrifying combat power silenced all the forces, primarily those Divine experts.","They understood that it was not Zhu Buping and the Heavenly Dragon who were weak. It was because the Jiang Great Ancestor’s strength had soared after entering the fourth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","The Jiang Great Ancestor’s purpose was apparent—to kill Chu Yunfan. There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan would be able to stop the Jiang Great Ancestor after his strength soared.","When everyone thought this, Chu Yunfan suddenly appeared without warning during the battle’s most critical moment.","Since these filming locations were far away, they could only capture a little of the process. They only captured the sudden change and then Chu Yunfan’s sudden appearance.","Chu Yunfan had just appeared out of nowhere and had defeated everyone. First, it was the blood-red monster hybrid from the Monster Cult, followed by the Huang Great Ancestor.","After that, the Deep Sea Crocodile expert that made many people tremble was destroyed in a single strike. Mo Beidou and the other mighty experts were famous. However, Chu Yunfan killed them with just a few punches and kicks.","Finally, it was the Jiang Great Ancestor’s turn. Many could no longer see what was happening clearly, as the videos they had taken could not capture the movements.","Any movements that were captured only showed figures wrapped in clouds of boiling blood and energy. They could only see two balls of light colliding wildly.","According to the usual situation, it was typical for Divine experts of equal strength to fight for a day and a night. Everyone thought it would be shocking if Chu Yunfan, who had just broken through, could even fight the Jiang Great Ancestor to a draw.","But who knew that would not be the situation?","After Chu Yunfan truly exploded, he killed the Jiang Great Ancestor with just a few punches and kicks, just like how he killed the Huang Great Ancestor, Mo Beidou, and the others.","The people finally knew Chu Yunfan’s true strength. Everyone was astounded after watching these videos. The Jiang Great Ancestor had gathered many experts and even colluded with external forces to eliminate Chu Yunfan in one fell swoop.","Now, the Jiang Great Ancestor’s goal was no longer a secret. His goal was straightforward—to take advantage of Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough to exterminate him.","There should not have been any problems with this plan. Besides, there was a fourth-tier Divine expert, the Jiang Great Ancestor, here too. It should have been foolproof.","After the Jiang Great Ancestor showed off his might, people started discussing the science behind fourth-tier Divines and the status they held among the other Divines on Internet.","It wasn’t something ordinary Divine experts could compare to. After all, there were few such experts within the Federation.","However, the powerful Jiang Great Ancestor died at Chu Yunfan’s hands just like that. It had been a crushing defeat from the beginning to the end. There was no challenge.","While many were exclaiming in shock, even more, shocked by Chu Yunfan’s strength, fell silent.","Many netizens gave the title of the Federation’s number one to Chu Yunfan, even though the Federation’s number one master had always been the president of the Federation. Still, no one knew the president’s whereabouts.","Most importantly, in many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan was frighteningly young compared to the president. He was only in his twenties, a student who had just graduated from university.","While others still struggled in society, looking for a job or starting a business, Chu Yunfan was already one of the Federation’s top experts, even killing a fourth-tier Divine like killing a chicken.","It was almost inevitable that he would become the Federation’s number-one expert in the future, even if he wasn’t right now. That was the most shocking thing.","While the Internet was still debating whether Chu Yunfan was the Federation’s number one expert, the Federation Government, the Federation Army, and Special Ops made their move.","The Federation dealt with the Jiangs and the Huangs, the two clans that had been rooted within the Federation for over a hundred years.","Chu Yunfan uprooted the two clan’s influence in the business world overnight, detaining and investigating the clans’ government officials.","It was as if the Sky and Earth had collapsed in one night."]},{"number":923,"title":"Chapter 923 The Great Purge, the Reshuffling of the Federation","paragraphs":["923 The Great Purge, the Reshuffling of the Federation","The Jiangs and the Huangs’ influence was spread all throughout the Federation. Many of their members held important positions in the Outskirt Territories.","They were colossuses within the Federation, and their tentacles penetrated deep into all levels of society. It was unclear how many people were related to these two clans.","Even when the Federation took action, it had to mobilize a large amount of manpower and resources. If it was Chu Yunfan, even if he wanted to kill them all, he could only kill a few people by himself. Just looking for them would take a lifetime.","These two seemingly indestructible forces had been destroyed overnight. The main forces were, of course, the government, Zhu Buping’s troops from the army, and Special Ops.","But in reality, these three major forces had only served as the fuse. This was because the interests involved in the fall of these two major forces were simply too huge.","Companies under the two major forces were spread all over the Federation, and their value was immeasurable. Now that they were taken down, a part of it would be divided up by the three major forces as direct businesses, allowing the three major forces to swallow them up.","The rest of the profits were distributed through an auction. Of course, the Chus, the Tangs, and the Heavenly Dragon Villa were given special attention. However, the other families and sects would also get a share. Although it was not much compared to the three forces, it was still a windfall.","In addition, many of the two clans held high positions within the government and the army. Now that they had been uprooted, who knew how many positions would be vacated? To the other forces, it was naturally a feast and a carnival.","The two superpowers were the same. Everyone could see that the Federation was determined to get rid of them. This meant that if they continued to protect the two superpowers, they would be going against the Federation.","After so many years, these forces had long gotten used to the Federation’s pattern. They could turn a blind eye to some things and allow them to be neutral. However, once the Federation made up its mind to do something, they were not allowed to cause trouble behind the scenes.","For example, the extermination of the Monster Cult. Other than the evil sects like the Fire Acolytes and the Shadow Cult, the other forces didn’t dare to ignore the will of the Federation Government.","Most importantly, the joint operation of the three forces represented the will of many Divine experts, and the most dazzling one was naturally Chu Yunfan, who had instantly killed many Divine experts and defeated the Jiang Great Ancestor.","Before entering the Divine Abilities Stage, Chu Yunfan had already killed Divines like they were ants. Now that he had entered the Divine Abilities Stage, he could really beat everyone.","Someone had calculated. In total, more than ten Divines had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. What kind of concept was this? If these people were all Federation experts, Chu Yunfan had already wiped out at least half of the Divines within the Federation by himself.","There were people on the Internet calling Chu Yunfan the Divine Terminator. None of the Divines who offended him had a good ending.","The sect leader of the Fire Acolytes was very powerful. In the end, he was arrested and put on trial without any warning because he attacked Special Ops’ pioneer team.","In the eyes of many forces, this was just a trivial matter. At most, they would let the middle-ranked people of both sides wrangle over it.","However, Chu Yunfan obviously didn’t see it this way. He arrested the Fire Acolytes’ sect leader and put him on trial for such a trivial matter. This was the first time since the establishment of the Federation that a sect leader had been tried. It was best not to provoke someone like Chu Yunfan.","On top of that, by eliminating the people in high positions from these two clans, there was no doubt that there would be many positions for the other factions in their forces to compete for.","Without the protection and support of the two main clans, the members of the two clans simply had no ability to resist.","As for those who were truly capable, most of the Innate experts in their clans had participated in the matter against Special Ops. They were uprooted, and the remaining were removed from power.","The two clans were relocated to various places and had to start over again. Many years of construction had been burned down and turned into ashes.","This was a painful price to pay. The strength of the current Chu Yunfan had clearly exceeded the limits of their imagination, and most of them didn’t even dare to think about revenge.","Who would dare to attack a living god?","It was just like how no one had dared to lay a hand on the Jiang Great Ancestor.","Moreover, the Chus were getting stronger and stronger. Now, they already had three Divine experts. They were the number one family within the Federation and the head of the now six great families.","The destruction of these two aristocratic families was different from the destruction of the Fire Acolytes and the Shadow Cult.","Most of the forces of the Fire Acolytes and the Shadow Cult were in the Outskirt Territories. Although they secretly controlled some industries in the Federation, the overall scale was not very large.","However, these two aristocratic families were different. Their influence spread all over the Federation, and there were hundreds of millions of people working directly and indirectly for these two clans.","This was an extremely large number. Fortunately, the government was very skilled in its methods and quickly settled everything. This was because the purge was not targeted at everyone and did not expand.","Under such circumstances, the destruction of the two clans was finished at lightning speed.","However, on the Internet, heated discussions were still on-going, especially about Chu Yunfan’s strength.","Some felt that Chu Yunfan had already surpassed the previous president. Although most didn’t agree, they still unanimously agreed that Chu Yunfan was already among the strongest in the Federation.","He was only in his twenties, the same age as most of the younger generation, so he naturally had countless fans. After all, if Chu Yunfan was only a little stronger than them, it would only attract the envy and jealousy of most people. But Chu Yunfan was much, much stronger than them, and was a powerful existence that they could not compete with.","Thus, they could only look up to him, and not feel any envy or jealousy.","Chu Yunfan was about to become the national idol of the new generation. But to him, the various comments on the Internet couldn’t affect his rare moment of peace.","After that battle, Chu Yunfan had been living in the Chu family villa. In his spare time, he would guide his parents and sister in their cultivation.","Although it was only a fine line away from before, in reality, because of the increase in cultivation level, there was a world-shaking change.","The way Chu Yunfan looked at cultivation was completely different from before. It wasn’t just through the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, but his own insights that were deeply engraved in his bones."]},{"number":924,"title":"Chapter 924 Time Flew By, Two Months","paragraphs":["924 Time Flew By, Two Months","With Chu Yunfan around, there was no shortage of Innate pills. Chu Yunfan’s parents quickly entered the Innate Stage without any problems.","Coupled with the cultivation experience of the Innate Stage’s various levels left behind by Chu Yunfan, as well as the various medicinal pills that he was currently making, it was foreseeable that it was only a matter of time before Chu Yunfan’s parents reached the peak of the Innate Stage. At that time, it wouldn’t be too difficult for them to enter the Divine Abilities Stage.","Chu Yunfan had already started his preparations. This time, three superpowers joined forces to uproot the Jiangs and Huangs. Special Ops had received a pot full of money.","As the person in charge, Chu Yunfan received a lot of money. Just the direct funds alone had reached more than 300 billion. In addition, Chu Yunfan snatched up a considerable amount of various companies under the two clans.","Shanhe Alchemy was upgraded from a simple alchemy company to a huge financial magnate. Of course, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t personally take care of it. Most of the matters were handled by Lu Qingxuan.","With Chu Yunfan’s help, Lu Qingxuan, who wasn’t very talented in cultivation, had already stepped into the Innate Stage, so she was able to handle all kinds of affairs within the huge company.","Now, Shanhe Alchemy Industries was all over the Federation, and its market value exceeded one trillion. And this was before Chu Yunfan listed the company. Once it was listed, it wouldn’t be a problem to increase its value by at least tenfold.","As the owner of 70% of the shares, Chu Yunfan didn’t lack money. In addition, he still had the inner cores of the Deep Sea Crocodile and the Deep Sea Whale experts.","When the time came, he would leave behind two Divinity Nourishment Pills for his parents to use. It would not be difficult for them to step into the Divine Abilities Stage.","Chu Yunfan had also been paying close attention to his sister’s cultivation. In just a few months, Chu Qingxuan had advanced by leaps and bounds, breaking through to the peak of the Acquired Stage, which was even faster than Chu Yunfan’s cultivation.","Of course, her current environment was much better than Chu Yunfan’s.","Back then, Chu Yunfan had enemies all over the world, and his situation at Federation University was built up through killing.","Although Chu Qingxuan didn’t announce to the public that her brother was Chu Yunfan, all the higher-ups at the university knew her identity. Even those who had been hostile to Chu Yunfan before didn’t dare to make any moves now.","What a joke. He was a Divine expert. If Chu Yunfan was angry and wanted to kill them, even their chancellor, who was also a Divine, wouldn’t be able to stop him.","Chu Yunfan would have people send cultivation pills to Chu Qingxuan regularly, as well as all kinds of cultivation insights he had written down. These were all things that couldn’t be bought with money and would be treated as top secrets in any sect.","At the same time, Chu Qingxuan often followed her instructor to battle in the Outskirt Territories, so she did not lack real combat training.","It was worth mentioning that not long ago, Chu Qingxuan successfully became the top scorer of this year’s college entrance examinations, defeating all the strong enemies in a crushing manner.","She gained a lot of fame in a short time. After all, before she won first place and was now considered a regional genius. Only after passing the college entrance examination, which was a stage where geniuses from all over the Federation competed, was she considered to be truly recognized by people.","The strongest among them was only at the seventh Acquired Stage, but she was already at the peak of the Acquired Stage. If it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan who asked her to suppress her cultivation and consolidate her foundation, she would have already broken into the Innate Stage.","After all, with the guidance of a Divine like Chu Yunfan, it would be strange if her cultivation didn’t advance by leaps and bounds.","Even so, it still shocked countless people. This year’s batch of students was even more amazing than the legendary batch—Chu Yunfan’s batch—from a few years ago.","It had only been a few years, but the quality of Chu Qingxuan’s generation seemed to be a little stronger than Chu Yunfan’s. Especially Chu Qingxuan, who was much stronger than Chu Yunfan, who had not yet fully emerged.","After the initial shock, the crowd accepted the fact that the quality of the younger generation of humankind was getting stronger and stronger with each passing year. In fact, it was also because of the appearance of Chu Qingxuan that this batch of students was so eye-catching. Otherwise, even if there was an improvement compared to a few years ago, it would not be so exaggerated.","However, his carefree days had finally come to an end, because the matter of his helping the various clans to make the Divinity Nourishment Pills had finally arrived. Including the Tang clan, the Heavenly Dragon Villa, the Chu clan, Zhu Buping, and his parents, there were a total of seven Divinity Nourishment Pills that Chu Yunfan had originally planned to make.","Apart from Chu Yunfan, who had obtained the inner cores of the Deep Sea Crocodile and the Deep Sea Whale, the other clans had used various means to obtain inner cores—either by buying them or killing Divine monsters near Infinite Demon Mountain. After paying a certain price, they finally gathered all the inner cores needed.","However, it was much easier compared to before. After all, with the cultivation of the Chu Great Ancestor, Zhu Buping, and the Heavenly Dragon Elder, it was not difficult for them to kill Divine monsters.","With Tang Siyu’s cultivation base, she could crush Divine monsters on the same level as her. It was much simpler than when the Tangs had to obtain the inner core of a first tier Divine monster that they had paid a great price for.","Chu Yunfan only found out later that in that battle, the Tangs had lost three peak Innate cultivators and more than twenty Acquired experts.","The losses were incalculable.","At that time, the Tangs had staked everything on that one mission. They went crazy to let Tang Siyu break through to the Divine Abilities Stage.","To Chu Yunfan, who had yet to step into the Divine Abilities Stage, it would definitely be a huge headache to make seven Divinity Nourishment Pills. But to the current him, this was not a problem at all. Originally, he could only make one pill at a time and had to be careful.","But now, Chu Yunfan could make all of them in one go, so there was no problem. As his cultivation level improved by leaps and bounds, his cultivation in alchemy also improved by leaps and bounds.","Although he had never competed with an Alchemy King before, he dared to say now that even without the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, he was still at a higher level than the current number one alchemy master of the Federation.","It only took Chu Yunfan three days to complete all seven of the Divinity Nourishment Pills.","After getting someone to send out five of the pills, he gave the remaining two to his parents and let them choose when to consume and breakthrough.","Then, after leaving the Six-Tail Nether Flame Fox that he had tamed at home to protect his parents, Chu Yunfan quietly left the Chu ancestral home."]},{"number":925,"title":"Chapter 925 The Thunderstorm Sea Is a Sacred Land of Cultivation","paragraphs":["925 The Thunderstorm Sea Is a Sacred Land of Cultivation","At a region of the Infinite Sea, just outside of the Thunderstorm Sea, there were countless powerful marine monsters that did not dare to approach this forbidden area.","On the sea’s surface, several figures were walking on the waves. No matter how high the waves were, when they hit these figures, they would scatter into white spray and fall back into the sea.","It was a man and a woman. The man was tall and dressed in black, looking quite fierce. As for the woman, she was wearing a long white dress and looked like a fairy. She looked like a spiritual master. Walking behind them was an azure-colored ferocious beast with a pair of wind wings.","The three figures were none other than Chu Yunfan, Tang Siyu, and the Thunder Winged Beast.","After a few months, Chu Yunfan once again came to the Thunderstorm Sea. This place was a sacred land for him and the Thunder Winged Beast. Although he had already entered the Divine Abilities Stage, there was no end to cultivation. He could not grow complacent.","With the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, he did not lack cultivation methods. He was very clear about the various key points of cultivation. His weakness was that he had not accumulated enough power. He was still too young, and Tang Siyu and the Thunder Winged Beast also had the same problem.","Those who had entered the Divine Abilities Stage could be called the kings of the Federation. But in Chu Yunfan’s opinion, it was far from enough.","With his improvement, his vision was no longer limited to a city or a single place. The Federation was in danger. The stronger he was, the more he could deal with the various dangers.","The Thunderstorm Sea was undoubtedly a sacred land for cultivation. Training here was accompanied by countless thunderbolts, and it was able to yield twice the results with half the effort.","After fusing with the Thunderclap Physique, the Imperial Physique now had the ability to absorb thunder energy.","“This is the Thunderstorm Sea?” Tang Siyu furrowed her delicate brows. She instinctively felt a little uncomfortable.","Although the mysterious Arcane Sky Spirit Physique was not an ordinary technique and was extraordinary, she still instinctively felt uncomfortable in this place where the infinite power of lightning gathered.","“That’s right, this is the Thunderstorm Sea. Although it’s filled with thunder, from a scientific point of view, thunder is also a type of energy. Since it’s energy, it can be absorbed.","“This place is the sacred land of cultivation for me and the Thunder Winged Beast. We can get twice the result with half the effort here.” Chu Yunfan nodded","“The Imperial Physique is much more powerful than ordinary physiques. Because of this, it is ten times more difficult to cultivate. With my current cultivation speed, even with the help of various medicinal pills, it will take at least one or two years to break through to the next level. Although it is not long, I have a feeling that something big is about to happen. I must shorten the time.”","“But there’s too much lightning here. It is not easy for me to cultivate in this place,” Tang Siyu said. Although thunder was considered energy, it did not mean that she could use it.","“I will teach you a cultivation technique called the Celestial Devouring Art ,” Chu Yunfan said, “The Celestial Devouring Art came from an emperor of the Ancient Zenith Civilization. He was known as the Emperor Supreme. He created a technique that allowed ordinary people to devour all kinds of energy and wield them for their own use. After that, cultivating in a place with such rich energy will yield twice the result with half the effort.","“However, the minimum requirement was to use this technique is the Divine Abilities Stage. When one’s meridians aren’t completely opened up yet while in the Innate Stage, forcibly absorbing all that energy would be equivalent to seeking death.”","Tang Siyu’s eyes lit up when she heard this. After all, a Divine expert could absorb the Spirit Energy of nature and wield it. However, that was ordinary Spirit Energy. It was impossible to absorb thunder energy like this.","If one did not have a special constitution, they would be seeking death if they tried to forcibly absorb thunder power. Even Chu Yunfan, who possessed the Thunderclap Physique, had his cells burnt by the thunder when he was absorbing it.","The Celestial Devouring Art has a miraculous effect when it comes to absorbing all kinds of energy. As long as the body can withstand it, all kinds of energy could be absorbed and wielded.","As Chu Yunfan spoke, he transferred the Celestial Devouring Art recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book into Tang Siyu’s mind in the form of divine will. This was a divine power that could only be achieved by someone in the Divine Abilities Stage.","Tang Siyu closed her eyes and quietly observed at the Celestial Devouring Art. The technique that Chu Yunfan had sent over was clearly not as simple as just getting the cultivation method. In addition to the method, there were also various cultivation experiences. All the possible problems that could happen were listed.","This would lower the difficulty of her cultivation, and it was extremely precious.","She looked at Chu Yunfan with some curiosity. She felt that Chu Yunfan was hiding all kinds of secrets, cultivation techniques, and inheritances. There were all sorts of speculations about Chu Yunfan’s inheritances in the outside world, but it was obvious that none of them were right.","He was like a bottomless pool, and no one knew what his true trump card was.","“I understand it now.” Tang Siyu said after some time as she opened her eyes.","With her talent and the exaggeratedly detailed cultivation guide that Chu Yunfan had sent her, it would be abnormal if she still didn’t understand it. However, this was only a preliminary grasp. The specifics would only be known after the implementation.","“In that case, let’s start training,” Chu Yunfan said.","As soon as he finished speaking, the three of them entered the Thunderstorm Sea. In a short while, they were completely submerged by the thunder.","After entering the Thunderstorm Sea, Tang Siyu finally understood what Chu Yunfan meant when he said that the energy here was dense. It was only after entering this place that she realized the density of the thunder energy in the Thunderstorm Sea was at least ten times more than she had imagined.","The moment she entered, at least a dozen thunderbolts struck down.","She immediately began to use the Celestial Devouring Art that Chu Yunfan had just taught her, absorbing the energy contained wthin the thunderbolts.","Even so, she still felt that her meridians had been injured at the first moment. This place was indeed terrifying. Even her Arcane Sky Spirit Physique had been injured from the beginning. If it were any other person, it would be impossible for them to effectively use the energy here.","In front of her, the Thunder Winged Beast had already started to fly. It flew into the depths of the Thunderstorm Sea and started to play happily. The environment here was just right for it.","Chu Yunfan also sat down cross-legged and began to absorb the thunder energy. He simply said, “If you can’t hold out, tell me.”","Tang Siyu began to learn from Chu Yunfan, healing her injuries and absorbing the thunder energy for her own use.","Cultivation knew no time, and time flew by as the two humans and the beast cultivated."]},{"number":926,"title":"Chapter 926 Breakthrough, Second Tier of the Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["926 Breakthrough, Second Tier of the Divine Abilities Stage","To cultivators, time had no meaning, especially after entering the Divine Abilties Stage. The lifespan of humans at this stage had exceeded the upper limit of technology. They could live for at least two hundred years, or even three.","Three whole months passed, and the discussion about the Jiangs and the Huangs finally subsided. This was normal within the Federation.","Within the Federation, which was advancing at all times, there was nothing that could occupy people’s attention forever. It was the same even if the Jiangs and the Huangs, two great families, were uprooted.","Finally, the turbulent Federation gained peace again.","In the Thunderstorm Sea, the cultivation of the two humans and one beast had finally reached a bottleneck. They had just broken through to the Divine Abilities Stage. To them, accumulating experience was the number one problem.","The Thunderstorm Sea was a sacred land of cultivation. If the thunderbolts were equal to Spirit Energy, then the energy here was at least ten times denser than the outside world. It was just that it was difficult for outsiders to make use of the energy here. Even the overlord of this sea region, the marine folks, didn’t dare to approach this place.","Tang Siyu was sitting down cross-legged. Countless bolts of lightning struck her continuously. However, she felt that the divine power in her body had reached an unprecedented state of abundance, and there was no way to improve it.","In just three short months, she had entered the peak of the first tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. If the outside world knew about this, they would be completely shocked. Such a cultivation speed was simply astonishing.","However, the two humans and one beast here were not ordinary people. They did not have the physique of ordinary beings.","The amount of lightning energy Tang Siyu absorbed every day was an astronomical figure. But compared to Chu Yunfan, who was less than three thousand feet away from her, it was nothing.","From a distance, she could see Chu Yunfan sitting cross-legged in the air, circulating his Emperor Method. The surrounding thunder energy fell on his body and was absorbed by him. More energy was absorbed, forming an energy vortex around him.","The energy vortex was more than a hundred feet in diameter. It was extremely terrifying—like a small storm.","The amount of energy she absorbed every day was already shocking enough. If it were any other Divine expert of the same level, they would have already exploded to death.","However, the amount of energy Chu Yunfan absorbed was at least ten times more than her.","When Tang Siyu absorbed the thunder, it could only be described as absorbing energy. But Chu Yunfan was different. He was simply devouring it. Just like the scene described in the Celestial Devouring Art, he devoured the sky and the earth.","It was such a terrifying amount of energy, but Chu Yunfan’s body was like a bottomless pit. He didn’t reject any of it and absorbed all of it.","In the past few days, she could feel that the amount of energy Chu Yunfan absorbed had finally reached a limit. Like her, Chu Yunfan had also reached the peak of the first tier.","Compared to the day when he fought the Jiang Great Ancestor, Chu Yunfan was clearly much more terrifying now. According to Tang Siyu’s estimation, if he were to meet the Jiang Great Ancestor again today, she was afraid that the Jiang Great Ancestor would not be able to hold on for very long.","Previously, it was because Chu Yunfan had not fully mastered the power that belonged to a Divine, which was why he had wasted some time.","In the distance, the Thunder Winged Beast continued to flap its wings and fly up into the thunderstorm clouds. It was struck down by countless thunderbolts, then it flew up again and was struck down again. It was enjoying itself.","This was the Thunder Winged Beast’s training method. After all, the body of a monster was different from that of a human. They were different from birth, and their training methods were also very different.","The Thunder Winged Beast’s cultivation also advanced by leaps and bounds under this energy filled with thunder, and it had also reached the bottleneck of the peak of the first tier.","The next few days were crucial for them.","After reading for a while, Tang Siyu stopped reading and began to break through. Compared to her previous confusion and clueless about how to cultivate in the Divine Abilities Stage, Chu Yunfan had helped her sort out a complete set of cultivation guidelines in the past three months.","It was as if a golden path had been laid out in front of her.","As long as she cultivated according to the cultivation guide, it was not impossible for her to step into ninth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage and reach an unprecedented height within the Federation.","At this time, Chu Yunfan had no idea that he had become the focus of Tang Siyu’s attention. He was fully immersed in his cultivation, absorbing the power of the thunderbolts while trying to break through.","In the past three months, even the energy absorbed by the Thunder Winged Beast and Tang Siyu added up was not as much as his. One could only imagine how much energy he had absorbed and what level he had reached.","If he cultivated outside, unless he was in a cultivation paradise, he would probably absorb half of a city’s Spirit Energy in one breath.","It would certainly attract the attention of countless people. But here, there was no need to worry about that.","Even though the two of them and the beast were absorbing energy madly, it was still a drop in the ocean compared to the thunderstorm here. There was an end to humans, but the power of nature was endless.","The energy Chu Yunfan gathered in his body grew larger and larger, helping him to break through to second- tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. At the same time, the godhead in his mind began to emit bursts of light, allowing him to enter a state of clarity he had never experienced before.","Once any thought was formed, he could infer many things from one fact. All the paths were unprecedentedly clear.","This was an extremely rare state of enlightenment. The cultivation of the Divine Abilities Stage was like this. If you understood it, you understood it. If you didn’t, you didn’t.","Comprehension and accumulation were both indispensable.","The results of these three months of crazy cultivation were finally fully reflected at this time. His whole body began to emit a jade-like color. It was a faint light, and looked extremely sacred.","Another three days passed by in a flash, and Chu Yunfan finally opened his eyes. The energy in his body seemed to have broken through a barrier, reaching an unprecedented realm.","At the moment of his breakthrough, the thunderstorm around him disappeared, leaving behind not a single trace. Then, countless thunderbolts seemed to be condensed by a mysterious power, forming a long river of energy and pouring into Chu Yunfan’s body.","Chu Yunfan, who had just made a breakthrough, felt like his body’s capacity had changed from a water tank to a pool. He was in urgent need of a huge amount of energy to replenish it.","Just like that, more than an hour passed. Chu Yunfan, who had just absorbed a massive amount of energy, finally stopped. He had finally stabilized his new cultivation level of the second tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","“I’ve finally broken through!”"]},{"number":927,"title":"Chapter 927 The Riot at the First Prison","paragraphs":["927 The Riot at the First Prison","After completing the breakthrough and consolidating his cultivation level, Chu Yunfan felt that his strength had reached an unprecedented level.","He had reached a peak. Now, he could even defeat a fifth-tier Divine, let alone a fourth-tier. The power of the Imperial Physique was undoubtedly demonstrated.","He looked at his surroundings. Tang Siyu’s breakthrough had entered the most critical moment. She would probably be able to successfully break through to the second tier of the Divine Abilities Stage in a few days.","Of course, although they were in the same state, Tang Siyu’s combat power was far from his. However, she was still strong compared to others. Even though she had just broken through, she could defeat existences like the sect leader of the Fire Acolytes or the sect leader of the Shadow Cult.","The Thunder Winged Beast’s breakthrough would also happen within the next few days, and it was almost at the same time.","Chu Yunfan heaved a sigh of relief. Now, he could completely trust Tang Siyu and the Thunder Winged Beast, and he did not need to guard against them.","They could now truly hold their own.","The stronger they were, the more benefits Chu Yunfan would receive.","Chu Yunfan leaped a few times and was out of the Thunderstorm Sea. Just as he was about to take a breath of fresh air, an urgent cry came from his terminal. He turned on the video call and saw that the person was none other than Chu Haoyue.","Chu Haoyue had an anxious look on his face, but after seeing Chu Yunfan, he let out a sigh of relief.","“What’s wrong?” Chu Yunfan asked curiously.","“It’s bad!” Chu Haoyue quickly said.","“What’s the matter? Speak slowly,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Have you heard of the Federation’s First Prison? ” Chu Haoyue asked.","Chu Yunfan shook his head. The Federation had many prisons and exile areas that there were simply too many to count. They were all over the places that the Federation could reach. Many places were even established by death row inmates.","Because pioneering in itself meant that there would be heavy casualties, it was a good thing to use these prisoners.","Chu Yunfan usually didn’t know much about these things. The only time he came into contact with them was when he was in the examination area for the college entrance examinations.","Chu Yunfan quickly searched through his terminal and soon found information about the First Prison. He was surprised. According to the classification of the Federation’s confidential information, the lowest access authority was level one, and the highest was level nine. To have access to First Prison, one had to have level seven access and above.","And this was only if they knew about the existence of the First Prison. If they wanted to inquire about specific information, they would need level nine access. In the Federation, only a few people had level nine access, including the president. Even a high official of the Federation like Chu Yunfan only had level eight access.","When Chu Yunfan looked up information about the First Prison, he knew why the security level of this prison was so high. It was because none of the prisoners locked up in this prison were normal people.","In other words, ordinary people were not qualified to be forced into the First Prison. Those who were forced into the prison were at least Innate experts. Such experts would not be allowed to explore the land or open mines outside. The vitality of Innate experts was too strong. If they were given a chance, they could cause a great deal of trouble.","It was impossible for the Federation to spend so much energy to keep these people in custody. Therefore, these prisoners were usually locked up in special prisons. However, the First Prison was of a much higher rank than normal prisons.","Those who were locked in there were at least in the seventh Innate Stage or above. In the Federation, these kinds of people could easily start their own businesses.","However, these people, who seemed to be big shots in the outside world, were just small fry in there. The real trouble was that there were many Divines imprisoned in there too.","It wasn’t just a few, there were actually quite a number of Divines. In fact, the Federation had been in a state of panic for hundreds of years, so it was impossible for there to be only these experts present. There was a time when they were able to suppress the Federation Government, and there was even a shocking incident of someone assassinating the president.","That was a dark age. In those years, these Divines were the rulers of the entire world. It wasn’t a situation that could be formed by just one or two Divines. Later on, these people were suppressed one after another, and the place where they were imprisoned was this special First Prison.","“I’ve just checked. This First Prison is really a troublesome place. Is there any problem?” Chu Yunfan said.","“It’s bad. The Monster Cult’s sect master has gathered the Infinite Demon Mountain Army and is now attacking the First Prison!” Chu Haoyue said anxiously, “Everyone locked up here has a blood feud with the Federation. If they’re released... I think you should understand the consequences.”","Chu Yunfan’s expression became serious. He didn’t need Chu Haoyue to explain any further. He knew that if the First Prison was broken into and all the criminals inside escaped, the consequences would be dire.","They would break the Heavens.","“But if I remember correctly, upon checking the information just now, the First Prison is in the depths of the void. No one knows the specific coordinates, right?” Chu Yunfan asked.","According to the information he had access to, the First Prison was built high up in the sky to ensure that no prisoners could escape and no one would try to get their hands on it. It was constantly changing locations.","There were only three to five people in the Federation who knew its exact location.","Even with Chu Yunfan’s authority, he couldn’t find out the real coordinates. According to the information, the First Prison had been built from the ruins of an Ancient Zenith Civilization sect.","Most came and went through the teleportation formation built within the place. Other than that, there was no normal way to come and go, because no one even knew the specific location or how to contact the prison.","“If it’s so secretive, how do people know about it?”","Of course, Chu Yunfan didn’t doubt the secrecy of the First Prison. It had been at least a hundred years since it was built, and there hadn’t been any problems, which showed how secretive it was. But even so, something still happened.","“There’s no way to confirm it now, and now is not the time to investigate.” Chu Haoyue said he shook his head, “The Great Ancestor is now on his way to the First Prison, but the situation doesn’t look good. There are too many Infinite Demon Mountain experts who have gathered together. You have to hurry back!”"]},{"number":928,"title":"Chapter 928 Arriving at the First Prison, the Battle Is Intense","paragraphs":["928 Arriving at the First Prison, the Battle Is Intense","To be able to make Chu Haoyue feel that it was dangerous, Chu Yunfan could imagine how serious the matter at the First Prison was.","From the information, the reason why the First Prison had not had any problems for so many years was not that there were a lot of soldiers, but because it was difficult to find.","If it was because of the heavy gathering of soldiers and tight security, it would be easy to deal with. If it was made into a fortress, it would not be easy to break through.","However, the security of the First Prison was built on the fact that its specific coordinates could not be found. Although there were defenses, it was obviously not enough.","!!","“Many of the Federation’s elites have already rushed over. Only the weakest Divines are left in the Federation. We don’t have much time. We have to end this as soon as possible,” Chu Haoyue said.","Chu Yunfan’s expression became serious. Experts like them couldn’t just walk around randomly. These people had to be scattered to guard various parts of the Federation.","The Federation allowed the development and growth of the original Great Eights, as well as the development and growth of the various sects. This was the reason why it was impossible for the Federation to take care of all situations even with its strength.","The Great Eights each occupied a city, and at the same time, they were also protecting that base city and its surrounding satellite cities.","This was because the Federation had many enemies. In addition to the Monster Cult, there was also the Infinite Demon Mountain, the marine folks, and the holy land.","It was necessary to keep the necessary people.","However, this also meant that the current situation had reached an extremely dangerous level. The Federation was big, but there weren’t that many experts. Most importantly, if the experts locked up in the First Prison were to go on a rampage, it would be a complete disaster.","“I understand. I’ll rush back immediately.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“Go to Capital City. There’s a teleportation array there that will take you to the First Prison. I’ll get someone to receive you,” Chu Haoyue said.","After saying that, both parties hung up the call. Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and decided not to disturb Tang Siyu and the Thunder Winged Beast who were in the midst of their breakthrough.","With his current strength, not to mention fourth-tier Divines, even fifth-tier Divines were no match for him. With the current situation in the Federation, even if he was not number one, he was at least in the top few.","If even he couldn’t solve it, it would be useless to call the two of them.","Therefore, after Chu Yunfan left a message, he went straight to Capital City.","When Chu Yunfan arrived at the coast, there was already a spaceship waiting for him. With his current status, he was naturally worthy of such a grand display.","The Federation’s resources were indeed powerful. This was the reason why it was easier to cultivate with the government’s help.","An hour later, Chu Yunfan arrived at the Capital City. There were already people in the city preparing to lead him into a base deep inside the city.","The core of the base was a giant teleportation array with a radius of several hundred meters. This teleportation array maintained the connection between the Federation and the First Prison.","Now, this place had been activated. Countless mechas flew over from afar and gathered here. All of them were advanced mechas that were comparable to Innat-level combat strength.","Ordinary people didn’t exist in the void. They wouldn’t survive. Only Divines could survive freely in the void.","Mecha legions were constantly being sent away by the teleportation array to reinforce the battlefield at the First Prison.","When Chu Yunfan arrived, he immediately got first priority. He didn’t have to wait long. In just a few minutes, he was already standing in the teleportation array.","This was Chu Yunfan’s first time using a teleportation array. Because the Federation existed, there weren’t many teleportation arrays that could be used. Fortunately, he wasn’t unfamiliar with them. In the Alchemy Emperor’s memories of the Ancient Zenith Civilization, arrays such as this were very common.","Chu Yunfan’s vision blurred, and he felt a force pulling him backward. He circulated his Mighty Eternal Emperor Method, and a jade-colored light enveloped his body. Only then did that feeling finally disappear.","When he opened his eyes, he realized that he was in a hall.","The hall was hundreds of meters high and tens of thousands of square meters wide. One could even see battleships parked there, not to mention the densely packed mechas.","The Federation’s true war reserve was revealed a little here.","The battle here was about to break out into a war on the level of an army.","“Hurry up, hurry up!”","“Everyone, hurry up! We don’t have much time left!”","All sorts of shouts and yells could be heard.","When Chu Yunfan arrived, a middle-aged man in a military uniform strode over.","“Chief Chu?” The middle-aged man looked at Chu Yunfan. Although he tried his best to maintain a calm expression, he still revealed a hint of surprise. He had heard of Chu Yunfan before, but this was the first time he had met him.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties, he could not help but be shocked.","“That’s right, I’m Chu Yunfan. And you are?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“I’m the deputy warden of First Prison, Chai Jin,” the middle-aged man said.","“The deputy warden?” Chu Yunfan looked at Chai Jin in surprise. He could sense that Chai Jin was a Divine. Although he was only in the first tier, he could already establish his own sect. However, he was only a deputy warden.","“First Prison actually has one warden and two deputy wardens. I’m the second deputy warden.” Chai Jin said, “You should understand that this is not an ordinary place. We have to be extremely careful.”","“I understand.” Chu Yunfan nodded. He could imagine that in a dangerous place like the First Prison, it would not be too much to have three Divines guarding it.","“How’s the battle going?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Right now, the main battlefield is divided into two sides. One is the external battlefield. On this side, the warden, Marshal Zhu Buping, the Chu Great Ancestor, some other Great Ancestors, various sect masters, and other marshals are here to resist Infinite Demon Mountain’s progress,” Chai Jin rattled off, “Additionally, there are rioters in the internal prisons. The first deputy warden has already led a team out to suppress them.”","Chu Yunfan closed his eyes and spread out his mental power to check the situation on the battlefield. This was a power that came with entering the Divine Abilities Stage.","With Chu Yunfan’s current strength, he could detect the area within a hundred kilometers of himself. Ordinary Divines could only detect the situation within twenty to thirty kilometers at most. They were not on the same level.","Under Chu Yunfan’s investigation, the battlefield outside had already reached a white-hot stage."]},{"number":929,"title":"Chapter 929 I’m Going to Start a Massacre","paragraphs":["929 I’m Going to Start a Massacre","In Chu Yunfan’s perception, First Prison was a huge island. However, this Island was not floating on the sea, but in the endless void.","The entire island had been transformed into a fortress. After many years of transformation, this place had turned into a fortress.","Thousands of cannons were pouring out their energy. From electromagnetic cannons to positron cannons, and all kinds of conventional cannons, all of them were pouring out their terrifying energy.","Opposite them, completely different from what Chu Yunfan had imagined, were dozens of spaceships opposite the stronghold. They opened their cannons and rained hellfire on First Prison.","!!","It was like a battle between two interstellar races.","All kinds of terrifying firepower were pouring out and smashing into each other. At this time, defensive barriers and formations were activated one by one.","This was the first time that Chu Yunfan had seen a real battle between different races, but he soon understood. The Federation was able to develop a martial arts civilization from the Ancient Zenith Civilization ruins, so it was not strange that the demons had also obtained the power of technology from mankind.","After all, even the Great Eights had nuclear weapons. It was conceivable how widespread high-tech weapons were. With the existence of a Monster Cult spy within the human race, although the demons’ technology was not enough to compete with humans, they were probably not as primitive as many people thought.","In addition to the bombardment of many cannons, there were countless mechas and monsters fighting. Unless human martial artists entered the Divine Abilities Stage, there was no way for them to survive in the void.","However, monsters were different. The light of runes flowed over their skin, which helped them to survive and fight in the void of the universe.","This was a completely different kind of technology. It was different from humans who relied on mechas to fight at high altitudes. This was the power of a completely different technical system.","Although the Infinite Demon Mountain was different from the humans, it was able to fight for so many years that the Federation had no time to care about other things. Its strength was unquestionable.","On the battlefield, the most dazzling battle was, of course, the battle between the Divines. Even the void of the universe could not stop the battle between these top experts.","The first to bear the brunt were the three great experts. Two of them were familiar faces. One was the great ancestor of the Chu family, and the other was Zhu Buping.","After Chu Yunfan taught them the breakthrough method, the two of them, who already had extremely deep foundations, broke through to the fourth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage without any difficulty.","Their accumulation of martial power and comprehension in all aspects had already reached their peak. All they lacked was an opportunity.","And Chu Yunfan had given them this opportunity.","Other than the two of them, there was also a burly man who was running rampant on the battlefield in the void of the universe. His cultivation had also reached the fourth tier.","Chu Yunfan found his identity very easily. He was the warden of First Prison.","First Prison was so dangerous that it was impossible for it to survive without a powerful master.","The three of them were like iron walls, firmly nailed in the void. In addition, there were about eight or nine other Divine experts firmly holding the front line.","Even so, the line of defense was still in danger. There were many Divines on the Federation’s side, but there were more on the Infinite Demon Mountain’s side.","The number was at least double. At this rate, it was only a matter of time before all of them were defeated.","At that time, only the use of nuclear bombs could clear the field. This was consistent with the Federation’s tactics. If they could not win, they would use nuclear bombs to clear the field. Otherwise, in regard to top experts, the Federation would be very far behind.","“The front line is in danger!” Chu Yunfan said after closing his eyes and sensing for a while.","Chai Jin, on the other hand, looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise. Being able to sense something so far away was something that even he could not do.","Even Divines were divided into strong and weak, and Chu Yunfan’s reputation was, without a doubt, well-deserved.","Now that they had such a strong helper, it was naturally a great thing.","“The situation is bad!” Chai Jin’s terminal rang. He turned on the phone and a subordinate immediately reported.","“What’s going on?” He frowned.","“Sector One and Sector Two where the Divine Abilities Stage prisoners are kept have been broken into. Someone broke in and released the prisoners. Even the First Deputy Warden can’t hold them!” that person said anxiously.","Chai Jin’s expression suddenly changed. He knew what kind of existences were locked up in this prison. They were a group of existences that have committed heinous sins. Any one of them had the blood of at least eight to ten million lives on their hands.","Once they were released, judging from their hatred for the Federation, it would lead to a shocking disaster.","“Chief Chu, I’m afraid I don’t have time to entertain you. As you’ve heard, Sectors One and Two of the prison are used to hold Divine prisoners. Now that someone has broken in, I’m afraid it’ll cause a big disaster. With the strength of those people, even the First Deputy Warden may be no match for them. I have to hurry over there to help,” Chai Jin said.","“How about I go? This place needs your help in dispatching troops.”","Chu Yunfan immediately made a decision. Although the defensive line looked fragile from the outside and would collapse at any moment, the real danger was the crisis that was coming from the inside.","Once these Divine prisoners were released, First Prison would be finished. With a pincer attack, less than ten percent of the Federation’s experts would be able to escape.","“I’m sorry to have to trouble you then.”","Without a doubt, Chu Yunfan’s strength was much stronger than his. Having Chu Yunfan help was better than having him help.","“Can I kill people?” Chu Yunfan asked nonchalantly, ” I don’t think those people will obediently return to their positions. I have no choice but to start a massacre.”","“If they don’t obey, you may kill them all, Chief Chu. There’s no need to hold back.” Chai Jin’s eyes flickered with a cold light. “All of these people have committed heinous crimes. If the Federation didn’t have a use for them, they would have died long ago. Being able to live is the greatest grace to these scumbags. If they don’t appreciate it, just kill them all.”"]},{"number":930,"title":"Chapter 930 The Situation Is Precarious, a Group of Prisoners Come Out of Their Cells","paragraphs":["930 The Situation Is Precarious, a Group of Prisoners Come Out of Their Cells","When Chai Jin said this, Chu Yunfan’s eyes flickered with a bone-piercing coldness.","These people, regardless of whether they were at the Innate Stage or the Divine Abilities Stage, had all committed unforgivable sins, which was why they were held captive here.","All of them were extremely evil and had committed heinous sins. In his opinion, not killing them was already good enough. It could be considered as being exceptionally merciful.","If these people dared to rebel at such a critical moment, they might as well just die.","!!","Chai Jin didn’t disclose what use the Federation still had for these prisoners, but Chu Yunfan could guess. For these people to have cultivated to this level, there was no doubt that all of them were geniuses and all had amazing fortuitous encounters. Whatever the Federation could obtain from them would be a huge gain.","Moreover, it was not easy to obtain living specimens of Divine experts. So far, the Federation had not found a complete path to the Divine Abilities Stage, so through the study of these people and summarizing the rules, finding a path to the Divine Abilities Stage on a large scale was the best way for these people to atone for their sins.","Although the methods used on these prisoners were cold and could not be considered humane. But just as Chai Jin had said, these people were extremely evil and were absolute scumbags. All of them had committed heinous crimes, so Chu Yunfan did not sympathize with them.","To be able to make contributions to the Federation was, in fact, the greatest value of their lives.","This was understandable.","Chu Yunfan had known from a long time ago that although the Federation appeared to be holy on the surface—where there was light, there would be shadows. This was a corresponding matter.","“In that case, I won’t linger. It just so happens that I want to see how strong these old guys who were active in the previous era are.”","Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid. Instead, he felt the blood in his body boil, and his fighting spirit soaring.","“Don’t look down on these people, Chief Chu. They’re all extremely evil, and it wasn’t easy to catch them back then. Many of them were caught by the president himself, and many of them have profound cultivation. Although they’ve been suppressed by us all these years and their skills are no longer at their peak, they shouldn’t be underestimated. You know the recovery ability of Divines. As long as they’re given the slightest opportunity, they’ll immediately burst out with powerful combat power.”","Seeing how confident Chu Yunfan was, Chai Jin could not help but advise him.","Although he felt that Chu Yunfan was indeed stronger than him, being stronger than him and being able to completely suppress those prisoners were two completely different things.","Among those prisoners, there were many who were stronger than Chai Jin. If they were not locked up in a special prison, how could the warden and the other two Divines suppress so many people?","Chu Yunfan was young, after all. Even if he started cultivating in his mother’s womb, how strong could he be? At most, he would only be at the third tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. That kind of cultivation was already not weak, but it was still not enough to face those vicious people.","“Don’t worry, they’re just a bunch of outdated fools. If they’re obedient, then forget it. If they’re not, I’ll kill them.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t take Chai Jin’s advice to heart. It wasn’t that he was arrogant, but that he had absolute confidence in his strength.","“If things go south, you and the First Deputy Warden should leave immediately. There are nuclear bombs installed everywhere in the prison. If things go south, retreat immediately. I’d rather bomb those b*stards and let First Prison go down with them than let them escape,” Chai Jin said as he gritted his teeth.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He wasn’t surprised. It would be strange if there weren’t any backup plans in such a dangerous place.","“All right, enough talk. I’ll set off immediately. Get someone to take me there,” Chu Yunfan said.","Soon, Chai Jin found someone and arranged for Chu Yunfan to be shown to the prison area below First Prison.","At this time, in Sector One of First Prison, more than a dozen figures were flying high in the sky. All of them had monstrous auras as if they were the overlords of the world.","However, they were in a sorry state at the moment. Their clothes were torn and tattered, and they looked dispirited as if they had not eaten for many years.","Among these people, only one person was different. This person looked to be in his twenties. He had sharp eyebrows and bright eyes. He looked extremely handsome and extraordinary. Donning a long robe embroidered with a flood dragon, he looked extremely wealthy. Even these extremely powerful Divines had to lower their heads in front of this person.","Looking from afar, one could see corpses and the wreckage of mechas everywhere under the feet of these people. These were the guards who were guarding these powerful prisoners.","In front of these people who had escaped, they were unable to withstand a single blow. Only one of them had to make a move and these people had been instantly killed. Not even a single piece of their armor was left behind.","Even their bones were incomplete. Some of the corpses had a layer of skin left on them, and their blood essence seemed to have been completely absorbed.","Among these powerful Divine prisoners, there were traces of blood on the corners of their mouths. They had drunk the blood of the guards to replenish their years of consumption.","“Hehehe, I didn’t expect that I would get out one day. I must get my revenge. I’ll kill millions of ants, no, hundreds of millions of ants, to vent my hatred!”","“That’s right. When we get out of here, we can join forces and turn the Federation upside down. We’ll let them know who the real masters are!”","“Those who dare to stand in our way will all die!”","...","Every single one of these prisoners was filled with resentment. Some of them had been locked up for decades, while others had been locked up for at least a hundred years. Even for Divines, this was an extremely long time.","In this process, they had suffered a lot, and now, they were finally going to vent all the suffering they had felt all these years.","The young man in the lead took a step forward, and a halberd appeared in his hand. It fiercely slashed down, turning into a roaring dragon. It rushed down and blasted open a prison cell.","In this cell was an extremely old man. This old man’s body was extremely thin, but he carried an unimaginably terrifying aura. As the cell door was broken, this aura could not be suppressed and burst out all at once.","Slowly, the old man stood up and glanced at the other Divine prisoners. All of them were shocked.","“This old man is actually still alive? My God, he’s an antique. There’s going to be a good show,” one of the Divine prisoners muttered to himself."]},{"number":931,"title":"Chapter 931 One Strike Kills a Hundred","paragraphs":["931 One Strike Kills a Hundred","The old man’s escape made the other Divines’ spirits rise.","Even though these people were all great experts, once high and mighty, and had brought disaster to the common people, compared to this old man, it didn’t seem like much.","Everyone’s eyes were filled with unconcealable fear when they looked at the old man.","They all knew the old man’s background and his fierce reputation.","“Hehe, I didn’t think I’d survive to this day.” The old man smiled icily, then glanced at the other Divine prisoners, but he did not care much.","Finally, he looked at the young man in the lead and said, “Demon, why did you save me?”","He immediately pointed out the identity of this young man. This young man was not a human at all, but a demon expert.","“Because I need help. The price for saving you is your loyalty to me,” the young man said indifferently. His words were filled with confidence.","“Pledge loyalty to you?” The old man said coldly as he stared at the young man. Then, he laughed wildly. “You’re trying to order me around?”","“You have no other choice. Do you think that with your current situation, even if you want to return to the Federation, you will have such an opportunity?”","The young man didn’t get angry and said this indifferently.","“I was born to rule the world, but you? When I come to the Kunlun Realm, you will be allowed to lead a part of the human race to become the human king and serve me.”","“Hehe!” The old man said with a faint smile. “You’re young, but you’re ambitious. You’re the king of the Kunlun Realm? But you’re right about one thing. There’s no place for me in the human world now. Those ants don’t understand that they were born to be ruled. It’s engraved in their genes.","“But don’t talk big so soon. Let’s discuss it after you get us out of here. As far as I know, there’s more than one nuclear bomb buried here. Once it explodes, all of us will die,” the old man said indifferently.","The other Divine prisoners’ expressions immediately changed. They did not doubt the old man’s words. According to the Federation’s usual style of doing things, this was very likely.","No matter how amazing a Divine was and could create miracles or how awesome they were, they would still die if they were hit head-on by a nuclear bomb in such a small area.","There was no other possibility.","“When I came in, I already opened up an exit path. All of you just need to follow me,” the young man said.","With that, the young man flew off into the distance, and the Divine prisoners followed suit. The old man thought for a moment, and a hint of fear flashed through his eyes. Then, he followed suit and flew away.","At the same time, Sector Two was also in a mess. Unlike the dangerous prisoners in Sector One, the prisoners locked up her were weaker, but they were all Divines.","Although these Divine prisoners were not unreasonable in the past, and there might even be blood feuds between them, they knew that there was strength in numbers.","They continued to break through the prison cells one by one, killed the guards, and released the prisoner inside. Even a large number of Innate Stage prisoners managed to escape. Although they did not care about those people, they could at least be used as a means to contain the prison staff.","They had to work together and escape from this damned cage first. Only then would they be qualified to talk about other things.","In the core of Sector Two, a woman in her thirties was struggling to hold on. Her Spirit Energy was extremely powerful, and she was able to hold off two or three Divine prisoners on her own.","Although these Divine prisoners were not in their peak state, there was no doubting the woman’s strength.","However, as more and more Divine prisoners rushed over, she soon fell into a disadvantageous position. Her cultivation was almost completely sealed, and it was difficult for her to exert it.","She could only watch helplessly as the elites she had brought with her were slaughtered. There was nothing she could do. Although her cultivation was tyrannical, she could not protect everyone. Even she herself could not hold out much longer.","However, she also knew that if she couldn’t suppress these Divine prisoners, the consequences would be unimaginable. Once these people broke out, the collapse of First Prison was only a matter of time.","She could have killed one or two Divine prisoners, but there were too many enemies, which completely suppressed her combat power.","On the other side, the escaped prisoners and the guards from all over the world were fighting each other. The entirety of Sector Two was filled with small battlefields.","But as soon as these Divine prisoners arrived, the entire line of defense collapsed. The guards were above the Innate Stage and were considered elites. Although there were many of them, not a single Innate was able to withstand a single blow from a Divine.","After all, not everyone was Chu Yunfan’s opponent, not to mention that there were so many Divine prisoners.","All the Divine prisoners in Sector Two had been released and the entire line of defense collapsed instantly, suffering heavy casualties.","The prisoners cheered as they rushed toward the hole in the sky above Sector Two.","They were all told that there would be someone to pick them up there. The feeling of being rescued from the brink of death occupied their hearts.","One must know that they were not ordinary prisoners. Once they were caught, they would not have a chance to get out until they died. Otherwise, they would surely be a bane to the Federation.","They thought that they would be imprisoned till the day they died. Who knew that they would have such an opportunity?","Just as they were about to rush out, suddenly, countless thunderbolts condensed and turned into a sword light that filled the sky. Then, it slashed down.","Slice!","Slice!","Slice!","Countless rays of sword light slashed down, hitting the Innate prisoners who were trying to rush out.","In an instant, hundreds of Innate prisoners were nailed to the ground. All of them were from the group of people who had rushed to the front.","They were originally the group that had the most hope of breaking out, but now, they were the group that had died the fastest.","They saw a figure slowly approaching from the distance.","“Retreat now and I’ll spare your lives. Otherwise, you’ll end up like these people.”"]},{"number":932,"title":"Chapter 932 One Strike, All-Kill","paragraphs":["932 One Strike, All-Kill","A figure slowly walked over. When everyone fixed their eyes on him, they realized that this person was none other than Chu Yunfan.","However, these were all death row prisoners who had been locked up for a long time, so of course, they did not know Chu Yunfan’s reputation. In fact, even the guards here did not know of Chu Yunfan.","Due to the need for confidentiality, this place was not connected to the Internet, and they were not allowed to easily contact the outside world.","But this didn’t stop them from knowing that Chu Yunfan was on their side, because it was obvious.","Chu Yunfan slowly walked over. In front of him were hundreds of Innate prisoners. Without exception, they were all elites at the upper Innate Stage and above. The weakest among them was at the seventh level, and there were even peak Innates everywhere.","Although they had been imprisoned for a long time and were no longer at their peak, they couldn’t be underestimated.","When the number of people had reached more than a thousand, even if there were many guards in the prison, there was no way to stop these people who were crazy for survival.","However, Chu Yunfan had killed over a hundred people in one strike, which frightened these people. They stopped moving forward and fought against an army of thousands by themselves.","“Where did this expert come from?” Many of the guards looked at Chu Yunfan, not knowing where he came from. They didn’t have the qualifications to know about Chu Yunfan’s affairs. After all, during their shift, they were not allowed to contact the outside world.","However, they had all seen Chu Yunfan’s strength, so they felt at ease.","The prisoners were intimidated by Chu Yunfan’s power.","“I’ll give you a chance. Go back and you won’t die. Otherwise, you’ll all die,” Chu Yunfan said as he glanced at the prisoners.","“Let’s fight him. I don’t believe that he can kill all of us on his own. We’ll die if we go back. We’ll die if we fight him. So, let’s fight!” someone shouted loudly.","These Innate prisoners got riled up. Staying here would only result in them being imprisoned to death. Only by fighting to the death would they have a way out.","Thinking of this, many looked at Chu Yunfan with hatred in their eyes.","As soon as the man finished speaking, thousands of prisoners began to charge. The whole situation was spectacular.","“You’re seeking your death.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Since these prisoners were so stubborn, there was no need for him to show mercy.","Chu Yunfan raised his arm high up in the air and countless thunderbolts suddenly condensed into a long sword in the void. Behind him, a dense wall of swords was formed, which looked extremely powerful and terrifying.","At this time, the prisoners finally understood what kind of existence they had provoked. It was beyond ordinary martial arts means and had risen to the realm of divine power.","A Divine!","Many people gasped when they saw this scene. But at this time, most of them had already rushed toward Chu Yunfan, so they had no choice but to fight with all their might.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and the dense wall of swords behind him suddenly moved. Countless long swords formed by the power of lightning instantly swept out. Like a storm, they slashed at the thousands of Innate prisoners.","In just a few moments, these prisoners who had been so aggressive just a moment ago were all nailed to the ground.","Although the power of each sword was not comparable to Chu Yunfan’s full strength as he had yet to use his full strength, against these ordinary prisoners, it was still an unrivaled blow.","This was because they were not on the same level.","In an instant, the Innate prisoners were completely annihilated.","The guards were dumbfounded. Looking at Chu Yunfan, who was standing among a pile of corpses and walking slowly, it was as if they were looking at an asura on the battlefield who had so easily destroyed a group of death row prisoners that even they felt terrified.","It was only then that they truly understood how terrifying Divines were. In this era, all rumors about Divined had long been refuted by science, but they were still regarded as gods. The fundamental reason was that they were simply too powerful.","Their power was beyond imagination.","With just one strike, a Divine was able to completely annihilate an entire army.","However, what they didn’t know was that not every Divine had such powerful strength. If it was someone like the Fluttering Bloom’s vice sect leader that Chu Yunfan had killed earlier, they would probably have to temporarily avoid facing thousands of Innates.","After all, these were all upper Innates, not ordinary ones. If the vice sect master wanted to annihilate them, it would take him a lot of effort. And most importantly, some of them might escape.","It was impossible to deal with it as cleanly as Chu Yunfan had.","Then, Chu Yunfan looked at the guards and said, “I’m the current head of the Federation’s Special Operations Department, Chu Yunfan. Now, with my authority as the head of Special Ops, I shall be giving orders.","“Guard the entrance. If you see any prisoners who have escaped, you can attack them. If anyone tries to escape, kill them all.”","When the guards heard this, although they didn’t know why the new head of Special Ops was so young, they still let out a sigh of relief. Previously, they had been restricted by a few of the prisoners. But now that they had Chu Yunfan’s orders, they could attack with all their might. Their goal was not to capture them but to kill them.","After saying that, Chu Yunfan stepped on a bolt of lightning and went straight into the depths of Sector Two. He felt the energy fluctuations of a powerful Divine there.","Meanwhile, in the depths of Sector Two, the first deputy warden was being beaten back. Although she tried her best to stop them, she couldn’t stop the dozen or so powerful Divine prisoners in front of her.","The faces of these thugs revealed sinister and wild laughter. When they looked at her, their eyes lit up with a perverted light.","“We’ve not touched a woman for so many years, and we’ve been sent one right after we’re released from prison. Not bad, not bad.”","“When I get out, I’ll turn the Federation upside down!”","Each of these fanatics was more ferocious than the last.","“Don’t even think about it!”","The first deputy warden gritted her teeth. She was sweating profusely, and blood was flowing down her body. She was injured in many places.","“Hahaha, you’d better take care of yourself first. We’ll talk after you get out of here alive!” One of the Divine prisoners laughed arrogantly.","“Who said you’ll be able to get out? Since you don’t want to live anymore, I’ll send you to Heaven.”"]},{"number":933,"title":"Chapter 933 Have You Ever Been Shot by an Electromagnetic Cannon?","paragraphs":["933 Have You Ever Been Shot by an Electromagnetic Cannon?","With a cold voice, Chu Yunfan appeared.","“Who do you think you are to block my way?!”","As Chu Yunfan walked in, these people put up arrogant attitudes. When they saw how old he was, they thought that he was another kid who didn’t know his place.","One of them was a ten-foot-tall Divine who looked like a gorilla. He grabbed at the air and formed a huge Qi-condensed hand that slammed down on Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","This huge hand seemed to be able to tear the sky apart.","The prisoner’s face revealed a ferocious smile.","Swish!","A flash of lightning appeared in front of Chu Yunfan and it transformed into a long sword. With a light swing, the huge hand exploded in mid-air.","“Gorilla, do you want to die?” Chu Yunfan coldly glanced at the Divine prisoner.","The prisoner was instantly enraged. He absolutely hated it when people said he looked like a gorilla.","“You’re seeking death!”","The prisoner took a step forward, and in the next second, he was already in front of Chu Yunfan.","All of a sudden, terrifying flames emerged from his fists as if they could override all living beings in the world. A somewhat proud smile appeared on his face. He was known as the Fire Fist Tyrant in the past and made many people tremble in fear.","These two fists had killed countless people who didn’t obey him.","Bam!","This pair of terrifying fists that could shatter a mountain landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but he found that his fists couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan. They couldn’t make Chu Yunfan move even a little.","“Gorilla, is this all you can do with your fists?” Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a sneer.","The prisoner was only at tier two of the Divine Abilities Stage when he was at his peak. After being imprisoned for so long, it was already good enough for him to be at the peak of tier one.","Why would Chu Yunfan care about someone with this level of strength?","At this time, the arrogant prisoner finally realized that something was wrong. He realized that Chu Yunfan was not a simple person. He immediately roared and threw thousands of punches. Each punch was filled with fire as if it was going to burn the whole world.","It was terrifying!","All of these attacks landed on Chu Yunfan, but he was like a rock in the middle of a boundless sea. No matter how the waves crashed against him, he didn’t move.","“Sh*t!”","At this moment, the prisoner finally reacted. The young man in front of him was probably extraordinarily powerful.","He planned to retreat, but Chu Yunfan gave him no chance.","“Have you ever been shot by an electromagnetic cannon?”","A coin was tossed high up in the air. The moment it landed, a terrifying electric current ran through it, forming a terrifying blast.","Boom!","The fearsome electromagnetic cannon shot through the sky and struck the chest of the tall prisoner.","Bam!","The prisoner fell to the ground. He struggled for a while and stopped moving because his entire head had exploded. He died instantly.","He had attacked Chu Yunfan with thousands of punches, but he couldn’t even hurt a single hair on Chu Yunfan’s head. On the other hand, he couldn’t even block a casual attack from Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s strength finally attracted the attention of these people after he killed a Divine in one hit. These people, who used to be high and mighty, all looked at Chu Yunfan with fear in their eyes. They didn’t know when such a terrifying person had appeared.","Killing a Divine with one strike, even though the prisoner had not been at his peak, such combat power was still terrifying.","The first deputy warden took advantage of this rare opportunity to force back the prisoner who had besieged her and then retreated to Chu Yunfan’s side.","At this time, she was in a very sorry state. There was more than one wound on her body. Blood and sweat were flowing down at the same time, and she would occasionally let out heavy pants.","“Thank you for your help, Chief Chu.”","Ordinary people couldn’t access information from the outside world, but that didn’t mean that the top executives of First Prison couldn’t.","She knew who Chu Yunfan was. Recently, he had caused such a big commotion in the Federation, so it was impossible for her not to know.","She had originally wondered when the Federation had gained such a genius. She didn’t expect that he would save her this time around.","Just the thought of a Divine in his twenties was terrifying.","“No need to thank me. Rest. I’ll clean up these b*stards,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Why didn’t anyone else come?”","The first deputy warden retreated behind Chu Yunfan, panting heavily as she spoke.","“I’m afraid the others won’t have the time to come to our aid,” Chu Yunfan said.","He knew what kind of situation the battle outside had reached. It was already in a precarious situation, and it was impossible to pull out more people.","“What? How is that possible? There are so many Divine prisoners here. How can you deal with them alone? the first deputy warden exclaimed.","She had tried her best to hold out until now, but she was told that there would be no more reinforcements. Did they really have to use nuclear bombs to destroy this place?","“I alone am enough. Since these b*stards are not willing to return to their cells, I’ll just kill them all,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly, “If this is Sector Two, the situation at Sector One must be even more chaotic. I don’t have much time left.”","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s confident look, the first deputy warden didn’t know how to persuade him. After all, there were more than one or two Divine prisoners here. Although the prisoners imprisoned in Sector Two were not as powerful as those in Sector One, they were still at the Divine Abilities Stage.","“You think you can stop all of us by yourself?”","“That’s right. If you step aside now, we’ll spare your life.”","“Get out of our way now!”","These Divine prisoners stared at Chu Yunfan. The amazing strength that he had just displayed made them extremely afraid. However, they were much more powerful than Chu Yunfan, so they were not too afraid.","However, no one was willing to stand out and help others.","“Spare my life? I don’t think you guys understand the situation.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. “Today, all of you will die. Don’t even think about escaping.”"]},{"number":934,"title":"Chapter 934 Suppressing Sector Two, Annihilating All Divine Prisoners","paragraphs":["934 Suppressing Sector Two, Annihilating All Divine Prisoners","Chu Yunfan looked at these prisoners and smiled coldly.","“We don’t have much time now and I’m too lazy to talk to you dregs,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. Then, step by step, he walked toward these prisoners and stepped into the sky.","He went into the battle alone without a trace of fear.","It was as if every step was stepping on their hearts, making them feel apprehensive. Just one person seems able to suppress all of them.","However, these prisoners were not frightened. On the contrary, their faces showed ferocious expressions. All of them had committed heinous sins before, and their hands were stained with blood. Even though Chu Yunfan gave off a very dangerous feeling, they would not give up so easily.","Chu Yunfan’s pace seemed slow, but it was actually fast. In just a moment, he had already arrived in between them as if he had naturally walked into their encirclement.","“You’re looking for death!” Seeing that Chu Yunfan had entered their encirclement, the prisoners finally couldn’t hold it in any longer. In an instant, the Sky and Earth changed color, and all the Spirit Energy in the world began to boil.","All the prisoners attacked at the same time. All of their world-famous ultimate skills burst out and attacked Chu Yunfan.","“Sh*t!”","The first deputy warden’s expression changed when she saw the scene. She knew all too well how powerful these prisoners were. They were not people ordinary folks could deal with.","But then, she saw an extremely terrifying scene.","The attacks of these people all landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, which was terrifying to look at, but when they all landed, he didn’t waver in the slightest.","Their terrifying attacks were like a gentle breeze, unable to affect him in the slightest.","Chu Yunfan ignored the attacks of these prisoners. The experts among them were only in the first or second tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, and they had been imprisoned for a long time. They had long lost their peak cultivation.","These attacks had no effect on him at all.","Swish!","Chu Yunfan grabbed at the air and pulled out a huge thunderbolt. This huge thunderbolt turned into a long sword, and in his hand, this long sword instantly burst out a terrifying sword light.","Chu Yunfan had amazing swordsmanship, and now, he was finally showing it all.","It was a simple swing of the sword, and it hit a prisoner head-on. The prisoner screamed in pain as his whole body was cut in half.","He didn’t even have the time to unleash his strength before he died on the spot.","After killing one Divine in one strike, Chu Yunfan didn’t slow down. He slashed out again.","Slice!","Yet another prisoner had fallen at his hands.","The first deputy warden looked at the scene in front of her, dumbfounded. In front of Chu Yunfan, it was as if these people were just ants on the road who could be killed at will.","She gulped and thought, ‘What kind of monster is he? No wonder he managed to make such a big name for himself. We’re so lucky to have such a person in the Federation!’","She finally understood what it meant to say that there would always be someone better than you. People like her could only be considered ordinary, but Chu Yunfan was completely different. He was a monster that was above geniuses.","In a short while, Chu Yunfan had killed more than half the prisoners.","At this moment, the remaining prisoners were truly terrified. They didn’t dare to imagine how Chu Yunfan could be so powerful.","These people had been locked up for decades and had just escaped when they immediately met a super fiend like Chu Yunfan. They felt that their lives were simply hopeless.","“Run!”","They didn’t know when it happened, but this was the only thought left in their minds. They didn’t dare to go against Chu Yunfan. He was too terrifying.","They swore that they had never encountered such a terrifying existence in their lives. To him, killing Divines like them was as easy as cutting cabbage on the side of the road.","These people fled in all directions.","“Stop them! Don’t let them escape!”","At that moment, the first deputy warden stood up in the distance, planning to fight the fleeing prisoners head-on. These people were too dangerous. Even if only one of them escaped, it would endanger the whole world.","“They won’t get away.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","In the blink of an eye, he made his move. His hand turned into a series of afterimages as he shot out a few electromagnetic beams across the sky.","Bam","Bam!","Bam!","The prisoners who were running away could not escape and were all struck, dying in an instant.","“So many people and they were killed in an instant...”","“This is terrifying. Is this guy part of the Federation?”","“That’s impossible! That’s too scary!”","The remaining guards exclaimed in disbelief. They were shocked by Chu Yunfan.","If it was only one of them, then they could still understand. After all, Chu Yunfan was also a Divine, and these prisoners had been imprisoned for many years, so their strength was not at its peak.","However, such an astonishing massacre could not be explained by the fact that one of them was in a Divine. Otherwise, the first deputy warden wouldn’t have been beaten back in such a pathetic manner.","“The Federation is going to have a tough character,” an older guard muttered to himself.","“I’ve killed them all,” Chu Yunfan said as he flew to the first deputy warden’s side.","“I’m going to clean up Sector One. I’ll leave this place to you. If there are any fish that escaped the net, I’ll have to trouble you to deal with them.”","After a long time, the first deputy warden finally reacted. Chu Yunfan had killed the most powerful people in Sector Two, but there were indeed a few people who had escaped.","“No problem. But you shouldn’t go in alone. Sector One is too dangerous. It’s much more terrifying than Sector Two.”","The first deputy warden suddenly shivered as if she had thought of something. She had seen those people in Sector One with her own eyes. All of them were terrifyingly powerful. The Federation had paid a huge price to capture them.","“Don’t worry, they’re just trash,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","After he finished speaking, he didn’t stop and flew in the direction of Sector One."]},{"number":935,"title":"Chapter 935 Chu Yunfan’s Legendary Battle Record","paragraphs":["935 Chu Yunfan’s Legendary Battle Record","Sector Two was completely annihilated. After Chu Yunfan’s arrival, they were suppressed at a shocking speed. From start to finish, only a short time had passed.","At this time, the place where the huge hole had been blasted open at the prison was filled with carcasses. They were all huge monsters.","These beasts had smashed open the huge hole in the originally sturdy First Prison.","There were hundreds of mechas surrounding the entrance of the hole. The person leading these mechas was none other than the second deputy warden, Chai Jin.","His expression was extremely grave, and his brows furrowed. “I didn’t expect someone would be able to sneak into this place. Whether it’s the high-tech radar or the defensive barrier, they failed to discover the intruders. This is humiliating.”","He was in a dilemma. Nothing like this had ever happened in First Prison.","This didn’t seem like an ordinary method of sneaking in. No matter how one snuck in, it would definitely trigger the defensive barrier.","Due to the uniqueness of this place—where a large number of powerful criminals were locked up—there was no concept of rest here. The detection barrier was active twenty-four hours a day.","No one could get close without setting off the alarms, not even Divines. The three prison wardens had tested it out themselves, and even their methods could not get them in without setting off a sound.","That was why Chai Jin couldn’t figure out how the other party had got in.","However, Sector One and Sector Two were in complete chaos at the moment.","“Everyone, this is an order. Those who escaped are not our people. Attack with all your might and leave no one alive. No matter if they are Divines or Innates, whoever dares to escape will be executed!”","After Chai Jin finished saying this, he felt very uneasy. Nevertheless, he took a step forward and entered this huge hole.","Sure enough, it was a scene of complete devastation. There were heavy casualties in every direction. But then, he saw an extremely shocking scene. Thousands of prisoners had been killed in an orderly manner. Why they had died in such a manner was shocking. With his strength, it was not difficult to see that these people were killed in one blow.","He couldn’t help but take a deep breath when he saw thousands of prisoners had been killed in one strike. If it were him, it would be impossible for him to achieve such a feat.","It might not be too difficult for him to kill over a thousand Innate prisoners. However, to be able to do it so cleanly and perfectly in one strike was only the stuff of legends.","“How did this...” He instantly ruled out the possibility of the first deputy warden as it was impossible. He knew her strength very well.","Although he was stronger than her, it was impossible for him to kill the first deputy warden in one hit. This feat had been achieved through a strength that was clearly beyond the first deputy warden’s.","Then there was only one possibility, and that was Chu Yunfan who had just arrived to help.","‘Chu Yunfan is much stronger than what the rumors say!’ Chai Jin thought. He didn’t know if this was because Chu Yunfan had hidden his strength before, or if it was because he had improved again during this period of time.","But now, the stronger Chu Yunfan was, the better it would be for them.","As Chai Jin flew deeper into Sector Two, he crossed paths with the first deputy warden. She was now a little better than when she had first met Chu Yunfan, but she still looked quite embarrassed.","Chai Jin could imagine how fierce the battle she had been in.","“Are you all right?” Chai Jin asked as he hurriedly toward her.","“I’m fine now.” When the first deputy warden saw Chai Jin arrive, she let out a sigh of relief.","“You weren’t the one who killed all these people, were you?” Chai Jin looked at the corpses of the Divine prisoners on the ground. Without exception, all of them had died in a miserable manner.","What alarmed him, even more, was that these prisoners had not died from battle. Their bodies were devoid of excessive wounds.","All of them were killed in one shot.","Just killing these prisoners was already a great feat, let alone killing them in one strike. That was simply a myth. It was an impossibility. At least, to him, it was.","“How could that be possible? It’s not like you don’t know my strength. It’s not difficult for me to kill one or two of them, but I wouldn’t be able to kill so many at once.” The first deputy warden shook her head.","Thinking of Chu Yunfan’s terrifying combat power, she felt that it was simply unbelievable. That clean and efficient method was not something she could do.","“This was all done by the newly appointed Chief Chu of Special Ops,” the first deputy warden said.","Although he had already guessed it, Chai Jin could not help but gasp when he saw the many corpses and heard the first deputy warden’s admission.","“I’ve read his information. He’s only in his twenties. Even if he started cultivating in his mother’s womb, he couldn’t have progressed so quickly. He’s a monster!” Chai Jin said.","“Isn’t it? Even when the president was his age, he wasn’t this terrifying. In the future, he’ll definitely be someone like the president, or even more terrifying,” the first deputy warden said. “In such troubled times, the more such people there are, the better. Otherwise, we won’t be able to suppress the freaks inside and outside the Federation.”","“I agree.” Chai Jin nodded. However, when he swept his gaze over the corpses that covered the ground, he could not help the chill running down his back.","“All right, I’m fine. I’ll clean up the fish that have escaped the net. If you want to help, go to Sector One quickly. The Chief went to Sector One alone. You know the situation there. All the prisoners there are monsters. Each one is more terrifying than the last,” the first deputy warden said hurriedly.","“I understand.” Chai Jin thought about what kind of monsters were locked up in Sector One and couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air. Sector Two was already troublesome enough, but it was nothing compared to the monsters locked up in Sector One.","It was obvious that the difference was not just one grade.","After he finished speaking, Chai Jin didn’t hesitate and flew toward Sector One.","The first deputy warden looked at Chai Jin and called out, “Don’t die!”","At this moment, Sector One was in an uproar."]},{"number":936,"title":"Chapter 936 I Alone Am Enough to Kill You Pieces of Trash!","paragraphs":["936 I Alone Am Enough to Kill You Pieces of Trash!","“Hehehe, the blood essence of Innates is so useless. It’s better to get a Divine. I can feel that his energy and blood are magnificent. He must have amazing strength in physical cultivation.” One of the demonic cultivators looked at Chu Yunfan with a greedy expression as if he was not looking at a person, but prey.","“That’s right. Kill him and divide up his blood essence!”","These demonic cultivators who had been trapped for so many years had gone completely mad. Most of them were imprisoned because they were demonic cultivators and not from the proper path.","They had committed heinous crimes in the Federation and so were imprisoned here.","“The warden and the deputy wardens are not here? I don’t think one person’s blood essence is enough for me.” One of the demonic cultivators laughed. His teeth had turned into fangs, making him look extremely ferocious.","“I don’t need them. I’m enough to deal with trash like you.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“You dare to call us trash?!”","The Divine prisoners were instantly enraged. They had been imprisoned for so many years, and now, a junior who had popped out of nowhere dared to look down on them. It was a great humiliation.","“Brat, you’re too arrogant!”","They suddenly heard an angry roar, and then a figure appeared beside Chu Yunfan.","The speed was simply too fast, not giving anyone any time to react.","“I killed the Federation’s president back then. Who do you think you are?!”","The old man who had pounced forward angrily roared and revealed a secret from back then.","As he attacked, a sea of blood appeared around him. It was as if the boundless sea of blood would drown Sector One.","The old man gestured at the sea of blood and a sharp dagger suddenly flew out from it. The dagger ruthlessly flew toward Chu Yunfan’s head.","The speed was too fast, and the dagger had a terrifying glow. It was extremely terrifying.","Bam!","However, to everyone’s horror, the old man didn’t even have time to land his attack on Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan reached out his hand and grabbed the blood sea. In fact, it couldn’t form a blood sea anymore. After being locked up for so many years, the old man’s power was no longer at its peak. It was just a sea of blood, but to others, it was very dangerous. But against Chu Yunfan, it was completely useless.","Then, Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and threw a punch at the old man.","“You want to exchange injuries with me?” The old man seemed to have seen through Chu Yunfan’s plan at once.","Chu Yunfan seemed to be planning to exchange injury for injury with him, but the old man didn’t take it to heart. After being hit by his attack, even if one had three heads and six arms and was a deity of the great all-embracing Heaven, it was useless. They would still die.","Boom!","Clang!","With two different sounds, the dagger struck Chu Yunfan’s body with a monstrous power, but it made a sound like the clanging of gold and iron. It couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan.","It couldn’t even break through the layer of jade-colored light on Chu Yunfan’s body.","“Sh*t!”","The old man finally realized that something was wrong and hastily retreated, but it was already too late. Chu Yunfan’s punch landed on his body.","“Bam!","The old man grunted and was sent flying like a shooting star."]},{"number":937,"title":"Chapter 937 Killing Several People in a Row, Gaining the Upper Hand","paragraphs":["937 Killing Several People in a Row, Gaining the Upper Hand","The old man was hit directly, and his chest seemed to have been bombarded by a heavy cannon.","He instantly became a bloody mess. What was more terrifying was that a huge bloody hole had appeared.","He was severely injured in the blink of an eye, and this was just a casual attack from Chu Yunfan.","“If you want to kill me, you have to see if you have the ability,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","!!","Then, he was surprised to find that the old man whose chest he had punched through was not dead.","The old man’s body was shaking from head to toe, and then his skin was torn open. A bloody man crawled out of it, gasping for breath. Chu Yunfan’s attack just now seemed to have not existed, and only skin was left behind. And on that piece of skin, there was a huge bloody hole.","“As expected of Dark Blood Pool’s sect master who dared to assassinate the president back then. You really are something.”","Chu Yunfan was a little surprised, but then he said these words nonchalantly, not taking the sect master to heart.","He had been hunted down by Dark Blood Pool more than once. In fact, there were people from three assassin organizations among those who had hunted him. Therefore, he could be said to be very familiar with these people’s cultivation techniques.","The sea of blood that filled the sky was actually a powerful technique of Dark Blood Pool. When cultivated to the extreme, it could form a sea of blood. It was even said that as long as the sea of blood was not destroyed, they would not die.","Of course, that was just a claim, but it made Chu Yunfan recall something from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. There were indeed people who had cultivated similar techniques back then. Then, it was not a claim, but the truth.","The sea of blood the person in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories created could cover the entire world. As long as the sea of blood didn’t dry up, he wouldn’t die. That was a truly terrifying almighty.","The sect master was nothing compared to that person.","Back then, Dark Blood Pool’s sect master had assassinated the president. The entire Federation was completely enraged. Later, some people said that the sect master had died in the Federation’s revenge. It was only now that they realized that the rumors back then were not true.","Back then, the sect master had indeed been retaliated against. However, he did not die. Instead, he was captured and imprisoned here for a long time.","“You actually dared to injure me?! You’re dead meat!” the man covered in blood roared. He was already at the peak of his anger. He was completely enraged by Chu Yunfan.","If it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan, he wouldn’t be in such a sorry state.","“You should be grateful that you survived back then. How dare you cause trouble now.”","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he threw a coin up into the air. Countless bolts of lightning wrapped around his arm, turning into a storm of lightning, and finally hit the coin.","Boom!","It turned into a terrifying electromagnetic cannon, fast and swift, and it instantly arrived in front of the bloody man.","The sect master had never expected Chu Yunfan to be so unpredictable. He didn’t even plan to say anything to him and simply attacked him.","Boom!","The electromagnetic cannon hit the sect master. He had just used his ultimate life-saving skill, so it was naturally unable to save its life again. He was severely injured and died a tragic death.","The blood-red body instantly exploded and the sect master died a tragic death.","A deathly silence.","At this moment, everyone no longer looked at Chu Yunfan with the disregard they had before. Or rather, he had scared them all.","No matter how weak they were, they were still Divines. But in front of Chu Yunfan, they were so vulnerable.","This was the most terrifying thing.","“If you don’t back into your cells, you’ll end up like him.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t even glance at the sect master as if he had just killed an insignificant person.","At this time, these prisoners finally understood why Chu Yunfan dared to come alone. It wasn’t that he was arrogant, but that he really had the confidence and strength to do so.","When the old man who had been following behind the group stared at Chu Yunfan, his eyes glinted with a sharp light.","“Everyone says that the prisoners in Sector One are stronger, but I don’t think there’s much of a difference.” Chu Yunfan sneered, as if he was trying to anger these prisoners.","As expected, the faces of these prisoners were filled with anger. Chu Yunfan’s contempt for them was a great humiliation.","“This is a tricky problem. Everyone, let’s attack together!” one of the prisoners said with a serious expression.","After this attack, even if they were stupid, they could see Chu Yunfan was not to be trifled with. Even when they were at their peak, they hadn’t been this strong, so how could they still dare to underestimate him?","For a moment, even vulgar words were shouted out!","These people quickly came to an agreement and decided to join forces.","Swish!","Swish!","Swish!","As soon as these people came to an agreement, they disappeared from their original spot. They were so fast that they formed an encirclement around Chu Yunfan in the blink of an eye, surrounding him from all directions.","Their bodies were burning with amazing energy. Although they were not at their peak, they did not dare to hold back at this time. Dark Blood Pool’s sect master was the best example of this.","As for Chu Yunfan, he stood stockstill as if he did not care about these people at all.","The prisoners in Sector Two were at tier one or tier two of the Divine Abilities Stage. There were only a few who were at tier three. However, it was different here. Most of them were in the tier three, and there were even a few in tier four.","Thinking back to how the Jiang Great Ancestor had single-handedly turned the Chu Great Ancestor and company upside down, one could imagine how terrifying and astonishing experts of this level were.","Boom!","All of a sudden, a red arm grew out of Chu Yunfan’s body. It was a blood-red skeletal hand, and in a flash, it grabbed one of the prisoners.","Before the prisoner could react, the skeletal hand slammed him into the ground. The terrifying force was many times more terrifying than before.","With just one strike, the prisoner was killed.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan’s other blood-red skeletal hand also struck out, and another prisoner killed before he could react. These prisoners were fast, but how could they compare to Chu Yunfan who had activated the garuda portion?","In just a moment, they had formed an encirclement and had yet to make a move, but Chu Yunfan had already killed two of them, gaining the upper hand."]},{"number":938,"title":"Chapter 938 Easily Annihilated","paragraphs":["938 Easily Annihilated","No one had expected that things would turn out this way.","Chu Yunfan was fast and ruthless, not giving them any chance to react.","In the blink of an eye, he had killed two people.","However, these people had already come this far, so they refused to give up so easily. If they were the kind of people who were easily scared out of their wits, they wouldn’t have reached their current cultivation.","!!","“I don’t believe that you can do anything even if you have three heads and six arms!” one of the prisoners roared. Countless flames appeared on his palm, and he wanted to burn Chu Yunfan to death.","All kinds of magical powers and martial skills burst out like a tide, instantly drowning Chu Yunfan.","However, a terrifying scene happened. Chu Yunfan’s body emitted a faint layer of jade light. He was like a god, walking through all kinds of disasters, but none of them could affect him.","It was extremely terrifying. Such a thing would be a miracle in the outside world, and it made everyone tremble in fear.","They realized that their attacks couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan. They couldn’t even break through jade light.","“How is this possible?!” Even the young man’s eyes widened.","A hint of shock flashed through his eyes. He was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing physical cultivation.","In the present world, there were not many who had a real physical cultivation base. This was because physical cultivation was very hard and much more difficult than normal cultivation. It was not something that ordinary people could successfully cultivate. It was not a concept on the same level.","Without a doubt, Chu Yunfan possessed a great body-tempering technique, which was why he could have such an amazing performance.","The eyes of the old man who had been holding back also shone brightly.","In such a short time, the battle had already reached a hot-white stage. These people’s attacks couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan. Even at their peak, they were not Chu Yunfan’s opponent, who had cultivated the Imperial Physique to the bone stage, let alone now.","“Is this all your attacks can do? I’m so disappointed,” Chu Yunfan said coldly. He reached out his hand and grabbed countless lightning bolts, which turned into two twin blades.","He attacked wantonly, slashing at the prisoners. He could let them attack him without any fear. Their attacks could not do anything to him. They did not have such terrifying cultivation and skills.","Chu Yunfan’s attacks were powerful. Anyone grazed by him would be severely injured, and those who were hit would instantly die.","In just a few moments, several people had already fallen to Chu Yunfan’s dual lightning blades—their bodies cut in half.","Chu Yunfan’s attacks now had the bearing of a grandmaster. None of his movements had a set pattern and were extremely powerful.","“How can we fight this?!”","At this time, there were less than ten prisoners left. In just a short while, Chu Yunfan had already killed almost half of them.","They were both shocked and angry. Although they had long known how terrifying a physique cultivator was, after fighting Chu Yunfan, they realized that those physique cultivators they had encountered before were nothing compared to him.","Although those physique experts were troublesome, they weren’t like Chu Yunfan who could slaughter them like ants.","“Is he a monster?” These prisoners were incomparably shocked. In such a short time, another two people had died.","Those who were struck by Chu Yunfan’s dual lightning blades were inevitably cut in half, and their souls were destroyed. They couldn’t be more dead, and the key to this was that Chu Yunfan was lightning fast.","Not only was he powerful, but he was also unimaginably fast, surpassing all of them. All the martial skills in the world and speed were indestructible. Chu Yunfan had both of these advantages.","This was the fundamental reason why he was so terrifying.","Those who couldn’t avoid it could only face death. What really scared them was that some of them had barely managed to defend themselves, but their defense was like paper in front of Chu Yunfan.","In just a moment, it was torn apart, and they were killed by Chu Yunfan’s blades.","It didn’t seem to make much of a difference. It was just a little more delay and a little more struggle.","The dead prisoners had been killed with just one strike. This kind of terrifying killing efficiency frightened these demon kings who had killed people like killing flies.","After Chu Yunfan killed his way through and only five people were left, these people finally broke down. They were scared of Chu Yunfan’s killing.","All of this had happened in such a short time. So short that they had only been dazed for a moment, and everything had already happened.","At this moment, they were all fleeing in all directions.","“You’re done for!” the old man spat out these words and looked at the few people who fled as if they were dead.","Chu Yunfan was already difficult to deal with. If they scattered and fled now, wouldn’t they just be waiting to be killed one by one?","However, he understood what these people were thinking. Even if they ran away together, Chu Yunfan couldn’t possibly kill them all in one go. There was still a chance of escaping.","This hope that Chu Yunfan would hunt down the others instead of themselves was because they were terrified by his lone pursuit.","To be able to do this all by himself, when did the Federation gain such a shocking figure?","The old man then looked at the young man in the lead, and seemed to understand why this young man was so insistent on killing this junior named Chu Yunfan. If such a character was allowed to continue growing, the future would be unimaginable.","And sure enough, the result was exactly as the old man had predicted. With Chu Yunfan’s strength, how could he let the fleeing prisoners escape?","Chu Yunfan stretched out his hand, and suddenly, endless power of lightning began to boil. With Chu Yunfan’s current profound cultivation, the scale of his power could be imagined. Countless thunderbolts turned into countless thunder spears, and in an instant, the five people were exterminated.","Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. At his level, even divine-tier experts were no longer of any use to him.","“It’s your turn.”","Chu Yunfan looked toward the remaining two people, one old and one young. He could feel that the cultivation of these two people was different from the others.","“Are you going to surrender obediently, or do you want to die?”"]},{"number":939,"title":"Chapter 939 The Demon Royals","paragraphs":["939 The Demon Royals","Chu Yunfan gazed at the young man. The young man seemed to be emitting a demonic aura. Although it was hidden very well, it could not escape Chu Yunfan’s vision.","Almost immediately, Chu Yunfan determined that this young man was a demon. And he was probably no ordinary expert.","Even after Chu Yunfan had gone on a killing spree, he didn’t seem the least bit frightened. It was as if he was still full of confidence that he could take down Chu Yunfan in such a situation.","“You’re pretty powerful. No wonder your name is spreading throughout the world.”","!!","The young man looked at Chu Yunfan with some fear in his eyes, but there was more of a fierce look in them.","The more outstanding Chu Yunfan’s performance was, the more intense the killing intent in his heart became. He couldn’t wait to see Chu Yunfan die.","A person such as Chu Yunfan was naturally a nemesis of the demons.","As for the old man, he just looked on indifferently as if he was unwilling to interfere. He only looked at the two people in interest.","The two were probably the top youngsters in their respective races. He was not surprised that the demons had such a foundation and managed to produce such talent. However, he did not know that such a talent had appeared in the Federation.","In terms of the Federation’s heritage and development, it was not even one-tenth of the demons’ lifespan. The road ahead had been cut off, and it was difficult to continue. At this time, Chu Yunfan seemed dazzling.","Even if some people’s strength was amazing, it was also down to personal opportunity. The most important thing was Chu Yunfan’s age. Such an age, in this era, was shocking.","Chu Yunfan had originally been on guard against this old man, but who knew that this old man didn’t seem to have any intention of coming forward and just looked at him indifferently?","“Who are you? Tell me your name. I’m a little interested to know your name now,” Chu Yunfan said offhandedly.","The young man looked at Chu Yunfan and then said, “I don’t mind telling you. My name is Bai Yulin.”","“Bai Yulin!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up. “I’ve heard that there are a total of three great demon kingdoms on Infinite Demon Mountain, and one of them is surnamed Bai. In that case, you must be from the royal family of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom.”","As Chu Yunfan spoke, information about Infinite Demon Mountain quickly flashed through his mind. Most people didn’t know much about it. They only knew about the existence of the human-demon battlefield, but they didn’t know much about the demons the humans fought. Even if they knew, they only knew of Infinite Demon Mountain.","But at Chu Yunfan’s level, he naturally knew a little about Infinite Demon Mountain. After all, the human race and Infinite Demon Mountain had fought many times, and they were old rivals. Although they didn’t know the specifics of Infinite Demon Mountain, they had a general idea of the situation.","Infinite Demon Mountain was divided into three major demon kingdoms, which were the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom, the Silvermoon Kingdom, and the Mighty Mighty Lion Kingdom.","There were many demon tribes under these three demon kingdoms. They were the rulers of the tribes scattered across the Kunlun Realm.","Among them, the rulers of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom were said to have the bloodline of a wyrm. Although it was very sparse, it was still extraordinary. It was the strongest among the three great demon kingdoms.","And the ruler of this kingdom was surnamed Bai.","Other than the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom, the rulers of the Silver Moon Kingdom was a tribe called the Howling Silver Moon Wolf tribe. They were also extremely terrifying and ruled over thousands of demons.","Then there was the Mighty Lion Kingdom, which was ruled by the famous Golden Lion tribe of the Kunlun Realm.","These three major demon tribes were known as the Royal Tribes across the Kunlun Realm. They usually only appeared in large-scale battles like the human-demon Battlefront. Chu Yunfan had not expected to meet a royal of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom at First Prison.","These three tribes were extremely powerful, but there weren’t many purebreds. The number of purebreds in each tribe was limited, and among the three kingdoms, the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom had the biggest family. The wyrms also had some dragon characteristics, which were lascivious by nature, so there were many subspecies, but there weren’t many purebreds.","This was why Chu Yunfan was a little surprised to meet a pure royal of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom here.","Considering the demon’s age, he was considered very young even among the demons. Such a person was extremely rare even in the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom.","A hint of excitement flashed in Chu Yunfan’s eyes. He had finally caught a big fish.","“Not bad. You’re quite knowledgable.” Bai Yulin smiled, a hint of pride on his face. It was indeed something to be proud of, considering the achievements of his tribe.","“It just so happens that the Federation has never captured any members of the Royal Tribes alive before. We’ll start with you.”","Chu Yunfan was fearless. Instead, he felt excited.","It was extremely difficult to capture the experts of the Royal Tribes on the battlefield. It was several times harder than killing them.","“Chu Yunfan, what a man you are. There are rumors that you’re very arrogant, and it seems they’re true.” Bai Yulin stared coldly at Chu Yunfan, and the killing intent in his eyes became even more intense.","“Same to you,” Chu Yunfan said to Bai Yulin.","Suddenly, Bai Yulin made the first move. It was just a simple flick of his finger, but it seemed like the whole world was pierced through.","In an instant, his fingers turned into dragon claws.","“Bonebreaker Finger! I’ll take your life!”","This finger was pointed directly at Chu Yunfan. Bai Yulin wanted to kill Chu Yunfan as quickly as possible, not giving him the slightest chance of escape.","Bam!","This finger touched Chu Yunfan’s forehead. If it was an ordinary person, even if they were as strong as a mountain, they would have exploded.","However, Bai Yulin had met Chu Yunfan, who had cultivated the Imperial Physique to the extreme.","Chu Yunfan simply exerted his strength, and all the divine power in his body burst out like an endless river. In an instant, the finger was shaken away.","Thud, thud, thud!","Bai Yulin was forced back by Chu Yunfan’s counterattack and his eyes were filled with disbelief. He knew that he had held nothing back, but Chu Yunfan still managed to instantly push him back.","“Interesting. Your physique cultivation is quite unusual.” Bai Yulin looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. “But can you within my next move?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Bai Yulin reached out with his hand and pulled out a long saber. It glowed with a terrifying light, and all the killing intent in the world gathered like a storm. It was visible to the naked eye that killing intent was concentrated on Bai Yulin’s saber.","“Take this! Life Ender!”"]},{"number":940,"title":"Chapter 940 Give Me Everything You’ve Got, I’ll Break Everything With One Punch","paragraphs":["940 Give Me Everything You’ve Got, I’ll Break Everything With One Punch","When the Life Ender was used, the killing intent that had accumulated completely burst out.","“The Life Ender?” Chu Yunfan recognized the technique at a glance. It was none other than the Jiang clan’s ultimate technique, and now, Bai Yulin was using it.","In terms of technique, he was no less than the Jiang Great Ancestor.","“You dare to show off your petty skill in front of an expert?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Asura Portion!”","Chu Yunfan clenched his fist, and his entire body emitted rays of golden light. Behind him, a huge asura appeared, and the figure threw a punch.","Bam!","The Life Ender landed on the asura, but it couldn’t break the golden light on its body, let alone hurt Chu Yunfan. In an instant, he had shattered this seemingly terrifying attack.","Shock and fear flashed through Bai Yulin’s eyes. Although the Life Ender was not his best martial skill, he had not held back.","However, Chu Yunfan’s simple punch had completely destroyed it.","Bai Yulin didn’t hesitate. He grabbed at the air again and pulled out a sword. The long sword emitted a shocking sword light.","“Sword of Despair!”","Chu Yunfan recognized this other unique skill. It was indeed a famous skill throughout the Federation.","He was a little shocked. These were all famous ultimate techniques from the Federation. Even within the Federation, anyone who could master even one of these skills would be a famous figure.","However, Bai Yulin was able to display two ultimate techniques in such a short time. It was clear that the demons had thoroughly studied the various ultimate techniques of the Federation.","Through this display, it was clear that the demons had deeply infiltrated the Federation.","However, in the face of these attacks, Chu Yunfan simply threw out a punch and shattered them all.","Meanwhile, Bai Yulin seemed to be using Chu Yunfan as practice. All kinds of well-known martial arts skills of the Federation were completely displayed, and they bombarded Chu Yunfan like a storm.","In the face of all these attacks, Chu Yunfan was as unmoving as a mountain and as firm as a rock. No matter what kind of methods the other party used, he could break all of them with one punch.","It was simple, direct, and effective.","Chu Yunfan had the bearing of a grandmaster, and he treated Bai Yulin as he were nothing. It was as if all the martial skills in the world were under his control.","Although Bai Yulin was on the offensive, and all kinds of attacks burst out like a storm, he was becoming very more frightened as he fought. It was simply terrifying. Chu Yunfan was able to block all of his attacks with just a raise of his hand. This level of power was absolutely shocking.","Chu Yunfan felt like he could do whatever he wanted, and he didn’t move an inch. No matter what kind of attack Bai Yulin used, be it sharp, thick, fast or slow, there was no difference on Chu Yunfan’s side.","Finally, Bai Yulin realized that he couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan if he continued like this, so he distanced himself from Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan, although he had a calm expression on his face, he was a little shocked. These famous martial skills were all at Bai Yulin’s fingertips. He had both the form and the spirit, such as the Life Ender. Even if the Jiang Great Ancestor was resurrected, he might not be able to do it better than Bai Yulin.","Of course, Chu Yunfan knew that this wasn’t Bai Yulin’s true strength. No matter how well he learned these martial arts, they were not his secret arts.","“Not bad. You’ve learned these martial skills to the point of being impeccable. But in the end, you’re just imitating someone else. You must have warmed up by now. If that’s all you’ve got, then you better obediently stay here.”","Although Bai Yulin had displayed extraordinary strength, it was nothing in Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","Bai Yulin’s expression became serious. He looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “You’re even more difficult to deal with than the rumors say. But the more difficult it is, the more I have to kill you!”","As Bai Yulin spoke, the power he had been hiding finally burst out. His aura soared to the peak of the fourth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, and then broke through the limit, reaching the fifth tier.","Chu Yunfan finally understood why Bai Yulin dared to break into First Prison alone. Although First Prison was not the most heavily guarded place in the Federation, it was definitely one of the few secure places.","However, Bai Yulin could come and go as he pleased. He was indeed powerful. Even if he was discovered by the wardens, they probably wouldn’t be able to stop him.","A nuclear bomb scared him, but in this place, it would only be used as a last resort. The deterrent force of a nuclear bomb was apparent. Once it was launched, it would be a situation where both sides would suffer.","The world would fall into chaos.","Tier five of the Divine Abilities Stage was almost invincible in the current Federation. There were only a few who could match it. In terms of top experts, the Federation was still at a disadvantage. They had to rely on high-tech weapons to maintain the balance on the battlefield.","“It’s very rare for anyone to force me to this point, but it’s over now,” Bai Yulin said as he looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","His hand made a grabbing motion, and a Fang Tian spear slowly emerged from the void. This was the space that divine power came with. Although it wasn’t very big, it could easily store a weapon.","Bai Yulin had brought out his spear, which meant that he was serious. His power increased dramatically. He was now completely different from before.","This power was above those Divine prisoners Chu Yunfan had killed earlier.","Speaking of which, he felt a little regretful. These Divines were all more ambitious than the last, but all of them were lawless and wanted to make big names for themselves. Otherwise, the gap between the Federation, the Infinite Demon Mountain, and the marine folks wouldn’t be so big.","Boom!","Bai Yulin’s energy and blood began to boil. At the same time, scales began to grow all over his body. These scales emitted a pale blue light as if they were a set of scale armor. They covered his body and looked extremely powerful.","After seeing Chu Yunfan’s strength, he forgot about being arrogant. He was going to use all his strength and take Chu Yunfan down in one blow.","Swish!","Bai Yulin flew forward and rushed toward Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":941,"title":"Chapter 941 Beating Up Bai Yulin, Dying From Serious Injuries","paragraphs":["941 Beating Up Bai Yulin, Dying From Serious Injuries","Bai Yulin was quick. All of his energy and blood erupted, shaking the universe. Bai Yulin’s physique cultivation was also incredible.","This was because the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom’s royal bloodline contained the blood of wyrm. As long as one had any connection with to the dragon race, their physical bodies would usually be very strong. Outrageously so.","A strange power formed around Bai Yulin. From a distance, he looked like a dragon.","As for the old man who was watching from a distance, his eyes were constantly flickering with a sharp light. No one knew what he was thinking.","However, he didn’t rashly intervene in this battle. Any one of these youngsters could be said to be powerful and terrifying. If he was at his peak, it might not be a big deal, but he was no longer at his peak. It had been many years.","At this moment, Chai Jin finally arrived at the depths of Sector One. Everywhere he saw was a scene of devastation, just as he had expected. If there was anything different, it would be that none of the prisoners who were supposed to wreak havoc everywhere had managed to leave this place.","All of them had fallen to the ground like the prisoners at Sector Two. They were all dead.","Just by looking at the corpses, Chai Jin understood that it must have been Chu Yunfan who did it. Other than him, who else could stop the rampage of these Divines?","He heaved a sigh of relief, but before he could, he spotted the battle between Chu Yunfan and Bai Yulin.","‘The fifth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage!’ Chai Jin gulped.","Even though his cultivation had reached this level and he stood above countless people in the Federation, when he assessed the cultivation level of the young man covered in scales, he felt a chill down his back.","In the current Federation, it was difficult to find someone in the fourth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, let alone someone in the fifth tier. If it were not for Chu Yunfan, no one would have been able to stop this young man’s outburst. They could only watch as the young man leaves after a massacre.","Technological weapons were powerfu. A tactical nuclear bomb was able to kill Divines. As long as it hit a Divine, they would die even if they had the ability to reach the Heavens.","Under such circumstances, technology should have had the complete advantage, but that was not the case. Divines could attack as they pleased, but nuclear bombs could not be fired at will. Once they were launched, they could not control the bomb’s power, unlike Divines who could control their power freely.","It was a good thing that Chu Yunfan was able to stop Bai Yulin, or the consequences would have been unimaginable. Now, Chai Jin realized that although he had consciously raised his opinion of Chu Yunfan’s strength, he was still shocked when he saw it for himself. If Chu Yunfan could stop a fifth tier Divine, one could only imagine how amazing his strength was.","Chai Jin then spotted the old man who had not moved. When he saw the old man, the air in his lungs froze. He recalled the identity and strength of this old man.","If the old man was in his peak state, First Prison would probably be torn down once he exploded in anger.","Right now, he was definitely not that strong, but he was not that strong only in comparison to a peerless master like Chu Yunfan.","To Chai Jin, the old man was a powerful existence that could not be stopped.","But he immediately made a decision and stood in front of the old man. His muscles tensed up. If the old man made the slightest move, he would also explode. He didn’t hope to defeat the old man, but only hoped to buy Chu Yunfan enough time.","He didn’t dare to imagine how long Chu Yunfan could last if he was attacked from both sides. This was all he could do.","When the old man saw Chai Jin firmly blocking his path, he grinned and said, “Interesting. I recognize you. You must be the second deputy warden.”","“Yes, that’s me.” Chai Jin nodded. “You will not interfere in their battle. I’ll stop you even if I have to risk my life.”","The old man just smiled faintly and said, “If I wanted to make a move, what’s the point of you risking your life? It’s just one more life lost.”","“Although I’m no match for you, if you think you can just ignore me, then you’re wrong!” Chai Jin gritted his teeth.","“Don’t worry. I don’t plan to make a move for the time being. I didn’t expect such a powerful figure to appear within the human race in the years I was locked away.”","The old man didn’t say much, but there was a hint of admiration in his eyes as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, Chai Jin heaved a sigh of relief. Only now did he realize that his back was completely drenched.","At this time, the battle between Chu Yunfan and Bai Yulin had reached a white-hot stage.","Bai Yulin, who had released all his strength, was a completely different person compared to before. All his attacks were at least twice as powerful.","The fifth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage was a far cry from the peak of the fourth tier Chu Yunfan had previously suppressed.","The Fang Tian halberd was brandished to perfection—like a wyrm. It rushed in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","“A fifth tier Divine? It’s no use. I’ll show you the difference between us.”","Chu Yunfan sneered, then clenched his fist. His whole body seemed to have turned into a golden roc. He then flew into the sky and attacked the wyrm.","Boom!","This punch landed on the halberd, and in an instant, sparks flew everywhere. Chu Yunfan’s fist was like a piece of metal, containing boundless power.","Thud, thud, thud.","Bai Yulin was forced to step back again and again. His arms were numb, and his hands were bleeding profusely.","His eyes were filled with disbelief. He had already exerted all his strength, so how was he still so vulnerable?","At the same time, Chu Yunfan’s next wave of attacks had already come. It was just a simple fist technique, but it swept across the entire path.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","In an instant, there were countless collisions. Bai Yulin kept retreating. He looked extremely humiliated. The scales on his body were cracked and blood was flowing everywhere. He looked like a bloody man.","The moment he was sent flying, Chu Yunfan’s next wave of attack arrived.","Chu Yunfan threw a coin into the air, countless electric currents wrapped around it, and an electromagnetic shot was fired.","Boom!","The blast hit Bai Yulin head-on, and the brilliant light swallowed his body.","In the next moment, he was in a sorry state as he slammed into the ground. A large hole had been blasted through his chest, and he was on the verge of death."]},{"number":942,"title":"Chapter 942 Beaten up and the Show Ends","paragraphs":["942 Beaten up and the Show Ends","A single electromagnetic cannon shot had severely injured Bai Yulin, leaving a fist-sized hole in his body as he crashed into the ground.","The alloy floor had a huge hole in it. One could only imagine how terrifying this was.","Spurt!","Bai Yulin coughed up a mouthful of blood. His eyes were filled with shock and fear.","He was well aware of his own strength. With his bloodline and strength, it would not be difficult for him to take on two humans at the same tier of Divine Abilities Stage, let alone a human at Chu Yunfan’s level. In fact, he could even hold off three or four of them on his own.","It would be a trashing.","But now, in a one-on-one battle, he was actually being beaten by Chu Yunfan who was at at lower cultivation level than him. This was terrifying.","“He’s quite good at taking hits.” Chu Yunfan looked at Bai Yulin and sneered.","If it was an ordinary person, even a Divine, Chu Yunfan’s cannon shot would have blasted away half their body. However, Bai Yulin only had a fist-sized hole in his chest. It was clear that Bai Yulin’s physique cultivation was unique and was due to the power of his bloodline.","This was the difference in nature. Some people were born with boundless strength, while others were born weak. The so-called absolute equality did not exist from the beginning.","Bai Yulin’s cultivation was enough to crush an ordinary person, but it was a pity that he had encountered Chu Yunfan. After Chu Yunfan had cultivated the Imperial Physique, no one could be his opponent unless they were absolutely superior.","“F*ck!”","Although Chai Jin was on guard against the old man, he was also paying attention to the battle. His eyes almost popped out. This was simply a joke. The aura Bai Yulin released was enough to make him feel terrified.","But just like that, Chu Yunfan defeated Bai Yulin with just a few punches and kicks.","Chu Yunfan was a monster.","As for the old man, he stared at Chu Yunfan intently but still made no move to help.","“Are you going to surrender or wait for me to kill you?” Chu Yunfan looked down at Bai Yulin.","Bai Yulin might be a hero in front of others, but in front of Chu Yunfan, he was nothing.","“Why you...” Bai Yulin felt pain all over his body. The hole in his chest was the most obvious wound, but the truth was all the muscles in his body had been torn apart and he was bleeding everywhere.","This was the first time he had been crushed by someone of the same age as him. Yes, it was a crushing defeat. There was no way he could fight back.","Against Chu Yunfan, he was like an ant that could be crushed to death at any time. He could see that Chu Yunfan didn’t kill him not because he couldn’t, but because Chu Yunfan wanted to capture him alive.","At the Divine Abilities Stage, the easiest way was to defeat and then kill. The most difficult was to capture someone alive. If one did not have absolute confidence, they would not try this easily.","But Chu Yunfan did this, which meant that Chu Yunfan was not the slightest bit concerned about him.","This was more infuriating than any insult.","Chu Yunfan stared at Bai Yulin, but what flashed through his mind was the future. A royal member of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom could be exchanged for many benefits. Whether they were dead or alive, they would be of great use.","In particular, humans did not know much about the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom. Other than knowing that they were very powerful, they knew very little about anything else. Now that a royal member had fallen into their hands, there were many things they could do.","“You want to make a fuss out of me?” Bai Yulin instantly realized Chu Yunfan’s purpose. “Don’t even think about it. Chu Yunfan, I’ll remember your name. The next time we meet, I’ll take your life!”","Suddenly, Bai Yulin took out a scroll and crushed it. The scroll shattered on the spot and turned into a light portal which led to another world.","Bai Yulin rushed toward the portal.","Even Chu Yunfan had not expected Bai Yulin to have such a method.","A teleportation scroll!","Chu Yunfan immediately found this method in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. It was a teleportation scroll. Items such as this were considered precious even back during the Ancient Zenith Civilization era.","This was a teleportation array compressed into a scroll. It was much more difficult than building a teleportation array on flat ground. Those who could engrave such an array were those with amazing cultivation in the dao of space.","That was not a realm that Chu Yunfan could come into contact with at the moment. The comprehension of the realm and the cultivation level were both indispensable.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know if such things existed in the Federation, but even if there were, it was probably very rare. There was no possibility of mass production.","However, Chu Yunfan reacted quickly. He raised his hand, and countless thunderbolts wrapped around it. They gushed out and instantly turned into a terrifying electromagnetic cannon.","Boom!","This time, Chu Yunfan didn’t hold back, and he blew up almost half of Bai Yulin’s body.","Bai Yulin screamed, but he still managed to escape to the other side of the portal.","“He got away!”","Chu Yunfan furrowed his brows. He was a little regretful that he didn’t manage to kill Bai Yulin.","Bai Yulin wanted to kill Chu Yunfan the next time they met.","But for Chu Yunfan, even Bai Yulin was no match for him now. The next time they met would be the day of Bai Yulin’s death.","However, Chai Jin’s loud cry was suddenly heard from the side.","“Where is he?”","Following Chai Jin’s loud cry, Chu Yunfan turned his head around to take a look. As expected, the old man who had been here just a moment ago had disappeared.","All that was left was a pool of blood.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood that the old man had probably left a long time ago, but no one realized it. He had left a clone at the scene, which had fooled everyone.","Even Chu Yunfan was fooled the old man’s clone. It was indeed impressive.","No wonder the old man didn’t make a move. It turned out that he had no confidence at all.","“How could he be gone?!”","Chai Jin thought that it was such a pity. He knew the old man’s identity and the terror he could inflict. If he could work with Chu Yunfan to take him down here, it would be for the best. Who knew that the old man would escape their grasp?","Chu Yunfan descended and sighed. “I was careless. I let them escape, especially Bai Yulin. He’s a member of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom’s royal family. What a pity.”","But in Chai Jin’s ears, this was not the case at all. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan was terrifying. Beating up that kind of existence was simply heaven-defying."]},{"number":943,"title":"Chapter 943 The Former Emperor of the Federation","paragraphs":["943 The Former Emperor of the Federation","If it could be said that Chai Jin had originally treated Chu Yunfan as an equal, then he no longer thought so. What a joke, they were not on the same level at all.","The gap between Divines was huge. Sometimes, it was even bigger than the gap between Innates and Divines.","To ordinary people, of course, they did not have such an understanding. To them, the Divines were high and mighty existences. Even if there were strong and weak ones, they probably did not expect the difference to be so great.","If Chai Jin had been in Bai Yulin’s place, he would have been beaten to a pulp. The only question was how long he could last.","But in front of Chu Yunfan, Bai Yulin was completely beaten up. Chai Jin saw the difference between them as clear as day, and he knew his own limits. If Chu Yunfan wanted to make a move on him, he would be killed in one move.","He wasn’t being humble, but rather, it was a kind of intuition. At his level of cultivation, he fully trusted his intuition, because intuition was often the most accurate judgment.","“Chief Chu, thank you for all your help. If you didn’t help suppress the prisoners, I don’t know what kind of mess it would have been,” Chai Jin said after a moment’s thought.","Indeed, if it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan, it was unimaginable how bad the situation would have become.","Although they could use nuclear bombs, it was a last resort. If they weren’t forced to the limit, they wouldn’t use them. If they weren’t careful, First Prison would collapse. They might even be buried with the place.","“It’s nothing. It’s my duty, after all. It’s a pity that they escaped. Forget about Bai Yulin for now. Who was that old man?” Chu Yunfan asked.","In the battle earlier, compared to Bai Yulin, the old man was the one he was more wary of. Moreover, judging from his attitude, Chai Jin seemed to be extremely afraid of that old man.","“You should recognise him once I say his name. That man was Gao Tenglong,” Chai Jin said as he stared intently at Chu Yunfan/","When Chai Jin mentioned Gao Tenglong’s name, Chu Yunfan finally understood why Chai Jin was so afraid of him.","This name had become a taboo within the Federation. He was the person who had truly started the Federation’s dark era. That era had risen because of him, but it had also been destroyed because of him.","The Federation had a history of a republican system since the beginning of the A.D. era, and had even kept that system after entering the Federation Era.","Gao Tenglong was the only one who had successfully claimed the title of “emperor” within the Federation. He had almost reversed the situation of the Federation with his own power, and was about to become an existence like the Emperor Supreme.","Although he was defeated in the end and was rebuked by the Republican forces, it had been more than twenty years since he became the emperor. That was the beginning of the Dark Age. After him, the authority of the Federation fell to the bottom.","Although they had successfully put out the riot caused by Gao Tenglong, the Federation had been unprecedentedly weak at that time. There had even been unprecedented assassinations of the president, and they had happened more than once.","Starting from Gao Tenglong to the annihilation of the last rebellious Divine, that area had lasted for decades. That was the Dark Age, which was taboo even to the Federation.","Chu Yunfan finally understood why he felt that the old man was so dangerous. Just from his appearance, it was impossible to tell that he was a terrifying person who had once stirred up a storm and almost caused the entire Federation to sink.","As for Gao Tenglong, there were no detailed records of him in history books. They only knew that he had a fortuitous encounter in his early years, and his cultivation advanced by leaps and bounds after that. In that era, he had turned the tide and repelled the attacks of the demons many times, becoming the great hero of the Federation. Later, he was determined to restore a monarchy system, which was opposed by countless people and eventually failed.","However, in that era where he had acted violently, the Federation couldn’t do anything to him. The technology at that time wasn’t as developed as the modern era. Tactical nuclear bomb technology was still in its infancy. In that era, he was a god, and even the Federation couldn’t do anything to him.","As for how he was captured, the history books didn’t describe it in detail. It seemed that there was some secret, but everyone knew that he was the number one master of that time. He was simply like a demon, suppressing an entire era all by himself.","Even now, he was still the strongest. No one could defeat him. Probably only the Federation’s President was a match for him.","Of course, this was the official statement. In fact, nobody believed in this judgment. What kind of joke was this? That was a long time ago. Whether it was the development of martial arts or technology, it was far superior to that dark era.","It would be nonsense to say that the people of that era could be on par with the current president.","In the past, Chu Yunfan didn’t believe it either. Unless there was a gap in civilization like back during the Ancient Zenith Civilization, each generation was surely stronger than the last. There was no reason for the ancient people to be more powerful than the people of the present. That didn’t conform to the development trend.","With the Federation’s modus operandi, they wouldn’t blindly praise the previous generation to be more powerful than them as each generation was stronger than the lastt.","But now, Chu Yunfan believed it. Gao Tenglong had been locked up for so many years and First Prison must have had some means to restrict his cultivation and recovery. But the feeling he gave Chu Yunfan left him even more afraid of him than Bai Yulin","Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid, but he couldn’t be as relaxed as he was when he faced Bai Yulin","And this was after Gao Tenglong was extremely weak. It was simply unimaginable how strong he would be when he truly recovered.","“We’ve allowed a notorious character to escape,” Chu Yunfan lamented.","However, compared to Chai Jin’s incomparable fear, Chu Yunfan was less so. No matter how powerful Hao Tenglong was, he was still an ancient relict.","As long as he was given more time, Chu Yunfan was confident that he could surpass Gao Tenglong, even if that man was once known as the world’s number one expert.","“Shouldn’t he have died during his era?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Gao Tenglong had been alive for a long time. He was alive when the Federation had just been established and had only started colonizing the Kunlun Realm. When he achieved Dao, it was the most dangerous time for humans.","He should have died a long time ago, given the timeline of that era. Most Divines would have been prepared for their funeral after living for more than two hundred years.","Compared to the Innate Stage, the increase in lifespan of the Divines was not very obvious. Of course, compared to the average person who could not live more than a hundred years, it was still a huge increase.","“As far as I know, he had a fortuitous encounter when he was young. He consumed a heavenly treasure and have went on to live an extremely long life,” Chai Jin said with a bitter smile.","“To think that such a dangerous person is imprisoned here... Don’t tell me...” Chu Yunfan suddenly understood why such a dangerous person had been kept in prison and not executed."]},{"number":944,"title":"Chapter 944 Blowing up Warships and Setting off Huge Fireworks","paragraphs":["944 Blowing up Warships and Setting off Huge Fireworks","Chu Yunfan immediately understood why such a dangerous person had not been and was still alive.","The reason was simple. They probably wanted to find out the secret to immortality.","Gao Tenglong had a fortuitous encounter when he was young, which was why he had been able to live from the early days of the Federation up to the present. Even in the present era where the lifespan of humans had been greatly increased, it was still an incredible miracle.","The average maximum lifespan was one hundred and twenty years. This was the limit that current life science could achieve. In theory, the number of cell divisions in a human could only support a human’s life up to one hundred and twenty.","Of course, this was only in theory. In reality, there were not many who could break through or reach this age. Most of those who did were martial arts masters. Although the number of times human cells could divide was limited, the time of each division could be delayed.","Martial arts experts experienced a transition in the level of life. However, even with the current development of martial arts, two hundred years was still far out of reach. That was a realm that only Divines could touch.","Gao Tenglong had almost doubled his lifespan. Chu Yunfan would find it strange if the Federation had let him go so easily.","“Forget it. We can’t do anything about Gao Tenglong for the time being. Now that we’ve cleaned up the internal departments, we can go all out in the outside battle,” Chai Jin said.","Although they had used the most brutal of methods to clean up the internal departments and First Prison had surely suffered a great loss this time, it was still much better than letting these death-row prisoners escape and allowing them to wreak havoc.","“Mm, let’s get out there.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","The two of them quickly flew toward the outer area of First Prison. As for Sectors One and Two which were in a bad state, there were naturally people in charge of cleaning them up. The real danger was happening at the defense line outside.","When the two of them got outside, they saw that the whole place was a complete mess. The defense line was almost crippled.","The Chu Great Ancestor, Zhu Buping, and the warden of First Prison were the core of the defense line. It was because of this that Infinite Demon Mountain’s deadliest forces were gathered here.","Two fierce monsters the size of small mountains were suppressing the three, forcing them to retreat and cough up blood.","One of them was a giant wolf with two heads. It was snow-white and blindingly dazzling.","The other was a huge winged lizard with black scales all over its body. It looked like the giant dragons in Western legends from the AD era. It spewed flames from its mouth as if it was going to burn through the defense line.","The two huge monsters were equally ferocious. They were extremely powerful, and the cultivation of the black lizard was terrifying. It had reached tier five of the Divine Abilities Stage.","He alone was able to suppress the three. And with the addition of the giant wolf whose cultivation had reached the fourth tier, they were extremely terrifying.","If not for Zhu Buping and the other two doing their best to resist and stall for time, the two monsters would have long broken through the defense line. As for the other experts who had come to support them, they were completely stalled. They were even besieged by twice the number of experts.","It was a difficult feat for them to hold out up till now.","If it weren’t for the fact that they themselves were afraid of mankind’s last resort—nuclear bombs on a large scale—they would have launched the bombs a long time ago.","These berserk monsters seemed to have received the order much earlier on. They only held the humans back but did not really break into the defense line.","Divine monsters were terrifying, but if the humans were forced into a corner, they would launch nuclear bombs on a large scale. At that time, they would suffer heavy casualties.","The monsters just wanted to stall for time. Not give up their lives.","Therefore, the situation seemed dangerous, but they managed to persist until now. In First Prison, the nuclear silos were already fully prepared. If things went south, they would rather destroy the place than let it fall into the hands of the demons.","“The situation looks bad, The defense line is in danger. Chief Chu, I’ll leave the rest to you. I’m going to help!” Chai Jin said after looking at the situation. He immediately chose a place that was about to be broken through and went to provide support.","Chu Yunfan began to survey the situation on the battlefield. The defense line was in imminent danger. The demons’ warships were also firing their huge cannons at the First Prison’s defense boundary, which made the entire thing shake.","There were all kinds of killings everywhere. Human-piloted mechas fought huge monsters. The power of technology and the most primitive power of cultivation collided.","Boom!","One of the demon warships had discovered Chu Yunfan. A huge cannon was fired at him, and the terrifying cannonball reached him in the blink of an eye. The terrifying attack that could level an entire mountain instantly drowned him.","As for Chu Yunfan, he spread out his palm. The moment the huge cannonball touched his palm, it exploded but failed to hurt him in the slightest","In the end, the demons’ technology was not as good as that of humans. If it were a human warship, even an expert of his level would have to dodge and avoid taking the main firepower of a warship head-on.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan finally erupted. A huge blood-red skeleton appeared around him. It was over a hundred feet tall and extremely huge.","Under Chu Yunfan’s control, it crossed space and instantly appeared in front of the demon warship. The demon commander inside the warship roared madly when he saw the bloody skeleton.","“Shoot him down!” he shouted.","The cannonballs hit the bloody skeleton one after another, but they were unable to break it apart. The power of Demon Descends Illustration was closely related to the user, and with Chu Yunfan’s current strength, it was almost invincible.","Chu Yunfan had nothing to fear.","The huge skeleton stomped on the steel warship, and a big hold suddenly appeared in the seemingly powerful warship.","The skeleton couldn’t be stopped. In just a moment, Chu Yunfan was blasted it into a huge firework.","Chu Yunfan’s actions attracted the attention of the entire battlefield."]},{"number":945,"title":"Chapter 945 Massacre, One Person Suppressing the Entire Scene","paragraphs":["945 Massacre, One Person Suppressing the Entire Scene","Chu Yunfan’s actions caused such a huge commotion.","He destroyed a warship as soon as he arrived, which was something that ordinary Divines couldn’t do.","Ordinary Divines would not dare to charge around like Chu Yunfan on this kind of battlefield. All sorts of heavy cannons were raining down dense firepower, and even Divines could be seriously injured if they were not careful.","After Chu Yunfan destroyed one of the warships, the remaining ones seemed to have found a target to vent their anger on. They locked their main cannons onto him, and the concentrated artillery fire formed a net of death around him, trying to swallow him up.","But at that moment, Chu Yunfan burst out with a golden light. In the blink of an eyes, he turned into a golden roc and swept out. The golden light that filled the sky passed through the countless artillery fire.","Those cannons with automatic lock-on functions couldn’t lock onto Chu Yunfan. Although countless cannons covered the area, they discovered that Chu Yunfan had turned into several phantoms and they couldn’t lock onto him.","It was like a confrontation between technology and martial arts. Each had their own strengths, but Chu Yunfan was clearly more terrifying.","He crossed space in a flash and appeared in front of another warship.","He was simply too fast. At this moment, the lackings of a technological weapon was clearly displayed. Compared to a martial arts expert, this type of weapon did not have much in terms of speed.","Unless a nuclear bomb or a weapon on the level of a Star Destroyer was used to carry out indiscriminate large-scale bombing, it would be difficult to do anything to Divines possessing amazing speed.","In other words, nuclear weapons were definitely the last resort. Under normal circumstances, only Divines could within such weapons.","Boom!","The second warship couldn’t stop Chu Yunfan’s attack either. With the Demon Descends Illustration activated, the entire warship was torn apart in a few moves.","The other warships fired at Chu Yunfan like crazy, even if it meant that they would hit their own numbers.","And for Chu Yunfan, this was even less of a concern, because those demon warships would be destroyed by his people.","Chu Yunfan was like a computer bug on the battlefield that couldn’t be solved. No Divine could achieve what he had done.","“Hahahaha, this is so satisfying!”","The Chu Great Ancestor looked into the distance and saw that Chu Yunfan was slaughtering everyone. No one could stop him.","Zhu Buping was also extremely happy to see this. He owed Chu Yunfan a huge favor. If not for Chu Yunfan’s help, he might not have been able to enter the fourth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage his entire life.","“D*mn, this is too brutal!”","Chai Jin and the others saw this scene from a distance. These people did not have the cultivation of three core defenders. Upon seeing Chu Yunfan destroying the demon fleet on his own, they felt the air in their lungs freeze. This was a miracle to them. It was simply impossible.","Meanwhile, the humans were trying their best to hold back the demons. Although they were struggling, they knew that if Chu Yunfan managed to destroy the whole fleet, the entire situation would be reversed.","However, the number of demons far outweighed them. Although they tried their best to resist, more than a dozen Divine monsters managed to leave the battlefield and pounced in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","The Divine monsters were like small mountains as they ran through space. Their aura was monstrous and extremely terrifying as if they could crush the universe.","“Just in time!”","Facing these Divine monsters, Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid. He reached out his hand and grabbed a bronze longbow that was devoid of a bowstring.","In his hand, the longbow slowly started exuding a terrifying power. This was the Sun Shooter that he had used to severely injure the Monster Cult sect master.","After that battle, Chu Yunfan never used the Sun Shooter again because it had been worn down by battle and time, and there were all kinds of cracks on it.","Chu Yunfan was not keen on ousing it too often, and now was the time.","He grasped at the sky and a wave of divine power began to boil. Compared to when he had severely injured the the Monster Cult sect master, he was now more than ten times stronger.","As Chu Yunfan poured his divine power into it, a terrifying power emerged and transformed into a long arrow.","Whoosh!","Chu Yunfan injected his divine power into the bow and opted not to rely too much on the Sun Shooter’s original power. But even so, the power of the arrow he shot was still terrifying.","Boom!","The arrow hit a monster that was pouncing over. It only had time to let out a miserable cry before its entire body instantly exploded.","A Divine monster did not even have the time to display its strength before it instantly exploded. Its last scream echoed throughout the battlefield.","No one had expected Chu Yunfan to produce such a terrifying magic weapon. However, this terrifying magic weapon had yet to display its true power.","After killing one Divine monster with one arrow, Chu Yunfan did not stop. He grabbed at the longbow, and a bowstring made of divine power reappeared. Another golden arrow instantly flew out.","Boom!","Another monster that was charging over was shot and instantly exploded.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Arrow after arrow pierced through space and hit monsters one after another. It was as if they were locked on.","With each arrow, one Divine monsters was bound to be shot and exploded to death.","Chu Yunfan suppressed the entire battlefield with his bow—suppressing the entire monster army to the point that they couldn’t move.","In just a moment, ten Divine monsters had died miserably at Chu Yunfan’s hands, and the remaining few finally realized that something was wrong. Although they were only in the first or second tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, they were definitely not considered weak in Infinite Demon Mountain.","But now Chu Yunfan was killing them so easily, they quickly came to a realization.","However, how could Chu Yunfan let them go just like that? He kept drawing his bow and shooting arrows. In just a few moments, all the monsters were killed. Their flesh and blood exploded and their bodies floated in mid-air.","For a moment, there was a deathly silence. A single person had stunned all the experts present."]},{"number":946,"title":"Chapter 946 Killing the Two-Headed Silver Wolf","paragraphs":["946 Killing the Two-Headed Silver Wolf","In just a short period, Chu Yunfan’s killing efficiency was truly displayed. Under his longbow, there was no difference between those in the first, second, and third tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","This was the most terrifying part.","It was the same when Divines massacred Innates. Whether it was a level seven, eight, or ninth Innate, it was all meaningless in front of Divines.","And ordinary Divines were completely meaningless in front of Chu Yunfan. These dozen or so unparalleled fierce monsters couldn’t even hold out for a short while in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","!!","One arrow was enough to kill one Divine monster. He alone could suppress an army.","“What bow is he using? How is it so terrifying?” one of the Divines said in fear as he witnessed the scene.","Everyone was dumbfounded by what they saw. They were all shocked to see Chu Yunfan kill the Divine monsters one by one.","If they had not seen it with their own eyes, they would not have imagined that someone could actually kill Divines like how they killed Innates.","At this moment, they felt a sense of sympathy for these monsters. Although they were also in the Divine Abilities Stage, Chu Yunfan instantly dispelled their sense of superiority.","At this moment, they realized that they were just ordinary people who were a little more powerful than the normal. They would also die and be mowed down like grass.","And this was the true reason these Divines present were shocked.","As for the Innates, they were even more dumbfounded. Chu Yunfan slaughtered these Divines who were as powerful as gods just like that. They couldn’t even stop him.","“Whoever offends the Federation will be executed, no matter how far away!”","Chu Yunfan’s words were transmitted to the ears of every human soldier on the battlefield through equipment.","“Long live the Federation!”","“Long live the Federation!”","“Long live the Federation!”","The soldiers of the Federation, who were wound as taut as a string and were low in morale, suddenly became invigorated again. Chu Yunfan killing more than a dozen Divine monsters was extremely shocking to the higher-ups, but to them, it made their blood boil.","The originally low morale suddenly rose to the peak.","“D*mn, this kid is freakishly strong!” Zhu Buping said in shock as he spat out a mouthful of blood.","He had seen how Chu Yunfan had killed the Jiang Great Ancestor that day. And now, with the cultivation breakthrough method that Chu Yunfan had given them, they had successfully broken through to the fourth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","He had thought that the gap between him and Chu Yunfan would be narrowed, but he now realized that it was impossible.","Even Chu Yunfan, who had killed the Jiang Great Ancestor back then, was probably much stronger than them now. They knew very well that even they couldn’t kill the Jiang Great Ancestor as easily as Chu Yunfan had.","It would be good enough if they could even fight him to stand still.","But now, Chu Yunfan was obviously more terrifying than before, and not just by a little.","“Roar!”","At this time, the two-headed silver wolf that had joined forces with the black lizard to attack the Chu Great Ancestor, Zhu Buping, and First Prison’s warden, let out a long howl.","In the blink of an eye, they disappeared from the battlefield, crossed the universe, and attacked Chu Yunfan.","“Sh*t! That monster is going aiming for Chu Yunfan!” Zhu Buping instantly realized, but it was useless.","The black lizard was too strong. It was at the fifth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage and single-handedly suppressed the three core defenders who were at the fourth tier.","“Don’t worry, there won’t be a problem. I believe in Yunfan!” the Chu Great Ancestor said loudly, “Don’t forget that the Jiang Great Ancestor was at the fourth tier of the Divine Abilties Stage at that time. It wouldn’t have made a difference even if he had been a demon.”","And just as the Chu Great Ancestor and the other two were trying to go to the rescue, the silver wolf arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","“You’ve killed so many of my kin! I’ll make you pay with your life!”","The silver wolf burned with rage. Many of the Divine monsters that Chu Yunfan had killed were its subordinates.","In the Federation, Divines could dominate a region and become powerful experts. In Infinite Demon Mountain, there was a clear distinction between the levels.","From the top forces of the three ruling demons tribes to the various large tribes below, each of them had a clear hierarchy.","Fourth tier Divine monsters had Divine monster subordinates in Infinite Demon Mountain. And now that Chu Yunfan had slaughtered so many of them, the silver wolf’s status in Infinite Demon Mountain would plummet.","It was the same in any place. Strength was the absolute truth.","“Kill me? Put your money where your mouth is,” Chu Yunfan said.","The two-headed silver wolf opened its bloody mouths, one on the left and one on the right, and spat out fire and ice respectively. The two extreme forces were unified in its body.","In an instant, the two forces rolled into one and turned into a terrifying force that blasted toward Chu Yunfan.","“Petty trick.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He clenched his five fingers into a fist and threw out a punch. In the blink of an eye, he turned into a golden roc.","The roc rampaged. The moment the power of fire and ice collided with the roc, it was immediately blown away. It could not pose any threat to Chu Yunfan.","The momentum of Chu Yunfan’s fist didn’t slow down and suddenly bombarded the silver wolf.","The silver wolf’s originally fierce eyes finally revealed a look of panic. It hadn’t really fought with Chu Yunfan, so it didn’t really understand how terrifying he was.","However, Chu Yunfan’s attack was too fast and the wolf didn’t have any space to dodge. With just one punch, Chu Yunfan hit one of the heads.","Boom!","One of the wolf’s heads was smashed on the spot and screamed in pain. Fortunately, it had two heads. If it only had one head, it would have died.","It was exactly as the Chu Great Ancestor had predicted. Even the monsters that were far more terrifying than the Jiang Great Ancestor were of no use in front of Chu Yunfan.","The wold made its decision immediately. It turned around and fled, not daring to stay for even a second longer.","However, it was already too late. Chu Yunfan casually made a grabbing motion, and a ball of lightning energy appeared in his hand, turning into a lightning spear.","The lightning spear pierced through the sky and instantly hit the body of the wolf. It exploded in mid-air and died instantly."]},{"number":947,"title":"Chapter 947 Fifth Tier of the Divine Abilities Stage? You’re Going Down Too!","paragraphs":["947 Fifth Tier of the Divine Abilities Stage? You’re Going Down Too!","Another instant kill!","The ferocious beast that had rendered Zhu Buping and the other two generals helpless could not even last two moves against Chu Yunfan.","“Your descendant is freakishly strong!”","The prison warden, who had been silent all this time, finally opened his mouth. He was completely dumbfounded.","If the Chu Great Ancestor was so powerful, he could accept it. But Chu Yunfan was only one of the ancestor’s descendants.","There were at least hundreds of thousands of descendants like Chu Yunfan in the Chu clan. How could such a monster appear among them?","“Hahaha, that’s my bloodline!” The Chu Great Ancestor burst into laughter.","As they spoke, the three of them were forced back by the ferocious black lizard.","The black lizard also noticed the shocking battle just now. Chu Yunfan’s terrifying strength had shocked it. Even if it had fought with the silver wolf, it would not have been able to kill the wolf so easily.","At this time, the lizard could sense that Chu Yunfan’s eyes were on him. It didn’t know why, but it suddenly felt as if it was being stared at by a terrifying existence.","Although this feeling was very ridiculous, it had such a feeling.","With a roar, the lizard spat out dragon’s breath to force back the three defenders who were entangled with him. It was not difficult for it to do this since it already had the upper hand.","However, before it could make a decision on whether to retreat or not, it saw a figure step on a layer of light, cross the battlefield, and charge toward it.","“It’s your turn,” Chu Yunfan said with a cold expression as he charged toward the lizard.","The lizard was clearly much stronger than the wolf, but in Chu Yunfan’s opinion, there was no difference.","“Roar! Human, you’ve gone too far!”","The lizard could feel the disregard in Chu Yunfan’s attitude, and it was furious.","After letting out a roar, it instantly transformed into a middle-aged man dressed in black. His entire body exuded a terrifying aura, and he glared at Chu Yunfan.","“Don’t even think about having a good time today. You’ve killed so many from Infinite Demon Mountain You’re a dead man walking!” the lizard said as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","“So what? I’ve seen through your plan. You’re just trying to stall for time so that Bai Yulin can cause trouble within First Prison and release all the prisoners.” Chu Yunfan looked at the black-clad middle-aged man calmly.","“What?” The black-clad middle-aged man was stunned. This was their top-secret plan, and only the top Divines like him knew about it.","But now, Chu Yunfan had pointed it out, and judging by his appearance, he didn’t seem flustered. This showed that something extremely terrifying had happened.","Not only had the plan been seen through, but the entire plan had probably been delayed.","“How could you possibly know?” the black-clad middle-aged man said in disbelief.","“Because I defeated Bai Yulin. If not for that, how would I have known about your plan? Do you think that releasing a few prisoners will be of any use? To me, numbers mean nothing,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","“So, you’re all experts from the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom? This time, none of you will escape. I don’t believe that the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom won’t feel anything after so many of its Divine experts have died.”","Of course, Chu Yunfan was here to trap the man, but to him, the end results did not make much of a difference. Although Bai Yulin managed to escape, Chu Yunfan managed to severely injure him. It was already good enough that Bai Yulin was able to escape.","The man broke out in a cold sweat. He never thought that things would turn out like this. If someone had told him before, he would not have believed it. He knew that Bai Yulin was stronger than him, and there were not many human masters who could rival him.","However, this exact person was Chu Yunfan. The lizard had witnessed Chu Yunfan’s amazing performance. In his hands, those Divines were being mowed down like grass.","The lizard was no match for Chu Yunfan.","In other words, even if Bai Yulin had managed to enter and release all the Divine prisoners, Chu Yunfan would have been enough to suppress them all.","Thinking about this, Bai Yulin was probably dead. Otherwise, he would have made a move by now.","This was truly a serious blow. Not only had the Divine monsters suffered heavy casualties, but they had also lost a member of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom’s royal family. The lizard shuddered at the thought of the royal family’s impending rage.","The Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom didn’t have many royal families, to begin with, and their bloodlines were extremely rare. The death of any one of them was a major event.","However, he immediately realized that he couldn’t continue like this. With Chu Yunfan already having slaughtered half of these Divine monsters, and with such a peerless fiend keeping watch here, they had no chance of winning.","“Charge!”","The lizard instantly made a decision. He chose not to do the same thing as the wolf, or Chu Yunfan would surely attack him from behind.","The only choice was to force his way in.","In an instant, the lizard made a decision. He let out a long roar and grabbed a long saber from the void. It was completely black and covered in black scales. As soon as the saber appeared, it exuded a monstrous and ferocious power.","“Time for you to die!” the black-clad man roared and slashed his saber at Chu Yunfan.","The saber was simple and unadorned, and there was no martial arts technique imbued within it. However, with the support of the man’s powerful body, even a human in the same realm would be seriously injured if he didn’t block this attack.","‘One opening! I only need one opening!’ the man roared in his heart. If Chu Yunfan blocked the attack, he would die. If he didn’t, he would make way.","The man only wanted a small opening.","But to his surprise, Chu Yunfan didn’t dodge. Instead, he didn’t move at all and just allowed the saber to come down.","Just as it was about to hit Chu Yunfan, he clenched his fist and threw a punch.","The power of this punch turned into an asura that swept across the world.","Clang!","The saber aura collided with the Asura, and a terrifying tide swept out. The energy tide filled the entire battlefield.","After his first attack failed, the man didn’t have time to think, because Chu Yunfan’s next wave of attack swept over without any delay.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","After many terrifying collisions, the man finally couldn’t hold out any longer. He coughed up blood and was sent flying. His body was covered with cracks and blood. He had been quickly defeated.","Fifth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage? He would be beaten up as well."]},{"number":948,"title":"Chapter 948 Subduing Ebony Dragon King, Killing in All Directions","paragraphs":["948 Subduing Ebony Dragon King, Killing in All Directions","Finally, the black-clad man could no longer maintain his human form. He transformed back into his original form—a huge black lizard.","At this time, this lizard was no longer as lawless as it was when it was suppressing the three core defenders. Chu Yunfan’s fist force had shattered all the scales on its body, and blood kept seeping out from the broken scales. It was a terrifying sight.","It did not have the peerless ferocity from before.","The lizard finally understood why the wolf wanted to run away as soon as it touched Chu Yunfan. With its strength, it was almost impossible for the wolf to defeat an existence like Chu Yunfan.","!!","At this time, the lizard was roaring in its heart, ‘How could there be such a monster among humans? Humans were naturally blessed by the heavens in the path of technology, but in the path of cultivation, they definitely did not have much advantage. Especially when compared to unique monstrous beasts!’","However, the truth was that Chu Yunfan had completely crushed him.","What a monster!","“Surrender? Or die?” Chu Yunfan asked as he looked at the lizard.","The lizard stared at Chu Yunfan and finally chose to surrender. It could feel that if it said no, Chu Yunfan would probably not hesitate to kill it immediately.","Chu Yunfan nodded. The lizard was quite tactful. He naturally looked down on ordinary Divines, but this lizard’s cultivation was at tier five of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Such a level of cultivation was extremely rare within the current Federation. It could be predicted that even if mankind made rapid progress in the field of martial Dao, it would not be enough to be ranked as a top master for a long time.","Chu Yunfan formed a hand seal, which then turned into a huge golden hand that grabbed at the lizard. It instantly entered the lizard’s body, and in just a moment, pulled out a shadow from the lizard’s body.","It was the lizard’s primordial spirit, or rather, a part of it. Now that it was in Chu Yunfan’s hand, he could kill it with a single thought.","The lizard didn’t dare to resist at all. Otherwise, it would probably die an instant death. Chu Yunfan could kill it easily.","After absorbing this wisp of primordial spirit, the lizard could no longer hide any secrets from Chu Yunfan. Everything was under his control. He now knew that the lizard’s name was “Ebony Dragon King.” However, it wasn’t a dragon from the East, but a variant of dragons from Western mythology from the AD era.","But none of that mattered to Chu Yunfan. He had gained a powerful elite. Although he couldn’t care less for this force, his family could greatly use the protection.","“Since you’ve surrendered to me, I won’t be stingy. Here’s a reward.”","Chu Yunfan flicked his finger, and a ray of light was sent into Ebony Dragon King’s mind.","Ebony Dragon King immediately felt that a cultivation method appear in his mind. This method was actually a demonic cultivation method, and compared to the method he was using, it was much more advanced.","He was able to cultivate to this level, to a large extent, because of his innate bloodline talent. The method he employed was considered powerful in Infinite Demon Mountain, but it was nothing compared to the method Chu Yunfan had inserted into his mind.","With this technique, it would be a piece of cake for him to reach the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage or even surpass it in the future. It was only a matter of time.","If he was still unwilling at first, then it all melted away at this moment. After all, it didn’t matter who he worked for. If he worked for Infinite Demon Mountain, it wouldn’t make his cultivation advance by leaps and bounds, but Chu Yunfan managed to give him such an opportunity.","He was born at Infinite Demon Mountain, and only understood the laws of the jungle where the strong preyed on the weak. Only the strong had the right to speak.","“Thank you, Master!” Ebony Dragon King’s attitude quickly changed. In just a few moments, he had already accepted the fact that Chu Yunfan was now in control of him.","He had no other choice. Chu Yunfan’s control was deep in his soul. With just a thought, he would die no matter how strong he was. He could even clearly sense the existence of the seal in the depths of his primordial spirit.","Now that his life was in Chu Yunfan’s hands, and Chu Yunfan had given him the hope of a breakthrough, he immediately knelt to Chu Yunfan.","However, for Chu Yunfan, this was a matter of benefit and no cost. This demonic cultivation method itself was a method from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, but it was used by the Alchemy Emperor to study the demons. He had not cultivated it himself.","This was because the structure of the humans and demons was completely different. They could only be used as references and could not employ the same methods.","“It’s time for you to show your worth. I no longer want to see any of these monsters.”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes swept over the dozen or so Divine monsters on the battlefield, and his eyes were extremely cold.","Ebony Dragon King immediately responded. Within that short exchange period, his powerful recovery ability had already healed many of his injuries. The wounds on his body were no longer bleeding. Even though he had not fully recovered to his peak, it was enough.","He flapped the huge wings on his back and charged at the Divine monsters who were his companions before.","To leave a good impression in front of Chu Yunfan—his new master—he attacked madly. These monsters were no match for him to begin with, and they did not expect Ebony Dragon King to suddenly attack them.","In the first exchange, Ebony Dragon King tore one monster apart.","At this moment, the Chu Great Ancestor and the others revealed a look of “this is only natural.”","This was a predictable scene. Ebony Dragon King was indeed strong. So strong that the three core defenders had been forced to retreat even when they joined forces.","However, when the terrifying Ebony Dragon King faced Chu Yunfan, he was completely defeated. This cursed their worldviews and beliefs, and now, they finally felt that the atmosphere was normal once more.","Ebony Dragon King unleashed his divine might, instantly killing one Divine monster with a single exchange. That was more like it.","“Everyone, let’s talk after I kill the rest of the demon army.”","After Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he once again disappeared into the universe and rushed to another battlefield."]},{"number":949,"title":"Chapter 949 The End of the First Prison’s Defense Battle, Huge Gains","paragraphs":["949 The End of the First Prison’s Defense Battle, Huge Gains","“Amazing! An amazing person has really emerged within the Federation!”","The prison warden finally had the time to catch his breath. Ebony Dragon King had beaten them so badly that they couldn’t even breathe, but the powerful beast that was almost impossible to deal with and even forced them to activate the nuclear bomb was no match for Chu Yunfan.","Ebony Dragon King was completely beaten up. He and Chu Yunfan were not on the same level.","They now had to admit that there was a fundamental difference between them and Chu Yunfan. They were simply not on the same level.","What made the warden sigh the most was that Chu Yunfan was so young—only in his twenties. It was hard to imagine what kind of level Chu Yunfan would reach in the future.","According to the situation where most were in the Divine Abilities Stage, Chu Yunfan could at least still improve rapidly for more than a hundred years.","It was hard to imagine where Chu Yunfan would be in a hundred years. He will probably surpass the Divine Abilities Stage by then, and at that time, he would be a stabilizing force for the Federation that could calm all the waves.","At the warden’s level, he truly understood what an expert meant to a race.","“Well done! Absolutely brilliant!” said the Chu Great Ancestor after treating his injuries.","At this time, Chu Yunfan and Ebony Dragon King had completely turned around the situation on the battlefield. With their strength, they were were able to easily kill ordinary Divines.","In just a few moments, a few more Divine monsters had died at their hands.","The demons were completely flustered. Ebony Dragon King was their pillar of support but he had betrayed them. In addition, another terrifying god of death had appeared on the Federation’s side.","To them, this was the worst situation they could find themselves in.","And how could the Chu Great Ancestor, the warden, and Zhu Buping let go of such a good opportunity? They immediately led the Federation Army and charged toward the demon army.","The warships of both sides fired at each other. The demons’ advantage was that they had far more Divines than the humans. But now, these Divine monsters had suffered heavy casualties, and it looked like they were about to be completely annihilated.","On the other hand, the warships of the demons could not fight head-on with the human warships. Without the restraint of these Divine monsters, they were instantly defeated.","The entire battlefield collapsed.","The Chu Great Ancestor and the other Divines, who had withdrawn their hands, stabilized the situation like magical needles. In just a few short moments, the entire situation had been reversed. The human army and fleet outflanked the demon army from all directions, trapping the remaining combatants in the middle.","Unable to escape, the demon army put up a last-ditch resistance. In truth, many of the monster experts had begun to react yet. Why had the situation, which had clearly been in a stable position before, suddenly reversed?","The Federation Army had been forced to retreat, and their line of defense was on the verge of collapse. But because of Chu Yunfan’s participation, the demon army was now on the verge of destruction.","And he only used a short time to get rid of all the remaining demon experts.","The harvest this time around was huge. The death of more than twenty Divine monsters had brought more than twenty Divine monster carcasses and their inner cores. The value was simply incalculable.","Although the human experts from all over the world were reluctant to part with this treasure, they didn’t dare to challenge Chu Yunfan.","After all, they had all seen his strength. Moreover, almost all these monsters were killed by Chu Yunfan alone. How could they lower themselves to ask for these carcasses?","Even though they knew that these carcasses were priceless, they couldn’t make themselves ask.","For Chu Yunfan, the most important thing was, of course, the Divine monsters’ inner cores. He could refine another twenty or so Divinity Nourishment Pills with them, and the Federation would gain another twenty Divines.","On the other hand, Infinite Demon Mountain had lost more than twenty Divine monsters in one breath. Under such circumstances, the Federation could recover some of its disadvantages.","Especially when it came to high-end experts at the Divine Abilities Stage, the gap and imbalance between them now was huge.","Such experts were not common at Infinite Demon Mountain, and it was impossible to mass produce them.","The uproar that this matter would caused when word got back to Infinite Demon Mountain could be imagined. After all, the Federation had been at a disadvantage in terms of the top experts for the past few years. Now that they had destroyed more than twenty Divine monsters in a single battle, it was a glorious victory.","After another half a day or so, the last resistant demon warship was finally reduced to cosmic dust under the attack of the human fleet. The battle to defend First Prison finally came to an end. All that was left was time to clean up the battlefield.","This battle had been very rushed and the demons had caught the humans off guard. However, with Chu Yunfan’s help, the situation was completely reversed, and the victory was determined.","Everyone understood who was the most important person in this battle. Although more than a dozen Divines from all over had come to the Federation’s aid and it had greatly increased the power of First Prison, the person who had the final say in everything was none other than Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s name finally began to spread throughout First Prison which was a closed off environment. This was the first time many of them had heard of Chu Yunfan’s name. Previously, apart from a few higher-ups, most were unable to access the Internet. No matter how big of a commotion Chu Yunfan caused, they did not know about it.","And now, Chu Yunfan’s battle performance had shocked everyone. They would never forget this shocking battle for the rest of their lives.","After confirming that the demons were not sending any new reinforcements, Chu Yunfan didn’t stay any longer. Tang Siyu and the Thunder Winged Beast were still in the process of breaking through at Thunderstorm Sea. He had to hurry back to protect them.","After bidding farewell to the warden, the Chu Great Ancestor, and Zhu Buping, Chu Yunfan brought Ebony Dragon King back to the Federation through the teleportation array.","As for how they would seek out the mole within First Prsion and how the whereabouts of the place were leaked, it was not within Chu Yunfan’s scope of concern.","Not long after Chu Yunfan left, the news of First Prison’s defense battle finally spread on the Internet. After all, a large number of elites were mobilized for this battle, and the matter couldn’t be kept under wraps.","When the news spread, the entire Internet was in an uproar."]},{"number":950,"title":"Chapter 950 Promotion, the Number One Expert of the Federation","paragraphs":["950 Promotion, the Number One Expert of the Federation","The defense of First Prison began to spread on the Internet. Of course, the specific details weren’t disclosed, but just the leaked information was enough to cause a great uproar.","It was the first time many found out that there was such a dangerous place within the Federation—where such terrifying criminals were locked up.","There were even Divines among them.","Just the word “Divines” was enough to attract the attention of countless people on the Internet. There was no doubting the importance of a place dedicated to imprisoning Divine criminals.","If even a few of these criminals were released, it would be a huge problem for the Federation.","Although First Prison announced to the public that no one had escaped, it still caused quite a bit of panic. Those criminals had been imprisoned for so many years and loathed the Federation. They were dangerous people.","However, soon, there was news that there were no more Divine criminals in there because they had all been killed.","All the criminals who were locked up in First Prison had been killed, and the one who did it was Chu Yunfan, who had recently become famous throughout the Federation.","When the names of more than twenty Divine criminals who had been killed by Chu Yunfan were listed, the entire Internet went silent.","He had once again refreshed their understanding of power. Although they knew that Divine were very powerful, they did not know that the gap between those in that stage was actually so big.","As more and more details were revealed, the news that made them completely speechless spread out. This time, there were more than twenty Divine monsters had attacked First Prison.","And now, those Divine monsters had all died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","In other words, Chu Yunfan had killed more than fifty Divines in this battle. How terrifying was this?","If there were people who ridiculed Chu Yunfan’s title of “Divine Terminator” before, it was now no longer a joke.","Since the establishment of the Federation, there probably existed many more Divines than the number known to the public. But now, Chu Yunfan had done it all by himself. What kind of terrifying existence was this?","On top of that, he had destroyed many demon warships. There was even a video that was circulated. Everyone saw how he slaughtered those Divine monsters.","Although the video was short, it still caused a huge uproar on the Internet.","This matter was supposed to be a military secret, but it seemed that someone was trying to push Chu Yunfan to a higher position, and all the forces in the Federation tacitly agreed to do so.","After the disappearance of the president, the Federation had lost its stabilizing force.","The Federation fell into a state of panic. Many did not know how far the Federation could go in the future.","People’s hearts were wavering, and now was the time when they needed a stabilizing pillar. And Chu Yunfan suddenly appeared out of nowhere and streaked across the sky with an absolutely tyrannical demeanor. Like the bright moon in the sky, many couldn’t help but notice his existence.","Under such circumstances, the plan to promote Chu Yunfan as the stabilizing force of the Federation—led by Zhu Buping and the others—began to gradually ferment.","Previously, the president had been domineering, which gave the Federation’s citizens absolute confidence in the Federation. However, this had also brought about a huge problem.","After he disappeared, the Federation became a group of dragons without a leader.","But now, Chu Yunfan could fill this hole.","The president had made countless contributions to the Federation over the years. He had slayed countless powerful enemies and fought on many fronts. That was how he came to occupy such a high position within the Federation and enjoyed such a great reputation.","It was not something that ordinary Divines could replace.","Chu Yunfan was different. He rose up quickly, and at the same time, his reputation also skyrocketed. The number of people who died at his hands alone was recorded to be more than sixty Divines.","It was a shocking number. Even all the Divines inside and outside the Federation combined did not have such a record.","A solid battle record was fame.","At this time, the discussion about whether Chu Yunfan could be considered the number one expert of the Federation, which had gradually died down, began to heat up again.","The people who supported Chu Yunfan before weren’t very strong-willed. After all, although his performance was good, it couldn’t be said that he had suppressed all the strong enemiest. It seemed that he was still some distance away from being the number one expert.","However, it was different now. With such a tyrannical battle record as a foundation, even those who originally disdained Chu Yunfan conceded that his battle record had probably surpassed the president’s.","As for whether he was stronger than the previous president, it was hard to say. After all, the two had never fought before. To them, the Divine Abilities Stage was a world that they could not come into contact with.","All their analysis and comparisons were meaningless.","However, the people began to accept another fact. Now that the president was not around, Chu Yunfan had undoubtedly been promoted to the position of number one expert of the Federation.","All of the Divines within the Federation were no match for Chu Yunfan.","There were even people who publicly admitted that they were no match for him. This was something that even Divines from the Outskirt Territories did not deny. After all, Chu Yunfan was clearly not someone who followed the rules.","So what if they were front he Outskirt Territories? If they angered him, he would still kill them and capture them as he pleased.","What tacit agreement between the Federation and the Outskirt Territories? in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, this carried no weight.","With the release of the numerous videos of Chu Yunfan’s battles, his title as the number one expert of the Federation spread like wildfire.","After many people came back to their senses, there was an uproar. Chu Yunfan had only appeared in their line of sight for a short time, and he already became the number one expert after being recognized as a Divine.","There had never been such a person in history.","And under the push of various people, topics about Chu Yunfan continued to simmer. He began to replace the president and gradually became the stabilizing force that calmed people’s hearts."]},{"number":951,"title":"Chapter 951 The Eye of the Storm, Surging Undercurrents","paragraphs":["951 The Eye of the Storm, Surging Undercurrents","On the Internet, the fact that Chu Yunfan had killed dozens of Divines in one battle naturally became a hot topic.","In particular, many of the marine folk experts who were originally clamoring on the Internet were not willing to believe that Chu Yunfan could destroy dozens of Divines in one single battle.","They thought that this was just a publicity stunt enacted by the humans.","How could such a person appear among the humans? Even among the marine folks, such a person would be a glorious character.","!!","However, there were surveillance cameras all over First Prison, and just some of the footage that was shown was enough to prove how Chu Yunfan killed those Divines.","Although there wasn’t much information about his battle style or secret techniques, it was already shocking enough for the outside world.","It could even be said to be terrifying.","All kinds of rumors about Chu Yunfan being the Federation’s number one spread and didn’t stop. The Federation really needed such a person to calm the hearts of its citizens.","Apart from that, it was also crucial to deter the many enemies. Nuclear bombs were a last resort because unless it was used on a large scale or to trap Divines, it would be very difficult to kill them once the plan was made known.","The best way to deal with a martial arts expert was with a martial arts expert.","Now that such a terrifying existence had appeared within the Federation, it wasn’t good news for the outsiders. It wasn’t even good news for the Holy Land, which had always hoped to take over the Federation.","During this period of time, the Holy Land had been promoting itself on the Internet. At present, it was obvious that the Federation lacked top-tier experts. Whether it was compared to the marine folks or Infinite Demon Mountain, the Federation’s foundation was far inferior.","Without the protection of high-tech weapons, the Federation would have been seized a long time ago.","This was the strength of the Holy Land. The cooperation between them and the Federation was the best guarantee for humans to gain a firm foothold in the Kunlun Realm and eventually rule it.","In reality, the Holy Land’s infiltration of the Federation had begun some time ago. It was just that it was beginning to move from the dark to the light.","For a time, the Holy Land received a lot of support on the Internet. After all, the Federation was in a state of panic after the president disappeared. The benefits of the Holy Land’s experts joining in large numbers were clear.","Overnight, the Federation’s high-end strength would grow to be comparable to that of Inifinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks.","However, with Chu Yunfan’s sudden appearance, many people’s panic was dispelled. After all, the Federation had its own expert and didn’t need to rely on external forces.","There were many requirements for the Holy Land to cooperate with the Federation. They acted like they were above everyone else, which made many unhappy.","Not to mention that the Holy Land had injured and killed many young geniuses of the Federation. Even Chu Yunfan had been hunted down more than once.","If they had a better choice, they naturally rejected the idea of working with the Holy Land.","Given Chu Yunfan’s current age, he would probably be on par with the president in another ten or twenty years.","At that time, the Federation would naturally gain a patron saint, and they would not be as embarrassed as they were now.","Under such circumstances, the wind of public opinion within the Federation suddenly changed. There were top forces within the Federation who were not willing to align with the Holy Land to get a share of the pie, and Chu Yunfan just happened to be there.","In this situation, Chu Yunfan was pushed to the forefront of the struggle, becoming the enemy of Infinite Demon Mountain, the marine folks, and the Holy Land. They were deeply afraid of him, and even wanted to kill him.","Infinite Demon Mountain and the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom, which had suffered the most losses this time, claimed that they wanted Chu Yunfan to pay with his blood.","The loss of more than twenty Divine monsters was a crushing defeat for the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom, which had always been known for its vast army.","On top of that, Chu Yunfan was still young. In the eyes of many, he had become a thorn in their side, and his future was almost unparalleled.","Under the storm on the surface, there were undercurrents surging.","At this time, Chu Yunfan naturally didn’t know that the outside world was in chaos because of him. He had already rushed back to the Thunderstorm Sea as fast as he could.","He saw the Thunder Winged Beast and Tang Siyu outside the Thunderstorm Sea. Both of them had broken through to the second tier of the Divine Abilties Stage.","Spotting Chu Yunfan, Tang Siyu quickly went up to him and asked in concern, “How’s everything? How’s the situation at First Prison?”","“Don’t worry. Everything has been settled.”","Chu Yunfan told Tang Siyu about the general course of the battle.","When she found out that there had been so many Divines participating in this battle, she could not help but gasp.","There were more than fifty Divines in total. It was such a huge force that even the Federation couldn’t find so many experts in such a short time.","Although Chu Yunfan had said all this casually, she still felt that the battle had been surely been very dangerous.","Chu Yunfan also opened the Mountain River Diagram and released Ebony Dragon King. That convinced Tang Siyu that Chu Yunfan had indeed been in control of the battlefield.","Ebony Dragon King gave her a sense of extreme pressure. Although the dragon had already restrained itself to the extreme, the suppression of its level still existed.","This was Ebony Dragon King’s first time at the Thunderstorm Sea and was caught off guard. The thunderstorms that filled the sky came crashing down, almost drowning him. Even with his cultivation base, he was still struck and quickly covered in blood.","He then looked at Chu Yunfan and the others, who seemed to be doing fine. Especially Chu Yunfan who was absorbing all the lightning energy that fell unto his body and turning it into his own power.","Ebony Dragon King found this absolutely unbelievable.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t stingy, either. He taught Ebony Dragon King the Celestial Devouring Art. The dragon immediately felt as if he had obtained a precious treasure. Shortly, he was able to absorb the energy of these thunderbolts, so that he wouldn’t be killed.","He could even feel the divine power in his body growing. Although it was not by much, it was very impressive compared to the original increase that was the speed of a turtle.","After all, monsters and humans were different. Their cultivation methods and speed were also completely different!","“You got back just in time, Yunfan.”","After Tang Siyu made sure that Chu Yunfan was fine, she heaved a sigh of relief and then brought up another matter.","“While we were here, we spotted more than one marine folk troop enter the Thunderstorm Sea,” Tang Siyu said after a pause, “Before you got back, the Thunder Winged Beast and I were planning to investigate.”"]},{"number":952,"title":"Chapter 952 The Marine Folks’ Expedition: A Sacred Cave Out on the Thunderstorm Sea","paragraphs":["952 The Marine Folks’ Expedition: A Sacred Cave Out on the Thunderstorm Sea","“Marine folk troops?” Chu Yunfan felt this a little strange.","The Thunderstorm Sea was a forbidden area for the marine folks. They didn’t dare to enter and leave as they pleased, even Divines were no exception.","“That’s right. Marine folk troops.” Tang Siyu nodded with certainty. “And there was more than one. Fortunately, the environment here is trubulent and visibility is low. They didn’t spot us.","“I have a feeling that they’re up to something. Otherwise, they wouldn’t risk coming here.”","!!","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and felt that what Tang Siyu said made a lot of sense. “The marine folks have taken great risks by entering the Thunderstorm Sea. They’re definitely not here for a vacation. Get into the Mountain River Diagram and wait for me. I’ll go investigate.”","Tang Siyu nodded, then entered the diagram with the Thunder Winged Beast and Ebony Dragon King.","Chu Yunfan began to travel across the sea’s surface like a bolt of lightning and shot deep into the depths of the Thunderstorm Sea.","In there, the thunder energy was much richer than outside. There were all kinds of lightning crisscrossing everywhere. There was no need to attract them. As long as one took a few steps, they would encounter all kinds of lightning that would strike their bodies.","In such a place, visibility was very low. Even Divines would be encumbered here. They could not go very deep into Thunderstorm Sea. If they were to go just a little further in, they would be completely destroyed by the endless thunder energy.","However, just as Tang Siyu said, when Chu Yunfan got further inside, he soon saw teams of marine tribe soldiers stationed there. The thunder energy, which was extremely terrifying to them, was bounced off by the charms on their bodies when it fell on them.","These charms glowed with a faint light that could block the thunder energy. They were a special charm known as the Thunder Repel Charm. It had been a very popular charm back in the Ancient Zenith Civilization.","Chu Yunfan could see that in addition to the marine folk troops that had taken on human forms, there were also many powerful marine monsters that had turned into liquid lightning.","They were all powerful beasts belonging to the marine folks.","Chu Yunfan felt this strange. The marine folks had a structure was somewhat similar to that of Infinite Demon Mountain, but there were some differences.","The marine folks, too, lived in groups of different races known as tribes, and Chu Yunfan could tell that there were at least several tribes in this troops that had taken human form.","To rule over so many tribes, the leader must be considered a large tribe. Ordinary tribes did not have such ability.","These marine folks had inexplicably entered the Thunderstorm Sea and had paid a considerable price for it. Just the Thunder Repel Charms alone were precious enough, but they were not permanent. Under the attack of such strong thunder, the charms would not last long and had to be replaced frequently.","The value of these items was quite high. This made it even more clear that the marine tribe’s goal was not simple.","Fortunately, the endless thunder helped to conceal Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. He cultivated in the midst of the thunder while absorbing its energy. He was waiting for the marine army to make their move.","A day later, the marine army finally made a move.","A group of seven Divines who were around tier three or four were in the lead. This cultivation was not considered weak among the marine folks. However, these Divines surrounded a middle-aged man in his forties like stars surrounding the moon.","This man was covered in black scales and looked extremely mighty. He was brimming with killing intent. Even from afar, one could feel a terrifying sense of oppression.","‘A tier six Divine!’ Chu Yunfan was able to instantly determine the man’s strength.","With Chu Yunfan’s current level of strength, ordinary fifth tier Divines were no match for him. He would be able to kill them in seconds. Even if he were to face tier six Divines, he would be able to protect himself.","Therefore, he wasn’t too worried. However, the appearance of this expert made him vigilant.","A tier six Divine was considered one of the best in the Divine Abilities Stage. It was hard to say if there were any experts of such a level within the current human Federation.","In the past, the president’s strength had definitely reached, or even surpassed, this level, but he was the only one who had done so. In his absence, a marine folk expert like this could turn the entire world upside down.","There was almost no one who could control them. As far as Chu Yunfan knew, no matter from which force they were from, experts of this level were often in secluded cultivation to complete breakthrough after breakthrough before their lives came to an end.","To bring them out of seclusion—other than a sudden major event—the matter at hand had to contain numerous benefits.","The black-armored middle-aged man waved his hand. Immediately, the entire marine army, which consisted of thousands, began to move. They headed toward the deepest part of the Thunderstorm Sea. The other Divines took the lead.","Chu Yunfan muttered to himself for a moment, then followed behind them. He hung back at a distance and they soon entered the deepest part of the Thunderstorm Sea.","In the deepest part, the thunder was as dense as a rainstorm. Even Chu Yunfan had to do concentrate on absorbing the thunder energy, not daring to be as distracted as he was before.","The marine army was also constantly changing the Thunder Repel Charms. Without these charms, this army of thousands would instantly be drowned.","Following behind this large army, Chu Yunfan finally understood what their goal was.","In this forbidden land within a forbidden land, a desperate land within a desperate land, there was a huge sacred cave, where it was said gods dwell, floating above the Thunderstorm Sea.","The endless thunder energy did not fall on the cave, but skirted around it.","A barrier surrounded the entire cave and a faint blue light could be seen flowing through the barrier as if it was also composed of thunder energy.","Chu Yunfan was also a little shocked. If it wasn’t for someone leading the way, he probably would never have guessed that such a place existed out at sea.","He had been following this army for a full day and night through the Thunderstorm Sea. The environment of this place was harsh. Even for cultivators with high cultivation bases, it was difficult for them to move forward. Without a Divine to open up a path, even with the Thunder Repel Charm, they would not be able to walk through this place.","The consumption of Thunder Repel Charms was naturally extremely huge. If these items were to be auctioned off in the Federation, all the charms that had been consumed over the one day and one night would certainly have fetched at least tens of billions of yuan.","The reason the marine folks were willing to sacrifice tens of billions to enter this place was obviously clearly because of the sacred cave out on the Thunderstorm Sea."]},{"number":953,"title":"Chapter 953 Waiting for an Opportunity","paragraphs":["953 Waiting for an Opportunity","When they arrived in front of the huge cave, the thousands of soldiers carried out their orders and wheeled out dozens of cannons from the goods that they were escorting.","Each of these cannons had a diameter of more than three meters. It was not something that an ordinary person could move. But thanks to the marine folks’ natural innate strength, they were able to move these cannons into the depths of the Thunderstorm Sea.","‘Even the marine folks have cannons now. This isn’t good news for the Federation,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","The Federation had established itself in the world by relying on superior technological strength, which was even more important than martial arts.","Now, Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks had clearly realized this and began to catch up. Although they still couldn’t compare to humans, they were no longer in their primitive state.","This did not bode well for the Federation.","Chu Yunfan didn’t have the time to ponder over this because shortly, the dozens of cannons—under the protection of the Thunder Repel Charms—opened fire.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Even in the depths of the Thunderstorm Sea which was filled with endless thunderbolts, the shocking sound of dozens of cannons firing at the same time still shook the entire place.","Dozens of cannonballs hit the barrier of the sacred cave and instantly created huge cracks in it. But in the blink of an eye, the cracks were repaired. It was evident that this barrier was of high grade. It could absorb thunder energy to repair cracks and maintain itself.","However, the marine army looked unfazed as if they had expected this. The dozens of huge cannons continued firing non-stop.","After being bombarded for half a day, the barrier had suffered little to no damage. At this rate, it was unknown how much more time it would take for it to break.","Chu Yunfan was amazed by the scene. This barrier was terrifying. The continuous bombardment of such heavy artillery was enough to turn a city into ruins.","Finally, the middle-aged black-armored man could no longer sit still. He called on the other six Divines and they all transformed into their true forms. They were terrifying beasts with bodies as huge as small mountains.","The black-armored man turned into a huge black crocodile that emitted terrifying killing intent.","‘The Deep Sea Crocodiles?’ Chu Yunfan immediately surmised the man’s background.","The ownership of this army was now clear. It was the Deep Sea Crocodiles who had been hostile to Chu Yunfan and had even tried to kill him many times.","He sneered. ‘What an opportunity. I shall deal with them right here.’","After the Divine monsters transformed into their true forms, they opened their jaws and spat out terrifying breaths, which blasted directly onto the barrier and echoed with the dozens of cannons.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The loud sounds were deafening even in the Thunderstorm Sea.","In the blink of an eye, another half a day had passed. Even if the barrier outside the sacred cave was of extremely high quality, it was unable to withstand such a degree of bombardment.","Finally, with a loud boom, it turned into nothingness, crumbling into dust and disappearing into the void.","“Advance!”","The Deep Sea Crocodile turned back into a middle-aged black-armored man. He waved his hand and the thousands of soldiers who had been waiting for a long time rushed into the cave.","Without the barrier, Chu Yunfan could see that the cave was very large. The army of thousands was endless, but they could swarm into the cave without blocking it up.","One could only imagine how shocking it was when the cave had a master.","Chu Yunfan waited until the whole army had entered the cave before he rushed in. As soon as he entered, he realized that the sacred cave floating above the Thunderstorm Sea only looked that way from the outside.","Inside was a completely different world. It was an incomparably huge palace.","At this time, the hall of the palace was filled with the sounds of killing. The marine folk soldiers who had entered earlier were fighting with figures covered in thunder.","Upon closer inspection, one could see that these figures were puppets wrapped in a layer of electricity.","There were at least a thousand of these puppets, which was much less than the marine army of thousands. However, they were able to hold off the marine army which was several times their number.","For a moment, the entire scene was in a stalemate.","“Useless trash!”","The black-armored man snorted and made his move.","He took a step forward, and in the blink of an eye, he was already in the middle of the puppet army. The tail of an extremely huge crocodile appeared, and with a powerful sweep, those that were sent flying exploded in mid-air.","Although these puppets were at the upper levels of the Innate Stage and were quite extraordinary, there was still a huge gap between them and the man.","The Divines of the marine folks behind him also made their moves. For a moment, all kinds of terrifying attacks swept out.","The Divines attacked without any hesitation. They launched attacks that had large attack ranges. Although there was some friendly fire, they did not care.","In just a few moments, they had broken through the line of defense formed by the puppet army.","Just as they broke through the defense line, four statues-like puppets at the four corners of the hall—each more than ten meters tall—came to life.","Unlike the previous puppets that were at most equivalent to the Innate Stage, these four giant puppets were comparable to the Divine Abilities Stage.","In a matter of seconds, the four puppets were activated, and their bodies bloomed with terrifying thunder. The huge figures went up to engage the Divines of the marine folks.","“Stop them!”","The middle-aged man had clearly expected this problem long ago. He did not panic and simply called out his orders. The six other Divines immediately pounced on the four giant Divine puppets.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","A terrifying battle between Divines broke out. If the hall hadn’t been large enough, this battle would have caused the entire place to collapse.","The black-armored man continued to walk forward. In front of him was a huge throne, and on the throne floated a scepter that flickered with lightning."]},{"number":954,"title":"Chapter 954 Unaware of the Opportunist Coming From Behind, Breaking Through","paragraphs":["954 Unaware of the Opportunist Coming From Behind, Breaking Through","This scepter that flickered with lightning seemed to be formed from lightning energy. Light flowed over its surface, making it look extremely shocking.","“It’s just like in the ancient texts. There really is a Thunder God Scepter hidden here.”","The black-armored man’s face revealed an “I knew it” expression and his eyes flashed with greed.","Because of this scepter, he had searched through all kinds of ancient books before finally finding the records of this Thunder God Scepter. If he had not accidentally found the ancient book regarding the origins of the Thunderstorm Sea, he would not have known that there was such a sacred cave within its depths.","According to the records, this cave belonged to a master from the Ancient Zenith Civilization who had built it out on the Infinite Sea.","How the Thunderstorm Sea was formed was also related to this cave. It contained a large amount of thunder energy, which constantly overflowed. Over time, it formed the endless thunder energy situation of the Thunderstorm Sea.","Now, this cave was about to fall into his hands. At that time, even if he didn’t have the Deep Sea Crocodiles behind him, he would still have his own place within the Infinite Sea.","“The Heavens are smiling upon me!” The black-armored man laughed.","He formed a huge iron claw and smashed the barrier around the Thunder God Scepter. When he tried to take it, a figure suddenly rushed over with lightning speed.","The black-armored man immediately felt that something was wrong, but it was too late. The figure was faster than he had anticipated. It caught up with him in an instant and shoved the Thunder God Scepter into its bag.","The figure was too fast. So fast that he didn’t even have time to react before everything was already over.","Boom!","When the figure touched the scepter, a terrifying power burst out from it. The scepter instinctively began to fight back. Endless thunder glowed from within it and spread in all directions.","This caused the figure to come to a halt, allowing the black-armored man to see the person clearly. It was a human male in black clothes.","Yes. A human male.","The aura on his body was apparent and he did not bother to hide it.","“D*mn it!”","The black-armored man was enraged. There had been someone following behind them.","And this person was none other than Chu Yunfan. When he saw the Thunder God Scepter, he knew that the core of the cave was within it.","The scepter was the key to controlling the entire cave.","Naturally, he couldn’t let it fall into the hands of the marine folks. Therefore, he took the initiative to attack. But the moment he touched the scepter, a terrifying force backfired on him.","Chu Yunfan felt a stream of pure thunder energy surge into his body. It was different from the thunder energy outside which contained a lot of impurities.","This pure thunder energy was extremely pure. It was many times purer than the thunder energy outside. Even just a small part of it was a huge amount for Chu Yunfan.","He felt as if he was about to explode from this force. However, since things had already come to this, he had no other choice but to accept it.","The black-armored man clearly realized the problem Chu Yunfan was facing. He immediately laughed out loud, “You’re toast!”","A ferocious expression appeared on the man’s face. He wanted to see Chu Yunfan explode from the energy, so he didn’t make a move.","But suddenly, Chu Yunfan opened the Mountain River Diagram and dove in.","In the blink of an eye, the black-armored man saw Chu Yunfan disappear.","“Rrraggh!!!”","The black-armored man let out a deafening bestial roar when he saw that Chu Yunfan had escaped.","“A spatial treasure!”","He never thought that Chu Yunfan would possess such a treasure. Although spatial treasures were rare, it was not the first time a Divine had been seen with one.","However, he had never seen a spatial treasure that could store a person. Generally speaking, it could only store inanimate objects such as weapons that could be taken out when needed.","Spatial treasure that could store living things was very rare even among many spatial treasures. This grade was not something he could come into contact with at the moment.","“I refuse to believe you’ll never come out!”","The black-armored man was extremely angry, but he recalled that Chu Yunfan had been bombarded with the scepter’s energy. It would be useless even if he hid in his spatial treasure.","Although he felt that Chu Yunfan was likely to die in the pocket dimension created by the spatial treasure, he was still unwilling to give up just like that.","As long as Chu Yunfan came out, he would not hold back. He could have made a move earlier, but because of that moment of hesitation, he missed out on a lot of things.","“I don’t care who you are, you’re dead!” the black-armored man said word by word, his killing intent boiling.","Chu Yunfan entered the Mountain River Diagram. At this time, Tang Siyu already knew what was happening outside. If Chu Yunfan willed it, those inside the diagram could see the situation outside of it.","“Are you okay?” Tang Siyu asked hurriedly.","“I have to focus on digesting the energy in my body!”","Chu Yunfan could feel the energy wreaking havoc in his body. This terrifying power was the most powerful and violent of thunder energy. If he hadn’t cultivated the Imperial Physique, he would have exploded a long time ago.","He could feel that this powerful thunder energy was constantly destroying his body. What was even more terrifying was that it formed an extremely huge and ancient symbol in his body. This symbol was extremely ancient, but Chu Yunfan instantly recognized the word—thunder.","This was an extremely ancient and simple language. It was even different from the ancient languages that were taught in schools.","Those were extremely ancient characters that were extremely close to the source of the great Dao. Only the various Emperors of the Ancient Zenith Civilization could decipher them, and Chu Yunfan just happened to have received the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, so there was naturally no problem in deciphering these characters.","These words, just by being written, held great power.","The symbol flowed with pure energy as if it was going to pour out all the energy that it had accumulated over the years.","“Let’s do it!”","Chu Yunfan immediately made a decision. Now that things had come to this, he could only take a gamble and use this thunder energy to break through."]},{"number":955,"title":"Chapter 955 Advancement, Tier Three Divine","paragraphs":["955 Advancement, Tier Three Divine","The energy wreaked havoc on Chu Yunfan’s body. It was so terrifying that he barely had the chance to breathe. If this went on, even with Imperial Physique, he would explode from the energy.","This “thunder” symbol was an ancient charm. It was unknown which top master had refined it. After so many years, it was unknown how much energy it had accumulated.","It was originally sealed inside the Thunder God Scepter, but the moment Chu Yunfan took control of the scepter, he clearly felt the godhead in his body burst out with a ray of light. It instantly attracted the thunder charm within the Thunder God Scepter into Chu Yunfan’s body.","This caused the energy in his body to go out of control, and more and more energy poured in from the Thunder God Scepter. Chu Yunfan didn’t dare to come into contact with it. After entering the Mountain River Diagram, he threw the scepter aside.","!!","Until Chu Yunfan could bring this thunder charm under control, there was no way to guide the energy out of the scepter.","He could feel that the thunder charm was the key to everything. By controlling the charm, he could control the scepter and the cave.","He could feel the terrifying energy contained in the scepter. Once it was truly unleashed, Chu Yunfan’s strength would also astonishingly increase. Whether it was to guide it out for his own use or to use it with the scepter, it would have endless wonderful uses.","But all of this was based on the premise that Chu Yunfan could control the charm.","Just the energy contained in the charm was enough to make Chu Yunfan explode.","In that case, Chu Yunfan had no other choice but to take the risk and use this energy to help him break through. Only then would he have a chance of survival.","“I’m going to enter seclusion and try to break through. Don’t worry about me, but don’t touch that scepter either. I can’t control it at the moment,’ Chu Yunfan said.","“I understand.” Tang Siyu’s pretty face flashed with a hint of worry, but she knew that it was useless to worry. All she could only do was remain by Chu Yunfan’s side.","After Chu Yunfan gave his instructions, he immediately sat down cross-legged and began to circulate the Mighty Eternal Emperor Method.","Inside his body, the divine power that had been continuously beaten back by the thunder energy began to condense and gather. He began to accommodate this energy and transform it for his own use.","The whole process was extremely dangerous. The thunder energy was extremely volatile. Even with the Imperial Physique, it was still impossible to completely transform it. Every second, the cells in his body were being burned, and his meridians were being ruptured, but they were recovering at an even more astonishing speed.","The Imperial Physique’s recovery speed was absolutely shocking.","Chu Yunfan absorbed the energy bit by bit and scattered it into his limbs and bones, constantly strengthening and increasing his cultivation level.","His cultivation speed, which had been gradually slowing down after he entered tier two of the Divine Abilities Stage, started to speed up like a speeding car.","This cultivation method was extremely dangerous, but Chu Yunfan had no other choice. If he didn’t want to explode, he could only transform the thunder energy at a faster speed than it was emitted by the thunder charm.","Cultivation knew no time, but his cultivation progress could be seen with the naked eye. Especially by Tang Siyu who was next to him.","Every once in a while, she could feel the divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body getting stronger, and this improvement was almost visible to the naked eye.","The strength of his divine power was constantly increasing, and this change was shocking. It seemed like he was advancing by leaps and bounds.","But Tang Siyu was very worried. She knew that although this cultivation speed seemed fast, it was also very dangerous.","Ebony Dragon King’s eyes were wide open as he stared at Chu Yunfan. He had a life span of several hundred years, which was older than most Divines within the Federation. Within his race, he was considered to still be in his prime.","But in his long life, he had never seen anyone break through like this. With his cultivation, his cultivation level was even higher than Chu Yunfan’s. He could see Chu Yunfan’s current situation, and it was because of this that he looked like he had seen a ghost.","When an ordinary person absorbed energy, they would drink it like soup, taking small mouthfuls at a time. But when Chu Yunfan absorbed energy, it was like he was devouring it. The speed of his absorption was like rivers running into the sea, swallowing up Heaven and Earth.","The power of the Celestial Devouring Art was fully displayed through Chu Yunfan. Only by using this skill could he keep up with the speed of the overflowing energy.","However, Ebony Dragon King knew that it was impossible for him to do this. Though his physical body was very powerful, he would still explode under such a crazy devouring situation.","The Thunder Winged Beast looked at Ebony Dragon King as if he was a thief, afraid that he would suddenly cause trouble.","Although Chu Yunfan was the one who had brought Ebony Dragon King back, the time had been too short. The Thunder Winged Beast didn’t trust him.","Unlike the Thunder Winged Beast that had been tamed by a Beast Taming Pill, Chu Yunfan had forcibly tamed Ebony Dragon King, so who knew if Ebony Dragon King was truly loyal?","In this situation where Chu Yunfan was in a precarious situation, the Thunder Winged Beast was even more vigilant.","Ebony Dragon King naturally understood the Thunder Winged Beast’s thoughts. He smiled bitterly. What a joke. Chu Yunfan had a wisp of his primordial spirit, and Chu Yunfan’s death didn’t mean that he would be free. On the contrary, if Chu Yunfan died, he would immediately die a violent death too.","In comparison, he was the one who didn’t want anything to happen to Chu Yunfan. Unfortunately, he couldn’t help in his current situation, so he could only leave it to fate.","As time passed, Chu Yunfan’s speed of devouring the thunder energy became faster and faster. This extremely pure thunder energy—in less than half a day—allowed Chu Yunfan’s cultivation to advance by leaps and bounds, directly breaking through from the initial tier two of the Divine Abilities Stage to the peak of tier two.","The divine power and pressure he emitted were getting stronger and stronger. Although this situation was extremely dangerous, it still had an unparalleled might.","The newly arrived Ebony Dragon King was dumbfounded.","Finally, after breaking through to tier two of the Divine Abilities Stage, Chu Yunfan did not hesitate and charged toward tier three.","Boom!","The barrier of tier three of the Divine Abilities Stage, which had been attacked countless times in less than half a day, could not withstand it and was shattered.","Chu Yunfan finally entered tier three of the Divine Abilities Stage."]},{"number":956,"title":"Chapter 956 It’s Time to Go Out and Deal With That Guy","paragraphs":["956 It’s Time to Go Out and Deal With That Guy","After entering the third tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, Chu Yunfan’s aura reached its peak. Then, he broke through this limit and entered a whole new level.","His aura was continuously growing stronger.","Ebony Dragon King’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets. Chu Yunfan’s actions, from his cultivation to his breakthrough, were completely unpredictable.","He too had once entered the third tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, but at that time, when he had just broken through, he was only around twice as strong as when he was in the second tier.","Even so, he still felt that he was relatively powerful. Many didn’t even double that amount when they first broke through. However, Chu Yunfan, who had just broken through, was at least several times stronger than before.","What kind of concept was that? It was as if he had risen like a rocket.","‘How is this possible?’ Ebony Dragon King was completely dumbfounded.","This didn’t make any sense. Not to mention humans, even the royals of the three great demon kingdoms of Infinite Demon Mountain had never heard of anyone who had such a terrifying breakthrough.","He could feel that Chu Yunfan had obtained the power of a tier-six Divine not long after he broke through. On top of that, he was still rising at an astonishing speed. If the capacity of an ordinary person’s body was like a water tank, then Chu Yunfan’s body was akin to a huge pool.","They were on completely different levels.","For most people, breaking through to this level would already be considered the end. But for Chu Yunfan, this was only the beginning.","Ebony Dragon King even had a premonition that once Chu Yunfan completed his breakthrough, even a tier-six Divine may be no match for him.","The strength that the Deep Sea Crocodile expert from earlier had displayed was not something Chu Yunfan could contend with. But now, it seemed that he was far more frightening than that man.","Thinking about Chu Yunfan’s young age, Ebony Dragon King was sure that he had a bright future ahead of him. It was easy to imagine that his future would be extremely brilliant. He had only come under Chu Yunfan’s command for a short time, but he had already gained a lot of benefits.","In the future, he might even gain the opportunity to catch up with those old monsters of the great ancestor level in Infinite Demon Mountain.","If Ebony Dragon King were to cultivate normally in Infinite Demon Mountain, he would be very lucky to be able to break through to tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage. But now, Chu Yunfan had given him a greater chance. Under the circumstances where he could not escape Chu Yunfan’s control, he could only do his best for Chu Yunfan.","After a full day, Chu Yunfan finally stopped. The violent energy around his body seemed to have come under control and was now swirling around him.","He slowly opened his eyes, and two bolts of lightning instantly shot out from them. It was extremely terrifying. Then, he opened his mouth and another bolt of lightning shot out.","He seemed to have become the god of thunder, controlling all the thunder energy in the world.","“How’s everything?” Tang Siyu asked with concern. She had been watching over Chu Yunfan for a whole day, and when she finally saw that he seemed to have completed his breakthrough, she was immediately overjoyed.","“Everything’s okay. I’ve used up a portion of my energy for my breakthrough, but I still have plenty left. Now, I can only use all my power to suppress the energy in the thunder charm,” said Chu Yunfan. He explained the situation regarding the thunder charm.","Tang Siyu, the Thunder Winged Beast, and Ebony Dragon King finally realized how complicated the situation inside Chu Yunfan’s body was. Sure enough, after the initial extremely powerful aura, his aura was slowly restrained.","Soon, it seemed no different from an ordinary person’s. At most, it was similar to an ordinary Innate’s. As for his cultivation level, it was as if he had fallen back to the Innate Stage.","It was as if he had turned from an extraordinary to a mortal.","“What should we do now? You’re basically sealing away all your divine power.” Tang Siyu’s brows furrowed slightly, and her pretty face was full of worry.","“For now, there’s no other way. If I don’t use all the divine power in my body to suppress it, I’m afraid I’ll explode and die shortly,” Chu Yunfan said with a bitter smile, “However, I can still use my full strength for a short period. As long as the battle doesn’t drag on, I can still do it.”","Tang Siyu did not feel relieved at his words. It was too dangerous for him to mobilize all his power even for a short time.","“Don’t worry. Although I can only mobilize my power for a short time, it’s enough for me. With my current strength, unless I encounter an old monster like a tier-seven Divine, it’s enough,” Chu Yunfan said. His words were filled with confidence.","“That’s right. Don’t worry, mistress. As far as I know, there aren’t many in tier seven, even at Infinite Demon Mountain. People of that level don’t leave their training halls easily. They hope to surpass the Divine Abilities Stage, so they don’t waste their time traversing the world,” Ebony Dragon King also consoled.","“That’s true, but it’s hard to say now. The situation of the Federation is unclear. Before that, who would have thought that so many experts would appear?” Tang Siyu countered.","When she and Chu Yunfan were studying, Divines were myths and legends. They would not show up easily. However, now that more and more Divine were beginning to surface and appear in front of the world, the times were clearly different.","“It’ll be fine. Although I can’t mobilize my strength for the time being, I’ve already thought of a way,” Chu Yunfan said.","He was not just comforting Tang Siyu. He did have a plan in mind. With the current situation in his body, he was like boiling oil and would die if he was not careful.","However, the most important thing was that even if he used all of his power to suppress it, it wouldn’t last long. The energy in the thunder charm was still pouring out continuously, attacking Chu Yunfan’s suppression.","If this continued, the energy would break through the blockade sooner or later. To solve this hidden danger, he had to deal with it as soon as possible, and Chu Yunfan had already thought of a solution.","What awaited him was a glorious rebirth.","After that moment, he would be reborn, and his strength would make another shocking breakthrough. He would not even be afraid of tier-seven Divines then and could easily defeat them all.","To him, this matter was dangerous, but it was also an unprecedented opportunity. If he used it well, it would save him at least ten years of bitter cultivation.","“But before that, we have to get out of here and kill that guy waiting for us outside.”","Chu Yunfan’s voice was chilling."]},{"number":957,"title":"Chapter 957 Wiping Out a Whole Army in One Strike","paragraphs":["957 Wiping Out a Whole Army in One Strike","From inside the Mountain River Diagram, one could see the scene outside. The Deep Sea Crocodile expert had no intention of leaving.","He was clearly unwilling to let Chu Yunfan take the Thunder God Scepter just like that. He intended to ambush Chu Yunfan.","In fact, there was indeed a problem with Chu Yunfan’s current condition, but he had suppressed it by force. What he needed now was time. As long as he had enough time, this bad thing could turn into a good thing.","He would soar into the sky.","With the thunder charm constantly releasing thunder energy into his body, Chu Yunfan’s control over this power was also constantly increasing.","It was like a double-edged sword. Now, it was time to see how Chu Yunfan coils utilize this power. In this turbulent era, he was in much need of such power.","The next moment, the Mountain River Diagram opened, and Chu Yunfan appeared in the hall of the cave once again.","“You’ve finally come out!” The middle-aged man in black armor was ecstatic. He had been ready to stay here for one, or even two, or even several years.","This opportunity was of utmost importance to him, but he was afraid that Chu Yunfan would die in that sub-space and the scepter would forever remain in there, never to see the light of day.","Now that Chu Yunfan had finally appeared, the black-armored man would definitely not miss such a good opportunity. In the blink of an eye, the six Divines who had been lying in ambush moved in.","One of them was fast and swift. In a moment of seconds, he had already arrived in front of Chu Yunfan with a sinister smile on his face. He held a long saber in his hand, and a terrifying divine power poured into it, turning into a huge saber light which was about to slash at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan, who seemed to have held back all his strength just now, suddenly exploded. A terrifying power surged out from his body, and endless thunder energy was released, forming a violent tide around him.","Just as the saber light was about to hit him, a blood-red skeletal hand suddenly extended from Chu Yunfan’s back. This skeletal hand was as fast as lightning, and in an instant, it had already slapped down.","The figure thought that he was extremely fast, but before he could hit Chu Yunfan, he was caught by the blood-red skeletal hand.","Bam!","The figure was hit head-on, and his body was smashed into the ground of the hall. A huge explosion was heard, followed by the sound of bones breaking.","Everyone saw the Divine being thrown to the ground. All of his bones were broken and he had turned into a pool of mud. He had not even had the chance to unleash his full power before he died a tragic death.","This scene caused the other Divines to be stunned as if they had been frightened. However, they were too close to Chu Yunfan now, so they couldn’t help him.","The blood-red skeleton formed by the Demon Descends Illustration materialized around Chu Yunfan’s body. Its two huge blood-red hands reached out.","Bam!","Bam!","Another two loud explosions were heard, and Chu Yunfan killed another two Divine marine folks before they could even dodge.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it all happened in an instant. Half of the six supreme martial artists, who were in tier three of the Divine Abilities Stage or even tier four, had already been killed by Chu Yunfan.","This terrifying killing efficiency was shocking.","The remaining three Divines instinctively stopped in their tracks and retreated.","“You’re courting death!”","The black-armored man was instantly enraged. The entire hall of the cave began to shake. Under his anger, it kept shaking.","The earth trembled and his anger level was so high that it could almost be seen with the naked eye.","He had allowed Chu Yunfan to start a massacre right under his nose. This was simply preposterous.","In an instant, countless waves surged in the hall. It was an ocean condensed from countless Spirit Energy. Out on the ocean, the marine folks were the only rulers and kings.","However, Chu Yufan barely even glanced at him. His targets were the three Divines who were retreating.","Although these Divines were usually very brave and fought in wars without fear of death, dying in battle and being killed by Chu Yunfan’s slap were two completely different concepts.","Countless thunderbolts surged out from behind Chu Yunfan, forming swords of thunderbolts behind him. It was like a wall of swords, which was a magnificent sight. It filled up almost half of the hall.","“Don’t even think about leaving,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly. With a wave of his hand, countless lightning swords shot out like a storm.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Countless swords shot out and instantly covered the three Divines who were trying to escape.","They did not even have time to resist, or rather, their resistance was meaningless in the face of the storm-like bombardment.","In the blink of an eye, they were blasted into balls of flesh and blood. It was extremely terrifying.","However, the thousands of soldiers behind them suffed an even more miserable fate. They occupied the entire hall. There was no way to dodge or escape.","All of them were drowned by the attack. The power of Chu Yunfan’s attack was comparable to that of an entire army.","Chu Yunfan took advantage of this attack to release a part of the excess thunder energy in his body. Not only did he not feel any loss, but he also felt much more comfortable.","The thunder energy in this attack was extremely pure. More than ten times purer than the ordinary thunder energy outside. The power of the same attack could not be mentioned in the same breath.","Even those Divine couldn’t handle it, let alone the marine army soldiers who were only at the Innate Stage.","In just a few short breaths, thousands of soldiers were completely annihilated by Chu Yunfan’s attack. The ground was covered with corpses, and one could only imagine how spectacular it was.","There were many Innates here, but before Chu Yunfan, it was meaningless. They were all killed in a single strike.","Just like human weapons of mass destruction, one nuclear bomb could be used to kill one or millions. There was no difference.","“Aaarrggh! How dare you!”","At this moment, there was only one person still standing, and that was the black-armored man. He was bleeding all over, his black armor was broken, and his hair was a mess. He looked extremely pathetic.","His angry roar shook the entire hall."]},{"number":958,"title":"Chapter 958 Killing a Tier-Six Divine","paragraphs":["958 Killing a Tier-Six Divine","At this time, the middle-aged man in black armor was in a very sorry state. He had long lost his previous high spirits. Chu Yunfan’s attack was like the end of the world, wiping out his subordinates and the elites he had gathered with great difficulty.","It was like a few hundred years of hard work had returned to square one in one minute.","The man was trembling all over. His divine power was burning, and he had exploded to the extreme. He had decided he had to burn Chu Yunfan’s bones and scatter his ashes. Otherwise, he would not be able to dispel the hatred in his heart.","Thinking of this, the man calmed down. He looked at Chu Yunfan coldly and said, “Human, you’re good enough to hurt me, Ashen Crocodile. But today, I will make sure you die a tragic death! Where is the Thunder God Scepter? Hand it over and I will give you a quick death!”","Give me a quick death? Hahaha, Ashen Crocodile, I think you still don’t understand the situation,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at Ashen Crocodile.","He looked at Ashen Crocodile with eyes full of killing intent. The Deep Sea Crocodiles had sent people to kill him many times, and he had killed many of their experts. The two sides had long had a blood feud.","Moreover, the Deep Sea Crocodiles had always wanted to go ashore. If the other sea tribes, including the Deep Sea Crocodiles, were to go ashore, the Federation would be the first to bear the brunt.","However, Chu Yunfan, who was born in the Federation, had a completely different stance.","“Cut the crap!” Ashen Crocodile shouted coldly.","A trident appeared in his hand. With a wave, a huge wave was set off in this waterless place.","These monstrous waves turned into countless smaller waves and crashed toward Chu Yunfan. They didn’t seem to be anything special, but each of them could smash a mountain into pieces.","This was the divine power that Ashen Crocodile possessed. Compared to all the other experts that Chu Yunfan had encountered before, Ashen Crocodile’s strength was clearly one level higher.","If he hadn’t broken through, Chu Yunfan would have only been able to protect himself in the fight with Ashen Crocodile. Although he was confident that Ashen Crocodile couldn’t do anything to him, he couldn’t do anything to Ashen Crocodile either.","But now, everything was completely different.","“Let me see what you’re capable of.”","Chu Yunfan took a step forward and put his five fingers together, turning them into a hand blade. In an instant, countless blade auras slashed out in the air, cutting the waves into nothingness. They couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan.","With the strength of his current body, Chu Yunfan was truly limitless. The hand blade that he casually condensed was like a divine weapon that easily cut these waves that could smash mountains into pieces.","Chu Yunfan was extremely fast. With the illusionary hand blades that filled the sky, he cut down countless waves, rendering them unable to get close to him.","Just as he shattered the waves, a trident pierced through the sky from behind one of the waves and stabbed toward him.","This attack was fast and swift. The trident burst out with a terrifying light. Ashen Crocodile was furious. All his strength was concentrated on this attack.","“The Sea God’s Wrath!”","However, Chu Yunfan was unfazed. He raised his hand and chopped down with his hand blade, slamming into the trident.","Clang!","A crisp sound shook the hall. It was like two pieces of gold and iron had collided. The sound of metal clashing set off a violent tide at the place where the two collided, spreading out in all directions.","Thud, thud, thud!","Ashen Crocodile hastily retreated. His hands were trembling and he almost lost his grip on the trident. His eyes, which were originally filled with killing intent, were now filled with disbelief. It was as if he couldn’t believe it.","Chu Yunfan was able to take his angry attack with his bare hands. This shocking performance completely subverted his worldview.","How could a person’s body be so strong? Even he didn’t dare to resist the divine weapons of an expert of the same level with his bare hands. It was simply impossible.","But before he could react and recover from his shock, Chu Yunfan had already taken a step forward.","“It’s my turn next. Try out my punch!”","Chu Yunfan clenched his five fingers into a fist. Around his body, countless divine energy boiled and turned into a huge asura. The asura clenched its five fingers into a fist and also threw a punch at Ashen Crocodile.","At that moment, Ashen Crocodile’s first reaction was to dodge. However, he felt that he had been completely locked on. It was impossible for him to escape.","His expression instantly changed. In just a short time, the original situation had been completely reversed.","‘How is he so strong? I have to go all out!’ Ashen Crocodile thought.","He forced himself to the limit. With a roar, all the divine power in his body condensed, and then the trident in his hand grew larger and larger.","It grew to a length of more than a hundred feet, and then, he attacked Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","There was another shocking collision sound, and it immediately set off a wild wave.","This time, it was Chu Yunfan’s real attack. His punches were absolutely terrifying.","At the moment of collision, Ashen Crocodile let out a miserable cry. The terrifying force passed through the trident and landed on his body. His arms instantly exploded, turning into a bloody mist.","The gap between him and Chu Yunfan had been completely exposed.","Ashen Crocodile hastily retreated. He couldn’t even stand steadily on his feet.","“Impossible! How cold you be so powerful?1”","Ashen Crocodile simply didn’t want to believe it. He transformed into his true form of a huge fierce crocodile, opened his bloody mouth, and bit at Chu Yunfan.","“You’re seeking death!” Chu Yunfan shouted coldly and clenched his fist. His body turned into a huge golden roc and flew out.","Boom!","The golden roc hit Ashen Crocodile’s huge body. Ashen Crocodile let out a scream. His entire body flew away with a bang. His body exploded and split into pieces.","He died a tragic death.","Even a tier-six Divine could not withstand a few moves from Chu Yunfan before he was completely killed.","After killing Ashen Crocodile, Chu Yunfan quickly restrained his internal energy to suppress the boiling thunder energy in his body. His aura was dropping at an alarming rate, falling to the level of an Innate.","Of course, even if he only relied on his strong body, ordinary Innates were still not enough to beat him.","Inside the Mountain River Diagram, Ebony Dragon King saw this scene and couldn’t help but take a sharp intake of breath.","He was covered in cold sweat. He hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to be so terrifying. If Chu Yunfan hadn’t asked him to surrender, he would probably be dead a long time ago, no different from Ashen Crocodile was now.","Thinking about it, he had been really lucky."]},{"number":959,"title":"Chapter 959 Cleaning up the Battlefield, Phoenix Rebirth Pill","paragraphs":["959 Cleaning up the Battlefield, Phoenix Rebirth Pill","While Ebony Dragon King was rejoicing, Chu Yunfan finished retracting his aura.","After that battle, it was harder for him to suppress the thunder energy in his body. He could feel that the energy had become much stronger during this period.","‘It seems like I have to speed up. Otherwise, I won’t be able to hold on for much longer,’ Chu Yunfan thought to himself.","At the same time, Tang Siyu, the Thunder Winged Beast, and Ebony Dragon King walked out of the Mountain River Diagram.","“Clean up the place. For the Innate marine folks, just take their inner cores. As for the Divines, take their inner cores and corpses with you. They’re all priceless treasures,” Chu Yunfan said.","Ebony Dragon King and the Thunder Winged Beast started to clean up the place. Tang Siyu stood in front of Chu Yunfan and said seriously, “What exactly is your plan? If I don’t know, I can’t relax.”","“All right, I’ll tell you.”","Chu Yunfan paused for a moment and then said, “You know about the situation in my body. The thunder charm is constantly spitting out thunder energy. With my current strength, it’s impossible for me to suppress it forever. If I want to get rid of this future trouble, I have to take a risk.”","“What do you plan to do?” Tang Siyu said as she stared at Chu Yunfan with her beautiful eyes.","“Simple. I know of a pill called the Phoenix Rebirth Pill. This pill imitates the state of a Phoenix’s rebirth and revival from ashes. This thunder energy will be the greatest nourishment for my rebirth.","“When that time comes, the thunder energy spat out by the thunder charm will not only not be my death charm, but will also become my stepping stone.","“I can then break through to tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage in one go. Even an ordinary tier-seven Divine will be no match for me.”","Chu Yunfan revealed his entire plan. If he could not even trust Tang Siyu, then there would be no one else he could trust in this world.","“This plan must be very dangerous!” Tang Siyu said as she looked at Chu Yunfan.","“There’s definitely a degree of danger. If it was an ordinary person, the chance of completing it successfully wouldn’t even be five percent,” Chu Yunfan said.","He had located this Phoenix Rebirth Pill from within the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. The rebirth of the phoenix itself was not a simple matter. Without phoenix blood, it was simply impossible to complete the rebirth, or even be stronger.","However, the Alchemy Emperor had used great means to develop this Phoenix Rebirth Pill to stimulate himself so that he could achieve rebirth.","However, the success rate was not very high, not to mention that there was still the thunder energy that was continuously spewing out from the thunder charm in his body.","An ordinary person would basically have hit a dead end, and it would be impossible for them to succeed. However, Chu Yunfan had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, and the Alchemy Emperor had used this pill to achieve rebirth.","Chu Yunfan knew a lot of things that others didn’t, which greatly increased his chances of success.","He was no longer the same as he had been a few years ago. He no longer needed to be forced to fight for a chance with his life.","“I’m very confident, so you don’t have to worry. This is a good opportunity for me. You know the current situation of the Federation. If we don’t quickly improve our strength, we’ll be too passive.”","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s determination, even though Tang Siyu was still a little worried, she suppressed it.","She gazed at him, took a deep breath, and then said, “I plan to return to the Tang residence. I want to draw out the power in the legacy pearl. Only then can I quickly catch up with you.”","Although her cultivation level was once higher than Chu Yunfan’s, as time went by, his progress had sped up. Not only his combat power, but his cultivation level had also surpassed hers. She felt that she was becoming less and less able to help him.","Although her cultivation speed was already unimaginably fast compared to ordinary people, if those who had been trapped in this realm for many years knew about it, they would probably be so depressed that they would hit their heads against the wall or kill themselves.","However, compared to her progress speed, Chu Yunfan was clearly far more amazing. Fortunately, she had the legacy pearl in her hands, which she had not opened after entering the Divine Abilities Stage.","An extremely pure power was sealed inside the legacy pearl, and once it could be guided out, it was enough to push forward her cultivation progress by leaps and bounds in a short time.","Chu Yunfan felt a warmth flow through his heart. He understood Tang Siyu’s thoughts, and he was unwilling to stop her. Now that the situation in the Federation was becoming more and more turbulent, the best way to protect oneself was to strengthen themselves.","“All right. Go home and cultivate,” Chu Yunfan said, “I’ll get the Thunder Winged Beast to send you back. It can help protect you in case of any accidents.","“I’ll be out collecting many medicinal herbs for the Phoenix Rebirth Pill for some time. I can collect the ordinary herbs through Special Ops, but there’s one main ingredient called the Phoenix Grass that I have to find on my own.”","“Okay. Be careful,” Tang Siyu said.","While the two of them were talking, the Thunder Winged Beast and Ebony Dragon King had already cleaned up the entire place. Although this place was very large, it was simple for the two of them with their level of cultivation.","“This cave was left behind by an ancient almighty. The key to it is the Thunder God Scepter. However, I can’t control the scepter yet, so I can’t control this cave either. I can only leave it here for now,” Chu Yunfan said.","Without control over the scepter, he couldn’t control the cave, so he could only leave it alone for now. He saw that the puppets that had been blown up were reforming little by little, especially the four Divine puppets. They were in charge of this area.","Previously, they had been blown up by Ashen Crocodile, but now, they were recovering little by little.","Chu Yunfan could also feel that the barrier around the cave recovering. This cave clearly had its own core energy source. As long as the cave was not destroyed, these puppets, the barrier, and other defensive means would also continue to recover with the passage of time.","“All right. Let’s leave,” Chu Yunfan said. Then, he took the lead and flew out.","Although his power was sealed, flying was almost an instinct for one in the Divine Abilities Stage. He could fly quickly with just a little power.","Behind him, Tang Siyu, the Thunder Winged Beast, and Ebony Dragon King also stepped on the layer of light and flew out."]},{"number":960,"title":"Chapter 960 Chu Yunfan’s Loss of Combat Power, Federation Shaken!","paragraphs":["960 Chu Yunfan’s Loss of Combat Power, Federation Shaken!","Not long after Chu Yunfan and the others left, the cave was once again enveloped by the power of countless thunderbolts. Just like countless years ago, time did not seem to have passed.","It was just like before.","After leaving the Thunderstorm Sea, Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu went their separate ways. Tang Siyu and the Thunder Winged Beast went straight to the Tang ancestral home. Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, rode on Ebony Dragon King—who had transformed into his original form—and flew directly to Special Ops’ headquarters in Kunlun City.","Ebony Dragon King’s cultivation was worthy of being in tier five of the Divine Abilities Stage. Flying at full speed, he was extremely fast. It did not take long for him to reach Kunlun City.","After arriving in the city, the first thing Chu Yunfan did was to organize a search for all the herbs needed for the Phoenix Rebirth Pill.","With the current power of Special Ops, ordinary medicinal herbs were easy to get. Even if they couldn’t be bought, someone would send them over.","Who didn’t know how popular Chu Yunfan was now? He was now known as the number one expert of the Federation.","He had many supporters on the Internet too. If he were to run for the position of president, he would obtain huge support and even have the hope of securing the position.","After all, Chu Yunfan was currently the number one person in the Federation in terms of strength. In terms of contributions, he had made a lot of heroic contributions since he came into the world, especially at the battle in First Prison.","That incident had made Chu Yunfan’s reputation soar to the sky.","Killing more than fifty Divines in one battle was a terrifying feat. Even the Federation might not have killed so many Divines over the past few decades.","In this battle alone, Chu Yunfan had made a great contribution. The only thing that restricted him was his age. After all, he was only in his twenties.","In this era, the average human lifespan could reach more than one hundred and twenty years. Compared to the Common Era, it was about the same concept as the age of thirteen or fourteen, or even younger.","However, Chu Yunfan’s future was definitely limitless. If he wanted to, he could even become the president of the Federation in the future.","Coupled with Special Ops that Chu Yunfan controlled, his current status was even higher than that of the great ancestors of the six great families. He was truly at the top of the Federation.","As long as he wanted it, someone would collect all the medicinal materials he wanted. Chu Yunfan’s identity to the outside world was that of an alchemist. He had graduated from the alchemy department of Federation University, so it wasn’t strange for him to collect medicinal materials.","However, the most important Phoenix Grass was nowhere to be found. Even after using Special Ops’ various channels, they failed to locate it.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t do anything about this. The Phoenix Grass was not an ordinary herb, and the environment it grew in was different from that of ordinary herbs.","It grew only in some of the more extreme environments of volcanoes, where Fire Spirit Energy was more dense. Only then would there be a certain chance of the Phoenix Grass growing there.","This herb was not even included in the Federation’s knowledge of medicinal herbs. Only Chu Yunfan, who had inherited the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, knew a little about it.","Since that was the case, he had no choice but to search for it himself. Fortunately, Special Ops had all kinds of information, and he could get whatever he wanted.","Chu Yunfan began to search for places where Phoenix Grass might grow. Because the conditions for the herb to grow were very harsh, there were not many places in the Kunlun Realm that were suitable for it.","Soon, he had locked onto a few volcanic zones. In these zones, there was not only one volcano, but many that were in an active state and would erupt from time to time. Only in these active volcanoes would the Phoenix Grass grow.","He began to search through these volcanic zones one by one. Although his cultivation level was temporarily suppressed, the strength of his physical body was still at the Divine Abilities Stage.","He could even fight against magic weapons with his bare hands.","Though the temperature of the crater was extremely high, it was nothing to him. Even if he was directly hit by a volcanic eruption, it would not matter.","In addition, Ebony Dragon King was accompanying him, so it was not a big problem.","To Ebony Dragon King, this wasn’t something he was unwilling to do. In fact, he was more than willing to stay by Chu Yunfan’s side for a while longer.","As he accompanied Chu Yunfan on his search for the herb, Chu Yunfan gave him some pointers on his cultivation.","Although Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level wasn’t as high as Ebony Dragon King’s, he had inherited the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, so he was able to see the problems that Ebony Dragon King encountered from a higher point of view.","Therefore, it was easy for him to offer many solutions to Ebony Dragon King’s problems.","Ebony Dragon King had been cultivating for so many years, and the problems he had encountered were not small. Under Chu Yunfan’s guidance, all of them had been solved.","He was extremely excited, as if the clouds had been cleared and the sun was finally shining through. His cultivation had not changed for decades and had been at a standstill.","Now that Chu Yunfan was helping to guide him in his cultivation, it was only a matter of time before he broke through to tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Under such circumstances, even if he had to do manual labor for Chu Yunfan, he was willing to do it. On top of that, although the environment of the volcanic zones was extremely harsh, the fire energy within it was also extremely rich. It was much easier to cultivate here using the Celestial Devouring Art.","Under such circumstances, Ebony Dragon King was naturally willing to do so.","However, while Chu Yunfan was walking through the volcanoes in search of the Phoenix Grass, on the Internet, news regarding Chu Yunfan was suddenly pushed to the forefront.","It was all because of a post that had become popular on the Internet. It revealed a shocking piece of news.","Chu Yunfan, who had been at the heart of the storm recently—known as the number one expert of the Federation—was suspected to have lost his combat power.","Although the post didn’t say with one hundred percent certainty that he had lost his combat power, a lot of information released showed that he probably had.","Everyone could see that the person behind this post wasn’t an ordinary person. This was because there was a lot of information that ordinary people couldn’t see. Some of them even had photos taken from satellites. These were all classified information to begin with, not to mention using satellites to observe the chief of the Federation’s Special Ops.","This wasn’t something ordinary people could do.","There were also some newly invented machines in the Federation that were used to test the strength of martial artists. They used some unknown method to test Chu Yunfan’s energy fluctuation, but it was actually zero.","Although they knew that the person who released the news was unusual, everyone was still shocked by the news."]},{"number":961,"title":"Chapter 961 Irrefutable Evidence, Turbulent Undercurrents","paragraphs":["961 Irrefutable Evidence, Turbulent Undercurrents","Although this post said that it was only a possibility, with the professional information provided, it didn’t seem like a joke.","In particular, this information was not something that ordinary passers-by could produce. Although they did not know the purpose of the person behind the scenes, it was clear that the more powerful the person behind the scenes was, the more market there was.","The more people believed him, the less sensational it would be if it was just a passer-by’s words.","Every day, all kinds of gossip about Chu Yunfan popped up on the Internet, but there were very few that could attract such widespread attention.","!!","But this time, things were different. After all, this was related to the strength that he relied on to survive. Without the strength that made him known as the number one in the Federation, how could Chu Yunfan have a foothold? Especially when he had offended so many people.","Even so, there were still many people who didn’t believe such a ridiculous thing. It should be said that the majority of people didn’t believe it. After all, he had just started killing in all directions, and now they were saying that he had already lost his ability to fight.","After all, Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to be in any trouble.","However, the fact that Chu Yunfan was collecting medicinal materials for alchemy had also been revealed. Before this, no one felt that there was anything wrong with it. After all, he was an alchemist, so it was not strange for him to make pills.","However, after the news broke out, Chu Yunfan’s obsession with alchemy at this stage seemed strange. It didn’t seem normal no matter how one looked at it.","This afforded this post much speculation.","However, many were only a little suspicious. Most of them didn’t believe it. However, someone stepped forward and confirmed everything that was said in the post.","The reason why Chu Yunfan had lost his combat power was because he had snatched a magic weapon from the Deep Sea Crocodiles, resulting in backlash from the magic weapon.","In this regard, the Deep Sea Crocodiles naturally swore that all of this was real, as if all of this was to confirm that something must have happened to Chu Yunfan.","For this reason, the Deep Sea Crocodiles did not hesitate to self-destruct, and a large number of elite experts died tragically at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Among them, there was no lack of Divines.","As for Chu Yunfan, it could be said that he was complaining tearfully.","The truth was that while Chu Yunfan was breaking through in the Mountain River Diagram, news about him had already reached the Deep Sea Crocodiles. Originally, they thought that they could capture Chu Yunfan.","After all, with his cultivation base, it was impossible for him to be Ashen Crocodile’s opponent. In the Deep Sea Crocodiles, Ashen Crocodile was the most powerful of them all.","Therefore, they were waiting for Chu Yunfan’s news about the huge trouble that the marine folks would face if they were to go ashore.","Perhaps they were waiting for Ashen Crocodile to kill Chu Yunfan, or according to Ashen Crocodile, Chu Yunfan might have been devoured by the Thunder God Scepter and died in the alternate dimension.","However, who knew that what they received was extremely bad. None of the troops that they had sent had returned, and Chu Yunfan had reappeared safely.","The outcome of the battle was clear.","Ashen Crocodile and the other Divines, along with thousands of Innates, had probably all died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, while he himself had returned unscathed.","In fact, what no one knew was that the post was written by the Deep Sea Crocodiles. Even if an ordinary person saw that Chu Yunfan was like an ordinary person without any divine energy fluctuations, they would not think much about it.","After all, his strength was already at an unbelievable level. As a Divine, it was very easy for him to do some incredible things.","In addition, he had just gone on a killing spree and killed more than fifty Divines. Even if many people were paying close attention to Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts, no one would think that he had lost his combat power.","This train of thought was too strange.","However, the Deep Sea Crocodiles were different. Before Ashen Crocodile died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, he had already sent back the news that Chu Yunfan had suffered the backlash from the Thunder God Scepter. Under their preconceived notion, they naturally observed Chu Yunfan’s situation with different eyes.","In the eyes of ordinary people, this was a very normal thing, but in their eyes, it was not normal at all. After all, they had determined that Chu Yunfan must have suffered a backlash, and that his current nonchalance was probably just a forced act.","Therefore, they tried all kinds of ways and used all the methods they had developed over the years just to get an accurate conclusion that Chu Yunfan had lost his combat power.","After all, if they were to casually post something, no one would care about it.","But now, things were different. Under their self-directed acting, more and more people came to believe this.","The Deep Sea Crocodiles didn’t expect these rumors to cause any harm to Chu Yunfan, but as long as there were people who suspected that he had lost his combat power, that was enough.","Judging from Chu Yunfan’s performance, he was indeed worthy of his title as the Federation’s number one. Although the Federation had never had an advantage in high-end martial arts combat power, it was naturally extraordinary for someone to be able to reach the number one position in the Federation.","Chu Yunfan had offended countless people along the way. Which one of them wasn’t a peerless expert? However, they were all afraid of his strength and didn’t dare to act rashly.","However, if the word “doubt” was planted in their hearts, as long as they began to doubt whether Chu Yunfan had really lost his combat power, it would be enough.","Although many were able to keep their cool, there would always be some people who couldn’t and would attack. At that time, it would be clear that Chu Yunfan didn’t really lose his combat power.","If he had lost his combat power, then he would naturally be killed, although it was a pity that he couldn’t die at the hands of the Deep Sea Crocodiles.","However, he had inflicted too many painful memories for the Deep Sea Crocodiles. Even if they were very powerful and had many experts, they still couldn’t withstand such a crazy slaughter.","As long as Chu Yunfan was dead, that would be the greatest news of all.","Under such circumstances, the news that the Deep Sea Crocodiles had directed and acted out naturally became the focus of attention of countless people. It was just as the Deep Sea Crocodiles had predicted.","Chu Yunfan had offended too many people, so as long as he showed the slightest sign of weakness, someone would take action.","This was cemented by the news from Special Ops that Chu Yunfan had not performed a single miracle since his return. He had been riding Ebony Dragon King when he first arrived and had not flown in person.","All these signs were the best evidence that Chu Yunfan had lost his combat power in the eyes of many of his enemies."]},{"number":962,"title":"Chapter 962 The Truth? A Stone That Causes a Thousand Ripples!","paragraphs":["962 The Truth? A Stone That Causes a Thousand Ripples!","With the Deep Sea Crocodiles’s denouncement of Chu Yunfan, the picture was complete.","Chu Yunfan had seized the so-called Thunder God Scepter that the Deep Sea Crocodiles had mentioned, but he suffered the backlash from the scepter.","After returning, Chu Yunfan pretended to be fine, but he was secretly collecting medicinal materials for alchemy to treat his injuries.","After sorting out all this, it seemed to be reasonable.","What they didn’t know was that although they had only guessed it, they were right this time. There was indeed something wrong with Chu Yunfan’s body, and he really couldn’t display his combat power for the time being.","On the Internet, Chu Yunfan, who had just started displaying his godly power, had suddenly lost his combat power. This was undoubtedly the most explosive topic at the moment.","In particular, the hearts of the people, which had just begun to calm down, began to stir again.","After all, Chu Yunfan was their biggest hope right now. But now, even he himself had a problem, so they couldn’t count on him.","There were even more undercurrents on the Internet. Many people with ulterior motives were asking Chu Yunfan to come out and explain the situation, and this led to more talents on the Internet to petition.","In addition to those with ulterior motives, most people were concerned about Chu Yunfan’s current situation. They were afraid that the future pillar of the Federation was in trouble.","And this caused the discussions about Chu Yunfan on the Internet to become more and more intense.","Many people called for an explanation. No matter what his situation was, he should at least come out and give an explanation. This trend was so intense that it even alarmed the higher-ups of the Federation.","At this time, Chu Yunfan’s existence was too important to the Federation. Although he was only the chief of Special Ops, his importance to the Federation was even greater than that of the three top marshals.","This matter became more and more intense, and in the end, even Chu Yunfan, who had been searching for Phoenix Grass in the volcanic belt, finally heard.","Looking at the messages that kept popping up on his terminal, Chu Yunfan sneered. “No wonder the number of satellites above us has been increasing.”","Although he couldn’t use his divine power, he could still feel the satellites spying on him. Nowadays, military satellites could monitor a person for a long time, but for a master in the Divine Abilities Stage, as long as he wanted to, there were many ways to block the satellites’ spying.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t use his divine power right now, but he could still sense that the number of satellites spying on him had increased. This didn’t require any divine power, and was purely a sixth sense.","He had found it strange at first, but after going on the Internet, he finally understood what had happened.","He took a look and instantly understood that this matter was not spontaneous. There must be someone behind it, and the most suspicious one was, without a doubt, the Deep Sea Crocodiles.","From the situation disclosed by the Deep Sea Crocodiles, Chu Yunfan could infer that Ashen Crocodile had sent word back to the Deep Sea Crocodiles while he had been in secluded cultivation.","They had managed to guess some of the situation correctly by accident.","Upon turning on his terminal, all sorts of messages came at him like a flurry of snowflakes.","“No matter what the situation is, do not say a word to the outside world!” advised the Chu Great Ancestor.","“Do you need me to come out?” asked Tang Siyu.","“We’re ready. If you need anything, just call me,” offered Chu Haoyue.","***","Chu Yunfan read the messages one by one, and a warmth spread through him. At the end of the day, there were still many who cared about him.","The general opinion of these people was that Chu Yunfan shouldn’t say anything. No matter how the rumors spread on the Internet, as long as he didn’t come forward, no one could really say for sure whether he really had a problem.","After all, he had just killed more than fifty Divines. That was a shocking battle record. Unless it was confirmed that there was something wrong with him, no one would easily make a move.","As long as Chu Yunfan was still alive, he would be a great deterrent.","After the news that Chu Yunfan had killed more than fifty Divines was revealed, Chu Yunfan not only caused a huge uproar in the world, but also attracted the attention of countless people on the Internet.","It also set off a great uproar in the shadowy underworld where the sun didn’t shine. Chu Yunfan’s rise had been too fast, and those who had besieged him before were all slaughtered.","Chu Yunfan was now on the wanted list of the entire underground world, and his danger level was perceived to be of SSS rank. The last person who had reached SSS in the Federation was none other than the president.","An ordinary Divine was only S-rank or SS-rank, which was already the top bounty. As for SSS-rank masters, there was only one evaluation for them—run for your life if you encounter them. You’d be lucky to even survive.","It was not hard to imagine how much the entire underground world feared Chu Yunfan. Even the three major assassin organizations, which claimed to even dare to assasinate the president, had rejected all the bounty missions related to Chu Yunfan.","No matter how much money they were offered, they would not do it.","The three major assassin organizations only gave two reasons. One was that Chu Yunfan was too strong. Putting aside the martial arts experts the Jiang clan had sent out, they had also used nuclear bombs several times but still failed to do anything to Chu Yunfan.","It was very difficult for the three major assassin organizations to deal with someone of Chu Yunfan’s level. Moreover, his vengeful personality was also well known.","Those who dared to besiege him all had bad endings. The Jiangs, the Huangs, the Fire Acolytes, the Shadow Cult, and so on were all examples.","Those who were powerful and vengeful were the most dangerous.","Most people didn’t know about these things. They only knew that recently, tasks that were related to Chu Yunfan had been rejected left and right. Even those related to those close to him were rarely accepted.","It was even difficult to advertise the tasks.","And all of this was built on the foundation that there was no problem with Chu Yunfan’s strength. But if his strength was lacking, then the three assassin organizations that had initially rejected all missions related to Chu Yunfan might make a move on him again.","The reason they didn’t make a move wasn’t because they didn’t have enough courage or money. They even dared to make a move on the president, let alone Chu Yunfan, the chief of Special Ops.","The only problem was that they didn’t have the confidence to win, and they also didn’t have the confidence to withstand Chu Yunfan’s revenge.","Once Chu Yunfan showed the slightest weakness, these hungry wolves would all pounce on him.","However, what no one expected was that at this critical moment, Chu Yunfan actually spoke up on the Internet through his terminal.","“Recently, all the speculations about me are false. Everything is not as serious as the rumors say. There are some problems, but everything is under control. Don’t worry, everyone!”","This was a stone that caused a thousand ripples!"]},{"number":963,"title":"Chapter 963 Chu Yunfan’s One-Trillion-Yuan Bounty Is the Highest in History!","paragraphs":["963 Chu Yunfan’s One-Trillion-Yuan Bounty Is the Highest in History!","Of course, Chu Yunfan’s words did not directly admit that he had lost his ability to fight, but he did admit that there was something going on with him.","In many people’s eyes, this was more believable than Chu Yunfan outrightly saying that he had a problem.","It was obvious that he was trying to cover up. He didn’t deny that there was a problem, but he also didn’t admit that there was a big one. This was enough for many forces that were already standing by to make a move.","This was a clear sign that there was indeed something wrong with Chu Yunfan. He was now walking around in search of herbs and making pills to solve the problem.","!!","All of this now seemed very credible.","“As expected. There is indeed something wrong with Chu Yunfan. He has stolen our magic weapon. This is his retribution!” a Deep Sea Crocodile expert clamored on the Internet, “He’s not that great. He’s only famous because there are no other heroes.”","These words ignited the rage of many of Chu Yunfan’s supporters.","“You sure have a big mouth. Back when Chu Yunfan was at his peak, did you dare to appear in front of him?”","“Of course not. If he had, he would be toast by now. He wouldn’t have the chance to be so arrogant.”","“That’s right. They’re just a bunch of people who bully the weak and fear the strong. They didn’t even dare to stand up before, but now they’re coming out to talk big.”","The Deep Sea Crocodile did not seem to be afraid of the anger of countless Federation citizens. They could not do anything to him on the Internet after all.","“Hmph, hmph. What’s the point of saying all this now? It’s all in the past. There are many outstanding figures, but we look toward the present. No, this is just the beginning.","“Chu Yunfan forcibly took away my kin’s magic weapon, and this is only the first wave of the backlash. As time passes, the backlash will become more and more severe.","“At that time, he would be lucky to die from self-destruction! He’s clearly asking for it. If he hadn’t stolen our important magic weapon, he wouldn’t have suffered such retribution!”","This Deep Sea Crocodile revealed another important piece of information. In his current state, Chu Yunfan might not be able to maintain this life. As time passed, he might die from the magic weapon’s backlash.","Many people were furious, but they couldn’t do anything about it. After all, all they heard was the one-sided story of the Deep Sea Crocodiles. Chu Yunfan didn’t come out to clarify anything.","“Now, he has fallen to the point where he can be bullied by anyone. If he dares to appear in front of me, I’ll twist off his head!”","This Deep Sea Crocodile became more and more arrogant. Originally, an expert of Chu Yunfan’s level was not someone he could afford to provoke. But now, he could insult Chu Yunfan without worrying about his revenge.","Everyone gritted their teeth in hatred, but there was nothing they could do about it. On the Internet, they could not access that arrogant person.","On the surface, countless people in the Federation were worried about Chu Yunfan. But in the underground world, countless undercurrents began to surge. No one knew when, but the bounty on Chu Yunfan, which had been taken down, was back on top of the list again. Although his level was still SSS, there was a question mark behind it, which meant that it was possible for him to be killed.","It was not like the beginning when all tasks related to Chu Yunfan were automatically canceled.","When Chu Yunfan once again became a bounty target in the underground world, the task was immediately picked up. The bounty limit broke through the sky and blew up the entire underground world like a nuclear bomb explosion.","One trillion federal coins!","This was an astronomical figure. Even the behemoths of the six great families couldn’t afford so much money, and all to kill Chu Yunfan. This was clearly not something that one force alone could take out. Many must have joined hands to produce this shocking amount.","As for who it was, it was impossible to tell because Chu Yunfan had offended too many people over the years. He had set a new record for the highest bounty in the Federation.","As the saying goes, birds will die for food as men will die for riches.","At first, countless people were afraid of Chu Yunfan’s strength, but when the bounty on him reached one trillion, the eyes of many went red and were filled with money signs.","If they could get this one trillion, they could get anything they wanted. Even the three major assassin organizations would get rich overnight if they got their hands on so much money. It would not be a problem for their strength to double severalfold in a short time.","If an ordinary martial arts master got it, he would have no lack of resources for the rest of his life. He could build a top force with money alone.","Besides, the most important thing was that even Chu Yunfan had admitted that there was something wrong with him. That meant that it was very likely that—just like what the Deep Sea Crocodiles said—Chu Yunfan had lost his combat power.","“This was a once in a thousand years opportunity to become famous in one battle.”","“Why were the three major assassin organizations so powerful? Wasn’t it because they had killed presidents of the Federation?”","“If they can kill Chu Yunfan, it would be no different from killing the president.”","The entire underground world went crazy. All of them were getting restless, and some of the big shots in the underground world even started shouting.","For one trillion, they would even kill a god, let alone a mere Chu Yunfan.","These trillions stimulated the violent genes in everyone’s body.","Such a big move in the underground world finally couldn’t remain hidden and began to surface on the Internet. The people who were trading curses with the Deep Sea Crocodiles suddenly began to worry about Chu Yunfan’s safety.","They didn’t know how much one trillion was, but they knew that it was enough to make everyone go crazy.","Now, even they thought that Chu Yunfan was at his weakest point in history. At this time, a bounty of over a trillion yuan appeared. Wasn’t this just asking for Chu Yunfan’s life?","The netizens stopped bothering with the Deep Sea Crocodiles. Everyone’s eyes turned to Chu Yunfan.","As for the person in question, after setting off this crazy tide that swept across the Federation, he still looked calm and composed. He didn’t even take any action to hide from the pursuit of the underground world.","He simply busied himself looking for the Phoenix Grass."]},{"number":964,"title":"Chapter 964 Using Oneself as Bait, Whoever Sticks Out Their Neck Will Be Killed!","paragraphs":["964 Using Oneself as Bait, Whoever Sticks Out Their Neck Will Be Killed!","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t care, his friends and family were all extremely anxious. The reward of over a trillion yuan was enough to stir up the entire underground world, and they were all on their way.","He didn’t even try to dodge. It was as if he didn’t care at all.","This made the Chu Great Ancestor, Zhu Buping, and the others, who had been paying attention to the situation, even more anxious.","The message from the Chu Great Ancestor only contained a few words, “You’re too reckless.”","!!","However, Chu Yunfan knew that the Chu Great Ancestor was probably trying to say “are you crazy?!”","Other than the Chu Great Ancestor, Zhu Buping and the others also sent him messages. All of them had the same intention, asking Chu Yunfan why he had suddenly said those words.","In the current situation, it was best not to say anything. And wasn’t he looking for herbs? The most important thing right now was to find the herbs and turn them into pills to solve the hidden problems in his body, wasn’t it?","That was the safest way, so why Chu Yunfan did attract the attention of the Federation, and even the entire Kunlun Realm?","The underground world was in an uproar, but it was definitely not just the Federation’s underground world that wanted to make a move on Chu Yunfan. Perhaps even experts from Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks would appear.","After all, a large number of experts from Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, and Infinite Demon Mountain and the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom had lost dozens of Divine monsters in one battle. Just thinking about it was enough to make one’s heart ache.","It was hard to imagine how many people would take action and how many wanted Chu Yunfan dead.","Faced with the Chu Great Ancestor’s questioning, Chu Yunfan knew that he had to give them an explanation.","He used his terminal to make a video call. He called on the Chu Great Ancestor, Zhu Buping, Chu Haoyue, Tang Siyu, the Heavenly Dragon Elder, and all the Divines who were close to him.","“What were you thinking? Do you know how danger you are in right now? I’ll get a plane to pick you up and you can return to the Chu ancestral home immediately. I don’t believe that anyone will dare come after you while you’re here!” The Chu Great Ancestor made a prompt decision as soon as the video call started.","Now, the Chus were ranked first among the six great families. They could be said to be the number one family of the Federation. Their power and influence were not the same as before.","“It’ll be useless. There are many people watching me. Believe it or not, if I get on that plane, it will crash immediately. It might even be bombarded by a nuclear bomb,” Chu Yunfan said, “If that happens, I will truly reach Geaven without any help.”","Chu Yunfan’s mouth twitched slightly as he said this with a smile.","“They actually dare?!” the Chu Great Ancestor said loudly. However, he didn’t insist because he knew that these people really dared to do so. Although it was scary to offend the Chus, who could resist the temptation of over a trillion tuan?","The Chu Great Ancestor knew that if the target was not Chu Yunfan but someone else, even he might not be able to resist such temptation.","“You’re still in the mood to laugh? I told you not to say anything, but look at what you’ve done. How are you going to end this?” When Zhu Buping saw that Chu Yunfan could still laugh, he huffed and glared at him.","Zhu Buping did things quickly and unyieldingly. Even when facing the demons, he didn’t give in. But this time, on such a scale, even he felt that Chu Yunfan was a goner.","“I’ll come and help you,” Tang Siyu said simply and directly. The worry in her beautiful eyes was apparent.","Chu Yunfan shook his head and said, “Although a big commotion has started up, this was my intention. Previously, they restrained themselves because of my strength, but how many people are really convinced? There are many plotting against me in the dark. Since they want to deal with me, I’ll give them a chance. Otherwise, should I let them die of depression?”","Chu Yunfan even made a joke at the end.","“If you had your strength, then you could do whatever you want. But your situation isn’t optimal right now, and you’re still laughing despite that,” the Chu Great Ancestor said in an unpleasant tone.","“The underground world has been completely stirred up. With trillions of dollars, even the President might not be able to protect himself,” Chu Haoyue interrupted.","“That’s right. Recently, many have come to me to persuade me to take action for the sake of this trillion yuan. As far as I know, some of the older generation have been swayed and may come out of the woodworks. The situation will turn unfavorable for you.”","Unlike the others, the news the Heavenly Dragon Elder received from the Outskirt Territories were different from the others, but it was equally as serious. Some of them were existences that even he was somewhat afraid of.","For the sake of Chu Yunfan, for the sake of the trillion yuan, they all came out of the woodworks.","“If it wasn’t for this problem I’m currently facing, I’m afraid they wouldn’t dare to act rashly. Those people are so smart. It’s impossible to hide from them if I relied on pretense,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","“Who are our friends and who are our enemies? This is the primary problem that we are facing now. Instead of waiting for them to drag us down in the future, it’s better to solve it now. I have a hunch that there will be a war between the Federation, Infinite Demon Mountain, and the marine folks. When that time comes, these will be unstable factors.”","At this time, the Chu Great Ancestor and the others went silent. Indeed, whether it was Infinite Demon Mountain or the marine folks, they had been too aggressive recently. Almost everyone knew what they were thinking—Chu Yunfan had become a thorn in their side.","What Chu Yunfan said was very likely to come true.","“But no matter what, it’s still too dangerous!” said Tang Siyu, still disagreeing.","“Don’t worry. I’m confident and I know what I’m doing. To me, this is both a danger and an opportunity. One battle will decide everything. The Federation has developed for so many years. Who knows how many dark sides it has accumulated? There are some things that are inconvenient for you guys, but I don’t care,” Chu Yunfan said, “If they don’t stick out their necks, they’ll be lucky. If they do, they’ll just be seeking their own deaths. They can’t blame anyone else.”","Chu Haoyue looked at Chu Yunfan and couldn’t help but widen his eyes. He suddenly felt that his own belief structure was too different from Chu Yunfan’s. If he were in this situation, he would hide in the Chu ancestral home and not take a step out until he recovered.","However, Chu Yunfan planned to turn this crisis into an opportunity to capture all those people hiding in the dark.","“You’re really cunning. To offend you is to suffer eight generations of bad luck.”","After confirming that Chu Yunfan was confident, the Heavenly Dragon Elder couldn’t help but tease him.","“How is this considered cunning? If they weren’t so greedy, none of this would’ve happened.” Chu Yunfan chuckled.","“All right, that’s all for now. I do need a favor from you guys. This time, I’d like to determine who’s my friends and enemies are.”"]},{"number":965,"title":"Chapter 965 Approaching Danger, Brewing Counterattack","paragraphs":["965 Approaching Danger, Brewing Counterattack","Chu Yunfan had his own plan. He would use himself as bait to lure those people out.","Whether it was the enemies within the Federation, the Holy Land, the Infinite Demon Mountain, or the marine folks, if they dared to stick out their necks, he would deal with them all.","“What do you want us to do?” Zhu Buping asked.","“Your full cooperation. Let’s see who else within the Federation will make a move,” Chu Yunfan said, “Kill them one by one. Show no mercy.”","!!","“Not a problem,” Zhu Buping said with a murderous aura, “If they dare to attack a high-ranking official of the Federation, they should be prepared to die.”","After giving his instructions, Chu Yunfan hung up the phone and called his parents. During this time, there were all kinds of rumors about Chu Yunfan, and of course, they couldn’t have not seen it.","They were anxious, but they couldn’t contact Chu Yunfan, so they could only worry.","“Son, are you okay? Everyone outside is talking about you. You should hurry home. They won’t dare to do anything while you’re here,” Yang Yayun said directly.","Compared to his wife, Chu Wencheng was much calmer, “Is there really something wrong with you?”","The heartfelt concern on his parents’ faces warmed Chu Yunfan’s heart. He said, “There’s no problem. This is just a ploy. I’ve discussed it with the Great Ancestor and the others. We’ll use this opportunity to capture all these people in one fell swoop.”","Chu Yunfan thought about it again and again, and in the end, he decided not to tell his parents the whole truth. He hid the fact that he had indeed suffered a backlash.","In fact, he knew that his parents didn’t care about the follow-up plan. As long as they knew that he was fine, they would be at ease.","“It’s good that you’re all right, but you still have to be careful!” Chu Wencheng couldn’t help but show a bit of worry on his face. Although he knew that his son was very strong and was recently praised as the number one master in the Federation, as a father, he was still instinctively worried about Chu Yunfan after seeing the whole underground world shake.","“If you can’t do it, come back quickly,” Yang Yayun said again.","“Don’t worry, I’m 100% confident!” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","Looking at his parents in the video, after they had entered the Innate Stage, they looked much younger. He couldn’t help but feel relieved.","After hanging up the call with his son, Chu Wencheng stood up from the sofa.","“Where are you going?” Yang Yayun asked.","“I’m going to train,” Chu Wencheng said without so much as a backward glance.","As the trillion-dollar bounty for Chu Yunfan exploded in the underground world, the trend became more and more intense. Countless experts who thought they had a chance began to rush in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","And he showed no signs of running away. He still ate and drank as he should every day as if he didn’t notice the terrifying tide that had shaken the entire underground world and even the Federation.","At this time, the Heavenly Dragon Elder, the Chu Great Ancestor, Zhu Buping, Tang Siyu, many other Divines, as well as the higher-ups of various forces, jointly spoke up.","They would destroy any party who dared to touch Chu Yunfan with nuclear in similar fashion at all costs. They would be chased to the ends of the earth and be uprooted.","Once this statement was released, it immediately scared many people. The forces that had originally planned to launch a nuclear attack on Chu Yunfan gave up on this idea. With so many forces jointly issuing this statement, no one dared to ignore it.","Although the trillion yuan that was on Chu Yunfan’s head was tempting, if they were uprooted, it would be over for them. With the power of these forces, it was indeed possible. Sspecially if they used a nuclear bomb.","Whoever provoked them would only be killed.","At their level, they knew how widespread nuclear bombs were in this era. It had been like this since the AD era where even nuclear bombs were even being sold on the black market.","In modern times, the technology to make nuclear bombs was not complicated, so the situation was even more widespread. Which force like the Jiangs and the Chus did not have nuclear bombs in their hands?","It was just suppressed by the Federation Government. Not only did the government have the most number of nuclear bombs, but they also had top-tier high-tech weapons like Star Destroyers. Those were weapons that could be as easily made as nuclear bombs.","However, many still saw some hope. After all, even if nuclear bombs could not be used, but it did not mean that other means could not be used.","In many people’s eyes, this was the compromise of the Chus, the Tangs, and the others. Under the stimulation of trillions of yuan, the whole underground world had gone crazy.","Even forces such as the Chus and the Tangs did not dare to stop a chariot, and could only try their best to reduce the threat to Chu Yunfan.","This also indirectly verified the rumors that Chu Yunfan was currently weak. After all, he had been bombarded by nuclear bombs several times before, but nothing had happened to him. It could be seen that he had some way to deal with the bombardment of nuclear bombs.","But now, he had no choice but to make such a statement. This was enough to prove that Chu Yunfan was not in a good situation.","Under such circumstances, even more people came. This was the first time in history that a bounty of over a trillion was offered, and many people wanted a piece of it.","***","In the depths of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom, Infinite Demon Mountain.","Bai Yulin was sitting on a throne, and he was very happy.","“Chu Yunfan, to think that you would have such a day. Hahahaha!”","Thinking about to the previous battle, he seemed to be able to feel the wounds in his body ache.","That battle had almost cost him his life. If he had not possessed an instantaneous teleportation scroll, he would not have escaped death.","Although the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom had spared no effort in healing him, the shadow of that battle would forever remain in his heart.","“Hmph, I’m going to go into seclusion now, so you’re lucky that you aren’t going to end up in my hands, Chu Yunfan!” Bai Yulin said through gritted teeth.","He knew that what was coming next was more important, and it was related to a series of major events. Even if he wanted Chu Yunfan to die, he could only make way for him.","In the gathering place of the Deep Sea Whale tribe, under the prostrating of countless Deep Sea Whales, a figure rose into the sky and turned into an old man. He rushed toward the land of the Kunlun Realm.","In the Holy Land, a man strode down from the void in the Fluttering Blooms’ encampment, shuttling through layers of space, bringing with him a supreme might.","Below him, many Fluttering Bloom disciples lowered their heads, their expressions respectful.","After landing, the man did not stop. He turned into a ray of light and flew into the distance.","One by one, powerful existences were closing in and danger was approaching Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":966,"title":"Chapter 966 Facing an Army of Thousands Alone, Killing Like an Asura","paragraphs":["966 Facing an Army of Thousands Alone, Killing Like an Asura","Finally, these experts from the underground world who had swarmed in finally trapped Chu Yunfan in a volcano.","Even though the outside world was saying that Chu Yunfan had already lost his combat power, these people who dared to bet on him were obviously not ordinary people.","There were more than a thousand people blocking Chu Yunfan’s way, and all of them were Innates. More than half of them were at least at level five of the Innate Stage, and there were also many masters at level seven.","Many of them were even wearing advanced mechas, which increased their combat strength by a lot.","Thousands of people surrounded Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan, you won’t be able to escape today!” One of the experts shouted, but no one dared to step forward.","After all, Chu Yunfan’s fierce reputation was well-known. Even if he was deemed to have lost all his combat power, no one dared to step forward.","“This is really interesting!”","Surrounded by thousands of Innates, Chu Yunfan did not panic. The more he acted like this, the more those Masters who were surrounding him did not dare to move forward.","“A bounty of over a trillion. What a big deal. However, I’m afraid that you guys alone are not enough to take my life. If you want my life, have a Divine come and take it,” Chu Yunfan said.","...","He looked at these people. If he had encountered such a situation a few years ago, he would probably have to hide in the Mountain River Diagram or die.","But now, he was proud of himself and did not worry about these people in the slightest.","“You’re just a cripple now, yet you dare to look down on the heroes of the world. Do you think you’re still at your peak?” Among the thousands of people, someone spoke up, trying to blend in with the crowd so that no one could find his whereabouts.","However, this echnique was too immature in front of Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level was far higher than his. The Divine Abilities Stage lent one a godly ability, and that was an instinct that seeped into one’s bones and blood.","“Have you ever been hit by a stone?”","Just as he finished speaking, Chu Yunfan took a slight step and kicked up a stone. He stretched out his palm and flicked the stone lightly. It flew out like a cannonball.","Bam!","This stone hit one of the people in the crowd. It was the one who had been shouting earlier. He thought that no one would know it was him since he was hiding in the crowd. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would instantly discover him?","It was only one hit, and he instantly died tragically. His head exploded. The power of this stone was just right, and it only killed one person.","Suddenly, there was a deathly silence. No one had expected that Chu Yunfan would lose all his combat power, just as the outside world had guessed.","However, even under such circumstances, a casual attack could still kill an Innate.","...","This was level-seven Innate, but he couldn’t block a small stone that Chu Yunfan casually threw out.","In front of Chu Yunfan, an Innate was like a blade of grass.","At this moment, they finally understood why Chu Yunfan looked at them with a bit of contempt. It was a look of superiority.","Even if a Divine had lost all of their combat power, they would not be easily humiliated.","In fact, there had never been such a precedence. Generally, Divines were either dead or perfectly fine. Even if they were seriously injured, they would not lose all their combat power.","Therefore, everyone thought that they had overestimated Chu Yunfan, but now they realized that they had still underestimated him.","“I had wanted to ask you which force you belong to, but now I don’t think it’s meaningful anymore. You’re all going to die anyway,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly, “A bounty of a trillion is good, but let’s see if you have the ability to take it.”","Chu Yunfan broke the silence with his words, and the calmness and indifference in his eyes finally infuriated the Innates.","“Surely we can kill this sickly Chu Yunfan if we work together. We have so many people here. I don’t believe he can kill all of us.”","Someone shouted loudly, causing killing intent to appear in everyone’s eyes.","That’s right, no matter how strong Chu Yunfan was, he had already lost all of his combat strength. If they couldn’t kill him now, they wouldn’t have a chance to do so when he recovered.","...","In an instant, the temptation of trillions of dollars rose in their hearts again, suppressing their fear of Chu Yunfan.","More than a thousand people simultaneously pounced toward Chu Yunfan. These were all Innates, and with their full strength, their speed was beyond imagination. In a short while, Chu Yunfan was surrounded. There were even people in the air who flew over and blocked Chu Yunfan’s escape route from above.","They were so densely packed that it was impossible to see their figures clearly, but Chu Yunfan didn’t panic. He clenched his fist and simply threw out a punch, which instantly landed on the body of an Innate who was pouncing at him.","That Innate didn’t even have the time to scream before he died. His head was blown apart by Chu Yunfan’s fist, and Chu Yunfan snatched the steel saber in his hand.","His body flew backward madly. More than a dozen Innates didn’t have time to dodge and were directly hit. They spat out blood as they too flew backward. They died in an instant.","With a saber in hand, Chu Yunfan instantly slashed out countless saber lights. The terrifying power of the Imperial Physique was fully displayed. The saber lights that Chu Yunfan displayed were like mercury flowing on the ground, forming a light curtain that protected him. Even the attacks of the peak Innates were unable to do anything to him.","It could be said that even water couldn’t touch him.","On the contrary, the saber in Chu Yunfan’s hand was like a meat grinder. Anyone who was touched by it died a tragic death without any exception.","These Innates were considered masters in the outside world, but when they encountered Chu Yunfan, they were like paper. One slash equated to one kill. He never needed a second slash.","In addition to the extreme speed that the Imperial Physique could support, dozens of Innates fell in the span of a single breath. There were mountains of corpses and rivers of blood everywhere.","It was extremely shocking. Wherever Chu Yunfan went, the encirclement would collapse. There was no difference at all. The so-called encirclement and the so-called defense line were like paper in front of him—completely useless.","...","In just a few short breaths, more than half of the thousands of Innates had been killed or injured. If it was Chu Yunfan who was still in the Innate Stage, even if he used all his power, it would be impossible for him to achieve such a level.","However, things were different now. After stepping into the Divine Abilties Stage, even if he did not use any divine power, he was far from being a match for these Innates.","One slash for one, or even several, and he could slash dozens of times in an instant. The efficiency of such a killing could only be imagined.","Finally, the remaining hundreds of experts collapsed."]},{"number":967,"title":"Chapter 967 Exterminated, Federation in Shock!","paragraphs":["967 Exterminated, Federation in Shock!","The remaining hundreds of experts were all experienced in battle. They were able to stand out from countless people and step into the Innate Stage. Many of them had been struggling in the underground world.","Their mental fortitude was hard to imagine, and many of them were numb to killing.","But now, Chu Yunfan had killed them all by himself. They couldn’t see any signs of him being killed.","Chu Yunfan’s body indeed did not give off any divine power fluctuations, but his physical body was strong. Just by relying on the power of his physical body, he was able to kill thousands of experts and force them to retreat. The so-called encirclement in front of him did not show any signs of success.","Their attacks couldn’t land on him. This time, Chu Yunfan truly displayed his amazing movement techniques. He continuously used the Nine Cyclone Phantoms, the Nine Heavenly Deity Transformations, and the Wind-haze Form alternately.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even give them a chance to attack him, and all their attacks missed.","Even though he was clearly surrounded, Chu Yunfan didn’t show any signs of being surrounded. Even if he was attacked by countless attacks at the same time, he just casually strolled around and resolved all the attacks.","Moreover, these attacks were unable to stop his attacks at all. He looked like he was strolling around the courtyard, dodging their attacks, and then easily killing them.","This was the main reason why they had collapsed. They couldn’t see any hope of killing Chu Yunfan, and Chu Yunfan’s killing efficiency was amazing.","If this continued, it wouldn’t be long before he killed all of them.","...","However, when they finally came to their senses, they realized that Chu Yunfan had killed more than two hundred of their original three hundred or so people in a short period, leaving only a little more than a hundred people.","There were originally more than a three hundred people present, but now only a hundred could stand. The others had all fallen into pools of blood.","These people finally reacted and wanted to escape. They fled in all directions, trying to distract Chu Yunfan’s attention.","But how could they escape from his pursuit?","Chu Yunfan simply kicked up a few stones on the ground, but to them, it was like being hit by a giant cannon.","They died instantly.","In just a moment, the hundreds who tried to escape had all died tragically with not a single survivor left behind.","All of this seemed to take a long time, but in fact, it had only taken a few seconds.","Chu Yunfan’s body didn’t even have a drop of blood on it, let alone a wound. He didn’t look like someone who had lost his combat power at all. Instead, he looked like he was on an outing.","And he had achieved his goal in the midst of strolling.","After killing all these people, Chu Yunfan smiled at the sky and then left to continue his search for Phoenix Grass.","...","In the sky, the satellites had recorded the entire scene and presented it to the leaders of the major forces.","Especially those leaders of the major forces who had sent people to kill Chu Yunfan, they felt like they were in shock. Fortunately, Chu Yunfan didn’t ask about the background of those people, otherwise, they would be in real trouble.","No one had expected that Chu Yunfan, who was said to have lost his combat power, would still be so terrifying.","Thousands of Innates! Even thousands of pigs wouldn’t be killed like this!","After this shocking massacre, many suddenly realized that although Chu Yunfan claimed to have lost his combat power, he had not actually lost it completely.","He had only lost his divine powers, but his physical body was still at the Divine Abilities Stage. After entering that stage, not only was his spirit extraordinary, but even his physical body had also begun to transcend. It was a kind of transformation.","And now, Chu Yunfan was truly displaying the terrifying power of a Divine’s physical body.","However, there were some people who looked unsightly. Even an ordinary Divine might not have the ability to kill thousands of Innates alone.","This was especially so when many of them were wearing advanced mechas and carrying weapons with them. Even they might not be completely harmless.","But now, all of them had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. One could only imagine how powerful and terrifying he was. In front of him, numbers had lost all meaning.","Many even felt that if he still had his cultivation, he would be able to kill these thousands of Innates in one hit.","...","“How is he still be so powerful? It seems that the information that Chu Yunfan had lost his combat strength can’t be trusted at all!”","Many people began to complain about the Deep Sea Crocodiles. If they hadn’t exposed the information blindly, would they have made such a big mistake?","None of the Innates that were sent out returned. Although Innates were not the top experts of those forces, they were the backbone of any major force.","The loss of thousands of experts in one go was enough to make the various forces feel heartache for a long time.","“No, unless we use a nuclear bomb, with the strength of his body, ordinary missiles and the like won’t be able to hurt him even if he stands still and lets us blow him up. Besides, Innates have no effect on him. Only those in the Divine Abilities Stage can kill him.”","At this time, many had already come to the conclusion that only a Divine could possibly kill Chu Yunfan.","However, they could only wait. After all, Divines were different from Innates. If they said they would mobilize them, they could mobilize them. Divines were more than capable of establishing a great sect in the Outskirt Territories.","After the battle, Chu Yunfan took some photos of the battlefield and posted them on the Internt. He put a simple caption.","“Is this all you can do for a one trillion bounty? I can’t hold out much longer, but I didn’t expect you guys to be even weaker.”","Suddenly, a stone caused a thousand ripples. Originally, many were still worried about Chu Yunfan, but who knew that in the blink of an eye, he had already revealed such a shocking battle record.","Although Chu Yunfan only had a part of the picture, the whole story of the battle was quickly spread on the Internet.","...","Thousands of Innates were all killed by him alone. It was as if Chu Yunfan’s words were a provocation, telling everyone that even if he wasn’t at the peak, he was still not someone that these clowns could provoke.","Everyone was silent, especially those who wanted to kill Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, one person finally spoke.","“You’ve only killed a few Innates. You’re just a cripple. How dare you be so arrogant? I’ll kill you!”"]},{"number":968,"title":"Chapter 968 I’ll Wait for You to Come and Kill You","paragraphs":["968 I’ll Wait for You to Come and Kill You","Finally, someone spoke up in the silence.","This person was no ordinary person. After this terrifying battle, no Innate would dare to say that they could kill Chu Yunfan. Even if he had no divine power, a Divine was still not someone ordinary people could kill.","In particular, many Divines, whether they wanted to kill Chu Yunfan or not, had more or less said that these Innates were simply seeking their own death and humiliation. No matter which side they were on, seeing Chu Yunfan being surrounded after losing his combat power, they couldn’t help but feel sad for him.","In Kunlun Realm, Divines were superior to all living beings. This was the reputation that many Divines had earned.","And these people dared to besiege Chu Yunfan, so was it possible that they would also be besieged one day? Although they weren’t afraid when they were at their peak, who wouldn’t die of old age and illness? If they fell from grace one day, wouldn’t they be bullied when they were down and out?","So, it was rare for many Divines who were not close to Chu Yunfan to stand up for him. Their meaning was clear. Chu Yunfan could die, but he could only die at the hands of a Divine. As for the Innates, they could forget about it.","Chu Yunfan alone was enough to kill a Divine. He would not allow any other to do him in. As such, those who dared to speak up were quickly noticed.","“It’s the Outskirt Territories’ Spectral Mantis!”","As this person stood out without hiding anything, everyone quickly uncovered his identity. He was another master in the Divine Abilities Stage.","In today’s advanced information society, some information about Spectral Mantis was quickly discover. He was an expert in the Divine Abilities Stage from the Outskirt Territories. However, unlike ordinary experts, Spectral Mantis had not established a major sect. He was a mercenary.","He killed, set fires, started wars, and committed all kinds of evil. As long as one was willing to pay, they could hire Spectral Mantis. He was even called the strongest mercenary because of his powerful cultivation.","Although he was on the Federation’s wanted list, he had not established a great sect, so his whereabouts were unpredictable. Coupled with his strength in the Divine Abilities Stage, he had been living very freely up until this day.","Of course, this was because Spectral Mantis had always been careful not to provoke strong enemies who were also Divines.","And now, seeing that Chu Yunfan had lost all his power and was out there, Spectral Mantis, who claimed to be the strongest mercenary, finally couldn’t sit still.","“Is there finally someone in the Divine Abilities Stage who can’t hold back? However, isn’t Spectral Mantis afraid of the Tangs, the Chus, and the other forces?”","“What’s so scary about it? He’s just one person. At that time, he can just hide out at the Outskirt Territories. Who would be able to do anything to him?”","“Besides, do you think one force alone can afford a bounty of over a trillion yuan? I can’t even imagine how many forces are involved in this. With the protection of these forces, no matter how angry the Chus and Tangs are, they can’t do anything. After all, Chu Yunfan will be dead.”","Spectral Mantis didn’t seem to care about the public opinion on the Internet, and said straigthforwardly, “It’s just that there are no heroes at that specific moment of his glory, that’s why this boy is famous! I’ll break his golden body!”","These words made many of Chu Yunfan’s supporters even more furious.","“But you’re just another person who bullies the weak and fears the strong. If Chu Yunfan’s strength was still there, would you dare to say such a thing?”","“If you have the ability, wait until Chu Yunfan’s strength is restored, then you can go and provoke him!”","“The strongest mercenary is so shameless. I didn’t expect this from him.”","“D*mn it, how many people are planning to kill the hope of the Federation?”","“Will the wind destroy the most outstanding tree in the forest?”","Many people were worried about Chu Yunfan’s safety, but there were also many on the Internet who were constantly clamoring. He had offended too many people ever since he started cultivating. It was just that no one could do anything to him previously because of his strength.","However, it was different now. The long-awaited misfortune had finally befallen him. The whole Internet was buzzing.","“Those who commit injustice are doomed to destruction. Chu Yunfan sought his own death.”","“The Heavens are watchung. Someone has come to take care of this evildoer and scourge.”","“The bounty is over a trillion. The whole world is his enemy. I think it won’t be long before we see his head roll!”","The supporters of both sides were quarreling fiercely on the Internet. There were many conflicts because of the positions they took up.","Chu Yunfan saw Spectral Mantis’s declaration too, and he left only one sentence in response.","“I’ll be waiting for you to come to kill you.”","It was a short sentence, but it was like a nuclear bomb that exploded the entire Internet.","Chu Yunfan, who had lost all his combat power, was not afraid of a threat from a Divine. He retorted directly.","However, in the eyes of those who wanted Chu Yunfan dead, this was just him being stubborn. After all, the Divine Abilities Stage and the Innate Stage were different. He, who didn’t even have divine power or True Energy, could no longer reproduce the glorious record of a Divine slaughtering Innates.","“Very well. Clean your neck and wait for me to kill you.”","When Spectral Mantis saw Chu Yunfan’s words, although he knew that Chu Yunfan was deliberately provoking him, he was still very angry. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan was just a cripple.","After knowing that Spectral Mantis wanted to kill him, not only did Chu Yunfan not tremble in fear and hide, but he also provoked him and disregarded him.","Originally, Spectral Mantis only wanted to get the one trillion bounty. After all, no one could resist the temptation of one trillion yuan. But now, he had some killing intent toward Chu Yunfan.","In a volcano, Chu Yunfan jumped out of the mouth of the volcano, but he still hadn’t managed to find the Phoenix Grass.","And when he jumped out of the volcano, he discovered that his surroundings were already densely packed with people. There were thousands of them, even more than the hundreds of Innates that Chu Yunfan had killed earlier.","Of course, because of Chu Yunfan’s fierce reputation of killing thousands of Innates by himself, none of these thousands of people dared to approach him. They only dared to stay far away.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even glance at them as if they didn’t exist. This made them feel very sullen. They were considered to be somewhat famous both inside and outside the Federation, and were the overlords of their own territories.","And now, even though Chu Yunfan had lost his combat power, he still dared to ignore them.","But in the end, they held back their grievances because they all knew why they had come today.","They didn’t have to wait long. In just a moment, a figure stepped on a layer of light and arrived at the mouth of the volcano. He looked down at Chu Yunfan and said, “Chu Yunfan, they’re afraid of you, but I’m here to kill you. If you kill yourself, I’ll leave your corpse intact.”"]},{"number":969,"title":"Chapter 969 Killing the Spectral Mantis in Seconds","paragraphs":["969 Killing the Spectral Mantis in Seconds","“You?” Chu Yunfan sneered as he looked at Spectral Mantis in front of him.","Spectral Mantis was a middle-aged man with a thin body. He looked sinister, like an evil ghost. The cultivation technique he cultivated was inclined to the feminine side.","“If I was at my peak, who would you be? If you dare to appear in front of me, I will kill you with a single move!”","Spectral Mantis’s face revealed a sinister smile, and then he said ferociously, “You still dare to be so arrogant even at this point. You really aren’t afraid of death.”","“Of course, I’m afraid of death. But it’s obvious that the person to kill me will not be you,” Chu Yunfan said as he stared down at Spectral Mantis.","Spectral Mantis simply laughed and said, “Chu Yunfan, you think I don’t know your ways? You’re just trying to stall for time, right? But it’s useless. No matter what kind of reinforcements you’re hoping for, they won’t come.","“There are more than one or two people who want you dead. I’m not the only one. You’ve offended too many people and blocked too many people’s paths in the past few years. You should have expected such an ending,” Spectral Mantis said proudly.","If Chu Yunfan was at his peak, although Spectral Mantis was known as the strongest mercenary, he wouldn’t have the right to jump around in front of Chu Yunfan.","And according to Chu Yunfan’s personality, Spectral Mantis would probably be killed with a single slap. At that time, he would have been eager to hide far away from Chu Yunfan, not to mention getting close to him.","But now, he was here to take Chu Yunfan’s life. Life was nothing more than this.","“Your biggest mistake is coming here alone,” Chu Yunfan said, “Even though I’ve lost my combat strength, I’m not someone trash like you can compare to.”","Spectral Mantis’s smile disappeared. Chu Yunfan’s attitude had angered him.","In the blink of an eye, Spectral Mantis made his move. His body turned into a ray of light and punched at Chu Yunfan.","An endless amount of divine power boiled up, pouring down like a vast ocean. A punch was fiercely thrown out, and his fist intent soared, turning into a huge praying mantis.","This mantis was different from ordinary mantises. Its entire body was pitch-black and emitted a faint light.","This was the technique that made Spectral Mantis famous, and also the origin of his nickname.","Many of the Innates who were watching the battle from afar immediately felt the terrifying pressure. It was a powerful pressure that far exceeded the Innate Stage. Only Divines could release such a power.","This pressure rendered them unable to think and ceased all thoughts of resistance.","Peak of tier one Divine Abilities Stage.","An endless gust of wind swept down, blowing at Chu Yunfan’s clothes. In an instant, Chu Yunfan had already assessed Spectral Mantis’s cultivation level. It was only at the peak of tier one of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Originally, one punch from Chu Yunfan would be enough to kill him. But Chu Yunfan currently had to use all of his divine power to suppress the thunder sigil on his body. He couldn’t easily call upon his power.","Just as the punch was about to land on Chu Yunfan, he moved. He twisted his waist and kicked out. This kick was like a huge sickle of a praying mantis, sweeping and harvesting everything.","It was the Mantis Divine Kick.","It was as if Chu Yunfan had turned into a huge mantis that could sweep away all the filth in the world with a single kick.","There was no fluctuation of divine power, but just by relying on the control of this kicking technique, the martial intent seeped out of his body. This was a scene that could only appear when one had grasped a martial skill to the extreme.","Boom!","Many of the Innates saw a blur in front of their eyes. It was as if two huge mantises had collided.","The most terrifying thing was that this collision only lasted for a moment before the outcome was already decided. Chu Yunfan’s mantis cut the gigantic black death mantis in half like a knife.","Boom!","The giant death mantis was blown into pieces.","Then, the leg swept across Spectral Mantis.","Bam!","In just a single strike, the outcome was already decided. Chu Yunfan’s leg hit Spectral Mantis’s arm, and the arm instantly exploded.","The outcome of the battle was instantly decided. At this moment, everyone was stunned and the world fell into a deathly silence.","Whether it was the Innates who were watching the battle on the spot or the leaders of the major forces who were watching the battle through the satellites in the sky, they couldn’t help but gasp.","Even though Chu Yunfan had lost his combat power, or to be more precise, his cultivation, Chu Yunfan’s physical body was still terrifyingly strong.","“Has his physical body’s cultivation already reached that level? It’s just as powerful even without any divine power!” a leader of a large faction said with difficulty. They only realized now that they had underestimated Chu Yunfan.","The Innates were scared out of their wits. It turned out that Chu Yunfan did not just kill Divines as he pleased.","“You’re too weak. You’ve been famous and have stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage for so many years, but in the end, you’re just a soft-legged shrimp,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","Spectral Mantis was covered head-to-toe in cold sweat. He was still immersed in the terrifying collision just now. One kick had exploded his arm.","If it were any other part of his body, it would not have fared any better. Thinking of this, he was immediately struck with a thought. Chu Yunfan in this state was obviously not someone he could deal with.","It was only now that he realized that the bounty was not that easy to get. He had been able to survive for so many years not only because of his strength, but also because of his caution. There were too many people in the world that he could not afford to provoke. And Chu Yunfan, who had lost all his strength, was one of these people.","Swish!","Spectral Mantis reacted immediately and fled into the distance.","“Trying to escape? Do you think you can get away?” Chu Yunfan stomped his feet, and his body shot across the sky like a cannonball, directly chasing after Spectral Mantis.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had already caught up to Spectral Mantis.","Spectral Mantis immediately panicked and waved his one hand. He pulled out a mountain from the ground and threw it at Chu Yunfan.","“Trying to stop me? Do you think you can block me?!” Chu Yunfan shouted, clenched his fist, and threw a punch.","The mountain peak that had been pulled up was instantly shattered. Then, Chu Yunfan’s momentum did not slow down, and he punched Spectral Mantis’s body.","Bam!","Spectral Mantis let out a blood-curdling screech as his entire body exploded. He instantly died.","All of this seemed to take a long time, but in fact, it only took a few short breaths.","Only then did Chu Yunfan slowly land. What he faced was a dead silence.","..."]},{"number":970,"title":"Chapter 970 Exhaling Pride and Exhaling Anger, the Killing Chu Rally","paragraphs":["970 Exhaling Pride and Exhaling Anger, the Killing Chu Rally","After the deathly silence, countless people gasped in shock. When these people looked at Chu Yunfan, they felt as if they were seeing a ghost.","Not only could Chu Yunfan slaughter Innates as if he was slicing vegetables, he could also easily defeat Divines too.","Many even began to doubt whether Chu Yunfan had really lost his combat power. After all, he didn’t look like he had.","They’ve never heard of someone who had lost their combat power and could still display such a fierce performance.","“Chu Yunfan is too terrifying. Don’t tell me he hasn’t lost his combat power at all.”","“No, he really has lost his power. Didn’t you see that he didn’t use any divine power? He must have reached this stage purely with his physical body.”","“This is why he’s so terrifying. He’s worthy of being named the number one expert in the Federation. Even if he lost all his cultivation, his physique is still terrifying.”","“This is to be expected. The cultivation of martial arts is, in fact, the evolution of human beings. This evolution can’t just be the evolution of the mind. The physical body of a truly powerful Divine is equally as terrifying. Without a strong body, it’s impossible to break the limit and gain divine powers.”","Many started to discuss among themselves. If they were afraid of Chu Yunfan before, then they were now terrified of him. His strength was beyond their imagination.","If he was at his peak, he would be unimaginably powerful.","After killing Spectral Mantis, Chu Yunfan didn’t say anything. He simply sneered at the thousands of Innates. His cold eyes were like blades as they swept over them.","The thousands of Innates retreated without a fight. They didn’t even have the courage to look Chu Yunfan in the eye. They were afraid that he would remember them or kill them if he didn’t like them.","The thousands of people scattered in a hubbub. In just a few minutes, all of them had fled.","Only the leaders of the major forces who were watching the battle through the satellites in the sky were left dumbfounded. Chu Yunfan’s deterrence alone was actually strong to this extent.","After Chu Yunfan had easily killed Spectral Mantis, many finally remembered that he was a peerless man who had just killed more than fifty powerful Divines.","Although he had lost all his cultivation, Chu Yunfan had just used his combat strength to announce to everyone that even though he had lost his cultivation, it didn’t mean that he had really lost his combat strength.","Just by relying on his earth-shattering physical cultivation, he was still unpredictable and no one could block him.","A dog could not bully a tiger.","“Kill him! He must die! No matter how strong he is, he’s at his weakest now! If we don’t kill him now, are we going to wait for him to recover and kill us?!”","A leader of a force shouted out these words through gritted teeth. Chu Yunfan’s amazing performance had aroused the killing intent in his heart even more. The more amazing Chu Yunfan’s performance was, the more determined his killing intent was.","“We can’t let him get back Kunlun City. He must die!”","“If he doesn’t die today, we’ll never have a peaceful day. We will be under his pressure for the next few hundred years!”","“If we don’t kill him, he’ll be a great enemy for Infinite Demon Mountain!”","All of a sudden, the leaders of the major forces were even more determined to kill Chu Yunfan.","At this time, on the Internet, there were countless people waiting for the news of this battle. Especially Chu Yunfan’s supporters, who were extremely anxious.","Spectral Mantis was famous, and Chu Yunfan was not at his peak. This was what they were most worried about.","However, all of this was dispelled with the appearance of a photo.","A picture of Spectral Mantis’s corpse exploded om the Internet.","No one had expected that Spectral Mantis would die so easily at Chu Yunfan’s hands. There was only one selfie of Chu Yunfan on the entire Internet, and in the selfie, there was a man’s corpse at his feet.","“Could that man really be Spectral Mantis?”","“It really is him. The battle was decided so quickly, and it wasn’t Spectral Mantis who won.”","“Wow, look at Chu Yunfan. He doesn’t look like he’s experienced a great battle at all. This means that the great battle was a one-sided crushing.”","Not long after he posted this picture, Chu Yunfan posted another message.","“This is it? I’m so disappointed. If you want to kill me, come at me.”","Chu Yunfan’s words had a hidden meaning, but no one was surprised. After all, the bounty of over a trillion was right in front of them, and it wasn’t something that one or two forces could afford. Obviously, there was an invisible mastermind behind it that was targeting Chu Yunfan.","This mastermind planned to use a trillion-yuan bounty to mobilize the entire world’s forces to deal with Chu Yunfan.","It was, therefore, normal for Chu Yunfan to say this.","As the thousands of Innates felt that they had already escaped to a safe place, the details of the battle finally spread on the Internet.","And what they heard was not some spectacular battle. Spectral Mantis, who was known as the strongest mercenary, was made short work of by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s overwhelming battle power was also known to everyone, and it made his supporters feel proud.","A true dragon was a true dragon. Even though he had temporarily lost all his power, he’s still not someone ordinary people can compare to.","Meanwhile, those who were hostile to Chu Yunfan felt that the Heavens were blind. How was he still be able to erupt with such combat strength at this point? This was simply illogical.","And at this time, not long after Chu Yunfan killed Spectral Mantis, the situation changed again.","After Spectral Mantis’s death, many thought that they could scare off those who had ulterior motives. However, they had underestimated the shocking attraction of the one trillion bounty.","A piece of news began to spread on the Internet.","A mysterious person appeared in a valley in the Outskirt Territories and organized an event called the “Killing Chu Rally.” He was currently sending out invitations to all those who wanted to kill Chu Yunfan.","The bounty would be divided among everyone.","As soon as this news came out, it became the hottest topic in the Internet at the speed of light.","More people turned their eyes to Chu Yunfan. After all, just from the name, everyone knew that they were out for Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":971,"title":"Chapter 971 Killing Chu Rally, Here I Come","paragraphs":["971 Killing Chu Rally, Here I Come","The Internet was in an uproar. Just by hearing the words “Killing Chu Rally,” everyone knew who the mastermind of this event was after.","In the eyes of many, the two sides had long been like fire and water.","A bounty of more than a trillion yuan was enough to turn the Federation upside down. Under the stimulation of this bounty, many people suspected that those people would even dare to rush into Kunlun City and Special Ops’ headquarters to capture people.","On top of that, Chu Yunfan was still outside at this time. He didn’t rush to return as if he wasn’t in a hurry.","However, some people asserted that Chu Yunfan couldn’t take any means of transportation. Otherwise, if the Chus and the Tangs came out to warn him, it was inevitable that someone would use a nuclear bomb to attack the transport.","There were so many satellites in the sky watching him, and now that Chu Yunfan had lost his power, if he wanted to escape, it would not be so easy.","However, these people had already openly come up to kill him. This was undoubtedly a provocation to the Federation.","After all, Chu Yunfan was the head of Special Ops. It was fine if he was hunted down in private, but now that there was an openly organized event to kill Chu Yunfan, it made the big shots of the Federation extremely angry.","No matter how sincere or fake they were, no one would go against the Federation on this issue. They were even a little sad for the loss of their kind.","These people think that they are rich and can do whatever they want. They even dare to put a bounty on a high-ranking official of the Federation. Isn’t this a slap in the face?","In the face of this sudden assassination attempt, the government quickly came out to warn them that whoever participated in it would be branded an enemy of the Federation. The forces attending the meeting had to consider whether they could afford to bear the anger of the Federation.","However, even with such a warning, it still could not stop the rally.","More and more experts headed to the meetup point, hoping to see such a grand occasion, especially many people who wanted to get a share of the loot. According to the purpose of the Killing Chu Rally, even if they couldn’t get all one trillion, they would still make a big profit even if they got a little of it.","All kinds of experts rushed to the valley where the Killing Chu Rally was held. The rally was held at an unprecedented speed. Stimulated by the one-trillion bounty, everyone rushed day and night.","With the support of convenient transportation, the invitations to the rally were sent out within the day, and the majority of the people had already gathered in the valley.","This originally very large valley had long been overcrowded. The monsters that originally occupied this place had long been scared away by the menacing arrival of more than ten thousand Innates. Those who did not manage to escape in time were all dead.","Tens of thousands of Innates had gathered inside and outside the valley. They all wanted to earn some money and participate in this unparalleled event. After all, they were not ordinary people. They didn’t have the opportunity to participate in the besieging of the number one expert in the world.","However, these people did not dare to get close to the core area. Everyone knew that there would be Divines coming today, and there would be more than one.","After all, the death of Spectral Mantis had made it clear to everyone that killing Chu Yunfan would not be that easy. Even those in the Divine Abilities Stage who were slightly weaker were no match for Chu Yunfan.","No one knew what his limit was.","“I’m afraid Chu Yunfan won’t be able to escape this. It’s a pity that such a character is short-lived.”","“The tallest tree in the forest will be destroyed by the wind. This principle is the same no matter what. If you want to blame someone, blame him for being too high-profile.”","“That’s right. He’s too high-profile, which is why he’s in trouble today.”","“There are so many experts here today. Even Chu Yunfan won’t have the chance to escape.”","Among the thousands of Innates, many of them felt pity for Chu Yunfan.","However, in their eyes, Chu Yunfan would definitely die today. Many people looked into the valley and saw many powerful figures standing on the platform that had been built overnight. Each of them had an unparalleled aura.","That was a realm that even peak Innate experts were not qualified to be involved in. Although there was only a thin line between peak Innates and Divines, it was this very line that separated Heaven and Earth.","There were more than twenty Divines sitting on thrones, each occupying a corner. They were the rulers of their respective areas. And among these Divines, there were individuals who possessed strength that far exceeded the others.","Compared to ordinary Divines, these five people’s cultivation had already entered tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage, which was more than a level stronger than theirs.","These five people occupied a side, and one of them looked to be about thirty or forty years old. His body was strong and looked extremely mighty. He gave off the aura of a conquerer.","Among the tens of thousands of people in the valley, he received the most attention. Many people were puzzled.","“That’s the Fluttering Blooms’ sect master? Tsk, tsk. Forget about the others, but the organizer of this Killing Chu Rally, that Sixth Divine Servant or something, is of unknown origin. Even if the Federation wants to deal with him, there’s nothing they can do. The others are either from the marine folks or experts from Infinite Demon Mountain’s Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom. He’s the only human. Have the Fluttering Blooms given up on their plans to become the master of the Federation?” someone asked in confusion.","There were over ten thousand Innates at the scene. The huge valley was filled to the brim. There were also people on the cliffs. There were experts from all races. Among them, the identities of the Divines who were leading the group could not be hidden from others.","Among the five experts in tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage, only two of them were humans. The mastermind of this killing spree was a handsome middle-aged man with unfathomable strength, known as the Sixth Divine Servant.","In addition, one was an expert from Infinite Demon Mountain’s Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom, one was from the Deep Sea Crocodile tribe, and the last was an expert from the Deep Sea Whale tribe.","The Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom, the Deep Sea Crocodiles, and the Deep Sea Whales all had deep grudges against Chu Yunfan. Moreover, they weren’t of his race, so it was normal for them to come.","However, the Fluttering Blooms represented the Fluttering Blooms. All along, the Fluttering Blooms had been like many other sects in the Holy Land, dedicated to becoming the master of the Federation.","Now that they had appeared at the Killing Chu Rally, they were undoubtedly cutting themselves off from the Federation.","Did they really not care anymore, or did someone give them a promise?","Many people thought to themselves, but no one could see anything from the man’s expressionless face.","While the rally was in full swing, a figure arrived outside the valley. It was like a nuclear bomb had exploded, instantly making the Innates in the outer area of the valley burst into chaos.","“It’s Chu Yunfan! He’s here!”"]},{"number":972,"title":"Chapter 972 Killing Divines Like Chopping Melons and Vegetables","paragraphs":["972 Killing Divines Like Chopping Melons and Vegetables","“What a turnout!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the valley in the distance. Although this valley was indeed very large, there were too many experts here, and all the places that could be used for resting were densely packed. Fortunately, these people were able to walk through the mountains as if they were flat land. Otherwise, there would not be so many people here.","With so many Innates, it was enough for a large-scale battle.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t show the slightest fear in the face of such a formation. He just looked around and saw thousands from the human race, the marine folks, and the demons.","!!","They were also vaguely divided into factions according to their different races.","“What? Chu Yunfan? He actually dared to come? What great courage!”","Chu Yunfan’s arrival immediately caused a commotion. In a short time, the news had spread throughout the entire valley. Many experts swarmed to the entrance of the valley to get a look at him.","“He really dared to come!”","“As expected, it’s really him!”","“Is he gutsy, or is he crazy?!”","No one could understand Chu Yunfan’s thoughts. They were clearly discussing how to kill him, but he didn’t have the slightest intention of hiding. Instead, he chose to go to the tiger’s den despite knowing that there was a tiger in it.","Everyone was stunned. Wasn’t there something wrong with his body? Why did he still dare to come? Was he really here to die?","“Didn’t you want to kill me? Now that I’m here, I’d like to see who can kill me,” Chu Yunfan said in a clear voice. His voice was so loud that it actually spread to the ears of the thousands of people in the valley.","Although these people were all here to participate in the killing of Chu Yunfan, no one dared to look him in the eye.","One man could intimidate an army of thousands.","Suddenly, at this moment, a few figures flew out from the valley and swept toward Chu Yunfan with the powerful pressure of the Divine Abilities Stage.","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you appear here!” One of the figures pointed at Chu Yunfan.","“Didn’t you want to kill me? I’ve delivered myself to your door. However, I’m afraid that you trash can’t kill me,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","“Such great courage!” The Divine’s face was filled with anger. He instantly transformed into a huge bird covered in golden scales. The bird’s wingspan was actually over a hundred meters long, covering the sky and the sun. It was extremely fierce.","The figures around him also transformed. Although they were all Divines, they did not dare to underestimate Chu Yunfan. After all, he had killed Spectral Mantis.","The rest of them also returned to their original forms. One of them turned into a huge pangolin. The pangolin’s ferocious aura was monstrous. From a distance, it looked like a small mountain. It was extremely terrifying.","The other one turned into a huge sea serpent. Its entire body was blue and it was more than a hundred meters long. It was also extremely fierce and its ferocity was monstrous.","The surrounding Innates retreated frantically, not daring to get close. This was a joke. This was a battle between Divines. How could they dare to stay?","In an instant, the huge bird of prey was the first to move. Its figure was like a dark cloud as it pounced toward Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","Everyone only heard a loud noise, and then saw Chu Yunfan suddenly stomping on the ground. His whole body rose up from the ground, and like a cannonball, he pounced toward the huge bird of prey.","Bam!","A huge explosion was heard. Chu Yunfan was like a cannonball, colliding head-on with the bird of prey. The collision caused sparks to fly in all directions.","In mid-air, this vicious bird was actually forced to retreat. It even collided with a small mountain until it was dizzy. Usually, if it crashed directly into a small mountain, it would only shatter the small mountain and there would be no impact on its body.","But now, Chu Yunfan had actually knocked him into a daze.","“How is this possible?”","The bird was dumbstruck.","However, Chu Yunfan was even faster. In the blink of an eye, he grabbed one of the bird’s wings with one hand and tore it off.","Blood and bone fragments flew everywhere.","The bird almost plummeted, but then Chu Yunfan used the counterforce to leap up to the bird’s head and kicked it hard.","Boom!","The bird’s body, which was as big as a small mountain, fell to the ground. A big hole was created in its huge head, and it fell to the ground in confusion.","Before he could react, Chu Yunfan had already landed on his body. He clenched his fist and hit the bird’s head.","Bam!","With a loud sound, the bird’s head instantly exploded, and it died a tragic death at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","The whole place was dead silent. Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan in shock, watching him kill the Divine ferocious bird with just a few punches and kicks.","This was something they did not even dare to think about, especially this Divine Abilities Stage ferocious bird. It was not even in the early stages of the Divine Abilities Stage but had already stepped into the second tier, which was much stronger than Spectral Mantis.","It would be difficult for the Federation to encircle and annihilate a monster of this level even if they dispatched an army. Only experts of the same level could drive it away, and it would be very difficult to kill it. However, he was still easily killed by Chu Yunfan.","Previously, when Chu Yunfan killed Spectral Mantis, many people did not see it with their own eyes, but now they finally saw what it meant to kill a Divine as if he was stepping on an ant.","No one could imagine how terrifying Chu Yunfan would have been if he was at his peak.","While everyone was still immersed in the fact that Chu Yunfan had casually killed a Divine ferocious bird, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He immediately pounced on the pangolin.","He clenched his five fingers into a fist, and the fist intent immediately surged out. Although he had lost his divine power, Chu Yunfan’s punch technique had already penetrated deep into his bones, and that kind of fist intent directly surged out.","Boom!","This punch landed directly on the pangolin’s body, and the pangolin, which was as big as a small mountain, was forced to retreat. The place where Chu Yunfan’s punch landed had all its scales turned into powder, and blood was flying everywhere.","“Rrraggh!”","The pangolin roared again and again, and everyone was dumbfounded. This monster was famous for its strong defense, and even if it was bombarded by all kinds of missiles, it would be very difficult to hurt it. But now, it was actually injured by Chu Yunfan’s pure physical body. How terrifying was he?"]},{"number":973,"title":"Chapter 973 Killing Divines in Succession","paragraphs":["973 Killing Divines in Succession","At this time, many people seemed to understand how terrifying Chu Yunfan’s physical body was, and why he could still fight against Divines and easily kill ordinary Divines even after losing all his internal energy.","What level of physical strength did he have?!","It was simply unimaginable!","The pangolin’s body was famous for its toughness, but compared to Chu Yunfan’s body, it was still nothing.","!!","Chu Yunfan’s punch was like a cannon, directly bombarding the pangolin’s body. The scales that were originally as hard as iron were immediately shattered.","Chu Yunfan moved as quickly as lightning. After the first punch, he threw another one.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","His fists were like a cannon—like a storm—bombarding the pangolin.","The pangolin monster looked as if it had been hit by all kinds of heavy artillery. In just a moment, the scales on its body had collapsed. Its huge body was completely soaked in blood, and it looked extremely miserable.","It kept retreating and roaring, but it couldn’t get rid of Chu Yunfan’s attack. Chu Yunfan’s attack was too terrifying. It would rather go to the human-demon battlefield and fight with the human army than be beaten up like this.","This crazy attack fell directly on its body, and all the bones in its body were broken, making it unable to move. In just a moment, it had been seriously injured and was in an extremely miserable state.","“This is the last punch! Now, die!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and threw a punch, which instantly penetrated the pangolin’s head. The giant pangolin died instantly.","All of this seemed to take a long time to describe, but in fact, it only took a few breaths of time. The pangolin, who had just appeared with monstrous ferocity, had died a tragic death at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","At the same time, the huge sea serpent, which was unable to participate in the battle with the pangolin, suddenly opened its bloody mouth and spat out a shower of venom.","Some of it dripped onto the ground, corroding large holes in it. It was extremely terrifying.","But Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid. He took a step forward and threw out a punch. With just his strong body, the wind created by his punch was able to disperse the venom.","The corrosive venom landed on Chu Yunfan’s fist, but it was useless.","“Petty tricks!”","Chu Yunfan had no fear. With the power of the Imperial Physique, this level was nothing.","Bam!","The momentum of Chu Yunfan’s fist didn’t slow down. His body rose from the ground, and his fist hit the fangs of the huge sea serpent, shattering them.","The Divine sea serpent finally realized that something was wrong. At this time, it wanted to retreat. If this continued, it was afraid that it would die at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","The huge sea serpent turned around and fled into the valley.","“It’s too late to escape now!”","Chu Yunfan grabbed the wing of the bird he had torn off and waved it around like a sword.","Although Chu Yunfan had easily torn off the bird’s wing, the wing was as hard as metal. Each feather was like a long sword, and under Chu Yunfan’s terrifying strength, it stirred up a gust of wind.","Boom!","The huge wing descended from the sky and ruthlessly struck the sea serpent’s head, piercing through it and bringing it to the ground.","The entire ground shook violently and a huge hole was made in it.","Everyone at the scene was shocked and silent.","All of this takes a long time to describe, but in fact, from the moment Chu Yunfan started to attack, he killed three terrifying beasts with his bare hands in just a matter of minutes.","Those were not some Innate monsters. They were Divine monsters. The appearance of any one of them could make a city feel like it was facing a great enemy. But now, Chu Yunfan had easily dispatched them.","Was this really a person who had lost his combat power?","If he had lost his combat strength, then how terrifying was his true peak combat strength? Could it be that some people were right, that these Divine monsters couldn’t even withstand a single move from Chu Yunfan?","At this time, all the Innates began to panic. Whether it was the Innates of the human race, the marine folks, or the demons, all of them began to be at a loss. They were extremely nervous.","Chu Yunfan had slaughtered thousands of Innates before, and it could be said that he was extremely ruthless. He had no concept of mercy. If he wanted to attack, even tens of thousands of people wouldn’t be enough for him to kill.","“I think I finally understand why the Chus and the Tangs only said not to use nuclear weapons. Judging from the combat power that Chu Yunfan has shown, who can defeat him without using nuclear weapons?”","Some people seemed to have understood why the Chus and Tangs seemed to be indifferent and allowed Chu Yunfan to be besieged and killed.","If one didn’t look at the situation objectively and only looked at the results, it could be said that Chu Yunfan was surrounded and killed, but so far, it was all the parties who had surrounded him that had suffered heavy losses.","Thousands of Innates and the loss of a few Divines. Who was the one besieging who?","If they hadn’t confirmed that Chu Yunfan had indeed lost his cultivation, they would have even suspected that this was a trap set by Chu Yunfan, using himself as bait to catch all those who took the bait.","However, this thought only lasted for a moment before it disappeared without a trace. Chu Yunfan’s loss of cultivation was not an act, and this had been confirmed by many parties. And under the circumstances of losing his cultivation, still using himself as bait, that would be really too crazy.","“It’s useless no matter how strong he is. He shouldn’t have come. There are too many experts here. He won’t be able to escape today.”","“That’s right. Even Divines have different levels of strength. He won’t be able to escape death today!”","Many people thought of the masters who came today, and they quickly re-established their confidence, not completely crushed by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about what these Innates were thinking. He went to the bird’s side and directly plucked a feather from its body. This feather was golden, like a sharp golden sword.","Then, Chu Yunfan walked into the valley with the feather sword in his hand.","“Anyone else who wants to kill me, come out and face your death!”"]},{"number":974,"title":"Chapter 974 Who’s the Prey? Chu Yunfan’s Trap!","paragraphs":["974 Who’s the Prey? Chu Yunfan’s Trap!","Chu Yunfan held the feather sword in his hand and walked into the valley, leaving footprints behind him. His footsteps were neither fast nor slow, and his voice was loud and clear, spreading throughout the valley.","The news of him killing three Divine monsters at the entrance of the valley spread throughout the place at an alarming speed.","Even the Divine experts who were sitting there had a look of horror on their faces.","Chu Yunfan’s speed of killing was incredibly fast.","Even those in tier one and two of the Divine Abilities Stage were no match for Chu Yunfan. Who knew what kind of astonishing combat power was hidden in that body that seemed to have lost all its power?","Chu Yunfan slowly walked into the valley, but he was surrounded by more than a dozen figures before he even reached the halfway point. Each of these figures was very powerful, and they were even more terrifying than the three Divine monsters who had stopped Chu Yunfan outside.","At a glance, they were all in tier three of the Divine Abilities Stage, and there were even some in tier four. It was shocking enough for such a lineup to surround and kill a cripple like Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re here, and you still dare to be so arrogant?!” someone angrily shouted.","Chu Yunfan glanced at them and said, “I heard that there are a few more. Aren’t they coming out together?”","“Who do you think you are? Any one of us is enough to kill you!” An ape-like monster covered in long hair stood out and pointed at Chu Yunfan.","Tier three of the Divine Abilities Stage was indeed much stronger than the monsters before.","“You?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He stomped the ground and his body rose from the ground. In the blink of an eye, he rushed toward the ape demon, and the golden feather sword in his hand slashed down.","“You’re looking for death!”","The demonic ape was furious. He was more than four meters tall, about the size of two or three Chu Yunfans. Chu Yunfan dared to launch a surprise attack first. He was so angry that his big hand, which was like a futon, instantly turned into a huge fist and smashed toward Chu Yunfan.","Clang!","In an instant, the sound of metal clashing could be heard. Then, everyone saw the golden feather sword in Chu Yunfan’s hand cut off the ape demon’s arm.","Whatever mana or energy force on the ape demon’s arm could not stop the feather sword from advancing. As soon as it was pointed out, all the ape demon’s mana collapsed.","Spurt!","Blood spurted out, and the huge arm fell to the ground, causing the ground to shake.","“Roar!”","The ape demon let out a blood-curdling screech and retreated. It didn’t dare to continue fighting Chu Yunfan, but it was already too late.","Chu Yunfan turned his hand around and swung his sword. The speed of the sword was extremely fast, and it swept across the ape demon’s neck.","Slash!","Blood spurted out, and the ape demon helplessly covered its neck with its hands. However, it was unable to stop the blood from spurting out, and its huge head slid off its neck. It had actually been beheaded by Chu Yunfan’s sword.","Although Divines were powerful, this sword was also deadly.","Chu Yunfan descended from the sky. Blood dripped from the tip of the feather sword in his hand.","“If you want to kill me, I’m afraid that you guys are not enough.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly, his face showing a hint of ridicule.","The other Divines were also shocked by Chu Yunfan’s sudden outburst.","When the Innates saw this scene, the doubts in their hearts deepened. Had Chu Yunfan really lose his power?","“Get him! He’s just an arrow at the end of its flight. I don’t believe that he can force himself much further. As long as we’re careful, he will only walk down the path of death!” one of the Divines shouted, and then he flew into the air. Chu Yunfan’s sudden outburst made him feel a little scared, but fortunately, Chu Yunfan seemed to have lost the ability to fly.","The other Divines also flew up into the air one after another, keeping a safe distance from Chu Yunfan. Then, they all made their moves. Those monsters and marine folks transformed into their original forms and opened their bloody jaws.","Endless divine power boiled, turning into energy cannons that blasted toward Chu Yunfan.","There were also a few human Divine who slashed out the brilliance of martial Dao, using all kinds of means to annihilate Chu Yunfan.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The place where Chu Yunfan was standing was instantly drowned by the storm of attacks.","All sorts of terrifying attacks caused the ground to shake violently, and for a moment, sand and dust flew in all directions. The Innates could no longer see the situation in that area clearly. They could only feel the ground shaking as if it had been bombarded by countless missiles.","At this moment, when everyone thought that Chu Yunfan was going to die, a terrifying aura surged out of the storm’s eye. It broke through the air waves that filled the sky and a figure flew out.","Everyone took a closer look and saw that it was Chu Yunfan who had soared into the sky. Endless divine power rippled on the surface of his body, and they were overflowing with the power of thunder.","Everyone was stunned and dumbfounded. What were they looking at?","They saw Chu Yunfan’s boiling inner energy, which was terrifyingly thick.","Compared to Chu Yunfan’s current display of power, the Divines attacking him simply paled in comparison. It was like a small stream meeting a river or a lake.","No one could imagine how a person could contain so much divine power in their body.","“You didn’t lose your power?” one of the Divines said in disbelief.","Everyone reacted at once. Who said that Chu Yunfan had lost his cultivation? Come out. I won’t beat them to death.","The smart ones realized that this was a trap.","Everyone thought that they had set up a trap for Chu Yunfan and even planned to kill him. But in fact, this had been a trap set up by Chu Yunfan from the beginning.","From the beginning, it was too strange. Chu Yunfan’s importance to the Federation, the Chus, and the Tangs was beyond doubt, but the Chus, the Tangs, and even the Federation didn’t have any reaction. They only issued a statement to disallow the use of nuclear bombs.","They thought the reason Chu Yunfan was unable to find any reinforcements was because they had sent people to stop the Chu Great Ancestor and the others, but the truth was, all of it was just an illusion.","In fact, Chu Yunfan had set up this trap, waiting for them to jump out.","Whoever stuck out their necks would be crushed to death.","From the beginning, this was a trap. They didn’t even realize that it was a trap and that they had stepped into it.","So, this was the truth."]},{"number":975,"title":"Chapter 975 Massacre — Is This His Peak?","paragraphs":["975 Massacre — Is This His Peak?","There were too many traces to follow and there were many abnormal factors. However, they had clearly been blinded by the one-trillion bounty.","Even if they discovered something amiss, no one wanted to stop. A bounty of over a trillion was too shocking. The Divines went completely crazy.","By the time they realized their mistake, it was already too late.","“That’s right. Otherwise, how could I have tricked you?” Chu Yunfan looked at the people in the valley. They were all people who wanted him dead or were the unstable factors within the Federation.","!!","If he had not shown weakness, these people would not have dared to stick out their necks and would have continued to hide.","Using oneself as bait to lure out those who didn’t know their place was a well-tested tactic. It was a very simple strategy, but very few could resist such a temptation.","The one-trillion bounty had helped Chu Yunfan a lot. If it weren’t for it, many wouldn’t have been so crazy. After all, whether it was the Chus, the Tangs, or the Federation Government, they were all forces that no ordinary people could ignore.","But for the sake of a trillion, everything could be thrown away.","Chu Yunfan felt the explosive power surge through his body. Without the suppression from his cultivation, the thunder energy from the thunder sigil poured out at an even more astonishing rate.","He didn’t have much time left.","‘This is...’ one of the Divines thought to himself as his eyes flashed with a ferocious look.","“Let’s fight it out with him. I don’t believe that he can deal with so many of us by himself!”","These Divines did not believe Chu Yunfan’s previous legends.","The Innates held their breath. They too realized that they had been fooled.","It was at this moment that Chu Yunfan finally revealed his true strength.","Swish!","Chu Yunfan instantly disappeared from where he stood and reappeared in front of a huge Divine monster. The feather sword in his hand slashed down, and under the support of his divine power, a terrible sword light burst out, slashing down at the monster in the Divine.","Swoosh!","All of the monster’s defenses were instantly shattered. It was unable to defend itself against Chu Yunfan and he ended its life with a simple sword strike.","At this moment, the Innates were completely speechless. They thought that Chu Yunfan’s killing of the three Divine monsters was already his limit, but now they realized that it was just child’s play.","This monster had entered tier three of the Divine Abilities Stage, but in front of Chu Yunfan, it was defeated in a single attack.","After killing a Divine with one strike, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. His figure flickered, and he once again pounced on another Divine monster.","Slash!","Slice!","Shinngg!","The golden sword light continued to sweep across the sky, almost tearing a huge crack in the world.","Wherever the golden sword light passed, the Divines were unable to withstand it. Whether it was the humans, the marine folks, or the demons, there was no difference.","In a short time, these Divines were all dead, leaving only corpses on the ground.","“Is this Chu Yunfan’s true peak?!” someone exclaimed.","“This is absolutely terrifying. No wonder he dared to attend the rally alone. This strength is indeed not something that ordinary people can compare to!”","“This is all a trap! A huge trap!”","The Innates were in an uproar. Everyone was dumbfounded as they stared at Chu Yunfan, who was slowly walking into the deepest part of the valley like a god of war—into the deepest part of the valley were the five top-tier experts who had presided over the Killing Chu Rally.","Any one of these experts was known as top-notch existences—existences that had already entered tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage. Any one of them was more terrifying than all the Divines from before added together.","But these five people also had shocked expressions on their faces. They had not expected Chu Yunfan to be able to kill the Divines who had gone to intercept him so easily.","They hadn’t even the time to catch their breath.","“Chu Yunfan, I didn’t expect this to be a trap that you’ve set up.” A middle-aged man stood up and looked at Chu Yunfan with a serious expression. “We’ve all been tricked by you.”","“That’s right. That’s exactly the case,” Chu Yunfan said, “If it wasn’t for this, I wouldn’t have known that there were so many people who wanted to kill me.","Chu Yunfan grinned. Although he looked extremely terrifying after he regained his strength, none of the five people were afraid. There was fear of regret on their faces.","They were different from any of the Divines earlier. They surrounded him silently and without a word.","“It’s no use. You can’t hold out for long in this state, can you? Do you think we can’t tell? You’re losing control of your power.”","At this moment, Fluttering Blooms’ sect leader, who had been holding back for a long time, looked at Chu Yunfan with eyes filled with killing intent.","The Fluttering Blooms was the largest sect in the Holy Land, and Chu Yunfan had killed many of their experts, causing them to suffer a great loss. It had even alerted him—the sect leader.","He had personally come from the Holy Land to kill Chu Yunfan.","They didn’t care if it led to a backlash from the Federation. Chu Yunfan was too dangerous, especially so for Fluttering Blooms. They had to kill him no matter what.","These people were different from ordinary Divines. They could see that behind his seemingly terrifying power, it was a power that was on the verge of losing control.","The other Divines had the same expression on their faces. They could also see it.","“That’s right. My tribe’s investigation is not wrong. There is indeed a problem with your body. You’re suffering from the backlash of the Thunder God Scepter. It’s just that you hid it well and managed to deceive everyone,” a Deep Sea Crocodile said.","“You won’t be able to escape today. No one can save you!” a Deep Sea Whale said. The aura on his body was also tyrannical.","“Looks like this is everyone. Then we can start. You’re right, I’m not in my best condition right now, so I have to hurry.”","Chu Yunfan sneered and grabbed at the air. A bronze long bow without a bowstring appeared in his hand. The cracks on the bow were a ghastly sight."]},{"number":976,"title":"Chapter 976 The Final Battle!","paragraphs":["976 The Final Battle!","There were even traces of blood in the cracks. After countless years, the blood still carried unimaginable fluctuations, which made people’s hearts race.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on the bow, and they understood that this was Chu Yunfan’s true trump card. But although it looked scary, wasn’t it still a broken bow?","Chu Yunfan had only used this bow a few times and many still didn’t know about the Sun Shooter’s existence. But after today, this couldn’t be concealed anymore.","In the sky, countless pairs of eyes saw the bow through the satellites above.","But this didn’t matter to Chu Yunfan. The power of the Sun Shooter didn’t lie in sneak attacks. Even if others knew of the Sun Shooter’s existence, if they couldn’t defend against it, that would be the end for them.","Chu Yunfan’s divine power poured into the bow and countless rays of divine power instantly began to shine from it.","“Sh*t!”","The faces of the five expert fell. They had not felt anything before, but now Chu Yunfan was emitting an extremely dangerous aura. To be more precise, it was the bow in his hand that had an aura that surprised them.","“To die under this bow is considered to have died a worthy death!” Chu Yunfan thundered.","This bow had killed countless powerful enemies during the Ancient Zenith Civilization. Back then, these people would not even be qualified to be shot to death by the Sun Shooter.","Countless divine powers boiled and turned into a golden crow. The crow swept out and hurtled out of the bow. It was extremely fast.","It flew toward the Deep Sea Crocodile. Against this one arrow, the Deep Sea Crocodile transformed into his original form and tried to use the power of his original body to resist.","However, it was of no use.","Boom!","The Deep Sea Crocodile, who was in tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage, experienced what the Monster Cult sect leader had felt before. At that time, Chu Yunfan’s power was far inferior to what it was now.","His power then had already been shocking them, let alone now.","Boom!","The Deep Sea Crocodile exploded in mid-air and turned into a blood mist that filled the sky. He burst apart and instantly died.","After killing the Deep Sea Crocodile with one arrow, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He gathered all the inner power in his body and then condensed it, shooting out another arrow.","Bam!","The Deep Sea Whale didn’t even have time to react before he was hit. There was no difference between him and the Deep Sea Crocodile. The arrow shot him in mid-air and he exploded.","“Run!”","At this time, no matter how slow their reactions were, the remaining three experts had already reacted. They were no longer as confident and calm as before. Chu Yunfan had killed one of them with each of his arrow. This terrifying efficiency made their hearts beat wildly.","“Trying to run? Will you be able to get away in time?” Chu Yunfan drew the bow again. Countless divine power gathered into it, turning into a huge golden crow and shooting out.","Bam!","The demon from the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom didn’t even have the time to escape or make a move before he exploded in mid-air, turning into a mist of blood.","Chu Yunfan paused for a moment. These three arrows had consumed much of his internal energy, which caused the thunder energy in his body to overflow even more.","He took a deep breath and drew the bow in his hand once again. At the same time, he poured all the thunder energy surging through his body into the Sun Shooter.","A golden crow formed on the Sun Shooter, and it was surrounded by thunder energy.","Swish!","The golden crow flapped its wings and gave a long screech. In the blink of an eye, it swept across the vast sky and struck the body of Fluttering Blooms’ sect master.","Boom!","The sect master let out a blood-curdling screech as his body exploded.","He exploded in mid-air and died instantly.","At this time, Chu Yunfan had already killed four tier-six Divines in a matter of minutes. His ferocity stunned everyone. Who wouldn’t be shocked by such a terrifying power?","Not only the Innates present, but the higher-ups of the various forces who were watching the battle through the satellites in the sky were completely dumbfounded.","No one had expected Chu Yunfan to burst out with such combat power at this point.","This time, they believed that Chu Yunfan had indeed set a trap for them. Everything was set and was just waiting for them to jump in. It was laughable that they were so confident before that they could kill him.","In fact, to get a slice of the one trillion, they had fought more than once.","Now that they thought about it, it was really scary.","“How could this be? Why is he so strong?!”","“This is impossible! I don’t believe it!”","“Hurry, hurry! Withdraw all the arrangements against Chu Yunfan!”","A higher-up quickly said. Chu Yunfan seemed to be unstoppable. If he knew that they were targeting him, with his vengeful personality, they would probably not have a good end.","At this moment, they no longer had any thoughts of reaping any rewards. All their previous thoughts had been cut short. It would simply be courting death.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know what those big forces were doing. He just took a step forward, and the thunder wings on his back spread out. He caught up with the Sixth Divine Servant in one step and stopped him.","“You’re the Sixth Divine Servant? I previously killed the Seventh Divine Servant. It seems that he wasn’t working alone, but part of an organization. Are you interested in telling me what kind of organization it is?” Chu Yunfan asked at he looked at the Sixth Divine Servant.","He had already sensed that these two people with the title of “divine servant” belonged to an extremely powerful organization.","The Seventh Divine Servant was already above the Divine Abilities Stage, and the Sixth Divine Servant was at tier six. Then, how powerful would the fifth, fourth, third, second, and first divine servants be?","If they were the servants, then were their masters gods?","Chu Yunfan didn’t know who this god was, but to be able to make a Divine bow down to them, that person was obviously no ordinary person.","“You don’t want to know. That’s a force you can’t afford to offend. You won’t have a good ending if you offend us,” the Sixth Divine Servant said coldly as he gazed at Chu Yunfan.","“You’re so stubborn.” Chu Yunfan knew that he would not be able to get any more information from him.","“In that case, you can go ahead and die!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","...","The Sixth Divine Servant reacted quickly. He immediately crushed a scroll, and a teleportation gate appeared out of thin air. He tried to escape.","However, Chu Yunfan would not let him.","Boom!","The Sixth Divine Servant let out a blood-curdling screech as his entire body crumbled apart. He didn’t even have time to escape to the other side of the portal before he died."]},{"number":977,"title":"Chapter 977 Endings With a Nuclear Bomb, Ten Thousand People Vaporized","paragraphs":["977 Endings With a Nuclear Bomb, Ten Thousand People Vaporized","The Sixth Divine Servant died in Chu Yunfan’s hands in the blink of an eye. The power of the Sun Shooter was not something he could resist.","With just one arrow, the Sixth Divine Servant exploded.","After Chu Yunfan shot this arrow, he used up most of his energy. The thunder power inside him could no longer be suppressed and began to wreak havoc.","A burning smell came from his body, which was caused by the electricity.","!!","The scene was dead silent.","“Impossible! He actually hid his power so deeply!”","“I don’t believe it either. Chu Yunfan is too strong!”","“Quick! Run!”","At this time, some Innates realized that with Chu Yunfan’s strength, killing them would be as easy as blowing off dust. However, many people’s eyes suddenly lit up, because they realized that the energy in his body was already overflowing uncontrollably.","Thinking back to the words of the Sixth Divine Servant, how could they not understand that Chu Yunfan must have suffered a backlash from the Thunder God Scepter?","Just now, he had killed a few Divines and had used up all his energy. Now, he was at his weakest.","Many started seeing red. Even now, they still didn’t want to give up on the bounty.","“Kill him! He’s at his weakest right now! I don’t believe he can stop so many of us!”","“That’s right! We have to fight! Are we going to just give up?!”","One of the Innates suddenly shouted, as if he was trying to free these Innates from the horror that Chu Yunfan had created before them.","With bloodshot eyes, over ten thousand Innates pounced on Chu Yunfan.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan merely sneered at them, and then released the thunder power which was no longer suppressed from his body. It turned the nearby area into a world of thunder, and those Innates who rushed in were electrocuted to death while screaming in pain.","Chu Yunfan was extremely fast. In a flash, he had already collected all the corpses of the Divines he had killed earlier into the Mountain River Diagram.","He was so fast that he gave the Innates no time to react.","After that, he entered the Mountain River Diagram too.","“Where is he?” Everyone watched as the thunder world disappeared along with Chu Yunfan, and they looked at each other in confusion.","Suddenly, a missile flew across the sky with a long flame tail behind it. All of the Innates instantly felt an extreme sense of danger.","They watched as the missile fell.","Boom!","A huge mushroom cloud rose up and flooded the entire valley.","The bright light instantly blocked everyone’s vision, and the entire ground shook violently.","After a long time, the mushroom cloud dispersed. The valley had been razed to the ground, leaving behind only crystallized ground. Because it was controlled, the range of the nuclear bomb was not very large, but its power was beyond doubt.","Tens of thousands of Innates were instantly blasted to death and evaporated. Not a single one of them was left.","In the face of a nuclear bomb, tens of thousands of Innates were nothing. This was the ultimate weapon in the hands of the Federation. Even though they were at a disadvantage in terms of the number of experts, they could still compete with Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks using this fundamental reliance.","“A nuclear bomb! They actually used a nuclear bomb!”","At this moment, all the leaders of the major forces who were paying attention to this scene were watching this scene through the satellites.","Everyone was dumbfounded. This might be the most glorious result of using a nuclear bomb in recent years. Even on the human-demon battlefront, it was impossible for so many Innates to stand so close together and allow people to use nuclear bombs to blow them up.","Unless they were completely crazy.","This was the place where over thousands of Innates had filled the valley because of the Killing Chu Rally. But now, in the blink of an eye, all the Innates of different races were annihilated. Under the nuclear bomb, whether they were at the first-level Innate or a peak Innate, there was no difference.","Moreover, they were hit head-on. The entire valley was razed to the ground, let alone these Innates.","The leaders of the major forces were in shock. There was no need to investigate the origin of this nuclear bomb because there were many forces that had them. However, the ones with the motive to attack were none other than the Chus, the Tangs, and the Federation Government.","Regardless of who had made the move, this shocking result had already happened. Over ten thousand Innates had been annihilated in one go. Most of the underground forces had collapsed along with the elimination of these Innates.","In addition, many forces suffered significant losses on the surface.","Fortunately, thousands of people may seem like a lot, but if they were distributed among those forces, each force may only have lost a few to a dozen people. Although the loss was great, it was not a serious injury.","“This was a trap set up by Chu Yunfan. He’s really bold.”","The leader of one of the forces took a long time to come back to his senses. He was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s amazing work.","He wasn’t just out to kill those Divines. He didn’t even let those Innates go.","They could only be angry and had no way to vent their anger.","After all, these people had come to participate in the Killing Chu Rally in an attempt to kill Chu Yunfan, so how could they not allow him to retaliate?","They never thought that Chu Yunfan’s goal had never been as simple as escaping from pursuit. He didn’t want to just seriously injure them, but to capture them all in one fell swoop.","“What a big move! What a ruthless heart!”","“Thousands of people were annihilated without even blinking an eye. We’ve underestimated his courage.”","“Who can deal with such a person?”","The higher-ups quickly issued orders to cancel all operations targeting Chu Yunfan.","Before he could figure out the details, all operations against him had to be canceled.","What a joke. After being tricked once, were they going to let him continue?","Inside the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan was sitting cross-legged, recovering his strength and forcefully suppressing the thunder sigil. He had prepared the nuclear bomb a long time ago, just to end the battle.","There were thousands of people. Even if he could defeat them, he wouldn’t be able to kill them all. It was faster to deal with them with technological weapons.","Beside him, Ebony Dragon King was flabbergasted. From the moment he knew about this plan, he never thought that it would go so smoothly. The instant annihilation of thousands made him truly understand that Chu Yunfan would never show any mercy to his enemies.","...","He was really lucky to have survived back then."]},{"number":978,"title":"Chapter 978 The Whole World Was Shocked and the Waves Were Endless","paragraphs":["978 The Whole World Was Shocked and the Waves Were Endless","What was called cruel and merciless? This was cruel and merciless.","Tens of thousands of people evaporated without even blinking.","However, for Chu Yunfan, this was a normal thing because he couldn’t accommodate these people. Since they came to kill him, they should be prepared to be killed by him.","Tens of thousands of people had been wiped out in one go. The underground forces of the Federation would probably suffer great losses and heavy casualties. Although there were still top experts and low-level experts below the Innate Stage, Inmates were the backbone of any force. Maybe even their top experts.","Now that they had lost so many in one go. It was a heavy blow to many underground forces as well as many forces on the surface.","Perhaps this time, Chu Yunfan would really become an existence that countless people in the underground world would hate to the bone.","Chu Yunfan felt that if he could, he would eradicate the underground world. It was a world full of filth, and who knew how much darkness it bred?","To the Federation, it was a huge malignant tumor that constantly threatened the safety of the Federation.","Although the Federation usually suppressed them and the underground forces didn’t dare to act rashly, as long as there were enough benefits, there was nothing they didn’t dare to do. It could be said that they were extremely daring.","However, he also knew that it was impossible to completely eradicate them. After all, as long as there were people who wanted to use this channel, as long as there were people who needed the underworld to deal with some unspeakable things, then even if the underworld was eradicated, it would quickly be revived.","However, this incident was enough to teach them a painful lesson.","In the depths of the Tang ancestral home, Tang Siyu breathed a sigh of relief when she saw that Chu Yunfan was finally fine. The nuclear bomb had been launched by the Tangs. This was what Chu Yunfan had discussed with her before.","This plan was very risky. She didn’t agree with it at first, but Chu Yunfan had already made up his mind, so she could only cooperate with him.","“He actually succeeded!”","In a military base of the Federation Army, Zhu Buping said this in slight disbelief as he looked at the images transmitted back from the satellites.","In the end, Chu Yunfan succeeded.","“A group of rats has finally been cleared out from the gutters!”","In the depths of the Chu ancestral home, the Chu Great Ancestor and Chu Haoyue looked at each other and heaved a sigh of relief.","They all knew that after today, the underground world would probably be dormant for a long time. They had been ruthlessly scammed by Chu Yunfan, and it was enough for them to engrave this incident in their hearts for many years.","At the same time, the entire Internet was in an uproar because of the Killing Chu Rally.","Ever since the existence of the rally was known, all sorts of news about it had spread throughout the Internet.","Whether it was Chu Yunfan, who was the number one expert of the Federation, or the huge one-trillion bounty, or the countless Innates and Divines, it was a terrifying lineup that was enough to launch a large-scale battle.","It was all because of Chu Yunfan, who had stirred up the world and attracted everyone’s attention.","People were constantly keeping up-to-date about the rally. In this era, all kinds of information were widespread. It was impossible to hide, especially when more than ten thousand Innates arrived one after another. Everyone was shocked when they saw the dense number of powerful experts filling the sky.","Many of Chu Yunfan’s supporters were especially worried.","However, the entire situation was full of twists and turns.","While everyone was paying attention to the rally, Chu Yunfan unexpectedly appeared. Many people on the Internet were worried about him.","This rally was clearly targeting Chu Yunfan, yet he still dared to go.","What shocked everyone further was that Chu Yunfan had killed many Divines in the rally. Under the influence of some people, how he killed those Divines was almost simultaneously broadcasted on the Internet.","In particular, many people wanted to let everyone see Chu Yunfan being killed. Who would have thought that they would instead see him slaughtering others?","In particular, Chu Yunfan’s invincible image whilst holding the Sun Shooter was deeply rooted in people’s minds. At this point, there was no doubt that he was the number one master of the Federation.","Many even began to think that even when the president was still alive, he might not have been as powerful as Chu Yunfan.","In a short time, Chu Yunfan gained countless supporters on the Internet. However, what really made everyone go into an uproar was that after he killed the Divines, he ordered people to send out a nuclear bomb and annihilate tens of thousands of Innates in one go.","The scene of thousands of experts being vaporized was recorded and posted on the Internet. Although the battles on the human-demon battlefield were far more brutal than this, most people had never seen such a battle.","Not to mention that he had destroyed over ten thousand Innates in an instant. This was no ordinary feat.","Although more than half of them were demons and marine folks, it was still enough to cause a great uproar.","Soon, a voice could be heard from the Internet. Chu Yunfan had killed too many people. He had killed over ten thousand Innates. He was a homicidal maniac.","In particular, there were thousands of human experts among them. This was simply massacring their own kind and damaging the strength of the entire human race.","This argument was pushed by some people with ulterior motives, but it soon attracted countless people’s ridicule.","Many people pointed out, “These people came to participate in the killing of Chu Yunfan. They were originally here to kill him. Are they the only ones allowed to kill? Is he not allowed to kill them?”","It was just that Chu Yunfan’s act of killing over ten thousand people in one breath was too shocking.","Among these thousands of human experts, more than half of them belonged to underground forces. The existence of these people itself was a factor of instability for the Federation. Their death was actually a good thing for the Federation.","In fact, even the forces these eliminated Innates didn’t dare to stand out and accuse Chu Yunfan. After all, the so-called Killing Chu Rally was not glorious in itself, and this kind of behavior was strongly opposed by the Federation.","At this time, they were all tucking their tails between their legs for fear of being targeted by the Federation. How would they dare to come out and cause trouble? They could only add fuel to the fire in the dark but did not dare to show their faces.","As for the demons and the marine folks, they had suffered heavy casualties, but not many people cared about it. After all, they were mortal enemies, and it would be better if they all died.","The waves were expanding and spreading, shocking the entire Federation."]},{"number":979,"title":"Chapter 979 With the Phoenix Grass in Hand, a Breakthrough Was Imminent","paragraphs":["979 With the Phoenix Grass in Hand, a Breakthrough Was Imminent","The entire Federation was shocked!","Over ten thousand Innates were instantly annihilated, and this became the hottest topic on the Internet.","To ordinary people, the result of this battle shocked them.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was once again confirmed, and he gained countless more supporters, especially because he was so young. For many young people, Chu Yunfan was their true ally.","However, to the major forces, there was a bone-chilling coldness that rose from the soles of their feet to the top of their heads.","That was how ruthless Chu Yunfan was when he dealt with the matter. He didn’t arrest or interrogate tens of thousands of people but just annihilated them.","Not to mention the Divines. So many Divines were killed by him in such a way. Yet, no one dared to stand out and say anything.","But soon, these forces didn’t have the time to pay attention to his whereabouts because the government, which had been patient for a long time, finally revealed its fangs.","Many forces thought that they had been very secretive, and no one had noticed that they were targeting Chu Yunfan. They didn’t know that this matter had been under the control of the Federation from the very beginning.","In particular, many of the forces that had extended their hands were directly confronted by the Federation.","Each of these forces had suffered heavy losses during the rally, and the funds they had invested had been seized. This was especially so when the headquarters of the underground world was sealed off by the Federation Army, with Zhu Buping personally leading the troops.","The one-trillion bounty jointly invested by the various forces didn’t go away. It all fell into the hands of the Federation Government. So much money could be said to have made the Federation Army rich overnight.","After handing over the bounty, the underground world was not wiped out. After all, after so many experts were killed by the nuclear bomb, the underground world suffered heavy losses and was unable to fight against the Federation. They were already powerless against the Federation, to begin with, let alone now.","The Federation didn’t have any intention of taking advantage of the situation. After all, even if the underground world was eradicated, it would soon rise again. Therefore, the Federation only monitored it and didn’t completely eradicate it.","As for the other forces, including those inside and outside the Federation, all those who participated in the pursuit of Chu Yunfan had to pay the price one way or another.","The Federation Government uprooted those who were deeply involved and confiscated all their assets. As for those who only had a small hand in the matter, they were fined a large portion of their assets, resulting in a huge loss.","There were too many forces involved this time. Even with the Federation Government’s strength, it was impossible to uproot all of them. Otherwise, the Federation would be in complete chaos and be in turmoil.","But even so, it was enough. The Federation Government and the Federation Army had at least reaped a few trillion in wealth. It was not an exaggeration to say that they became rich overnight.","This was also why the Federation Government and the Federation Army were willing to cooperate with Chu Yunfan’s actions. Without sufficient benefits, even the Federation Government and the Federation Army were not willing to easily make enemies with so many forces.","Of course, as the main initiator, the Chus, the Tangs, and Special Ops also received numerous benefits, but most of them were swallowed by the Federation Government and the Federation Army.","As the entire clean-up operation was controlled to a relatively small area, the normal citizens did not feel much. Everything was going on without a hitch.","On the Internet, all kinds of things about Chu Yunfan and the Killing Chu Rally continued to ferment.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan was still walking outside the Federation’s territory—in the Volcanic Belt of the Outskirt Territories, continuing to look for Phoenix Grass.","But now, no one dared to casually make a move on him. In fact, no one even dared to covet him. The bounty had already been taken away by the Federation Government, so there was no benefit to it.","The most important thing was that although he still looked sickly as if he was going to die soon, no one was willing to be fooled this time.","Perhaps Chu Yunfan had really lost all of his power this time, but it was clear that his power was not all of his combat strength.","Moreover, no one knew if this was another trap he had set up. Everyone was scared of him, and in many people’s minds, Chu Yunfan wasn’t cruel, but a madman.","There was no objection to him using himself as bait, and he had indeed suffered the backlash from the Thunder God Scepter. Although he couldn’t be said to have lost all his cultivation, it had already reached a very serious stage.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan still dared to use himself as bait. If not for that, he would not have attracted so many people to come and form a rally.","If he wasn’t careful, he could be killed by doing this, but he still did it. If he wasn’t a madman, then what was he?","In many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan was a madman that could not be provoked.","On the seventh day after the Killing Chu Rally, a figure flew past the edge of a huge volcano. He stepped directly on the lava, but it didn’t even cause a ripple.","On the cliff of the volcano, a vermillion plant stood proudly. It was about the size of a palm and looked like a fire phoenix that could flap its wings and fly high into the sky.","It was so vivid that it looked as if it would soar into the sky in the next moment and become a real phoenix.","Around this plant, there was a ring of flames that had transformed into a flame barrier to protect it.","In a few flashes, the figure arrived beside the plant. He stretched out his hand and grabbed the fiery red plant. The fire barrier was instantly torn apart and shattered.","“I’ve finally got the Phoenix Grass!” Chu Yunfan revealed a smile.","After searching for such a long time, he finally found the Phoenix Grass. This herb was still a little bit away from fully maturing.","Most people could only send people to guard the herb and wait until it was completely mature before picking it because the growth environment of the Phoenix Grass was harsh. This was the meaning of the existence of the medicine garden.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t have that trouble because there was a precious herb mountain in the Mountain River Diagram. It could automatically simulate the growth environment of medicinal herbs, and any medicinal herb could grow in that mountain.","Once he found the Phoenix Grass, it wouldn’t be long before he could solve the problem of the overflowing energy from the thunder sigil, and it wouldn’t be long before he broke through to tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage.","At that time, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength would also have a huge leap forward.","After accepting the Phoenix Grass, Chu Yunfan didn’t stay any longer. He called out to Ebony Dragon King, got on his back, and rushed in the direction of Kunlun City."]},{"number":980,"title":"Chapter 980 Breakthrough, Tier Four of the Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["980 Breakthrough, Tier Four of the Divine Abilities Stage","After receiving Chu Yunfan’s message, the whole of Special Ops gathered and waited.","The Phoenix Rebirth Pill’s main ingredient was the Phoenix Grass, and the other medicinal herbs had also been found one by one during this period. Now, they only had to wait for Chu Yunfan to return. After that, they could start making the pill.","However, Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry. He still wanted to wait for the Phoenix Grass to mature and harvest its seeds before picking it.","On the herb mountain inside the Mountain River Diagram, the area where the Phoenix Grass was planted had automatically formed an environment with boiling lava. Only in such an environment could the Phoenix Grass grow.","Most importantly, as long as there was enough Spirit Energy, the mountain could also accelerate the growth of medicinal herbs. The more Spirit Energy there was, the faster the growth.","In the past, the purchase of spirit stones was a huge expense for Chu Yunfan, but it was different now. As the head of Special Ops, he could mobilize a large number of resources, so it was easier for him to cultivate.","The huge Ebony Dragon King flew over Special Ops. At this time, the higher-ups of Special Ops had already received the news. Under the leadership of the deputy chief, Huo Ruonan, they had been waiting here since early in the morning.","“Chief Chu!”","When Huo Ruonan and the others saw Chu Yunfan, they heaved a sigh of relief. During this period, Chu Yunfan had been out alone. He had lost all of his cultivation, and he had also gone to the Killing Chu Rally.","There had been many twists and turns. Even though he had won in the end, Special Ops was still on tenterhooks.","“Is everything ready?” Chu Yunfan jumped down from Ebony Dragon King’s back and asked directly.","“Everything’s been prepared. It’s all in Alchemy Lab One,” Huo Ruonan said.","“Good. I’ll be going into seclusion for some time. You’ll be in charge. Don’t disturb me unless it’s necessary.”","Chu Yunfan spoke as he walked. Soon, they arrived at Alchemy Lab One deep underground in Special Ops.","The lab was a few hundred square meters in size, and it was filled with all kinds of medicinal herbs. Special Ops had collected more than one set of medicinal herbs as if they were afraid that Chu Yunfan would fail.","In the middle of the lab, there was a huge alchemical furnace. This was an alchemy furnace that was outfitted with the latest modern technology and was also the furnace that produced the best effect so far.","“Another thing. Please help me collect a million low-grade spirit stones,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Understood,” Huo Ruonan said, then went out to prepare.","After Huo Ruonan left, Chu Yunfan sent word to his family and friends. The news of his safe return made them feel at ease. Then, he began to make the Phoenix Rebirth Pill in seclusion.","With an unlimited supply of spirit stones, the Phoenix Grass, which had not yet ripened, matured in just three days under the urging of the herb mountain.","After harvesting the seeds, Chu Yunfan immediately began to make the pill.","The Phoenix Rebirth Pill was different from ordinary medicinal pills. It was a true genuine-quality medicinal pill. Even though he had the Alchemy Emperor’s complete memories, Chu Yunfan still didn’t dare to treat it casually.","Because they had been attacked once before, Special Ops was very serious this time.","But luckily, it seemed like after having been tricked once, no one dared to find trouble with Chu Yunfan anymore. For three days and three nights, no one dared to find trouble with him until he came out of seclusion.","In the center of the huge lab, the lid of the furnace was opened, and a flame suddenly soared into the sky. The radiance of the pill vaguely transformed into a phoenix that spread its wings and flew up as if it was about to turn into a real living creature.","After a long time, the glow of the medicinal herbs dissipated, finally revealing the true body of the Phoenix Rebirth Pill.","“It’s finally done.” Chu Yunfan smiled slightly. He had successfully made the Phoenix Rebirth Pill.","Chu Yunfan took out the pill from the furnace and went into the practice room next door. He sat down with his legs crossed and consumed the pill. Immediately, it turned into a huge medicinal power and began to flow into Chu Yunfan’s limbs and bones.","Chu Yunfan’s body was undergoing a shocking transformation. Under the original thunder energy, a ball of fire was surging, and this ball of fire turned into a fire phoenix.","At the same time, the thunder energy from the thunder sigil that was originally surging through Chu Yunfan’s body was absorbed by the fire phoenix.","This fire Phoenix was undergoing a rebirth in Chu Yunfan’s body, and it needed to absorb a huge amount of energy to complete this transformation.","The medicinal power of the Phoenix Rebirth Pill, Chu Yunfan’s own cultivation, and the surging energy from the thunder sigil all began to mix together. This majestic energy was boiling inside his body as if it was the beginning of the world.","All kinds of terrifying energy were about to make him explode.","Destruction was the main melody in Chu Yunfan’s body at the moment.","He gritted his teeth and persevered. After the destruction, there would be new life, and the rebirth of the phoenix was to seek life in death.","Finally, after an unknown amount of time, the three energies in his body began to fuse into one. Chu Yunfan’s injuries healed, and he had begun to truly enter the stage of rebirth.","There was a time when Chu Yunfan’s life force was at its weakest. However, as time passed, his life force continued to rise.","Finally, after a whole month of cultivation without any rest, the energy in Chu Yunfan’s body was finally completely digested and absorbed. During this process of rebirth, his power had been pushed from the beginning of tier three of the Divine Abilities Stage to the peak.","Chu Yunfan didn’t let go of this opportunity. In one go, he charged toward tier four.","In the earlier process of rebirth, the barrier of tier four was already riddled with holes, and now, it could not stop Chu Yunfan’s attack. In just three days, the barrier collapsed under the crazy impact.","After the energy in Chu Yunfan’s body reached a peak, he broke through and reached an even more powerful level—tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Chu Yunfan, who was already comparable to a tier-six Divine, now had an earth-shaking change in his combat strength. He now surpassed the combat strength of tier-seven Divines.","Chu Yunfan slowly opened his eyes. The energy in his body was boiling. Compared to a few months ago, he had undergone a tremendous change.","Just as he expected, not only did the Phoenix Rebirth Pill complete rebirth and solve the problem of the thunder sigil, but it also allowed his cultivation to advance to tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage."]},{"number":981,"title":"Chapter 981 I Have a Pill That Can Help You Enter the Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["981 I Have a Pill That Can Help You Enter the Divine Abilities Stage","Tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage was a dividing line. Not only in the cultivation level, but also in combat power.","This allowed Chu Yunfan to break through to the upper stage of the Divine Abilities Stage. This kind of power wasn’t invincible within the Kunlun Realm, but it allowed him to go anywhere in the world.","Especially with the Sun Shooter in hand, Chu Yunfan was not afraid of any powerful enemy.","However, the cracks on the Sun Shooter had become more obvious after continuous use. He was afraid that he could only get a few more uses out of it.","However, for the current Chu Yunfan, it was still an extremely important guarantee, especially now that he had just suppressed the thunder sigil. The thunder sigil was the key to controlling the Thunder God Scepter, after all. He needed time to complete the refining of the Thunder God Scepter.","After Chu Yunfan came out of seclusion, he began to update himself on the current situation.","Over the past few months, the Federation had not changed much. It was still without a leader, but what was completely different from before was that with Chu Yunfan as a stabilizing force, the people of the Federation had gradually calmed down.","A few months ago, the storm caused by the Killimg Chu Rally had gradually dissipated. Although it had caused turmoil at that time, it gradually calmed down.","On the whole, it was still calm on the surface, but in fact, there were turbulent undercurrents. However, after Chu Yunfan had ruthlessly killed everyone at the rally, the enemies inside and outside the Federation suffered a great loss. Those who had not been exterminated were secretly licking their wounds and were unable to cause any trouble.","This was a rare period of peace for the Federation. All the families were continuing to grow their strength, especially the Chu clan, who had obtained Divinity Nourishment Pills from Chu Yunfan. They were stepping up the pace of cultivating new Divines.","Chu Yunfan was happy to see this. The stronger the families were, the stronger the Federation would be.","Tang Siyu was in seclusion and concentrated on absorbing the power of the legacy pearl. When she came out of seclusion, her cultivation would definitely improve by leaps and bounds.","During the Ancient Zenith Civilization, the power of one who owned a legacy pearl would skyrocket overnight. It was not a miracle that they almost ascend within the day. On the contrary, it was a very normal thing.","It was a pity that Tang Siyu did not have a complete guidance method. Otherwise, her cultivation would be far more than this.","Chu Yunfan didn’t bother Tang Siyu, who was currently in seclusion. Not long after he came out of seclusion, the deputy chief of Special Ops, Huo Ruonan, came looking for him.","“Chief Chu, we’ve found the base of the Fluttering Blooms that tried in vain to assassinate you. We’ve already cleared it out,” Huo Ruonan reported, “Should we issue an arrest warrant?”","“Yes. Arrest anyone from Fluttering Blooms who dares to stick out their neck,” Chu Yunfan said.","Previously, the influence of the rally was very bad, and Chu Yunfan was not a forgiving person. On the contrary, it was his habit to seek revenge for the smallest grievances.","Since the Fluttering Bloom’s sect master had personally made a move to kill him, then they had already shed all pretenses of cordiality. Since that was the case, then there was no need for the Fluttering Blooms to exist anymore.","Chu Yunfan didn’t want to completely fall out with the Holy Land, but many people there regarded him as a thorn in their side, so there was no other way. Since the other party had chosen to fall out with him, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be soft-hearted.","However, the Fluttering Blooms were different from the famous forces within the Federation. Their base in the Kunlun Realm was in the outer regions that were outside of the Federation’s control. It took several months for Special Ops to finally find it and wipe it out.","“During the operation, we discovered a teleportation array in their base. According to the Fluttering Blooms disciples we interrogated, this teleportation array was used by the Fluttering Blooms to enter and exit the Holy Land,” Huo Ruonan said.","“Protect the scene. No one is allowed to enter without my orders.” Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up.","They had finally found a way to enter the Holy Land. The Federation’s current understanding of the Holy Land was too shallow. It was limited to the information they were willing to disclose.","According to current information, the Holy Land was a remnant of the Ancient Zenith Civilization. Before the ancient civilization was destroyed, a portion of its people escaped to the Holy Land, and slowly developed the place.","And ever since Chu Yunfan obtained the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, he had always wanted to find the root cause of the ancient civilization’s destruction.","The disappearance of the ancient civilization was too strange. It was as if the civilization that was once so prosperous that it was beyond imagination had disappeared overnight.","No one knew why, and none of the excavated ruins mentioned how such a powerful and prosperous civilization disappeared overnight.","The Holy Land was likely to have recorded the root cause of the disappearance.","But Chu Yunfan had not managed to find a way to enter the Holy Land because it was not in the Kunlun Realm. Strictly speaking, the Holy Land was on another small plane, and it could not be entered through normal means.","“Right. I have a pill here. It’s called the Divinity Nourishment Pill. It can help you break through to the Divine Abilities Stage,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at Huo Ruonan.","Chu Yunfan had more than one Divinity Nourishment Pill on hand, especially since he had many inner cores of Divine monsters in his possession. He could concoct many Divinity Nourishment Pills.","With his current cultivation level, the Divinity Nourishment Pill was no longer of much use to him. Naturally, he would give it to someone else to use.","Ever since Huo Ruonan became his assistant, she had been loyal and never complained. Her strength was also sufficient to use the Divinity Nourishment Pill, which was why Chu Yunfan gave her the pill.","“What?” Huo Ruonan’s red lips parted slightly. She seemed to be in disbelief.","What kind of concept was it to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage? It was the transformation of an insect into a dragon. It was simply not an existence of the same world.","Although Chu Yunfan had massacred many Divines during this period, it didn’t mean that Divines were all over the place. In fact, there were still very few Divines within the Federation.","For an expert who had entered the peak of the Innate Stage, the success rate might only be one in a thousand, or even lower.","And now, Chu Yunfan had clearly stated that he would give her a pill that could help her reach the Divine Abilities Stage, so how could she not be excited?","“Break through to Divine Abilities Stage?” Huo Ruonan was afraid that she had misheard, so she repeated the statement.","Chu Yunfan could understand Huo Ruonan’s excitement. He smiled and said, “That’s right. It’s to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage. Special Ops carries a heavy responsibility, but they don’t have enough experts. As the deputy chief, you should be conscientious and do your best. This is what you deserve.”","“Thank you, Chief! Thank you, Chief!”","At this moment, Huo Ruonan was close to tears. She was deeply grateful to Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":982,"title":"Chapter 982 Ambushed and Entering the Holy Land","paragraphs":["982 Ambushed and Entering the Holy Land","Huo Ruonan felt a surge of mixed emotions. It was not an exaggeration to say that she was deeply grateful. After all, there were too few people in the Federation who could enter the Divine Abilities Stage.","The difference in status between Divines and Innates was like Heaven and Earth. Once she entered the Divine Abilities Stage, she would be one of the top few people in the Federation.","It was as significant as a carp leaping over the dragon gate, transforming into a dragon and ascending.","Now, Chu Yunfan was giving her such an opportunity. How could she not be grateful?","!!","Looking at Huo Ruonan’s expression, Chu Yunfan suddenly thought of something. Since they were already going to start making pills, it would be better to turn all the inner cores into Divinity Nourishment Pills. That way, they could increase the number of experts in the Federation in one go.","It was very important for the stability of the Federation.","Moreover, with these Divinity Nourishment Pills, Chu Yunfan could promote the people he wanted to promote and support the forces he wanted to support according to his needs. In this way, his influence in the Federation would also be greatly improved.","Thinking of this, he didn’t hesitate any longer. He immediately asked Special Ops to start collecting medicinal herbs.","However, he had to collect all of these first. Even with the power of Special Ops, it would take a long time. After all, he had more than one or two monster inner cores.","In a valley in the outer regions of the Kunlun Realm, the forest was dense. The huge trees shot up into the sky like pillars supporting the sky.","Normally, this place was deserted and was the nest and home of countless monsters. But now, it had been occupied by countless humans. And with the work of countless modern equipment, a modern base had been built in the valley.","Countless humans were entering and exiting the base, and some heavy weapons were even transported down from the huge transport ships.","This was originally the base of the Fluttering Blooms in the outer region. Now that it had been found by Special Ops, they had transformed this valley into a fortress in order to occupy this place for a long time.","There weren’t many resources in this remote place. The reason why it was so important was that there was a huge teleportation array in the middle of the valley. This teleportation array led directly to the legendary Holy Land.","There were many rumors about the Holy Land in the Federation. No one had actually been there. Therefore, when the teleportation array was discovered, it immediately attracted Special Ops’ attention.","A transport plane broke into the valley and flew vertically above it. A figure flew down from above. The man was none other than Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, there were many array masters surrounding the teleportation array. They were making the final confirmation before the teleportation array was activated.","Seeing Chu Yunfan coming, the deputy chief in charge of the base’s reconstruction quickly came forward and greeted, “Chief Chu!”","“Is everything ready?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Everything is ready,” the deputy chief quickly said.","Chu Yunfan nodded and stepped into the teleportation array. The light of the teleportation array began to flash amid the noise. Suddenly, he felt that there was something wrong.","The deputy chief, who had been so respectful a moment ago, suddenly revealed a ferocious smile.","“Hahaha, Chu Yunfan, no matter how cunning you are, you’ve been tricked!”","Chu Yunfan suddenly felt a terrifying force tearing him apart.","“Sh*t! Something’s wrong!”","He immediately understood. This was not right at all. From the moment Special Ops discovered the Fluttering Blooms’ base, this was a trap.","It was a trap designed to lure him in.","“You’re asking for death!” Chu Yunfan shouted and casually grabbed out with his hand. A bolt of lightning struck out and then he threw it out.","The deputy chief didn’t even have time to dodge or react before he was blasted into pieces by the thunderbolt.","However, the activation of the teleportation array was irreversible, and the last thing Chu Yunfan saw was a figure appearing out of thin air. He was very familiar with the aura of the figure. He had felt the same power from the Seventh and Sixth Divine Servants.","Then, Chu Yunfan felt himself being transported into an endless void. A terrifying force was tearing his body apart. His Imperial Physique was starting to crack and blood was seeping out of him.","Even with the strength of his Imperial Physique, he had become like this. If it had been an ordinary Divine, they would have been torn to pieces by this terrifying force.","Chu Yunfan was forced into a corner. He could only use all his strength to circulate the Mighty Eternal Emperor Method to heal his injuries. However, as time passed, the injuries on his body continued to increase. It was as if he was trapped in the turbulence of time and space.","Suddenly, just as Chu Yunfan was about to use all his strength to open up the Mountain River Diagram, his eyes lit up. He was directly transported out of the space turbulence.","***","A group of carriages was shuttling through a forest. There were about a dozen people in the group, most of whom were strong and had extraordinary cultivation.","Surprisingly, every one of them had a cultivation base of the Innate Stage or above.","The leader of this group was a young man in his early twenties. This young man was dressed in tight clothes and had an imposing appearance. He was full of heroic spirit.","In this long line, there were many carriages with luxuriously decorated boxes. The items inside were clearly expensive.","This group of people all had a hint of worry on their faces as if they had not accomplished something. In one of the carriages, a man dressed in black was sitting cross-legged and looking up at the sky.","In the blue sky, there were cracks as if a picture scroll had been torn apart. It looked horrifying.","Looking at the strange scene in the sky, the young man’s face showed a thoughtful expression.","“So that’s how it is. Is this small world heading toward destruction? No wonder all the major forces in the Holy Land are trying their best to enter Kunlun Realm and take over the Federation.”","The young man was none other than Chu Yunfan.","Although that teleportation array had tricked him, the direction of the teleportation was not wrong. It was indeed in the Holy Land.","It was just that he had been tampered with in the middle of the process, which was how Chu Yunfan was tricked and almost died in the spatial turbulence.","A self-deprecating smile appeared on Chu Yunfan’s face. It was like shooting a wild goose all day long, but in the end, the wild goose pecked his eyes."]},{"number":983,"title":"Chapter 983 The Cause and Effect, the Situation in the Holy Land","paragraphs":["983 The Cause and Effect, the Situation in the Holy Land","He didn’t expect that the deputy chief he trusted so much would be related to the Sixth and Seventh Divine Servants.","At the last moment, he was sure that the figure he saw was also a Divine Servant because the aura was too similar. It was obvious that they were from the same lineage.","There was nothing wrong with the teleportation array, and it was indeed used by the Fluttering Blooms. However, someone had tampered with it.","Chu Yunfan furrowed his brows. This organization was clearly very powerful. They were able to infiltrate so deeply. They had even infiltrated Special Ops before Chu Yunfan took over.","It was clearly not something that had happened in a day or two.","The Seventh Divine Servant was the weakest one Chu Yunfan had met, and that man was in the Divine Abilities Stage. If the strength of the Sixth Divine Servant was taken into account, the strength of this organization was amazing.","In terms of top-tier strength, they might even be stronger than the Federation. Although the Federation mainly relied on high-end weapons, it was shocking enough to be able to compete with the top combat power of the Federation.","From the first time he met the Seventh Divine Servant, this force had been continuously going against him.","When he was still weak, he encountered the Seventh Divine Servant. If it wasn’t for the Jiangs’ nuclear bomb that scared the Seventh Divine Servant away, he would have faced a fierce battle.","Later on, the Seventh Divine Servant and the Monster Cult’s sect leader worked together to besiege him.","After that, the Sixth Divine Servant organized a rally to kill Chu Yunfan and wanted to use the power of the whole world to bury Chu Yunfan.","The whole plan couldn’t be said to have failed. In fact, if Chu Yunfan didn’t have the Sun Shooter, he would have to avoid facing such a lineup.","In addition to this time, they had set up traps to ambush Chu Yunfan four times. Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t ignore this organization. If he didn’t uproot it, he wouldn’t be able to eat or sleep in peace.","Chu Yunfan thought, ‘If these people were all divine servants, then who was the so-called divine at the top?’","‘I don’t care who you are. I will make you pay!’","Chu Yunfan sneered. He had learned his lesson. When he returned to the Federation, he would find a way to uproot this organization.","In the sky, cracks suddenly appeared, bringing with them a destructive aura that seemed like the end of the world.","The average person might not know, but Chu Yunfan, who had inherited the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, understood what this meant. This meant that the life of this small world had entered a countdown.","Nothing in the world was eternal. Even a real universe would collapse after hundreds of millions of years, let alone a small world. Its lifespan could not be compared to a big world like the Kunlun Realm.","If one started from the time when the Ancient Zenith Civilization was destroyed, it was normal for this small world to have entered its end phase. Such a small world needed constant maintenance to extend its lifespan.","However, it was clear that the various forces in the Holy Land did not have such an ability. In fact, even in the era of the Ancient Zenith Civilization, when human martial arts were at their peak, the forces that could extend the life of a small world were very rare.","Once a world was destroyed, if a person could not escape, they would be destroyed with the world.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally understood why the forces of the Holy Land were trying to enter the Kunlun Realm. In terms of the cultivation environment, the Holy Land was better than the Kunlun Realm. The concentration of Spirit Energy was at least fifty percent more potent.","That was why although the Holy Land was not as big as the Kunlun Realm, it still had many masters. It was not without reason.","However, judging from the cracks in the sky that were gradually becoming denser and denser and expanding, the Holy Land would collapse in a hundred years at most. In fact, during this process, it was like a person getting old. The body’s functions would decline, and all kinds of complications would erupt at the same time.","Gradually, the sky would fall and the earth would crack.","It had been three days since Chu Yunfan had entered the Holy Land. During this time, his strength had been constantly recovering. With the recovery ability of the Imperial Physique, ordinary injuries could be healed quickly.","However, this injury had been caused by spatial turbulence. There was a powerful spatial turbulence in his body that constantly obstructed his recovery. Right now, he had to recover from his injuries while constantly expelling the spatial turbulence in his body.","After he entered the Holy Land, he was seriously injured and had difficulty moving. It wasn’t long before he met this group of people and was saved by them.","Over these three days, Chu Yunfan figured out the background of this group.","The young man who led the group was named Lin Haoren, the son of the lord of a nearby city called Tianhe. His cultivation was good. At the age of only twenty years old, he had already reached the seventh Innate Stage.","In the Federation, such people were the top students that the Federation paid special attention to. It was not a big problem for them to reach the peak of the Innate Stage in the future. They even had the chance to enter the Divine Abilities Stage.","After walking for a while, the group stopped and started to recuperate by the stream. Except for those who had to be on guard, everyone else started to relax.","“I didn’t expect such a large sect like the Fluttering Blooms would actually be gone just like that.”","“That’s right. It’s said that all the Divines, including the sect leader, died in the Kunlun Realm. Without the protection of the Divines, their foundation was taken away.”","“However, now that the Fluttering Blooms has been destroyed, who will help us? Will we really have to hand over Tianhe?”","At this moment, the guards were discussing in low voices while they were resting, and their faces were filled with worry.","Although they laughed as they discussed it, how could it escape Chu Yunfan’s ears? But after thinking for a while, Chu Yunfan understood why.","Several of the Fluttering Blooms’ Divines had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. A few months ago, even the sect leader had died in the Kunlun Realm. It was equivalent to the entire sect suddenly losing the protection of the sect’s most powerful experts.","The sects in the Holy Land were not like the major forces in the Federation, who had high-end weapons like nuclear bombs to protect themselves. Without the protection of a Divine, they were basically doomed.","In this short period, without the protection of a Divine, the foundation of the Fluttering Blooms had been snatched away.","These people were all lamenting the fact that the Fluttering Blooms had gone from glory to decline in such a short time, but they never thought that the person who caused all this was right beside them."]},{"number":984,"title":"Chapter 984 Recovering the Strength of Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["984 Recovering the Strength of Divine Abilities Stage","The current situation of the Fluttering Blooms could be said to be single-handedly brought about by Chu Yunfan.","For him, he had only killed a few strong enemies, but for the Fluttering Blooms, it was an earth-shattering situation.","Without a top-notch expert like the Fluttering Blooms’s sect leader holding the fort, it was a disaster, especially since the sect leader’s cultivation had reached tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage, which was comparable to the effect of many ordinary Divines.","It was even worse than the Tang clan’s situation back then. At least the Tangs still had means such as nuclear bombs to protect themselves, so no one dared to push the Tangs to the end of the line.","However, the Fluttering Blooms did not have such methods. Not much time had passed since he killed the sect leader of the Fluttering Blooms, and their entire foundation had already been annexed and divided by other powers.","It wasn’t like Chu Yunfan hadn’t gained anything in the past three days. At least he knew the situation of the Holy Land. It was different from the government of the Kunlun Realm that ruled the world. In the Holy Land, the real rulers were the sects or the huge aristocratic families like the Wei clan.","Every sect would have a different number of cities under its command. These cities would submit to these sects and families to collect cultivation resources for them. These sects and families would also protect them from being invaded by enemies and act as their most solid backing.","As for the number of cities that would submit, that would depend on the strength of the sect. In the Federation, the Fluttering Blooms had three Divines, which could be considered extremely huge. However, in the Holy Land, it was only considered a second-rate force.","This was because their sect leader was only a tier six Divine. A true first-rate force had at least a master in tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage to hold the fort. Only then would they be qualified to be ranked as a first-rate force.","Unlike the Federation of the Kunlun Realm, there were not many high-end weapons in the Holy Land, so the role of the top masters was infinitely magnified.","And Tianhe City which this group of people belonged to was a city under the Fluttering Blooms. The items that this group of people was escorting on horseback were the tributes offered to the Fluttering Blooms.","Who knew that before it was delivered, they would hear the news of the Fluttering Blooms’ destruction? Now that they had lost the sect that protected them, everyone was in a state of panic.","In the Holy Land, without backing, it was basically written on one’s face that one was easy to bully—a soft persimmon. It was likely that it would not be long before a war began.","Chu Yunfan got out of the carriage and sat cross-legged by the stream. He began to use the power of nature to heal his injuries. After three days, he was no longer as weak as before.","Three days ago, when Chu Yunfan was rescued by this group, he was at his weakest. But now, he had recovered his strength to the peak of the Innate Stage. Even if there was a peak Innate hidden in this group, he could probably kill the entire group with a single hand.","And that hidden Innate was a mysterious old servant who followed the son of the city lord, Lin Haoren.","To ordinary people, this mysterious old servant was very powerful, but that was only to ordinary people. If his opponent was Chu Yunfan, even if Chu Yunfan wasn’t at his peak, Chu Yunfan could kill him with three punches at most.","Chu Yunfan was trying his best to recover. As long as he could recover to the Divine Abilities Stage, everything would be much easier.","He was breathing regularly. If one looked closely, one would notice that the Spirit Energy around him was pouring into his body at an astonishing rate.","As more and more Spirit Energy was absorbed, his recovery speed became faster and faster.","Chu Yunfan’s healing attracted the attention of the carriage guards, but it wasn’t the first or second time that Chu Yunfan had done this in the past few days, so they were used to it.","Lin Haoren glanced at Chu Yunfan with fear. At his level of cultivation, he could clearly feel that Spirit Energy was constantly swarming toward Chu Yunfan, and then being absorbed by him.","At this sensitive time, Chu Yunfan, who had no background, had mysteriously appeared. It would be strange if Lin Haoren wasn’t afraid of him.","However, Chu Yunfan was someone his little sister wanted to save, so he just let her be. His little sister had always been kind, and he didn’t want to have a big fight with her over this issue.","Of course, the most important reason was that he was confident that he could suppress Chu Yunfan. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan looked sickly and he couldn’t feel any trace of cultivation on his body. It was obvious that Chu Yunfan had been seriously injured.","If Chu Yunfan dared to make the slightest move, Lin Haoren would be able to kill him. Not to mention, Uncle Lin, who had followed their family for many years, had been monitoring Chu Yunfan’s every move. Unless he was a master in the Divine Abilities Stage, he was definitely not Uncle Lin’s opponent.","After all these layers of insurance, he was finally willing to take Chu Yunfan to Tianhe.","Of course, Chu Yunfan knew that his healing had attracted a lot of attention, but he didn’t care. He continued to use the Celestial Devouring Art to absorb the Spirit Energy and turn it into his own.","The speed at which he absorbed Spirit Energy was extremely shocking. It could only be described as devouring.","After a long time, he finally opened his eyes, and his face revealed a hint of joy.","It had been three days, and his strength had finally recovered to the Divine Abilities Stage. Although it was only a slight recovery, far from his peak, it was a good sign.","Now that he had returned to the Divine Abilities Stage, he could use his powers. The speed of his recovery was at least ten times faster than before.","It wouldn’t take long for him to recover to his peak.","Just as he opened his eyes, he saw a delicate figure coming down from a luxuriously decorated carriage in the convoy. It was a young girl about sixteen or seventeen years old, with snow-white skin and delicate facial features. She looked somewhat similar to Lin Haoren and brimmed with the aura of youth.","This was the other owner of the caravan, the youngest daughter of Tianhe’s city lord, Lin Chenxi.","It was because Lin Chenxi had tried to save Chu Yunfan three days ago that the convoy accepted Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, from his observation, whether it was Lin Haoren or the others, they were clearly on guard against him.","However, this was normal. If it were him, he would not be so assured as to let an unknown person join his group either.","“Brother Chu, have you recovered?” Lin Chenxi asked as she looked at Chu Yunfan with her big eyes.","Chu Yunfan nodded and said, “I’ve recovered a little. Thank you for taking me in these three days, Miss Lin. If it weren’t for you, I’m afraid I would’ve been buried in the belly of a beast.”","“You’re lying! I don’t believe you’d be eaten by a beast.” Lin Chenxi shook her head in disbelief."]},{"number":985,"title":"Chapter 985 Taking Action, Shocking","paragraphs":["985 Taking Action, Shocking","Lin Chenxi looked at Chu Yunfan with a pair of determined eyes. From those eyes, one could see the words “you’re lying.”","Chu Yunfan did not know where Lin Chenxi’s confidence in him came from. In fact, she was the one who insisted on saving him. Otherwise, he would not have been able to join the convoy.","Of course, with his strength, even if he was seriously injured, it was impossible for him to die in the belly of a beast. With the strength of the Imperial Physique, even if ordinary monsters crushed their teeth, they would not be able to break his skin.","“No matter what, thank you for your help, Miss Lin. As a token of gratitude, I will help you in any way I can.” Chu Yunfan smiled and did not argue with Lin Chenxi.","!!","“Hmph, hope boastful!”","Nobody knew when, but Lin Haoren had walked over.","In his eyes, Chu Yunfan was just a braggart. There was even a hint of vigilance in his eyes, thinking that Chu Yunfan was using this method to get close to his little sister.","This guy of unknown origin was delusional. His little sister was the daughter of Tianhe’s city lord. Who knew how many suitors she had? Chu Yunfan was a toad chasing a princess.","“I’m telling you, you’d better stay away from her or you’ll regret it,” Lin Haoren warned Chu Yunfan telepathically.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t angry and just smiled faintly.","“Then it’s a deal. That’s great!” Lin Chenxi said excitedly as if she had just received an important promise.","After a short rest, the group resumed their journey. Chu Yunfan was still sitting cross-legged in the carriage and recovering.","After recovering to the Divine Abilities Stage, Chu Yunfan could use the divine power in his body, which made his recovery speed even faster.","The group advanced steadily. Just as they were about to leave the forest, the entire forest suddenly began to shake. The sounds of countless monsters galloping could be heard from the depths of the forest.","Everyone’s expression changed. A monster swarm!","“D*mn it! Why would we encounter a monster swarm at this time?!”","Lin Haoren’s face instantly changed. The most terrifying thing when walking through the mountains and forests was encountering a monster swarm. Once they encountered a swarm, they were basically finished.","Although most of the monsters in the swarm were not very strong, when their numbers reached a certain level, they could drown out everything they saw.","“Get into formation!”","Uncle Lin, the old servant of the Lin family, reacted quickly and shouted.","The guards immediately got into formation because they knew that it was too late to run. The speed at which the swarm spread was usually extremely fast.","Everyone was praying that this was only a small-scale monster swarm and that they would survive it. If it was a large-scale monster swarm, they would probably not be able to escape death.","Not long after the group had got into formation, the first monster appeared in front of them. It tried to charge at the carriage formation, but it was instantly killed by the joint forces of the guards.","However, this was just the beginning. The second, third, fourth... All the way until the overwhelming number of monsters arrived in the blink of an eye.","Apparently, the heavens had not heard their prayers. The swarm was overwhelming. It was clearly not a small swarm. It was at least a medium swarm.","Even if it was a small swarm, they could be completely annihilated, let alone a medium and above one. With their strength, they were almost certain to die.","A brutal fight instantly broke out. These monsters seemed to have encountered some extremely terrifying existence. They ran away frantically and attacked the carriage formation.","The formation formed by these dozens of people was extremely solid, especially Uncle Lin who was at the front. At this time, he finally displayed the powerful strength of a peak Innate. He could kill a monster with a casual attack.","Whether it was a large monster or a small monster, there was no difference in his hands. In a short while, the corpses had piled up like a mountain in front of him.","Even so, he was unable to stop the monsters’ crazy attacks. He had already consumed more than half of his True Energy, but the endless swarm showed no signs of stopping.","Lin Haoren also kept waving his long spear to block the charging monsters, but even so, the entire convoy was still being pushed back.","Finally, one of the guards was swallowed by a monster. The entire line of defense collapsed and was in a mess.","Lin Chenxi emerged from her carriage. She held a sword in her hand and continuously slashed out Innate True Energy. She was young but she had already entered the Innate Stage. She was extremely impressive.","“Protect the Young Master. Young Miss, you have to leave. We’ll hold them back!” Uncle Lin roared and used all his strength to carve out a safe passage, wanting to escort Lin Haoren and Lin Chenxi away first.","The other guards were also trying their best to get closer, but they had no choice. The entire formation was already in a mess.","Lin Haoren knew that this was bad. Just as he was about to send his little sister away, he suddenly spotted Chu Yunfan, who was still sitting cross-legged in the carriage, recuperating. He was not moving, like a clay sculpture.","At this time, a leopard-type monster broke through the defense line. It opened its jaws and pounced on Chu Yunfan, who was in the carriage.","“Watch out!” Lin Chenxi shouted and then rushed in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","‘He’s dead meat!’","Lin Haoren made a judgment in his heart for Chu Yunfan, but in such a chaotic situation, he couldn’t even protect himself, so how could he possibly save Chu Yunfan?","However, what happened next completely shocked Lin Haoren. Just as the leopard-type monster was about to bite Chu Yunfan, he suddenly opened his eyes.","In an instant, it was as if the world had been split open again. His right index and middle fingers came together and casually swept toward the leopard-type monster.","In the next moment, a stream of energy swept out from Chu Yunfan’s finger, and the leopard-type monster let out a blood-curdling scream as it exploded in mid-air.","“Amazing!”","At this time, a hint of horror flashed through Lin Haoren’s eyes. That leopard-type monster was at least at the Innate Stage. Although he could kill it, it was absolutely impossible for him to kill it as easily as Chu Yunfan had.","Could it be that his little sister’s guess was right this time? This weirdo who claimed to be surnamed Chu was actually a super expert?","If that were the case, it would be very awkward. He had treated Chu Yunfan coldly before. However, he didn’t have time to think too much in the chaos.","Chu Yunfan, who had just killed a leopard-type monster, seemed to have completely awakened. He stood up straight, and his figure flickered. After a few leaps, he rushed into the group of monsters, not afraid of being surrounded."]},{"number":986,"title":"Chapter 986 He’s a Top-Tier Master","paragraphs":["986 He’s a Top-Tier Master","“This isn’t good. He’s too arrogant!” Uncle Lin said when he saw Chu Yunfan’s action.","Even he didn’t dare to rush into the monster swarm so casually. With his strength, even an Innate monster wouldn’t be able to hurt him. A peak Innate expert was the king of the Innate Stage.","However, when the number of opponents reached this level, the advantage of individual strength would be instantly weakened, or rather, it was useless.","No matter how fast the Innate’s True Energy recovered, it would be useless because it couldn’t keep up with the speed of consumption. In a collision of this level, they would only be exhausted to death.","And it wouldn’t be very long before that happened.","“We can’t do anything if he wants to die!” Lin Haoren shouted. At this time, he simply couldn’t care. Under the attack of many monsters, he was forced to retreat.","He couldn’t care about so many things.","At this time, everyone was busy with their own affairs and could not care about others.","Very soon, they realized that they were wrong. Chu Yunfan had rushed into the horde of monsters. It was not like what they had thought. Chu Yunfan was not drowned by the countless monsters.","On the contrary, he casually waved his arms and shot out a long sword light. As the sword light shot out, a few monsters, at least twenty or thirty monsters, were killed by Chu Yunfan.","This killing efficiency made Lin Haoren a little dumbfounded. His cultivation base was not weak, but he could only kill these monsters one by one, and it took all his strength to pursue each one.","Uncle Lin, who was the strongest among them, could only kill the monsters one by one and had to be careful of being surrounded.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He could kill many monsters with ease. His every move was a killing move. In his hands, the killing seemed to have evolved into an art.","In just a short while, he was surrounded by the carcasses of monsters. Since he started attacking, not a single monster had been able to get close to him. It was as if there was a wall around him, blocking all the monsters that came close.","And Chu Yunfan, who was outside, had blocked the entire monster swarm singlehandedly. This also greatly reduced the pressure on the people from Tianhe.","“He’s a top-notch master!”","The remaining guards of Tianhe widened their eyes as if they couldn’t accept it. Chu Yunfan, who was a sickly person in their eyes, had actually burst out with such powerful strength.","Previously, only Lin Chenxi believed that Chu Yunfan was a master, but they didn’t believe it. Or rather, looking at Chu Yunfan’s age, he was at most an Innate.","No one had expected Chu Yunfan would be able to burst out with such powerful strength. With his strength, he had done something they didn’t even dare to think about.","After lamenting that they might have misjudged the situation, they felt a heartfelt joy that they might survive this medium-sized monster swarm.","At the thought of this, everyone felt their morale rise. They had hope of survival, and no one wanted to die.","Meanwhile, Lin Chenxi was forcing back the monsters that were pouncing at her with a proud look on her face. Previously, everyone thought that Chu Yunfan couldn’t possibly be a master, but now the facts had proven that she was right.","She had saved the lives of this group of people.","“Uncle Lin, are you able to do such a thing?” After killing an Innate monster with a single move, Lin Haoren moved closer to his old servant, Uncle Lin.","Because Chu Yunfan was blocking most of the monsters in front of them, they finally had a chance to catch their breath.","“Impossible. The True Energy in his body is terrifyingly dense. If I were to attack so unscrupulously, I’m afraid I would have exhausted my True Energy and died. However, he’s acting as if nothing’s happening. Judging from the timing of his attacks, they’re fast, accurate, and ruthless. Coupled with his strength, he has given such a stunning performance. If it were me, I wouldn’t be able to do it at all,” Uncle Lin said as he shook his head.","With his cultivation, he was already at the peak of the Innate Stage. No ordinary expert could convince him, but he had to admit that Chu Yunfan was indeed extraordinary.","However, just by looking at Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation level, he still looked like he had no cultivation at all. However, Chu Yunfan was still wantonly attacking and slaughtering the monsters.","With so many unreasonable things happening all at once, there was only one possibility left—Chu Yunfan had been hiding his true power. Logically speaking, it should have been impossible for him to hide his true power when he attacked.","Then there was only one possibility.","Either Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was far above his, or Chu Yunfan had a very amazing breath-restraining technique.","Especially if it was the former, it would be terrifying. One must know that he was already at the peak of the Innate Stage. To be far stronger than him, Chu Yunfan could only be in the Divine Abilities Stage.","Could he be in the Divine Abilities Stage?","If that was really the case, then the young miss had really saved an extraordinary person and brought him home this time.","With Chu Yunfan on the front line, everyone worked together and finally killed all the monsters. Many of them felt like they had just survived a disaster. Even though the guards were all Innates, and the True Energy in their bodies had formed a large cycle that allowed them to recover their True Energy and physical strength very quickly, after this series of battles, their True Energy and physical strength had been completely exhausted.","Everyone was panting heavily, but when they looked at Chu Yunfan, they realized that he had not run out of energy or True Energy.","After fighting for so long, everyone’s True Energy had been exhausted, but Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to have exhausted his True Energy at all. Beside him, there were already mountains of carcasses and pools of blood.","When the monster swarm was formed, they usually did not have any rationality and would madly drown and devour everything in their path.","But now, Chu Yunfan’s frenzied killing had frightened those monsters. It was obvious that these monsters didn’t dare to move forward, but they seemed to be driven by someone and had no choice but to pounce forward.","“You don’t know what’s good for you!”","Chu Yunfan sneered and swept out a sword light, killing hundreds of monsters.","He was starting to get a little impatient, so he used his divine power to kill these monsters.","However, after this blow, even if those monsters were not afraid of death, they were terrified. Even if the monsters were not afraid of death, they would not be slaughtered so easily.","Finally, the monster swarm quietly retreated, leaving behind a ground full of carcasses."]},{"number":987,"title":"Chapter 987 Taking in a Disciple for the First Time","paragraphs":["987 Taking in a Disciple for the First Time","The entire mountain forest was in a mess. The smell of blood filled the air. Blood flowed like a river, and bodies piled up like mountains. It looked as if two armies had collided.","However, only the people present knew that there was no such thing as a collision between the two armies. Although they had contributed, in reality, it was Chu Yunfan who had single-handedly turned the tide. He had blocked this terrifying monster swarm with his own strength.","The way the guards looked at Chu Yunfan now was completely different from before. Before this, in their eyes, Chu Yunfan was just a sick man, and only the eldest miss believed that this Chu Yunfan had strength.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even try to defend himself, so they were even more certain that he was just trying to make things difficult for them.","But now, in their eyes, Chu Yunfan had completely changed. He was shrouded in a mysterious veil.","A top-tier master!","He might even be more powerful than the most powerful person on their team, Uncle Lin. At the very least, Uncle Lin couldn’t do what Chu Yunfan had done.","Although they were all Innates, there was still a huge gap between each Innate. Chu Yunfan could easily kill them all with a few casual moves.","As for being even more powerful, they did not even dare to imagine it.","Divines were extremely powerful in the Holy Land because Chu Yunfan was extremely young. It wasn’t because of his strong cultivation that he could remain young.","He was extremely young.","The junior city lord, Lin Haoren, who was around Chu Yunfan’s age, was at the seventh Innate Stage. This level of cultivation was already very amazing, but compared to Chu Yunfan, it was nothing.","In their eyes, the peak of the Innate Stage was already unimaginably powerful. It was the peak that most ordinary people could reach.","Chu Yunfan walked straight to the center of the group, and the way everyone looked at him had completely changed.","“Many thanks for your saving grace, Brother Chu!” Lin Haoren stepped forward and said as he bowed deeply.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop him but just looked at Lin Haoren in surprise. Lin Haoren didn’t like him at all before, and he always spoke coldly to him.","But now, Lin Haoren was willing to bow to him and was able to stretch and shrink at will. It was indeed a little interesting.","“Brother Chu, you’re so powerful!” Lin Chenxi said excitedly. Although she was the young miss of Tianhe, she was only a teenage girl.","“Will you accept me as your disciple?” Lin Chenxi asked expectantly as she looked at Chu Yunfan with her big eyes.","“Miss Lin, you come from a prestigious family. I believe that the city lord of Tianhe has arranged a master for you, right?” Chu Yunfan said, shaking his head. “You should think about that first.”","Chu Yunfan wanted to refuse because he had not yet made up his mind to someone’s master. Although in terms of cultivation, there were not many people in the world who were stronger than him, in terms of age, he was only in his twenties.","If it was an ordinary person, they might still be at the age of learning.","However, he thought of something, so he didn’t refuse.","“You’re right.” Lin Chenxi’s petite face was serious as she spoke. After pondering for a moment, she said, “I’ve thought it through. You can be my master.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. Lin Chenxi’s thinking was unpredictable.","“Mister Chu, our miss originally had a master, but now that the Fluttering Blooms has been destroyed, you need not worry about that. I think that even the city lord would not object to the miss having you as her master,” Uncle Lin said.","Uncle Lin was thinking even further. The current situation in Tianhe was not ideal. If he could recruit a great expert like Chu Yunfan, it would be no different from Tianhe having another strong ally.","Moreover, he always had a feeling that the peak stage of the Innate Stage might not be the limit of Chu Yunfan’s strength. Even if Chu Yunfan was only at the peak stage of the Innate Stage, judging from his age, the possibility of him entering the Divine Abilities Stage in the future was very high.","It was necessary for Tianhe to rope in a future Divine.","Chu Yunfan could immediately tell that although Lin Haoren and Lin Chenxi were the leaders of this group, Uncle Lin was the real master.","“That’s right. My father dotes on me a lot. He won’t object to it!” Lin Chenxi skipped over to Chu Yunfan’s side and hugged his arm.","Chu Yunfan’s arms sank into two soft mounds, and his nose was filled with the fragrance of a young girl.","“And Master, you said you would help me, but you won’t even agree to such a small request.”","“Fine...” Chu Yunfan muttered to himself for a moment before saying, “In that case, I’ll take you in as my disciple in name only.”","“Why only an in-name disciple?” Lin Chenxi pouted. However, she still hurriedly gave a big bow and said, “Greetings from your, disciple, Lin Chenxi, master.”","Even Lin Chenxi, who had a carefree personality, did not dare to be careless in this matter. After all, acknowledging a master and learning from a teacher were two different concepts.","A teacher was only responsible for passing on knowledge and dispelling doubts. However, if it was a master, it was a different concept.","His status was even comparable to her father’s.","“All right, since I’ve become your master, I have to give you a gift,” Chu Yunfan said.","He made a grabbing motion in the air, and a small porcelain bottle appeared in his hand. “This bottle contains ten Innate Pills that I made. They will help you in your cultivation.”","Of course, these were the Innate Pills that Chu Yunfan had concocted himself, but he didn’t use them up yet. Its efficacy was much better than the ones on the market, so he decided to use it as a greeting gift.","“That’s great! Master, you’re so good to me!”","Lin Chenxi’s smile immediately returned and she took the small porcelain bottle from Chu Yunfan.","On the other side, Uncle Lin’s eyes lit up when he saw Chu Yunfan grabbing something out of thin air. This either meant that Chu Yunfan was an expert in the Divine Abilities Stage, or he had a spatial magic treasure like an interspatial ring. No matter which one it was, it meant that Chu Yunfan was not simple.","“All right, it’s getting late. Mr. Chu, let’s hurry back to Tianhe,” Uncle Lin said quickly.","“Okay.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“It’s a shame. These carcasses are of great value. When we get back, we’ll immediately ask Father to send people to fetch them. We’ll take as many as we can.”","Lin Haoren looked at the carcasses all over the ground.","The group quickly resumed their journey and headed in the direction of Tianhe. They finally arrived before dark."]},{"number":988,"title":"Chapter 988 An Evil Guest Arrives at the Door to Forcibly Take in a Disciple","paragraphs":["988 An Evil Guest Arrives at the Door to Forcibly Take in a Disciple","Tianhe was an ordinary city in the Holy Land. It was different from the modern steel walls of the Federation. It was made of countless bricks and stones, but its city walls were much taller than the feudal era that Chu Yunfan knew. It was more than thirty meters tall.","On the city walls, there were fluctuations of a barrier spell. Everyone could feel that the defensive power of this city wall was extraordinary. It was not inferior to the city walls of modern Federation cities. These were two very clearly different paths.","The group hurried and finally entered Tianhe before the sky turned dark. It was the first time Chu Yunfan had seen such an ancient city, so he was curious about it.","Along the way, he learned from Lin Haoren and the others that Tianhe was considered a medium-sized city in the Holy Land that boosted millions of citizens.","!!","At night, Tianhe was still very lively, just like a city that never slept.","Chu Yunfan followed the caravan straight through the city and arrived at the city lord’s mansion in the center of the city. The mansion looked magnificent. With its carved beams and painted pillars, it looked very stylish.","“Mr. Chu, we’ve prepared a room for you. Please follow me,” Uncle Lin said as soon as they entered the house. “You must be tired from the journey. Please rest for the night. The city lord will meet you tomorrow!”","Before the convoy returned, a guard had already hurried ahead to report the situation, so everything had been properly arranged.","“All right.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t mind. The most important thing now was to recover his strength as soon as possible. Although ordinary Divines were no match for him after he recovered to the Divine Abilities Stage, it wasn’t too safe until he returned to his peak state.","Under Uncle Lin’s guidance, Chu Yunfan went to a room to rest, while Lin Haoren and Lin Chenxi went straight to see the lord of Tianhe, Lin Hongfeng.","Lin Hongfeng was a middle-aged man with a dignified expression. His facial features were somewhat similar to Lin Haoren and Lin Chenxi.","“What’s wrong with you two?”","Upon seeing his two children, Lin Hongfeng immediately frowned and started scolding them.","“This is outrageous. How can you just take him as your master? Have you guys figured out Mr. Chu’s identity? Why didn’t you stop your sister’s nonsense?!” Lin Hongfeng rebuked.","When he received the guard’s report, he felt that it was completely preposterous. What kind of joke was this? With his daughter’s status, how could she casually find someone of unknown origin to be her master?","Acknowledging a master wasn’t a big deal, but having a master and truly acknowledging a master were very different.","“Father, this Mr. Chu isn’t as simple as he looks.”","Lin Haoren immediately proceeded to tell Lin Hongfeng about what happened today.","Lin Hongfeng’s expression became solemn. It was a miracle that Chu Yunfan had repelled a medium-sized monster swarm on his own.","He was glad that Chu Yunfan had been there. Otherwise, he might have lost his daughter.","“That’s why I think Mr. Chu might already be a Divine. At the very least, at his age, it’s only a matter of time before he reaches the Divine Abilities Stage.” Lin Haoren concluded.","Lin Hongfeng silently looked at Lin Haoren with a hint of relief in his eyes. His son had finally grown up and wasn’t acting on impulse.","“Now that the Fluttering Blooms have been destroyed, they’re unable to provide shelter for our city. If we can rope in such an expert, it will be beneficial for our clan to stabilize our rule in Tianhe.”","After Lin Haoren finished speaking, he looked at Lin Hongfeng.","“Go rest for the night. I will meet with this Mr. Chu tomorrow.”","The night was silent. The moon fell and the sun rose.","Chu Yunfan, who was sitting cross-legged on the bed, opened his eyes. After a night of recovery, he had recovered a lot, and he had successfully recovered his cultivation to tier two of the Divine Abilities Stage.","At this rate, it wouldn’t take long for him to recover to tier four.","As expected, after recovering to the Divine Abilities Stage, his speed of recovery had sped up. It only took a few days.","At the same time, in the guest hall of the city lord’s mansion, the city lord’s family—Lin Hongfeng, Lin Haoren, and Lin Chenxi—were sitting in their seats, but their faces were filled with anger.","Opposite them was a young man who looked to be in his twenties. The young man had a frivolous look on his face and the way he looked at Lin Chenxi was filled with greed.","Behind him, there were three young men who looked to be in their late twenties. Like the young man, these people had a frivolous look on their faces and even a hint of lust.","“I’ve long heard that you have a beautiful daughter, Lord Lin. Now that I’ve seen her, she really lives up to her reputation,” the young man said.","“What do you say, Lord Lin? Have you made your decision? My master is a man of character. He’s willing to accept your daughter as a disciple. What a great honor that would be.” The young man sneered and looked at Lin Hongfeng.","“We appreciate your kindness but there’s no need for that,” Lin Hongfeng said while suppressing the anger in his heart.","“Lord Lin, you shouldn’t turn down this golden opportunity. Do you think you’re still the same as before? The Fluttering Blooms has long been destroyed. Who will protect you now? The Great Joy Sect is willing to give you a chance. Why don’t you know how to cherish it?” the young man said nonchalantly.","“Jin Feng, do you think we don’t know the background of your sect? You say you’re taking in disciples, but those women you’ve taken, which one of them wasn’t used as human specimens and tortured to death?!”","Lin Haoren finally couldn’t help but shout.","“You don’t know what’s good for you!” Jin Feng sneered and moved as quickly as lightning. In the blink of an eye, he was about to slap Lin Haoren.","Lin Haoren was shocked. This Jin Feng didn’t look like much, but his cultivation was at the peak of the Innate Stage—not inferior to his family’s Uncle Lin.","“Impudence!” Lin Hongfeng shouted and made a move. He threw a punch.","Bam!","They collided head-on. The fist and palm collided, and a loud boom like the collision of giant cannons erupted.","Thud, thud, thud!","Both of them retreated. Jin Feng took three steps back while Lin Hongfeng took five steps back.","Lin Hongfeng had blocked Jin Feng’s slap, but he couldn’t hide the shock in his eyes. Although he had been the city lord for many years, he had never stopped cultivating. And now, he had finally reached the peak of the Innate Stage.","This Jin Feng, on the other hand, looked like he was in his twenties. At most, he was in his thirties, but he had also reached the peak of the Innate Stage. His martial power was even stronger than Lin Hongfeng’s.","This was the power of disciples from large sects.","“You’re overestimating yourself.”","Jin Feng steadied himself, and with an even more astonishing speed, he threw a punch at Lin Haoren.","Bam!","Lin Haoren was caught off guard and was hit head-on. He hit the wall and spat out a mouthful of blood.","..."]},{"number":989,"title":"Chapter 989 I Meant That Your Whole Sect Is Trash","paragraphs":["989 I Meant That Your Whole Sect Is Trash","“What are you trying to do?!” Lin Hongfeng was furious. Jin Feng dared to be so arrogant in front of him. Jin Feng had even injured his son in front of him. This was simply intolerable.","“You have a death wish!” His body trembled in anger. In the blink of an eye, he threw a punch like a heavy cannon, and a shocking fist force swept toward Jin Feng.","As for Jin Feng, he seemed to have anticipated this. He showed not an ounce of regard as he threw out punches too.","Bam!","!!","Bam!","Bam!","After a series of shocking collisions, Lin Hongfeng, who had attacked in anger, was unable to gain the upper hand.","He could not gain any advantage at all, so he could only stop.","“Lin Hongfeng, I advise you to be sensible. It’s an honor for you that my master has taken a fancy to your daughter. Many people want to be my master’s apprentice but never get the opportunity. If you don’t know what’s good for you, don’t blame us for being impolite,” Jin Feng said.","“Jin Feng, this isn’t Great Joy. It’s not a place where you can do whatever you want!” Lin Hongfeng’s eyes were filled with killing intent. Jin Feng’s unscrupulous attitude had completely enraged him.","Jin Feng was only a peak Innate. With the strength of Tianhe, if they were to be ruthless, none of them would be able to escape.","“If you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish,” Lin Hongfeng said.","Jin Feng looked at Lin Hongfeng with disdain and said, “You dare? You know the consequences of doing this. My master will personally come and kill all of your neighbors. Since the Lin family isn’t willing to be obedient, then let’s change the city lord.”","Jin Feng’s words were filled with killing intent and coldness.","However, no one doubted that this would happen. In the Holy Land, this kind of thing was common. The city lords relied on sects or aristocratic families to survive. Once a sect was dissatisfied with the city lord of the city, it was very common for the entire clan to be executed. It was fine if it was a righteous sect, but a sect like Great Joy, which was close to the demonic path, had exterminated others more than once or twice.","If Tianhe was still under the protection of the Fluttering Blooms like before, it would still be fine. The pressure from Great Joy would naturally be dealt with by the Fluttering Blooms.","After all, the relationship between a sect and a city was interdependent. The city would try its best to collect all kinds of resources needed by the sect for cultivation, and the sect would provide protection for the city.","However, now that the Fluttering Blooms had been annihilated, Tianhe was like a child without a mother. No one cared about it.","Lin Hongfeng forced his anger down and coldly said, “You don’t have to worry about it. My daughter already has a master.”","“Already has a master? Then I’ll just drive them away,” Jin Feng said nonchalantly, “I’d like to see who dares to snatch my master’s disciple. They’re looking for death. I wonder which wild man dares to appear in front of me. I’ll kill him with one strike.”","Jin Feng had no regard for Lin Chenxi’s master. He had checked before he came, and no famous big shot had accepted her.","Since there wasn’t any and this so-called master wasn’t made up on the spot, it must be some random man who dared to snatch a disciple from their sect. Wasn’t that person courting death?","“I’d like to see how you’re going to kill me.”","A clear voice was heard as a figure slowly walked into the hall and looked at Jin Feng coldly.","“And who are you?” Jin Feng raised his head and saw a young man dressed in black.","“Master, why are you here?” Lin Chenxi asked in surprise when she saw Chu Yunfan.","“There are people who don’t know their place and want to snatch my disciple. If I don’t come, someone will kill me,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","“Hahaha! Lin Hongfeng, you’re so desperate. Although the Fluttering Blooms has been destroyed, what kind of master did you find for your daughter? This random man?” Jin Feng laughed out loud as if he had just heard the most unbelievable joke.","He could tell that Chu Yunfan was very young. Much younger than him. How high could the cultivation level of such a person be? He might not even be as strong as Lin Haoren.","Lin Hongfeng had found such a master for Lin Chenxi. If this was not self-degradation, what was it?","“You dare to compete with my master for a disciple? I think you don’t understand the power of Great Joy. I’ll give you a chance. If kneel and kowtow, I’ll spare your life.” Jin Feng looked at Chu Yunfan with disdain.","“You really don’t know what’s good for you,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer. He looked at Jin Feng and immediately saw through Jin Feng’s background. “So you’re using a crooked cultivation of absorbing others’ essence.”","He could tell the origin of Jin Feng’s cultivation technique with a single glance. Dual cultivation was the Dao of heaven and earth. The combination of yin and yang was the righteous path. However, it was the path of dual cultivation. Both men and women would be able to improve their strength.","However, Great Joy’s kind of absorption was completely different.","Using the other party as a cultivation vessel to improve oneself was a typical crooked way of harming others without benefiting the other party.","Chu Yunfan had always looked down on such crooked cultivation methods.","“What did you just say?” Jin Feng glared at him.","“I’m sorry, I’m not targeting you. I meant that your whole sect is trash,” Chu Yunfan said casually.","“You’re seeking death!”","The three young men standing behind Jin Feng suddenly became angry and rushed toward Chu Yunfan. The strength of these people was very strong. They had all stepped into the seventh Innate Stage.","“You’re overestimating yourself!” Chu Yunfan shouted coldly, and a terrifying Qi force was released from his body.","In the blink of an eye, the three young men who were pouncing at him were sent flying as if they had hit a wall of energy, and they crashed hard onto the ground.","The three young men struggled for a moment before they stopped moving. They died on the spot.","Chu Yunfan glanced at the three young men with a hint of disgust on his face. The cultivation path of Great Joy was to harvest a large amount of Yin energy from women. He wondered how many people had died for them to have cultivated to this level.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan only felt disgust and didn’t show any mercy.","“You actually dare!” Jin Feng was shocked and angry. “Don’t think that you can act like a tyrant just because you’re strong. There are always people stronger than you in this world!”","Just now, Chu Yunfan had easily killed Jin Feng’s three junior brothers before he even made a move. This made him realize that Chu Yunfan’s strength was probably above his.","Under such circumstances, he did not dare to be as arrogant as before.","“Didn’t you just want to kill me?” Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a cold smile."]},{"number":990,"title":"Chapter 990 The Great Joy Sect?","paragraphs":["990 The Great Joy Sect?","Just now, Chu Yunfan had easily killed Jin Feng’s three junior brothers before he even made a move. This made him realize that Chu Yunfan’s strength was probably above his.","Under such circumstances, he did not dare to be as arrogant as before.","“Didn’t you just want to kill me?” Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a cold smile.","!!","Although he had only just entered the Divine Abilities Stage, this was already very impressive. It would be a great honor to say that an Innate could plot against a Divine. Of course, he would not publicize it because it was his trump card.","Not to mention that it would cause dissatisfaction among the Divines.","This move was one hundred percent effective. This d*mn guy, no matter how strong his cultivation was, was dead for sure.","However, his smile froze almost immediately. As the pink centipede was spitting out a pink mist, just as it was about to reach Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan opened his mouth and let out a loud shout. Immediately, an invisible sound wave swept out.","The pink centipede was reduced to nothingness as if it had been crushed by some terrifying force.","“What?! How is this possible?!”","Jin Feng suddenly lost his voice, as if his throat was stuck.","The trick that he had cultivated with great effort was ineffective in front of Chu Yunfan. He was utterly terrified. What did this mean? It meant that Chu Yunfan might be far more powerful than he had imagined.","“I can’t let you leave after you’ve tried to use such a method against me!” Chu Yunfan shouted coldly and pushed his hand out. He didn’t seem to make any movement, but he sent out a strike.","A turbulent palm force surged out, but not a trace of it leaked out. While the others didn’t feel any change, they widened their eyes and saw Jin Feng turn into ashes as if he had been burned. The ashes then disappeared with the wind.","The whole place was dead silent. Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan with a dumbfounded look, as if they had seen a ghost. They couldn’t believe what they were seeing.","Jin Feng was at the peak of the Innate Stage—even stronger than Lin Hongfeng—but Chu Yunfan had killed him with a single strike.","In fact, they did not even feel any wind from the strike. There was not any shocking change in the situation. Then, they saw Jin Feng die just like that.","Of course, they wouldn’t doubt their own eyes, so there was only one possibility, and that was that Chu Yunfan’s internal energy was far beyond their imagination, and he was able to control his own internal energy to a very high level.","That was the only possibility.","Lin Hongfeng was touched. His son, Lin Haoren, and his daughter, Lin Chenxi, were still not very clear about what this meant, but he was very clear that this kind of thing was simply impossible for him to do. What a joke, was this something that humans could do?","At the very least, it was impossible for someone in the Innate Stage to do so. There was only one possibility. This top-notch expert that his daughter spoke of was probably in the Divine Abilities Stage.","When he thought of this, he could no longer remain calm.","“Thank you for helping us out of our predicament, Mr. Chu,” Lin Hongfengsaid as he saluted.","“It’s fine. It was easy. Also, they’re coming to snatch my disciple. Did you think I was just going to keep quiet?” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","Although he did not want to accept Lin Chenxi at first, since he already had, he would naturally not allow her to be taken away by the people from Great Joy.","According to the cultivation technique of Great Joy, it was obvious that the consequences would be dire if she were to be taken away.","“Master, you care for much for me,” Lin Chenxi said coquettishly as she giggled.","Chu Yunfan picked up the red gourd and said, “The quality of this tool is not bad, but it was refined into such a piece of trash. Let me refine it for you. You can use it to nourish your cultivation. It’ll be much better than that trash centipede.”","Chu Yunfan looked at the red gourd in his hand. The red gourd itself was a divine treasure. It was a pity that it was refined into such a piece of trash. It was only a pseudo-magic tool, and yet Jin Feng had been so proud of it.","And for Chu Yunfan, this was a piece of cake.","Although Alchemy Emperors were good at alchemy, it didn’t mean that they didn’t know how to refine weapons. In fact, experts who had reached a certain level could refine pills and weapons. It was just that the level was different.","“Many thanks, Master!” Lin Chenxi said happily.","“Mr. Chu, although you’ve repelled Great Joy’s people, I’m afraid they won’t let this matter rest,” Lin Hongfeng said as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood what he meant and said, “Don’t worry. If Great Joy’s people come, I’ll make sure they won’t be able to return. The cultivation technique of this sect is outrageous and unforgivable. I won’t let them off easily after seeing it.”","“Even so, Great Joy is not an ordinary sect. Although it can’t be compared with the three major forces, it’s still a first-class force. It’s said that the sect master of Great Joy has already entered the Divine Abilities Stage a long time ago,” Lin Hongfeng still said worriedly.","Although he knew that Chu Yunfan was also an expert in the Divine Abilities Stage, there were differences between the stages.","“Since I’ve said so, I’m confident. Lord Lin, you don’t have to worry.”","With his current recovery speed, Chu Yunfan would be able to recover to tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage very soon. By then, he would be able to defeat the sect master of Great Joy.","“Thank you, Mr. Chu!”","Lin Hongfeng cupped his hands and said, but his eyes still flickered with a hint of worry. He quickly made a decision in his heart.Chu Yunfan looked at Jin Feng with a cold smile on his face.","“Even if you’re quite powerful, you can’t bully people like this. Great Joy isn’t to be trifled with!” Jin Feng said boomed.","“Great Joy? What’s that? How dare an unorthodox cultivator be so arrogant,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","“Why you...” Jin Feng looked at Chu Yunfan with sharp killing intent in his eyes.","He already understood that it was impossible to resolve today’s matter peacefully.","Suddenly, Jin Feng took out a big red gourd from his waist. He raised the gourd up high and activated it with Innate True Energy. In an instant, a pink centipede flew out from it and pounced toward Chu Yunfan with lightning speed.","Jin Feng’s face showed a hint of a sinister smile. Only he knew what the gourd was. It was a pseudo-magic tool that he had obtained by accident. After many years of refining, it had been completely integrated with him.","Through this treasure gourd, he had tricked several people who had similar cultivation as him. He had even tricked a master in the Divine Abilities Stage and successfully injured him."]},{"number":991,"title":"Chapter 991 The Opportunity for Complete Recovery, Another Great God","paragraphs":["991 The Opportunity for Complete Recovery, Another Great God","The fact that Chu Yunfan had killed Jin Feng so easily seemed to confirm one thing—Chu Yunfan had indeed stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage.","The treatment of a Divine and an Innate were two completely different things. In addition, Chu Yunfan saved the city lord’s family, so his treatment in the city lord’s mansion naturally improved.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t really care about this. Right now, his main task was to recover his strength.","With his strength, as long as he recovered, he would be fearless even in the Holy Land where experts were as common as clouds.","!!","In the next few days, Chu Yunfan was treated as a guest of honor. He recovered his strength while guiding Lin Chenxi in her cultivation.","Through teaching Lin Chenxi, Chu Yunfan also discovered some things about the Holy Land. According to his understanding, the Holy Land had not completely inherited the methods of the Ancient Zenith Civilization.","Perhaps the inheritance was incomplete back then, and the remaining humans who entered the Holy Land were not the top experts of that time, or perhaps the majority of the inheritance had been lost over countless years.","The Holy Land was only slightly stronger than the current Federation, mainly because it seemed to have a more complete inheritance of the Divine Abilities Stage than the Federation.","At present, the Federation was still in the exploration stage of the Divine Abilities Stage. There was no complete inheritance. After cultivating to the Divine Abilities Stage, it was basically a matter of luck. Therefore, the Federation rarely had top experts.","They mainly relied on their advantage in high-tech weapons to gain even ground against Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks.","If these could be introduced into the Federation, the Federation would usher in a great age in martial Dao. It would shorten the exploration time by at least a hundred years, or even a few hundred.","Although Chu Yunfan had a complete inheritance, it was only enough to make him or a small number of people around him strong. If a whole civilization wanted to be strong, it definitely could not rely on one or two people, but on the overall strength of the nation.","It was not impossible for Chu Yunfan to bring the Federation up on his own, but it would take a very long time. It would take at least decades, or even hundreds of years, to popularize the Divine Abilities Stage to the same level as the Innate Stage.","However, if the Holy Land could be introduced into the Federation, this process would be greatly shortened.","Although Lin Chenxi’s cultivation base had only just entered the Innate Stage not long ago, her foundation was very solid. It was obvious that she was practicing an authentic cultivation technique.","It was just that there wasn’t anyone who was brilliant enough to guide her before. But now, with Chu Yunfan’s guidance, in just a few days, her cultivation had advanced to the third Innate Stage. If this continued, it was only a matter of time before she made another breakthrough.","This was also due to Lin Chenxi’s solid foundation. She was only one step away from the door, which was why the effect was so good.","However, this also solidified Chu Yunfan’s reputation as a master teacher, and the city lord’s residence was even more attentive to him.","On the fifth day, a piece of news came. A Divine had arrived at the city lord’s mansion of Tianhe with a few of his disciples.","“Senior Li Yan is a friend of my grandfather’s. Originally, Tianhe was attached to the Fluttering Blooms. But now that the Fluttering Blooms has been destroyed, Father invited Senior Li Yan to come over and become our family’s protector.”","Chu Yunfan was sitting cross-legged in the room he was in. On the other side, Lin Chenxi looked at Chu Yunfan as she reported this.","She seemed to be afraid that Chu Yunfan would be unhappy. After all, a mountain could not accommodate two tigers.","Chu Yunfan smiled slightly but did not take it to heart. He was only Lin Chenxi’s master and had no intention of staying in Tianhe to be a protector.","His goal was not something that could be restricted by Tianhe. How could an ant on the ground understand the vision and thoughts of a divine dragon in the sky?","“Okay.”","Lin Chenxi heard Chu Yunfan only respond with an “okay” and did not seem to care about this matter. She felt relieved. She was afraid that Chu Yunfan would turn around and leave in anger.","After these few days, she had long understood that the master she had jokingly wanted to acknowledge was indeed a capable person.","Whenever she encountered a difficult problem in cultivation, as long as she mentioned it, this little master would be able to solve it for her. It was as if he had already encountered such problems thousands of times.","It wasn’t that she didn’t have a master when she cultivated in the past. Even her father had given her guidance from time to time. However, she could still easily sense that there was a huge difference. They were simply not on the same level.","If Chu Yunfan was angry, then things would be difficult. However, she was also a little depressed, because she could see that Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to be interested in her family.","She even had a feeling that if she hadn’t picked up Chu Yunfan on her way back to Tianhe, they might not have had any interaction with him for their entire lives.","She didn’t know where this feeling came from, but she just had this feeling.","Lin Chenxi believed in her intuition because her intuition had never been wrong. It was as if she had already determined that Chu Yunfan was very strong from the beginning.","Now that she thought about it, this could only be explained by a woman’s sixth sense.","“By the way, Father wants to treat you to lunch and also for you to meet senior Li Yan,” Li Chenxi said.","“Alright.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","In the end, it was Lin Chenxi who was a little depressed. Chu Yunfan’s answer was too short as if he did not care at all.","Little did they know that Chu Yunfan was also in a critical period. Although he had been talking to Li Chenxi, he had actually been healing his injuries and was multitasking.","But now, he felt that he was about to reach a bottleneck. If he broke through, he would be able to recover to tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage and his cultivation might even reach the peak of tier four.","This could also be considered as not building without destruction.","“All right, I’m going into secluded cultivation. Call me again when it’s time for the luncheon,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Yes, Master!” Lin Chenxi said hurriedly. She did not dare to disturb him and left.","Soon, she found her father, Lin Hongfeng. As soon as he saw her, he immediately said, “How did it go, is Mr. Chu angry?”","“No, he isn’t.” Lin Chenxi shook her head.","“That’s good, that’s good!”","Lin Hongfeng heaved a sigh of relief. In his opinion, even if Chu Yunfan was in the Divine Abilities Stage, he should have just entered the Divine Abilities Stage not long ago. After all, he was so young.","However, even a master who had just entered the Divine Abilities Stage was not someone they could afford to offend. In the absence of high-tech weapons, the power of a Divine Abilities Stage master was magnified to the extreme.","If he made Chu Yunfan unhappy because he invited another Divine, then things would get out of hand.","Both sides were gods, and he couldn’t afford to offend either."]},{"number":992,"title":"Chapter 992 Breakthrough, Peak of Tier Four of the Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["992 Breakthrough, Peak of Tier Four of the Divine Abilities Stage","It was a good thing that Chu Yunfan didn’t care about it. Things would be much easier this way.","After all, he was only his daughter’s master. According to what he said, the reason why he was staying here was that he had not recovered from his injuries.","Once he recovered, he probably wouldn’t stay for much longer. Chu Yunfan’s existence could solve the urgent needs of Tianhe, but it was impossible for him to guard Tianhe for a long time.","Lin Hongfeng had been the city lord of Tianhe for many years, and he had met all kinds of people. He could see that Chu Yunfan’s sights were not on Tianhe, which was very rare.","It should be known that even Divines had to cooperate with the city lords. That was because they also needed resources to cultivate. Without the help of the local lords to help collect resources, they would have to spend a lot of time developing their own land and managing it instead of cultivating.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, didn’t seem to care. He felt that their setup here was too small. Shallow waters couldn’t raise true dragons.","Lin Hongfeng knew this, but he was a little curious about Chu Yunfan’s background. After all, Chu Yunfan was already in the Divine Abilities Stage at such a young age. This was not something that an ordinary force could raise.","He could only tell that Chu Yunfan wasn’t a bad person, or he wouldn’t have let his daughter become his disciple.","If Chu Yunfan was a bad person, Lin Hongfeng would stop him even if he had to risk his life. Of course, when one’s cultivation reached the Divine Abilities Stage, they would usually be straightforward and follow their heart.","This was because there were very few things that would make experts at this level go against their own will. Only the powerful could do as they pleased.","But it was also because of this that he felt that Chu Yunfan was by no means an ordinary person. However, upon recalling all the famous geniuses in all the major sects, he could find no one that matched Chu Yunfan.","This in itself was unusual. Even the top forces would try their best to promote a genius of this level, let alone other things.","However, Chu Yunfan was unknown to the public, so he was not sure about his background.","But no matter what, one thing was certain—Chu Yunfan was not an ordinary person.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan was fully focused on healing his injuries. The most troublesome injury in his body was none other than the wound caused by the spatial turbulence.","It was constantly tearing at his cells, making it impossible for him to recover. Otherwise, with his powerful recovery ability, even if his injuries were very serious, he would be able to fully recover in half a day.","But now, as Chu Yunfan’s strength continued to recover, he slowly gained an overwhelming advantage over the spatial turbulence.","And now, he had finally reached a critical juncture. After expelling the last bit of spatial turbulence, the injuries in his body would quickly recover and he would truly return to his peak.","In the process of this endless tug-of-war, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was also soaring. It was even enough for him to improve further.","To be on the safe side, Chu Yunfan went into the Mountain River Diagram. The Spirit Energy around him was constantly condensing. It formed a storm around him. The storm was getting faster and faster, and in just a moment, it had formed a huge hurricane that wrapped around Chu Yunfan.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan finally opened his eyes. A terrifying spatial power was expelled from his body. It turned into a faint light and disappeared.","Although there didn’t seem to be any changes on the surface, he could sense that his entire body was constantly exuding vitality. It was as if a phoenix had gone through rebirth and was stronger and more terrifying than before.","Chu Yunfan’s internal energy was gradually recovering, and it didn’t take long for him to return to his peak state. He rushed back to tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Even so, he hadn’t completed his breakthrough. In just a moment, his energy reached the limit and kept rising.","Cultivation knew no time. After a few hours, Chu Yunfan finally stopped. Compared to before, he had made a huge improvement.","There was no construction without destruction. After this near-death experience, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had broken through to the peak of tier four. He was now at least twice as strong as before.","If others knew about this terrifying increase, they would probably be scared to death. After all, other people’s breakthroughs were not as terrifying as this.","Chu Yunfan sneered. He estimated that ordinary tier-seven Divines were basically food for him. This was because the change in his strength had led to a qualitative change. Only he knew how strong he had become.","“Hmph. Wait until I find that Divine Servant organization. I’d like to see what their background is.” Chu Yunfan snorted. He instinctively felt that this organization might have something to do with his instructor’s disappearance.","It was because the few times they had appeared were too coincidental.","Jeang Yuanbin had disappeared in the Thunderstorm Sea. Chu Yunfan had searched for him and even sent people to search, but it was to no avail. Even Divines would easily die a tragic death if they entered that place.","All high-tech means had lost their effect there too. They couldn’t detect anything with radar or sound waves, and high-altitude satellites couldn’t capture anything. Even with the huge forces of Special Ops, it was very difficult and took a long time to investigate.","Most importantly, Chu Yunfan felt that given the brutal environment of the Thunderstorm Sea, if his instructor had not died there, he should have already left. However, as long as there was a glimmer of hope, he was not willing to let it go.","Chu Yunfan looked at the time. It was already noon, and it was time for the luncheon. He could go and meet this Divine, Li Yan.","Somewhere in the city lord’s mansion, Lin Chenxi was waiting for her master’s arrival. Beside her, a tall young man and a few other young men in similar uniforms were fawning over her.","“Junior Lin, I don’t want to say this, but you’re in too much of a hurry to acknowledge someone else as your master. If you had waited, you would have been able to become my master’s disciple. My master and your grandfather used to be friends, and our families are of equal status,” the young man in the lead said with a look of pity. “I heard that there are a lot of scammers pretending to be Divines these days. You guys better open your eyes and look carefully.”","“Zhang Wei, if you wish to continue speaking ill of my master, let’s end our friendship.” Lin Chenxi’s beautiful eyes flashed with dissatisfaction."]},{"number":993,"title":"Chapter 993 You Are Indeed Ignorant!","paragraphs":["993 You Are Indeed Ignorant!","Lin Chenxi’s eyes were filled with anger as she stared at Zhang Wei.","Seeing that Lin Chenxi was angry, Zhang Wei looked a little embarrassed. However, he still continued, “Junior Lin, you’re still young and naive. You trust others too easily. There are savages who pretend to be masters and swindle people for cultivation resources. I’m doing this for your own good.”","“That’s right, Junior Lin. Senior Zhang is doing this for your own good.”","“This Mister Chu or whatever, we’ve traveled the world for many years, but we’ve never heard of such a person in any of the Holy Land’s sects.”","“Yeah. After all, there’s no knowing what’s in a person’s heart. There’s no harm in being careful, Junior Lin.”","The young men behind Zhang Wei spoke up one after another, both openly and secretly accusing Chu Yunfan of being a swindler.","In fact, even Lin Hongfeng had his suspicions. If he hadn’t seen Chu Yunfan’s true power with his own eyes, he might have also suspected if Chu Yunfan really was a Divine. After all, he couldn’t find out Chu Yunfan’s background.","This was the biggest problem. It was why Zhang Wei and the others dared to believe that Chu Yunfan was a liar. Although the Holy Land was huge, once one reached a certain level, the circle would be so small that it wasn’t very big.","There were only so many Divines. If there really was such a young Divine, it was unlikely that no one would know anything about him.","“Enough!” Lin Chenxi shouted, “Zhang Wei, did you come looking for me just to say these things? If so, you can leave!”","“Junior Lin, I didn’t mean it that way,” Zhang Wei said hurriedly.","“We’re just trying to warn you and Lord Lin to be careful.” Zhang Wei saw that the situation was not good and immediately tried to smooth things over.","However, Lin Chenxi clearly did not want to continue talking to him.","Suddenly, a figure slowly walked out of the courtyard. It was a young man in his twenties who was dressed in black.","“Master!” Lin Chenxi quickly stepped forward and bowed.","“Let’s go,” Chu Yunfan said simply.","As for Zhang Wei and the others, he completely ignored them. How could he not know what Zhang Wei and the others had said? Chu Yunfan had always been a person who would respect others when they showed them respect, not to mention that Zhang Wei was just a mere Innate.","If it was a Divine with a bad temper, they would have killed Zhang Wei with a slap.","Seeing that he had been completely ignored, Zhang Wei’s face flashed with a hint of malice. Especially when he saw Lin Chenxi and Chu Yunfan walking together so intimately. He instinctively felt a sense of threat.","Ever since the first day he met Lin Chenxi, he had been taken by her beauty. He felt that he would marry no one else but her. Furthermore, Lin Chenxi was Lin Hongfeng’s precious daughter. If he married her, he would have a better chance of stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage in the future.","In the Holy Land, the inheritance of the Divine Abilities Stage was more complete. It was unlike the Federation which relied on luck. However, it was still extremely difficult to enter the Divine Abilities Stage from the Innate Stage.","Only with enough resources could one have a chance to step into the Divine Abilities Stage. In the Holy Land, Innates and Divines were two worlds apart. One was an ant on the ground, while the other was a dragon in the sky. They could not be mentioned in the same breath.","Chu Yunfan sneered. He saw the look on Zhang Wei’s face, but he didn’t bother to argue with him. If he really dared to do anything, Chu Yunfan could crush him with just one finger.","Now that he had fully recovered and even improved, he had nothing to fear.","Soon, under Lin Chenxi’s lead, Chu Yunfan entered the venue of today’s luncheon. In addition to the host, Lin Hongfeng, who was sitting in the head seat, there were two seats on each of his sides facing each other from a distance.","In one of the seats, a thin old man was sitting upright. Just by sitting there, a powerful aura shrouded the whole venue. Although he did not release much of his aura, he did not intend to restrain it either. If an ordinary Innate stood beside him, they would feel uncomfortable.","And the other empty seat was clearly reserved for Chu Yunfan.","There was another seat next to Chu Yunfan, which was reserved for Lin Chenxi. Opposite Lin Chenxi was the young city lord of Tianhe, Lin Haoren.","After that, there were some important officials of Tianhe. The luncheon was very grand, and all kinds of delicious food were served one after another.","“Hahaha, you’re here, Mr. Chu. Please take a seat!” Lin Hongfeng said as he quickly stood up. He didn’t dare to be arrogant in front of Chu Yunfan.","The old man had been staring at Chu Yunfan the moment he entered the venue. He waited until Chu Yunfan sat down opposite him and stared at him.","How could Chu Yunfan not understand that this old man was none other than the Divine that had been invited, Li Yan?","“For today’s luncheon, I’m honored to have two Divines grace us with their presence—Senior Li Yan and Mr. Chu!” Lin Hongfeng said loudly, looking very excited. “This is a Grand occasion for Tianhe!”","“I’d also like to announce two other happy news to everyone. One is that my daughter, Lin Chenxi, has the honor of becoming Mr. Chu’s disciple. The other is that my son, Lin Haoren, has the honor of becoming Li Yan’s disciple,” Lin Hongfeng continued.","Everyone’s eyes were focused on Chu Yunfan and Li Yan. It was as if both sides had agreed to take in one offspring of the city lord each.","The important officials and patriarchs of the various families in Tianhe were happy. They had long since been tied to Tianhe. The more powerful the city was, the more benefits they would receive.","Now that the city lord had roped in two Divines, things would start looking up for the unstable Tianhe.","“Hold on!” Zhang Wei, who had just arrived, suddenly spoke up.","Everyone’s eyes turned to him. He slowly walked up and said, “Earlier, Lord Lin said that this Mr. Chu is also a Divine. Forgive my ignorance, but how have I never heard of such a Divine in the Holy Land?”","Zhang Wei’s words immediately caused a commotion among many people. This was what many people were most suspicious of Chu Yunfan. It was as if this person had suddenly jumped out from the crack in a stone. No one knew who he was.","However, most looked to Li Yan. Zhang Wei was his eldest disciple, and it was impossible to say that Zhang Wei had not received his permission.","As for Zhang Wei’s words, Li Yan acted as if he didn’t hear them. He ate the delicacies in a relaxed manner as if it had nothing to do with him.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan said, “You are indeed ill-informed.”"]},{"number":994,"title":"Chapter 994 I Will Kill You in One Move","paragraphs":["994 I Will Kill You in One Move","Chu Yunfan’s calm words were like a sudden clap of thunder, instantly exploding throughout the luncheon.","Zhang Wei had provoked him to his face, and it was obvious that Chu Yunfan would not tolerate it. No one found it strange. After all, Chu Yunfan was known to be a Divine.","How could a Divines tolerate the clamoring of an Innate?","Most importantly, Zhang Wei had another Divine, Li Yan, behind him. It was obvious that Li Yan was dissatisfied with Chu Yunfan’s existence. Many had the impression that Li Yan wanted to monopolize all the forces in Tianhe.","!!","This was not impossible. After all, it was better to monopolize an entire city than to share it. However, no one wanted Li Yan’s clan to monopolize the entirety of Tianhe.","It was best for both sides to be in balance and restrain each other. Only then could they ensure their city would not become a vassal.","This was why Lin Hongfeng announced that his children would be under Chu Yunfan and Li Yan’s tutelage. They could imagine that there must be a balance in his mind.","This was clearly the most beneficial model for Tianhe.","But now, it was obvious that Li Yan was not satisfied with his current position, and he was about to launch an attack. In many people’s opinion, if this continued, Tianhe would not know peace in the future.","After all, Divines were like emperors to them.","“You’re ignorant and ill-informed. A frog at the bottom of a well. You don’t know anything and yet here you are being smug about it.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “How can a worm like you understand the world of eagles?”","“Why you!”","Chu Yunfan’s unconcealed contempt infuriated Zhang Wei. Chu Yunfan likened him to a frog at the bottom of a well, which he absolutely couldn’t tolerate. Moreover, he was even more certain that Chu Yunfan wasn’t in the Divine Abilities Stage. Especially when he compared Chu Yunfan to his master, Li Yan.","Li Yan’s aura was as deep as the ocean and was extremely terrifying. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan’s aura could not be compared to Li Yan’s.","“Mr. Chu. What sort of name is this? You’re just a sneaky person. Do you dare to tell me your name?” Zhang Wei looked directly at Chu Yunfan.","“Zhang Wei, what are you trying to do?!” Lin Chenxi said as she slammed the table with her fair and tender hand. “If you continue to cause trouble, I’ll have someone kick you out. Don’t think that I won’t dare to just because you’re Senior Li Yan’s disciple!”","Lin Chenxi’s little face was filled with anger. It was obvious that her patience with Zhang Wei had reached its limit. Zhang Wei repeatedly provoked Chu Yunfan’s position. It was simply intolerable.","“Junior Lin, I’m just speaking the truth. Aren’t you all curious? Who was this Mr. Chu? Why doesn’t he dare to give his name? Is it because he’s not a Divine, or is it because he has some strong enemies?” Zhang Wei continued to speak loudly, “As far as I know, he was picked up by Junior Lin after being injured. Don’t you all want to know who injured him? Aren’t you afraid of implicating Tianhe by taking in a person of unknown origin?”","Zhang Wei’s words instantly made many people hesitate. Indeed, Chu Yunfan’s matter was not a secret, because there were too many people on the escort team at that time, so it was impossible to hide the news.","They were worried. Since Chu Yunfan had proved himself to be very strong, the enemy who could injure him must be even more powerful.","What if his enemies came looking for him?","To them, it would be like the gods in Heaven fighting and the mortals on Earth suffering.","Originally, some people wanted to speak up for Chu Yunfan, but when they thought of this, they didn’t say anything.","Chu Yunfan’s background was unknown, and he might have provoked a strong enemy. It might be best for someone like to not stay in Tianhe.","“You want me to tell you my name?” Chu Yunfan chuckled. “Would you even know if it’s true just because I told you? Besides, who do you think you are? You think I’ll tell you my name just because you asked? Who do you think you are?","“Hehe, you’re just a fox who uses the tiger’s might as intimidation. You forget that you’re just an Innate. How dare you be so presumptuous in front of me.”","“Mr. Chu, you say that you’re in the Divine Abilities Stage, but who has ever seen you use your powers? You’re just a slightly stronger peak Innate. You may have deceived everyone, but you can’t deceive me!” Zhang Wei said, “Do you dare to accept my challenge? I’ll expose you in front of everyone!”","“Impudent! Zhang Wei, you’re getting out of hand! Men, take him out! My house is no place for you to be impudent!” Lin Chenxi shouted.","Suddenly, Li Yan, who had been silent all this time, spoke, “True gold fears no fire. Since you’re so confident in your cultivation, Mr. Chu, what’s wrong with giving my disciple some guidance? Life and death will be determined by fate, and blessings are determined by the Heavens.”","Chu Yunfan shook his head. Just when everyone thought he was going to refuse the challenge, he suddenly said, “For Lord Lin’s sake, I didn’t want to argue with you, but you’ve barked at me time and time again, so don’t blame me for what comes next. Your master is right. Life and death are determined by fate, and blessings are determined by the Heavens. If you have any means, just use them. If I can’t kill you in one move, I’ll admit that I’m a liar.”","“All right. You’re the one who said it.” Zhang Wei’s face revealed an expression as if his scheme had succeeded. He had said all this in order to force Chu Yunfan to this point and grab hold of his words.","He wasn’t sure how strong Chu Yunfan was. Even if Chu Yunfan wasn’t in the Divine Abilities Stage, according to the rumors about him killing Jin Feng, who was an Innate, he should be at least a great master among the peak Innates.","However, if it was just one move, then things would be much simpler.","“Master, he’s clearly doing this on purpose. Don’t be fooled,” Lin Chenxi said hurriedly.","“So what if he did it on purpose? An ant is just an ant. Just watch as I kill him in one move,” Chu Yunfan said. His eyes were filled with disgust. Zhang Wei had provoked him time and time again, and his patience had run dry.","“Mr. Chu, I’d like to see how you’re going to kill me in one move!” Zhang Wei burst into laughter.","Suddenly, a full-body armor appeared on him. As soon as the armor appeared, it burst out with a terrifying golden light, making him look like a golden buddha.","Zhang Wei’s aura quickly rose to another level. If Zhang Wei’s cultivation base was originally at the peak of the Innate Stage, then after equipping this armor, he had temporarily leaped to the Divine Abilities Stage.","He had gained the ability to fight against a first-tier Divine for a short period.","‘He came prepared!’ everyone present thought."]},{"number":995,"title":"Chapter 995 Killing With a Single Strike, the Situation Changes Again!","paragraphs":["995 Killing With a Single Strike, the Situation Changes Again!","Everyone understood that Zhang Wei had come prepared. Whether Chu Yunfan was in the Divine Abilities Stage or not, he would probably be forced into a corner.","When considering Chu Yunfan’s age, even if he was in the Divine Abilities Stage, his cultivation level shouldn’t be too high.","And the only person who could give Zhang Wei such a magic weapon was probably his master, Li Yan.","Li Yan, on the other hand, still looked indifferent. Obviously, he had planned this long ago.","Boom!","The aura around Zhang Wei’s body completely exploded. A terrifying aura that was obviously above the Innate Stage was released.","“Purple Flame Finger!”","Zhang Wei made his move. He flew directly into the sky and pointed his finger. Purple flames spurted out from his fingertip. In just a moment, it had swept out a monstrous flame and bombarded Chu Yunfan.","Many of the senior officials of Tianhe were about to jump up in shock. The purple flames seemed to be able to bring the whole world down.","Zhang Wei was going to kill Chu Yunfan with one strike.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, was unhurried.","“What gave you the impression that you could provoke me?” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly. The attack hit Chu Yunfan head-on.","“It’s done!” A ferocious smile appeared on Zhang Wei’s face. When this attack was fully unleashed, it definitely had the power of an ordinary Divine.","Li Yan’s face also showed a satisfied smile. As expected, Chu Yunfan was just a liar.","However, before he could smile triumphantly, his expression suddenly changed. They saw that Chu Yunfan, who should have been completely submerged in the explosion, was revealed to be unscathed.","“How is that possible?!” Li Yan couldn’t maintain the calmness he deliberately pretended to be.","As for Zhang Wei, he had used all his strength and confidence in his attack but seemed to be unable to do anything to Chu Yunfan.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan made his move. His big hand grabbed at the void, and countless Spirit Energy instantly condensed into a big Qi-condensed hand as if it had received an order. This Qi-condensed hand grabbed Zhang Wei and caught him.","“No!” Li Yan immediately realized the seriousness of the problem.","However, it was too late. Chu Yunfan’s large hand suddenly slammed down.","Bam!","Zhang Wei didn’t even have time to let out a scream before Chu Yunfan’s attack crushed him into a mist of blood.","A deathly silence filled the air, especially for the officials of Tianhe. Although they had long guessed Chu Yunfan’s identity and strength, this was the first time they had seen this harmless-looking young man’s true appearance.","Looking at his calm expression, they finally came back to their senses. A Divine was a Divine after all. Even if they looked harmless, in essence, they were not on the same level as others.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, acted as if he had just killed an insignificant person and did not care about Zhang Wei.","Li Yan suddenly stood up and glared at Chu Yunfan. He thundered, “Why did you kill him?! It’s just a sparring match! You were too heavy-handed!”","Chu Yunfan glanced at Li Yan and said, “Was I? If my cultivation base was not high enough and I was only at the Innate Stage as you guessed, his attack just now would have killed me. He had the intention to kill me, so what’s the problem with me killing him?”","Everyone nodded in agreement. They could clearly see that it was Zhang Wei who had set up a trap to force Chu Yunfan to that point. Unfortunately, Zhang Wei’s skills were inferior to Chu Yunfan’s. No one had expected him to be so powerful.","“Hmph! You killed my disciple. Do you think that’s enough?” Li Yan looked at him coldly.","“What are you going to do about it?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “This guy has provoked me time and time again. You’re supporting him from behind, right? I wasn’t interested in you being the city’s protector, but since you’ve come to my door, don’t blame me for being impolite.”","“You savage! How dare you kill my eldest disciple?!” Li Yan shouted. “I’ll bury all of you with him!”","When Lin Hongfeng and the other officials heard this, their faces fell. What did this have to do with them? They were just bystanders. They had clearly not done anything, but now they were being implicated.","“Senior Li Yan, are you planning to get us involved?” Lin Hongfeng looked at Li Yan coldly. He could see that Li Yan’s killing intent was not a joke. He was afraid that Li Yan really had the intention to drag them down too.","“That’s right. Zhang Wei’s death is related to you. I want all of you to die with him!” Li Yan’s eyes were bloodshot as he spoke with a somewhat crazed look.","The people of Tianhe immediately became vigilant. Li Yan didn’t seem to have come with good intentions.","“Senior Li Yan, what do you mean by this?!” Lin Hongfeng gritted his teeth and shouted.","“What does he mean? Does he need to explain any further? Lin Hongfeng, what he means is that all of you must die. Your whole family will be wiped out from Tianhe!”","Suddenly, an arrogant voice came from outside the city lord’s mansion, followed by a noisy fight. It only took a few moments for the noise to calm down.","Then, a figure strode in. It was a middle-aged man in a black robe with a fierce look on his face.","“It’s you, Bao Anzhi!”","When Lin Hongfeng saw the man, his eyes suddenly flashed with a terrifying light. The officials of Tianhe began to panic as they recognized the middle-aged man.","“That’s right, it’s me, Lin Hongfeng. We haven’t seen each other for many years, and there are some debts that we have to settle,” the middle-aged man, Bao Anzhi, said as he grinned. It was fine if he didn’t smile, but when he did, he looked ferocious.","“You still dare to appear in front of us? The Lin family had been extremely kind to you in the past, but in the end, you colluded with outsiders to rebel. I spared your life on account of your ancestors’ contributions to Tianhe. Now, you actually dare to collude with outsiders to rebel?!” Lin Hongfeng’s chest heaved with anger.","At this point, how could it not be understood that Bao Anzhi, the traitor, was in cahoots with Li Yan? No wonder Li Yan agreed without many conditions when he sent someone to invite him.","Initially, he thought that it was because his ancestor was on good terms with Li Yan. However, it seemed like that was not the case.","On the contrary, Li Yan had been in cahoots with Bao Anzhi since a long time ago, and Li Yan had been a spy among them from the very beginning.","The situation changed drastically."]},{"number":996,"title":"Chapter 996 Don’t You Think It’s Too Early to Be Celebrating?","paragraphs":["996 Don’t You Think It’s Too Early to Be Celebrating?","“Hmph. Lin Hongfeng, why are you pretending to be a good person? Is the status of your family Heaven’s will? If your family can be the city’s ruling family, why can’t my family, the Baos, be the ruling family?” Bao Anzhi said, “Besides, although you let me go back then, you killed my whole family. How can I not take revenge for this deep blood feud? Today, I’m here to take back everything I’ve lost. None of you will leave here alive. I will get rid of all of you and save myself the trouble of looking for you one by one.”","The officials’ expressions became solemn. It was obvious that Bao Anzhi had planned to capture and kill all of them in one fell swoop. Even this luncheon had been a trap.","Since they were invited here, they were naturally the Lin family’s trusted aides. Under such circumstances, Bao Anzhi would not let them off easily.","“D*mn it, what should we do?!”","!!","“Bao Anzhi, you despicable person!”","“You’re seeking death, Bao Anzhi!”","The officials started to curse, but Bao Anzhi didn’t care. He simply sneered at these people, seeming as if he were looking at dead men.","“Letting you go back then was the biggest mistake I’ve ever made. Now, I’m going to correct this mistake!” Lin Hongfeng shouted.","Back then, he had been soft-hearted and let Bao Anzhi go. Who knew that it would turn into this situation? Now, he had to personally deal with this future trouble.","Boom!","Lin Hongfeng instantly flew out like a cannonball. He flew through the air and came down from above, crushing Bao Anzhi with a force akin to Mount Tai.","Bam!","Lin Hongfeng’s attack landed directly on Bao Anzhi, but Bao Anzhi didn’t move. For him, this attack was like a breeze blowing in his face. It couldn’t move him even an inch.","“How is this possible?!”","Lin Hongfeng suddenly turned pale with fright. He knew his own attack very well. He hadn’t held back and used all his strength. However, it was completely useless against Bao Anzhi. His peak Innate strength couldn’t even hurt Bao Anzhi.","“Oh no!”","Lin Hongfeng suddenly thought of one possibility for such a strange situation. Bao Anzhi had already entered the Divine Abilities Stage. This was the only way to cause such a strange situation.","Bao Anzhi had a sinister smile on his face.”You only thought of this now? It’s too late!”","Bao Anzhi laughed out loud. He released his aura, forming a terrifying wave that instantly blasted in Lin Hongfeng’s direction.","Bam!","Lin Hongfeng was swept away by this wave of air as if he had suffered a heavy blow. He was blown away and fell to the ground.","Pfft!","Lin Hongfeng spurted out a mouthful of blood. After being hit by this attack, almost all the bones in his body were broken. Bao Anzhi didn’t use much strength, but the gap between them was that huge.","There was an uncrossable chasm between the peak of the Innate Stage and the Divine Abilities Stage.","“Impossible! You’re supposed to be weaker than me!”","Lin Hongfeng couldn’t believe it. He recalled when he had let Bao Anzhi go. Although Bao Anzhi was well-respected in Tianhe at that time, he was still much weaker than him. Bao Anzhi shouldn’t have been any match for him.","But now, Lin Hongfeng couldn’t even stop Bao Anzhi’s attack. The difference was simply unimaginable.","“Hahahaha! It’s been so many years, and you’re still judging people by old stories. It’s all thanks to you. If it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t have been driven out of Tianhe like a stray dog. If it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t have gotten the opportunity to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage.” Bao Anzhi laughed heartily.","At that moment, everyone finally understood where Bao Anzhi’s confidence came from. A Divine was enough to crush an ordinary city like Tianhe.","Especially now that Li Yan, the protector of Tianhe, was clearly on Bao Anzhi’s side, they felt even more despair.","Everyone was in despair. Li Yan had betrayed them, and Bao Anzhi, who had suddenly appeared, was actually in the Divine Abilities Stage. Were the Heavens really so blind that they wanted them all to die here?","“Lin Hongfeng, since you let me go, I will give you a quick death. But I will take your daughter. Hahaha!”","Bao Anzhi looked at Lin Chenxi with eyes filled with greed and desire. Lin Chenxi’s reputation was widespread, and even he was tempted by her.","“Don’t even think about it!” Lin Chenxi trembled in anger. Bao Anzhi’s greedy eyes made her feel disgusted.","Now that her father was injured, this villian was clearly more powerful than everyone had imagined.","Suddenly, the sound of footsteps came from behind Bao Anzhi. In just a moment, hundreds of people had rushed in. These hundreds of people were all experts. The weakest among them were peak Acquired, and most of them were Innates. Such a force was indeed powerful.","Bao Anzhi had been away for many years and had formed a considerable force. The guards that should have been in the city lord’s mansion had not appeared, so they had probably already been killed.","“Can you do it now? I want them all to die and be buried with my disciple!” Li Yan said through gritted teeth. “Also, according to our agreement, you have to give me some of the taxes collected in Tianhe.”","After Li Yan finished speaking, everyone finally understood why Li Yan had suddenly moved to the side. They didn’t expect Bao Anzhi to be willing to share such a large piece of the cake. Normally, even if they hired a protector, they wouldn’t give half of the city’s income to the other party. If that happened, the city would have a hard time operating.","In order to win Li Yan’s support, Bao Anzhi obviously didn’t care about these things.","“Of course, no problem,” Bao Anzhi said.","The expression on his face became more and more ferocious. For so many years, he had been hiding like a stray dog. Now, he could finally take back everything that he thought belonged to him.","“Kill them all! Other than that little beauty, don’t leave anyone alive!”","Bao Anzhi shouted, and the hundreds of people behind him immediately revealed bloodthirsty expressions. They were bloodthirsty people who licked blood from their blades, and now, they exploded like hundreds of hungry wolves.","However, just as they were underway and the officials were about to fight to the death, a sword light suddenly swept out as if it was going to split the sky.","Spurt!","Spurt!","Spurt!","The sound of bodies exploding could be heard. The hundreds of bloodthirsty experts were swept by the sword light. They instantly exploded in mid-air.","“Don’t you think it’s too early to be celebrating?”"]},{"number":997,"title":"Chapter 997 Hearing About the Holy Land’s Wei Clan Again","paragraphs":["997 Hearing About the Holy Land’s Wei Clan Again","Along with this clear voice, a figure slowly walked out from the side. It was Chu Yunfan. Because of Bao Anzhi’s appearance, everyone’s eyes had fallen on him as if they had forgotten about Chu Yunfan.","Hundreds of experts were killed in an instant.","The officials all gasped and felt a sense of grievance. Those who could become the high-level officials of Tianhe were at least at the seventh Innate Stage and above, and there were even some peak Innates.","However, these Innates were completely vulnerable in the face of these Divines.","Whether it was Zhang Wei, who had been crushed to death by Chu Yunfan, or Lin Hongfeng, who couldn’t even block Bao Anzhi’s aura, they were all well-known figures among the Innates.","In front of a Divine, Inmates were no different from ants. The scene of hundreds being wiped out in an instant was too shocking.","“A Divine. This is the power of a Divine. What are we still standing here?!”","“That’s right. Those in the Divine Abilities Stage can dominate everything!”","“In the end, the world is still decided by these powerhouses!”","The officials said one after another. They were distraught. In front of these Divines, they were simply ants.","“Why you...” Bao Anzhi looked at Chu Yunfan coldly, his eyes filled with killing intent.","“Brother, as far as I know, you’re only this little girl’s master. Is it necessary to sacrifice yourself?” Bao Anzhi said coldly.","Chu Yunfan’s attack just now had not only shocked the officials but also him. The officials thought that a Divine could have such strength but he knew that even he could not kill hundreds of Acquireds and Innates with a simple sword strike.","That was why he suppressed the killing intent in his heart and did not attack. Otherwise, with his brutal personality, he would have attacked long ago.","“A teacher for a day is a father for life. I think you should understand this principle,” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “Besides, I do not like you. Don’t you know that the ones who die the fastest are the ugly villains?”","Bao Anzhi’s expression grew twisted. The contempt in Chu Yunfan’s heart almost made him explode with anger.","“Brother, you must be joking!” Bao Anzhi said word by word, “I want to control Tianhe and am in need of people. If all these trash were to die, it wouldn’t matter. If you’re willing to join me, I can give you the other half of Tianhe’s profits. What do you think?”","Bao Anzhi’s words made Chu Yunfan look at him in a new light. He was able to endure Chu Yunfan’s mockery. He was indeed not simple. No wonder he could turn from a stray dog into a Divine.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t been here today, Bao Anzhi’s revenge would have been a success. He could be considered a formidable character.","“Hehe, there’s only so much profit in Tianhe, and you’re willing to give me half and Li Yan the other half. Don’t you want any of it?” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","“The main purpose of my return is to get revenge. To be honest, I don’t care about the little benefits from Tianhe,” Bao Anzhi said.","“Let me give you a piece of advice. While I’m still willing to talk to you, you’d better listen to me. Do you think I’m working alone? I have the number one family of the Holy Land, the Wei clan, behind me.”","Bao Anzhi mentioned the force behind him, and there was a smug look on his face. He thought back to decades ago when he had been in a constant state of anxiety like a stray dog. It was because he had joined the Wei clan that he had the glory he had today.","Except for Chu Yunfan, everyone else gasped. In the Holy Land, there was only one Wei clan. It was the number one family of the Holy Land. With their power, they managed to develop to where they could compete with the top sects. It was simply a behemoth.","With the Wei clan’s strength, it would only take a single word for them to destroy Tianhe.","Everyone looked at Bao Anzhi. No wonder he had been able to make a comeback. It turned out that he had joined the Wei clan. Everything could be explained.","“Now, the Wei clan is going to rule this area, including Tianhe. All those who resist will die. I originally wanted to kill you all, but since all the trash is dead, I’m willing to give you a chance. If you surrender willingly, I will let bygones be bygones.”","The more Bao Anzhi spoke, the more confident he became. Yes, he had the powerful Wei clan behind him. What was there to be afraid of?","The officials were swayed for a moment. Who could compete with a behemoth like the Wei clan? Even Divines were nothing in front of the Wei clan.","“No, I must kill him!” Li Yan glared at Chu Yunfan, wishing he could tear him into pieces.","“Li Yan, don’t ruin the master’s plan. Zhang Wei was just a peak Innate disciple. You can just take another one. You know the consequences if you ruin the master’s plan,” Bao Anzhi reprimanded Li Yan.","“Hmph!” Li Yan didn’t say anything else but just glared at Chu Yunfan fiercely.","At this time, except for Bao Anzhi, who was speaking with confidence and assurance, everyone was silent. Even Lin Hongfeng had nothing to say. They were not only facing Bao Anzhi, but also the behemoth Wei clan, which no one dared to provoke.","“So it’s the Wei clan.” Chu Yunfan broke the silence with a sneer on his face.","He and the Wei clan could be considered old rivals. The Wei clan had attacked him several times, especially when the Wei clan was the vanguard in the Holy Land’s invasion of the Federation.","There was no possibility of reconciliation.","“How about it?” Bao Anzhi asked triumphantly. “In front of the Wei clan’s name, everyone had to lower their heads.”","“No. If you didn’t say that you were related to the Wei clan, I wouldn’t have killed you. But since you are related to them, I can’t let you live,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“You’re courting death!”","Bao Anzhi also didn’t expect Chu Yunfan’s attitude to change so suddenly. He was enraged and instantly released all his aura. An aura that belonged to the Divine Abilities Stage enveloped the entire city lord’s residence."]},{"number":998,"title":"Chapter 998 One Punch to Kill Bao Anzhi","paragraphs":["998 One Punch to Kill Bao Anzhi","An aura that belonged to the Divine Abilities Stage enveloped the entire city lord’s mansion. It was the aura of a true Divine, not a fake Divine like Zhang Wei.","“Since you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish!” Bao Anzhi’s expression instantly turned cold.","Swish!","Bao Anzhi waved his hand, and a shocking rainbow instantly left its sheath. The astonishing sword light overflowed. It was so dazzling that people couldn’t open their eyes.","The dazzling light made Bao Anzhi look like a sword immortal, and his murderous aura resounded.","“Shi*t!” someone screamed.","This sword light was extremely sharp. Though it wasn’t aimed at them, they still felt as if their skin was being cut. They immediately retreated.","At this time, even Lin Haoren and Lin Chenxi quickly supported the seriously injured Lin Hongfeng and retreated to the side.","Lin Chenxi looked at Chu Yunfan with eyes full of worry. Even if she did not know how to fight Divine opponents, she could still feel how amazing this sword light was.","The sword turned into a long rainbow and slashed down at Chu Yunfan. It was as if even the stars in the sky were about to turn into nothingness under this sword. With a shrill whistling sound, the sword slashed down at Chu Yunfan.","“Petty tricks. Do you think you’re qualified to be on equal footing with me just because we’re both Divines? I’ll let you know how big the gap between us is.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He wasn’t afraid in the least. He clenched his five fingers into a fist and rays of golden light burst out. The terrifying fist force boiled up and swept across like a vast ocean.","Many people’s eyes were wide open. They didn’t even dare to blink. After all, Chu Yunfan was their last hope.","Before this, many had doubted whether he was truly in the Divine Abilities Stage. After all, he rarely revealed his true cultivation.","And now, he finally revealed his true cultivation. His astonishing power surged out and swept out like a vast ocean.","Chu Yunfan’s fist glowed with a golden light. He was not afraid as he met the sword light head-on.","“You’re looking for death!” Bao Anzhi laughed out loud. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan’s actions were simply seeking his own death.","Boom!","The fist broke through everything in its path and bombarded the terrifying sword light. The energy that burst out in the sky spread out like a gust of wind, blowing everyone to the side and forcing them to retreat. Many people had to attack over and over to hit away the sword light that had burst out.","Everyone could see that the sword lights were actually shards that had splashed out from Bao Anzhi’s sword light. Even so, these shards were enough to make the Innates’ arms numb. They were secretly shocked. These Divines were truly terrifying.","Then, to everyone’s surprise, when the fist energy and the sword energy collided, it was not Chu Yunfan’s fist that was shattered. On the contrary, his fist energy tore the sword energy apart and shattered it into pieces.","“This is impossible!”","Bao Anzhi couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan had actually broken through his full-power sword attack.","However, Chu Yunfan’s punch didn’t stop. It didn’t slow down one bit. With just one punch, he pierced through Bao Anzhi’s defense and landed a hit directly on his chest.","Although Bao Anzhi had long entered the Divine Abilities Stage and was even in tier two, he was still no match for Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","All of Bao Anzhi’s defenses were instantly pierced through, and a large hole appeared in his chest. Then, he was sent flying like a heavy cannon, smashing a huge hole in the luncheon venue’s floor.","Everyone looked at Bao Anzhi. The extremely arrogant Bao Anzhi was now writhing on the floor. He couldn’t get up. There was a huge hole in his chest that took up half of his chest.","Even a Divine would not be able to escape death from such a terrifying injury. Everyone could see that Bao Anzhi’s life force was rapidly draining away. If no one came to save him, he would die in a moment.","There was a deathly silence. Only the sound of gasping could be heard in the entire venue. Bao Anzhi had been so arrogant before when he had severely injured Lin Hongfeng with only the aura he had released. He had wanted to kill all the officials of Tianhe with his strength. But now, he had died just like that.","He couldn’t even block a single attack from Chu Yunfan. The difference in strength between the two sides was too great.","A thought appeared in everyone’s mind, ‘That was Chu Yunfan’s true strength. What is low-key? This was low-key! Even with such strength, he didn’t show off in the slightest.’","If Zhang Wei hadn’t forced him, Chu Yunfan probably wouldn’t even say a word or make a move. Before this, many thought that he didn’t dare to make a move, but now they understood that it was because he didn’t want to.","Watching Li Yan and his disciple put on a show was like watching a monkey show.","Many people felt their blood boiling after breathing out a sigh of relief. Previously, Li Yan and Bao Anzhi were aggressive and almost made them feel despair. But now, they had died a tragic death at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","After Chu Yunfan killed Bao Anzhi with one punch, he didn’t stop. On the contrary, the aura on his body continued to rise, and like a vast ocean, it rushed toward Li Yan.","Chu Yunfan’s face was expressionless. He simply sneered at Li Yan and said, “It’s your turn. Are you ready to die?”","“Mr. Chu, do you want to go against the Wei clan?” Li Yan saw Chu Yunfan’s eyes on him, and he suddenly felt his hair stand on end as if he was being stared at by a fierce beast.","This feeling made him feel extremely uncomfortable, and the fact that Chu Yunfan had killed Bao Anzhi with a single punch was shocking.","The only option he could think of now was to use the Wei clan to suppress Chu Yunfan.","“So what I go against the Wei clan? It’s not like I’ve only been doing this for a day or two.”","Chu Yunfan’s words were shocking. There was actually shocking news that he had fought with the behemoth Wei clan, and it wasn’t just a day or two.","Who exactly was this Chu Yunfan?","“Even if the Wei clan’s direct descendants came here personally, I would still kill them, let alone you.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Li Yan’s first reaction was to run. Although he was stronger than Bao Anzhi, he couldn’t kill Bao Anzhi so easily. Chu Yunfan’s strength was probably far above his.","“It’s too late for you to leave now!”","Chu Yunfan chuckled and immediately caught up with Li Yan, blocking his way out.","“I’m going to kill you!”","When Li Yan saw that his path of retreat had been cut off, he instantly exploded. His strength, which was even more terrifying than Bao Anzhi’s, exploded out."]},{"number":999,"title":"Chapter 999 Learning the Technique, Slashing Down LI Yan","paragraphs":["999 Learning the Technique, Slashing Down LI Yan","Li Yan had never dreamed that the final outcome would turn out like this. He had been colluding with Bao Anzhi to seize control of Tianhe.","Bao Anzhi had the behemoth Wei clan behind him. He could ignore Tianhe’s profits, but Li Yan couldn’t.","When one’s cultivation reached the Divine Abilities Stage, the resources required were a hundred times more than the Innate Stage.","After reaching the Divine Abilities Stage, it was impossible to advance further without the support of a force. It was impossible to complete the task if one had to collect all the required resources on their own.","There was no end to cultivation, but there was a limit to one’s lifespan. Divines had a slightly longer lifespan than the average person, but they were not immortal.","In addition to the Wei clan’s reputation, it was almost certain that Li Yan would side with Bao Anzhi.","There shouldn’t have been any twists and turns. Not to mention that Lin Hongfeng was still stuck at the peak of the Innate Stage, even if he had entered the Divine Abilities Stage, Li Yan would still be able to suppress him. Moreover, Bao Anzhi was working together with him.","Who knew that when they arrived, they would find out that there was a master who seemed to be in the Divine Abilities Stage in Tianhe? Although he was only the master of the city lord’s daughter, if he was on Lin Hongfeng’s side, it would definitely affect their plan greatly.","That was why Zhang Wei had provoked Chu Yunfan so brazenly in order to drive him away. Of course, it would be even better if he could kill Chu Yunfan.","However, no one had expected that this seemingly harmless Chu Yunfan, who he had thought was at most someone who had just entered the Divine Abilities Stage, would turn out to be so terrifying.","His judgment was based on age. Chu Yunfan was young. Entering the Divine Abilities Stage at this age was already a shocking thing. It was a miracle, so he didn’t dare to imagine that Chu Yunfan was holding back his strength.","And it was this little misjudgment that cost him his life.","At this point, Li Yan had no other choice. His aura burst out, and it was even more terrifying than Bao Anzhi’s. He was already in tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage.","The mighty aura burst out and enveloped more than half of Tianhe. Many martial artists in Tianhe trembled. From the beginning, the pressure of Divines had been bursting out from the direction of the city lord’s mansion.","It was obvious that there was more than one Divine. Many people recalled the legends from their ancestors that whenever this happened, it was very likely that a new city lord would be chosen.","The position of the various cities’ city lords in the Holy Land was not smooth sailing. The city lords could be driven away if they were not careful.","And every time there was a change of ruling, it would cause a bloody storm. Was it finally time for a change?","Boom!","Then, they saw a pillar of light shoot up into the sky and disperse the white clouds above.","The terrifying scene was spectacular. Then, a spear appeared out of thin air above the brilliance. It was condensed from countless brilliance. The spear expanded in the wind, growing longer and longer. In just a moment, it had become a terrifying spear that was hundreds of meters long and several meters wide.","This exceeded the scope of ordinary martial arts and had risen to the level of divine power. Only experts in the Divine Abilities Stage could do it.","The crowd was even more certain of one thing—there was indeed a Divine making a move.","Everyone in Tianhe had seen it, not to mention the people in the city lord’s mansion. They felt suffocated as if the spear had frozen all the air around them, making it impossible for them to breathe.","“Since you’ve forced me to this point, you’ll have to pay the price!”","Li Yan was flying high in the air. He raised one of his hands high and then suddenly swung it down. The huge spear suddenly came down at the speed of lightning, ruthlessly smashing toward Chu Yunfan.","“Heaven-Stabilizing Spear!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t move and just stared at the spear. It was as if countless pieces of information were jumping into his eyes.","‘Not a bad technique. It’s a pity that it’s incomplete,’ Chu Yunfan thought to himself.","He too liked to grab a ball of energy and turn it into a weapon to attack, but that was forcibly condensed by his powerful internal energy. However, this Heaven-Stabilizing Spear was a special technique.","At that moment, the godhead was emitting a shocking light in Chu Yunfan’s mind. It was as if it could see through everything through his eyes.","Countless pieces of information emerged and entered his brain. In an instant, he quickly analyzed the various techniques of the Heaven-Stabilizing Spear, found its flaws, and constantly improved on them. It was as if he had practiced it thousands of times in an instant.","Finally, Chu Yunfan mastered this technique. He had even pushed out the old ways and created new ones, making the technique even more powerful. He had abandoned all its flaws and truly turned it into a perfect technique.","At the same time, the Heaven-Stabilizing Spear landed on his head. The brilliance of the spear was about to stab through him.","However, just as many people were exclaiming in shock, thinking that Chu Yunfan would not be able to escape, they discovered that the spear seemed to be blocked by a mysterious force three inches in front of Chu Yunfan. On top of that, the spear began to crack inch by inch.","In just a moment, the spear had completely collapsed, turning into a brilliance that scattered into the sky. The light was extremely gorgeous and beautiful, but it was full of killing intent.","“D*mn it! How could this be?!” Li Yan’s face immediately paled. He had used all his strength to attack Chu Yunfan, but he couldn’t hurt Chu Yunfan. At this moment, he truly experienced the despair that Bao Anzhi had felt earlier.","“Not a bad technique. It’s a pity that it’s wasted in your hands,” Chu Yunfan said coldly. “Since you’ve taught me such a good move, I’ll let you die under your own ultimate technique.”","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan raised his right hand high and spread out his palm. In an instant, countless rays of light gathered in his hand and turned into a sword. This sword grew in the wind and quickly grew to a hundred meters long. In an instant, a terrifying light overflowed in all directions.","It was exactly the same as the Heaven-Stabilizing Spear that Li Yan had used. It should be said that the two divine techniques were the same, but this one had been improved upon. The only difference was that it was not a spear, but a sword.","The pressure emitted by the sword enveloped all of Tianhe. The terrifying aura it exuded was much stronger than Li Yan’s Heaven-Stabilizing Spear.","“Impossible... That’s too fast!” Li Yan couldn’t believe it, and he didn’t want to believe it. In such a short time, Chu Yunfan had already learned his most powerful technique.","“I call this move the Heaven-Destroying Sword!” Chu Yunfan’s right hand suddenly swung down, and the hundred-meter-long sword slashed down. Li Yan didn’t have time to resist or even react and was directly hit.","“Aaaargh!” Li Yan screamed as he exploded in mid-air."]},{"number":1000,"title":"Chapter 1000 Legacy Pearl, Breakthrough in Sight","paragraphs":["1000 Legacy Pearl, Breakthrough in Sight","After Li Yan was killed by the extremely stunning sword strike, the officials of Tianhe, who were on tenterhooks in the city lord’s mansion, finally heaved a sigh of relief.","When they looked at Chu Yunfan again, there was a change in their gazes. They were no longer the same as before. Although they had never underestimated Chu Yunfan, they did not attach much importance to him either.","However, everything was different now. Chu Yunfan had displayed his strength, and in this world where strength spoke for itself, everyone’s perspective was overturned.","At this time, the city lord of Tianhe, Lin Hongfeng, had finally recovered a little. There was a hint of relief in his eyes. This time, his daughter had accidentally made a great contribution.","If it wasn’t for her insistence, Chu Yunfan would have left long ago. If that were the case, they would probably not be able to escape today.","Whether it was Li Yan or Bao Anzhi, they were not people they could deal with.","Chu Yunfan landed on the ground, and Lin Hongfeng, along with the officials, quickly bowed and said, “Thank you for saving our lives today, Mr. Chu. Please accept our bow!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t decline. After receiving the bow, he said, “You’re too polite, Lord Lin. Since I’m Chenxi’s master, I naturally can’t just watch you suffer.”","Lin Chenxi heard Chu Yunfan mention her, so she couldn’t help but puff out her small chest and look proud.","Today, the luncheon could no longer be held, but the officials felt more at ease. Because of Chu Yunfan’s existence, Tianhe was now as secure as Mount Tai.","However, they also didn’t know that their biggest backer, the Fluttering Blooms, was destroyed because of Chu Yunfan.","Many people even had the idea of letting their children go under Chu Yunfan’s tutelage like Lin Chenxi. If they could make connections with such a great master, their future status in the family would be guaranteed.","“Men, drag these guys out and behead them!”","Under Lin Hongfeng’s order, the disciples that Li Yan had brought with him were dragged away and beheaded. Without the protection of their master, they couldn’t show off their strength as before and were even a little scared.","It was simply unbelievable that their master, whom they respected like a god, had been killed by Chu Yunfan with a single strike.","“Mr. Chu, please follow me,” Lin Hongfeng said.","Lin Hongfeng led Chu Yunfan into a secret room. He knocked on the wall of the secret room, and suddenly, an ancient brocade box was pushed out from the wall.","Lin Hongfeng took out a brocade box and handed it to Chu Yunfan, “Mr. Chu, I have no way to repay you for saving my life. I know that with your cultivation, this may be a simple act, but to our entire family, it is a life-saving grace.","“Our city isn’t a very rich place, and the resources we provide may not be of much use to you. However, I think you should be able to make use of this, Mr. Chu.”","After hearing Lin Hongfeng’s words, Chu Yunfan was curious. He took the box and opened it, only to see a broken pearl the size of a fist before his eyes.","Chu Yunfan could almost immediately sense that this pearl contained a powerful energy. It was as if this energy was sealed by some kind of power, so it didn’t completely leak out.","“This is...a legacy pearl?” Chu Yunfan’s eyes immediately lit up. Although this pearl was extremely damaged, Chu Yunfan was still able to recognize it immediately. It was a legacy pearl.","It was exactly the same as the one Tang Siyu had. They were both legacy pearls. Although Tang Siyu did not have a complete guidance method, the legacy pearl itself was intact.","The legacy pearl before Chu Yunfan was in tatters. If it wasn’t for the seal that sealed the energy within, the power contained within would have completely dissipated.","“Not bad, you have a good eye, Mr. Chu.” Lin Hongfeng nodded and continued, “This is indeed a legacy pearl. To be honest, Mr. Chu, our ancestors once had a master in the Divine Abilities Stage. It was this ancestor who single-handedly brought our family to our current position of rulers of Tianhe.","“This is what he left behind. According to the last words left behind by the elders, although this legacy pearl is somewhat broken, it’s because of this that it doesn’t need a guiding method and can be completely absorbed by others. It’s extremely useful for Divines,” Lin Hongfeng said, “Mr. Chu, you saved my family’s life. I have nothing to repay you with, so I can only give you this legacy pearl.”","Lin Hongfeng’s heart ached, but it was nothing compared to the lives of his family.","In fact, this legacy pearl had been in their hands for many years, but they had never used it. The fundamental reason was that after that ancestor, no one had ever stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage. They couldn’t even break the seal, let alone absorb the energy in the legacy pearl.","Since that was the case, it would be better to give it to Chu Yunfan to repay this favor. After all, the legacy pearl was useless to them, but it was a different matter for Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan pondered for a moment, then said directly, “In that case, I won’t stand on ceremony.”","If it was something else, with Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation level, he wouldn’t have cared much about it. But this legacy pearl was different. It could greatly increase his strength in a short time.","This was the most important thing for him at the moment. Everything else was just floating clouds.","He was now at the peak of tier four of the Divine Abilities Stage. One more step and he would be tier five. Only one step away from the top.","However, this step was extremely difficult to cross. Now, it was different. With the legacy pearl, all difficulties could be easily solved.","During the Ancient Zenith Civilization, someone had obtained a legacy pearl and their power skyrocketed overnight. They became a top existence in the world.","However, Chu Yunfan could see that this legacy pearl was damaged. However, its power had not dissipated. It was all due to the seal, and once the seal was opened, the power within would continue to flow away.","Therefore, it was not like the legacy pearl in Tang Siyu’s hands, which could be used repeatedly. It was basically a one-time thing.","But even so, to the current Chu Yunfan, it was like sending charcoal in the snow, which was extremely important.","“In return, I will help you reach the Divine Abilities Stage, Lord Lin,” Chu Yunfan said after pondering for a moment.","“What?” When Lin Hongfeng heard this, he was stunned for a moment, and then he became excited."]}]);
